window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":801,"title":"Chapter 801 - Mo Yuan Has A Thing For Beauties","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was clearly aware that she had just come into contact with hypnosis and her body had yet to completely adapt to it when she used the skill twice in a row. That was why she suddenly fainted.","She leaned against the bed and asked casually, “What’s the situation with Lu Yan?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was subtle. “At first, Lu Yan wondered if Han Ye was still alive. For some reason, after attending the art exhibition, he suddenly thought it through and decided to use Han Ye’s paintings as the packaging for the perfume. Everyone is very supportive of him.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Lu Yan’s assistants were all Gu Zheng’s people, so presumably, no one would object.","“Lu Yan is such a suspicious person. It’s really beyond my expectations to have him put the packaging into production without any doubts.” Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi with a smile. “Mrs. Gu, do you know what happened?”","Hearing Gu Zheng’s meaningful words, Qiao Xi’s heart thumped violently as she said guiltily, “How could I know? Perhaps he suddenly thought it through after not seeing Han Ye at the art exhibition this time.”","Gu Zheng smiled faintly. “I don’t think he would’ve made a decision that quickly for no reason. Someone must have said something. I remember that he met you and you two were alone. Did you say something to him?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked. Could it be that Gu Zheng knew?","Impossible!","She pretended to be calm. “Lu Yan did look for me, but it wasn’t because of Han Ye. He wanted to encourage me to leave you. He’s full of bad ideas!”","Qiao Xi said indignantly, “I told him that I loved my husband so much, so how could I leave him? I reprimanded him a few more times before he left angrily. I don’t know what happened after that either.”","Gu Zheng smirked. Mrs. Gu’s ability to lie through her teeth was getting stronger and stronger.","She lay on the bed and smiled. “Ah Zheng, I’m so tired. I’ll sleep first.”","Gu Zheng nodded, then stood up and left. He gently closed the door behind him.","After Gu Zheng left, Qiao Xi heaved a sigh of relief. Actually, she had thought of telling Gu Zheng about the hypnosis, but if she did, she would be discovered when she tried to hypnotize him in the future. After all, Gu Zheng was so smart. Perhaps he could rely on his willpower to resist the hypnosis!","...","In the living room of Longwan Residential.","Ye Qingyuan was sitting on the sofa and leisurely sipping tea. When he saw Gu Zheng coming downstairs, he could not help but raise his eyebrows. “Ah Zheng, it wasn’t easy for you to get the beauty. You have to treat her better. How could you make her faint?! If this happens again, I won’t hide it for you.”","Gu Zheng curled his lips. “Okay.”","Ye Qingyuan had a serious expression. “Your wife is so weak and obedient. It’s fine if outsiders bully her, but as her husband, how can you bear to bully her? She’s been under so much pressure since she married you. You should treat her better to make up for everything she’s done for you!”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment. “Where did you hear this?”","Ye Qingyuan looked proud. “I have dozens of spies. Nothing in Li City can escape my eyes and ears.”","Gu Zheng sneered. “Your subordinates aren’t much either.”","His dozens of spies found out about these things? They found out that Mrs. Gu was weak and obedient. She was bullied by outsiders and had to endure the pressure of marrying him?","...","Four hours ago, in the exhibition hall.","After being humiliated by Qiao Xi and Carter in public, Tang Ruge returned to the lounge angrily.","At this moment, Mu Ling and Mu Ming had just finished looking at the oil paintings on the first floor when they heard everyone talking about Tang Ruge. Mu Ling said excitedly, “Brother! Did you hear that?! Tang Ruge and Madam Tang have lost all their dignity this time! It’s really too tragic!”","Mu Ming’s expression was indifferent. “Looks like I have to thank Black Tide properly this time. But why has Tang Ruge been targeting Black Tide?! Could it be that she likes Mo Yuan? Is that why she’s targeting Black Tide?”","Mu Ling sneered. “Even if Tang Ruge has taken a liking to Mo Yuan, it’s absolutely impossible for Mo Yuan to like her! Black Tide is so beautiful! Tang Ruge is inferior to even a strand of her hair. How could she snatch Black Tide’s man?”","Actually, she had long known that Mo Yuan was obsessed with looks. Previously, she chased after Mo Yuan to acknowledge him as her master but was always rejected. Although she was not as capable as Black Tide, she was not far off. After all, she was also on the hacker rankings, so she asked Mo Yuan why he did not accept her as his disciple. Unexpectedly, after a long time, Mo Yuan replied: [You’re ugly.]","At that time, Mu Ling was dealt a blow. Although she was not as good-looking as Black Tide, she was not ugly either. At least, she was better than Tang Ruge. If Mo Yuan did not like her, he would definitely not like Tang Ruge!"]},{"number":802,"title":"Chapter 802 - Perfume Exchange","paragraphs":["Mu Ming nodded and thought that Mu Ling’s words made sense.","At this moment, Lu Yan walked to a corner and instructed his assistant in a low voice, “Go buy some ointment for bruises.”","“Yes, Young Master!”","Mu Ming looked in the direction of the voice and could not help but ask, “Is he Mo Yuan’s biological younger brother?”","Mu Ling frowned and sized him up. “He doesn’t look like him! He doesn’t look like Mo Yuan at all, and he’s not as handsome as Mo Yuan!”","Lu Yan was also considered a handsome man, but he looked ordinary compared to Gu Zheng. Although they were biological brothers, the two of them did not have any similarities.","Mu Ming reminded him, “You can’t just judge a book by its cover. Gu Zheng was raised as an illegitimate child since he was young. Now, his relationship with the Lu family is like fire and water. Lu Yan was raised by the Lu family and even nurtured as the heir by the Lu and Gu families. He has more than Gu Zheng.”","Mu Ling suddenly thought of what had happened to her and her brother. They originally had a happy family. It was those people from the Tang family who schemed against their parents, causing them to lose their lives. They even took over the family and chased the siblings away.","Their experiences were similar to Gu Zheng’s, but the difference was that Gu Zheng relied on his own ability to become the God of Li City. Even if the Gu and Lu families joined forces, they would not be able to shake his status. Meanwhile, she and her brother did not have the ability to overthrow the Tang family for the time being. They could only endure it and wait for an opportunity.","Ten minutes later, the assistant returned to the lounge.","Lu Yan lifted his pants. His knees were red and swollen. He gritted his teeth.","“Young Master, what happened?” the assistant exclaimed.","Lu Yan carefully recalled that he had only gone to see Qiao Xi to test Han Ye. After seeing her, he was very sure that Han Ye had already passed away. He did not know why his knees suddenly started to hurt. What exactly happened?","The assistant asked tentatively, “Young Master, who dares to offend you like this?”","Lu Yan frowned. The only person who could attack him was Qiao Xi, but he did not remember Qiao Xi hitting him at all. It could not be that he was the one who knelt on the floor and knocked himself out, right?","After thinking for a long time, Lu Yan said with certainty, “It’s Qiao Xi.”","The assistant’s mouth twitched slightly as he asked in disbelief, “Who? You mean Mrs. Gu?”","Lu Yan nodded.","The assistant: “...” Mrs. Gu looked so weak and petite. How could she beat Young Master Lu up like this?","Mu Ling, who was outside the lounge, also said in disbelief, “How is that possible?! Who can Black Tide defeat with her small physique? Lu Yan is too tasteless. He actually blames Black Tide after being beaten up?”","Lu Yan changed the topic. “Has the leader of the Dark Net arrived?”","The assistant replied, “He arrived a long time ago and is waiting outside.”","After a while, the assistant walked in with the siblings. Mu Ming spoke first, “Young Master Lu, the matter you asked us to investigate has been concluded. Han Ye has indeed passed away, and he doesn’t have any family. You can use his paintings without worry.”","Mu Ling instantly understood her brother’s intentions. Black Tide and Mo Yuan had helped them, so they would return the favor. At that time, they could use Mo Yuan to deal with the Tang family. Lu Yan would also be implicated and suffer a huge loss.","This game was a mutually beneficial deal for them. Both parties had attacked their enemies, but they were not affected at all.","...","A month later, all the companies in Li City were preparing their New Year’s limited edition products. Gu Corporation was also in the midst of preparing. Coincidentally, Li City was holding a perfume exchange, so Gu Corporation sent their own perfumers to participate. As the president of Gu Corporation, Gu Zheng had to be present to cheer on the perfumers.","Qiao Xi was very interested in perfumes, so she followed along.","The two of them sat in the car. Gu Zheng slowly said, “Mrs. Gu, guess who will win this New Year’s product competition?”","Qiao Xi smiled and said, “Is it even necessary to ask? Of course, it’s your Gu Corporation!”","“Are you so sure? But the perfumers in the company have already been poached by Lu Corporation. Without unique packaging to attract attention, it won’t be easy to win,” Gu Zheng said casually.","Qiao Xi curled her lips. “President Gu, I’m your wife! There’s no need to hide anything from me, right?! Although those perfumers under you are newcomers, I’ve smelled the scents they made and know what achievements they have. They’re all geniuses in perfumery. Are you still afraid of losing even though you’ve taken these geniuses under your wing?”"]},{"number":803,"title":"Chapter 803 - Mysterious Perfume Master","paragraphs":["Seeing that it was almost the end of the year, all the companies were working hard to launch their new products at this time to promote their companies’ sales.","After the wave of popularity of the new products ended, various companies would also use this opportunity to see who could win in this competition. It could be considered good luck for the new year.","Now that the famous perfumers of Gu Corporation had been poached by the Lu family, not only did Lu Corporation have many perfumers, but they had also invited the master perfumer, Sally, from overseas to help out. They even used Han Ye’s paintings as the packaging. With many factors, Lu Corporation’s new perfumes instantly attracted everyone’s attention.","At this moment, almost everyone believed that the champion of this product competition would definitely be Lu Corporation.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled into a disdainful smile, then he held Qiao Xi’s hand and entered the venue.","The perfume exchange meeting was held in a hall in Li City. There were more than ten companies attending, and there were more than a hundred people. The entire hall was crowded and lively.","There were many companies under Gu Corporation, and perfumes were just one of their industries. Actually, Gu Zheng did not have to appear. The others did not expect that not only did he come, but he even brought his wife to attend the exchange with him. It instantly caused a commotion.","Everyone knew very well that the Lu family and Gu Zheng did not have a good relationship. Gu Zheng might be here this time because he was afraid that the Lu family would occupy the perfume market and affect the interests of Gu Corporation.","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were strolling around the hall, but a figure like Gu Zheng was the most dazzling presence no matter where he went. Everyone’s gazes would occasionally land on the two of them.","Gu Zheng ignored everyone and leaned close to Qiao Xi as he asked, “I heard that the Lu family originally wanted to invite a mysterious perfumer, but they didn’t manage to. Do you know about this?”","Qiao Xi’s heart skipped a beat. “You’re talking about Mu Jin? How would I know? I don’t even know Mu Jin. Perhaps she’s already married and has children, so she’s no longer involved in the perfume industry! Moreover, it’s very rude for so many people to disturb a girl!”","“How did you confirm that Mu Jin is a woman?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","How... How should she explain this?","“Although most of the people who like perfumes are women, the ratio of men to women in perfumers evens out. How did you determine that Mu Jin is a woman, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked. After a long time, she retorted, “She’s called Mu Jin! How could a man be called Mu Jin? This name sounds like a girl with an outstanding temperament!”","Gu Zheng smirked. “Is that so?”","Qiao Xi lowered her head nervously. The perfume industry did not pay much attention to men and women. Many men would also come up with elegant and artistic names. It was not strange for a man to call himself Mu Jin, but at this moment, for the sake of clearing her name, Qiao Xi could only brace herself and say, “I just guessed it! I can’t be sure that Mu Jin is definitely a woman, but this name sounds very much like a woman’s name!”","Gu Zheng smiled and nodded, not making things difficult for her anymore.","On the other hand, everyone was praising a young woman in gorgeous clothes.","“Mengyan, so you’re the mysterious perfumer named Sally that the Lu family invited! You’re really too awesome!”","“Sally is very famous internationally. I didn’t expect her to be so young! Mengyan, you’ve been studying perfumes overseas all these years! As expected of the Xia family’s daughter!”","Xia Mengyan’s movements were elegant as she raised her head and replied indifferently, “Yes. All these years, I’ve been painstakingly studying perfumes overseas. I also participated in the International Fragrance Competition four years ago and won the championship. I only returned after being invited by the Lu family.”","“Mengyan, why are you suddenly collaborating with the Lu family? Don’t you know that President Gu and the Lu family...” The person’s expression was subtle, and everyone understood what he meant.","“What’s wrong with President Gu and the Lu family?” Xia Mengyan looked confused. It was obvious that she did not know.","The person stammered, “I can only tell you that President Gu and the Lu family are competitors. President Gu is also attending the perfume exchange this time to compete with the Lu family for first place. Aren’t you afraid that President Gu will blame you for helping the Lu family?”","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed. “What exactly is going on? I agreed to help the Lu family because I met President Gu in the Lu family when I was young. I thought that he and the Lu family... Forget it, I’ve already signed a contract with the Lu family. No matter what, I’ll do my job. I can’t go against my professional ethics because of outside affairs.”"]},{"number":804,"title":"Chapter 804 - Who Doesn’t Like Beautiful Women?","paragraphs":["“Mengyan is indeed an internationally renowned perfumer. She’s too professional!”","Everyone was praising her when someone suddenly broke the peaceful atmosphere. “Mengyan, you probably don’t know yet, but... President Gu is already married.”","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed as if she had been struck by lightning. “He’s married?”","“Yes, his wife is called Qiao Xi. I heard that she’s related to your Xia family! She seems to be the biological daughter of your aunt, Xia Yunlou!”","Xia Mengyan reacted for a while. Qiao Xi was her aunt’s daughter?","Xia Yunlou was Old Madam Yin’s daughter. Back then, after Old Madam Yin and Xia Cheng got married, they gave birth to three children. After the two of them divorced, Xia Yunqiu and Xia Yunyi left with Xia Cheng. Only Xia Yunlou stayed in the Xia family.","Xia Mengyan’s father was Xia Cheng’s illegitimate child. He was also the only heir of the Xia family.","Although Xia Yunlou was Old Madam Yin’s daughter, she was very close to the illegitimate child and had nothing to do with the Yin family. Hence, the Xia family also knew that Xia Yunlou’s biological daughter had been found.","However, Xia Mengyan never expected that the daughter of the Xu family who had been missing for 20 years was Mrs. Gu. In that case, Mrs. Gu and she were considered sisters!","At this moment, everyone was discussing in low voices. “Qiao Xi is really lucky! Although she went missing when she was young and couldn’t grow up in the Xu family, she had an adoptive mother who doted on her and left her with a huge inheritance. Now, she’s married to President Gu and has become the supreme Mrs. Gu.”","At this moment, Xia Mengyan could not help but be a little nervous. She immediately picked up her phone and sent a message to her parents. The other party quickly replied: [Mengyan, don’t worry. The old master doesn’t like Qiao Xi, so the Xia family won’t acknowledge her. You’re the only daughter of the Xia family.]","Xia Mengyan heaved a sigh of relief and smiled. “I’ve been overseas all these years and haven’t heard anything about President Gu’s marriage. The two of them probably haven’t held a wedding yet, right?”","“That’s true! They’ve been married for so long but there hasn’t been a wedding. It looks like President Gu doesn’t like Mrs. Gu much either.” Everyone looked disdainful.","......","“I heard that even her biological mother doesn’t want to acknowledge Mrs. Gu. She relied on her face to get to where she is today. Before long, President Gu will lose his interest in her. She’ll be in trouble then!”","“That’s right. Only an independent woman like our Mengyan is worthy of an outstanding man like President Gu. This time, Mengyan will definitely become famous with the release of Lu Corporation’s new products. At that time, President Gu will naturally see how good you are!”","“I heard that Mrs. Gu will be coming too. What right does she have to come? She doesn’t know anything. She’ll just be a joke if she comes!”","Everyone laughed. “Mengyan is the trump card of Lu Corporation. Mrs. Gu is just a loser who depends on men. How can she be compared to Mengyan?”","Xia Mengyan had a proud expression. She wanted to see what Qiao Xi had to compare herself to her!","At this moment, someone shouted, “President Gu is here!”","Everyone immediately looked up. Xia Mengyan also looked at the door excitedly. Her eyes were filled with admiration, but they were immediately buried by cold hatred.","Gu Zheng was tall and exuded a noble and elegant aura. Qiao Xi was petite and cute. Her perfect face made everyone envious.","No wonder Gu Zheng, who had never been close to women, suddenly got married. No wonder Gu Zheng doted on Mrs. Gu so much.","“Mrs. Gu, you’re so beautiful!”","“To be honest, I think Mrs. Gu is much better-looking than Miss Xia. If I were President Gu, I would choose Mrs. Gu too! Who doesn’t like beautiful women?”","“Don’t spout nonsense! Miss Xia and President Gu have known each other since they were young. Moreover, you can’t just look at a woman’s appearance when she’s married to a virtuous man. Miss Xia is capable and knows how to make perfumes. Of course, she’s more outstanding than Mrs. Gu!”","On the other side, Lu Xiang’s expression turned cold. Why was Qiao Xi here?","She kept having the feeling that Qiao Xi was a very strange woman. Every time she encountered Qiao Xi, any plan would fail. Hence, she thought that an encounter with Qiao Xi was bad luck.","Lu Xiang immediately said nervously, “Ah Yan, quickly chase that woman out. We can’t let her in.”","Lu Yan looked at Qiao Xi who was not far away and instantly felt a sharp pain in his knee. His eyes were filled with anger as he immediately instructed his assistant in a low voice.","When the assistant heard Lu Yan’s instructions, his eyes were filled with disdain. However, he was well-trained and naturally would not expose himself in front of Lu Yan. Instead, he nodded and left.","At this moment, someone asked in surprise, “I keep having the feeling that I’ve seen Mrs. Gu somewhere before. Is she... the Xu family’s biological daughter who went missing for 20 years?”"]},{"number":805,"title":"Chapter 805 - Xi Xi, Long Time No See","paragraphs":["A while ago, the news of the real and fake daughter had spread throughout the city. Everyone had heard about it. If Mrs. Gu was really Xia Yunlou’s daughter, then Xia Mengyan and Mrs. Gu could be considered cousins.","Everyone subconsciously looked at Xia Mengyan, and Qiao Xi also noticed the young woman in the crowd.","Xia Mengyan smiled and went forward to greet her. “Xi Xi, long time no see.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at the woman in front of her. She did not expect to meet Sally so soon. She really did not want to see this woman!","Previously, when she was overseas, she did not get along with Sally. Now that they had met in the country, she heard that Sally’s surname was Xia. What was her relationship with Xia Yunlou?","Xia Mengyan smiled and said, “You don’t know yet, right? I’m the daughter of the Xia family. Xia Yunlou is my aunt, so I’m your cousin.”","Qiao Xi nodded, her expression unchanged.","Xia Mengyan smiled gently. “Xi Xi, I thought that we could get along well from before. I didn’t expect you to be my cousin. Are you also here for the perfume exchange today? Are you also a perfumer?”","The entire venue was silent as their gazes shifted between the two of them.","Apart from perfumers, there were also representatives from various companies who came to participate in the perfume exchange. However, Qiao Xi did not have a position in Gu Corporation. She did not have the qualifications to represent Gu Corporation, so who was she?","Xia Mengyan caught hold of Qiao Xi’s weakness and deliberately exposed her scars in public. “Xi Xi, ever since Aunt got a divorce, she’s been crying all day. She’s about to go blind from crying. I don’t know what happened between the two of you, but she’s your mother, after all. What hatred can there be between mother and child? I hope you can make a trip back to the Xia family with me to see Aunt—”","“Miss Xia, you already said that you don’t know what happened. What right do you have to say these words in front of Xi Xi?” Gu Zheng interrupted Xia Mengyan. His voice was indifferent, but it made one feel a chill.","Xia Mengyan’s body trembled, and her face turned pale.","......","On the other hand, Lu Yan’s assistant brought the young masters of the Lu family in. When he saw Xia Mengyan’s aggrieved expression, he was instantly unhappy. Moreover, the Lu family and Gu Zheng were not on good terms to begin with. At this moment, he said arrogantly, “Mrs. Gu, this is the perfume exchange conference. Unrelated people can’t participate. Are you going to leave now, or should we get someone to send you out?”","Gu Zheng’s entire body emitted killing intent, but Qiao Xi asked with a smile, “Are you chasing me away?”","“If you’re sensible, you’d better leave yourself. It’ll be embarrassing if you’re chased out. We’re not targeting you. This is the rule of the perfume exchange.” The Lu family was proud.","Qiao Xi walked to the sofa in the resting area and sat down. She lazily leaned to the side and asked gently, “Then why is Miss Xia here?”","When the Lu family heard this, they immediately laughed.","Xia Mengyan hurriedly explained, “Xi Xi, have you forgotten? I’m the internationally renowned perfumer, Sally. I’m also the chief perfumer invited by the Lu family.”","With that, Xia Mengyan looked at Gu Zheng and said gently, “President Gu, long time no see. I didn’t expect your wife to be Xi Xi. We can be considered to be related to each other now.”","Everyone present knew that Xia Mengyan was the chief perfumer invited by the Lu family. However, Mrs. Gu even asked such a stupid question in public. She was really embarrassing President Gu!","Qiao Xi’s eyes were clear as she said slowly, “So, you’re participating in the exchange while representing the Lu family?”","Xia Mengyan was just about to nod when Qiao Xi chuckled. “Then why can’t I participate while representing Gu Corporation?”","If it were any other time, it would be understandable for Mrs. Gu to attend banquets while representing Gu Corporation. However, the requirements for the perfume exchange meeting were strict. Only the higher-ups of the company were qualified to attend. However, Mrs. Gu clearly did not meet these two requirements.","Gu Zheng stood beside Qiao Xi with a calm expression.","Song Shijing explained loudly, “Miss Xia isn’t the only one in this world who can participate in the production of perfumes. Our young madam is the designer of Gu Corporation’s new perfume packaging. Of course, she has the right to attend the perfume exchange.”","The entire venue was in an uproar. Obviously, everyone did not believe that Qiao Xi could design packaging.","Xia Mengyan lowered her eyes aggrievedly. “I’m sorry, I’ve offended you. I just didn’t expect Gu Corporation to let Mrs. Gu handle their packaging design.”","“Miss Xia, you knew Young Madam before this, so you should know her identity. How could you ask such a silly question?”","Song Shijing looked disdainful. “Our young madam is the internationally renowned designer Gu Shan. Don’t you know that, Miss Xia?”"]},{"number":806,"title":"Chapter 806 - Mrs. Gu Is Gu Shan","paragraphs":["Song Shijing looked disdainful. “Miss Xia, you’ve been overseas for so many years. If you’ve never heard of the designer, Gu Shan, then you’ve been living in vain!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","As expected of Gu Zheng’s assistant, he had a sharp tongue.","Everyone discussed in low voices. “Mrs. Gu is Gu Shan?”","“Gu Shan doesn’t have many works, but every one of them is exquisite. Her international reputation is also more resounding than Sally’s. What right does Miss Xia have to look down on Mrs. Gu?”","Seeing Gu Zheng’s cold expression, everyone quietly left. Not long after, only a few people were left.","Xia Mengyan lowered her eyes with an unhappy expression. She originally wanted to embarrass Qiao Xi in public, but she never expected that she would shoot herself in the foot.","She looked up and smiled indifferently. “Of course, I’ve heard of Gu Shan. I just didn’t expect Mrs. Gu to be Gu Shan.”","Gu Zheng ignored her words and turned to look at Qiao Xi. He said gently, “The perfume exchange will start in a while. Do you want to rest first?”","Qiao Xi nodded. Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and was about to leave when Xia Mengyan suddenly said, “President Gu, long time no see. Do you still remember—”","“Why haven’t you left?” Gu Zheng’s tone was instantly cold and filled with impatience. He probably thought that since she had embarrassed herself in public, she would be too embarrassed to continue staying here.","Xia Mengyan’s expression froze. “President Gu...”","Gu Zheng did not even bother to look at Xia Mengyan. Instead, he bent down and asked Qiao Xi gently, “Shall we go to the lounge? It’s too noisy here.”","“President Gu!” Xia Mengyan shouted, her expression extremely ugly. “I know you’re angry with me and blame me for working with the Lu family, but when I agreed to work with the Lu family, I didn’t know about your relationship with the Lu family.","“I can promise you that after this collaboration ends, I won’t help the Lu family anymore. I’ll do my best to help you in the future, so can you forgive me on the account of our past relationship?”","Qiao Xi could not help but raise her eyebrows when she heard Xia Mengyan’s words. From the sound of it, she and Gu Zheng were old friends?","At this moment, Gu Zheng looked up slightly and sized up Xia Mengyan.","Xia Mengyan met Gu Zheng’s gaze and smiled. “President Gu, I knew you wouldn’t—”","“Who are you?” Gu Zheng looked at her in confusion. The entire hall instantly fell silent, and the air seemed to have frozen.","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng stood there casually, but Xia Mengyan could not take it anymore. She gradually lost control of her expression. Her face was pale, and the corners of her mouth were even twitching slightly.","After a long time, Xia Mengyan gradually calmed down and explained helplessly, “President Gu, you saved me when I was five years old, so I’ll never forget you.”","Gu Zheng looked at her thoughtfully.","Xia Mengyan was instantly excited. “Do you remember? I’m that little girl who wore a pink princess dress!”","“I don’t remember.” Gu Zheng said mercilessly again, “I’m really sorry, Miss Xia. I really don’t remember you. After all, not everyone has a good memory like you. You still remember what happened when you were five years old.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Xia Mengyan’s expression froze and gradually became ferocious.","Gu Zheng glanced at her with disdain, then held Qiao Xi’s hand and turned to leave.","Looking at their intimate backs, Xia Mengyan gritted her teeth. Because there were too many people here, she did not chase after them.","On the other hand, when Gu Zheng and Gu Zheng were about to reach the lounge, Qiao Xi asked curiously, “Ah Zheng, do you really not know Miss Xia?”","Gu Zheng replied without hesitation, “Do I need to know her? She’s not my relative or friend. To me, she’s just a boring passerby. It’s normal for me to forget her.”","Qiao Xi nodded and habitually stroked her hair. She did not notice that Gu Zheng’s gaze was suddenly burning.","Only then did Gu Zheng realize that she was wearing a thin top and a long lace skirt. The clothes revealed her exquisite collarbone and fair neck. No wonder those people had been staring at her just now.","He frowned and took off his jacket to cover her. His voice was domineering. “Put on my jacket!”","Qiao Xi said softly, “But... my clothes are too feminine today. I won’t look good in your suit jacket.”","“You’ll catch a cold.”","Qiao Xi took off his jacket and said with a smile, “It’s okay. The perfume exchange will only last for two hours. Moreover, there’s a heater in the hall, so it’s not cold at all. Other girls are wearing less clothes than me! Don’t worry, I’ll wear the jacket after the exchange. I won’t catch a cold.”"]},{"number":807,"title":"Chapter 807 - Bringing Up The Past","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s hot palm landed on her shoulder, caressing her delicate skin. His touch was slightly cold. He was silent for a moment, then his eyes suddenly burned. “Are you sure you don’t want to wear it?”","The man’s handsome face suddenly approached her. His eyes were filled with gentleness, but they carried a trace of a smile. His entire body emitted a sense of invasion, causing Qiao Xi’s heart to beat violently.","Seeing that she did not respond for a long time, the man said in a low voice, “Alright.”","As soon as he finished speaking, dense kisses landed on Qiao Xi’s collarbone. Hot air filled her entire body, causing her to tremble. His slightly cold lips gradually became hot with a trace of impatience and ferocity, leaving marks on her fair skin.","After a long time, Gu Zheng slowly looked up and licked his lips. His voice was hoarse and a little lingering. “Mrs. Gu, aren’t you going to wear it now?”","Qiao Xi gradually recovered from her shock and looked at him with dazed eyes.","His body was slightly stiff as the flames in the depths of his body roared. At this moment, Qiao Xi’s face was red, and her fair collarbone was filled with red marks. She looked at him innocently. With just a glance, the self-control he was proud of was about to disappear without a trace.","“Be good and put it on.”","Qiao Xi tilted her head to look at the mirror at the side. She instantly seemed as if she had been struck by lightning.","Gu Zheng picked up his jacket and wrapped it around her upper body carefully. He would never allow anyone to see such an alluring side to Mrs. Gu.","Seeing that Mrs. Gu had put on his jacket, Gu Zheng touched her cheek gently and smiled. “Mrs. Gu, you’re not allowed to wear so little in the future. Otherwise, you’ll have to pay the price.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Damn! This bastard! He actually thought of such a method to deal with her. Now, she had to wear it even if she didn’t want to. She couldn’t participate in the exchange meeting with hickeys all over her neck!","She pushed Gu Zheng angrily, but the man took the opportunity to grab her hand and pull her into his arms. His voice was hoarse and low. “Xi Xi, I’ll be jealous.”","......","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled. She could clearly feel the man’s scorching breath on her neck. She heard him say helplessly, “I’m a man and your husband. I can’t accept the gaze of another man on you.”","When she appeared in front of everyone, he could clearly see the stunned gazes of those men. At that moment, he began to feel angry and uneasy because his most precious woman was being coveted by others.","Qiao Xi blinked and took a few seconds to react. She reached out to hug the man’s strong waist. She replied obediently, “I understand.”","Xia Mengyan stood not far away and looked at the two people hugging in the corner, her eyes filled with resentment.","After a while, Gu Zheng let go and said gently, “Wait for me in the lounge first. I’m going to attend a meeting. I’ll come back to look for you after it’s over.”","Qiao Xi smiled and nodded as she watched Gu Zheng leave. She was just about to enter the lounge when an old roar came from behind. “How shameless!”","This voice was a little familiar. Qiao Xi slowly turned around and saw an old man with an angry expression. After sizing him up, Qiao Xi remembered that the old man in front of her was the Lu family’s old master.","Old Master Lu said disdainfully, “You’re really a wild girl who grew up in the countryside. You’re so shameless. You’re hugging a man outside and even wearing a man’s clothes!”","Qiao Xi was not angry but raised her eyebrows. “Old Master Lu, my husband and I are legally married. Who said I can’t wear his clothes? Who said I can’t hug him?”","With that, she looked at the middle-aged woman in the distance and sneered. “Old Master, you’re attending the perfume exchange meeting with a mistress. Is this the rule of your Lu family? You haven’t even taken care of your own matters yet. Do you have the right to interfere in my affairs?”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s ridicule, Old Master Lu’s expression instantly turned ferocious. “Qingyun’s mother passed away a long time ago!”","Qiao Xi retorted, “So what? Can a mistress attend events openly after the death of the first wife? I think Ah Zheng is very good. He has never had any scandals and only dotes on me. Even if he sits on the supreme throne, there’s nothing to nitpick. But you... Tsk tsk.”","Old Master Lu choked.","Everyone in high society knew that Lu Qingyun was born from his first wife, while Lu Xiang was the daughter of a mistress he kept outside. It was just that Lu Qingyun’s mother died early, so no one mentioned this matter anymore. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi brought up the past again today. This was clearly a slap to his face!"]},{"number":808,"title":"Chapter 808 - Relying On Elders Is Also A Skill","paragraphs":["“Old Master Lu.” Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes. “Don’t be angry yet. If you want to find fault with us, you have to think of a more appropriate excuse. Isn’t it too far-fetched to say that we’re shameless? Take your time to think about it. You still have a lot of time. The exchange will take an hour!”","This eccentric attitude angered Old Master Lu so much that his beard trembled. He roared, “I’m Ah Zheng’s grandfather!”","“So?” Qiao Xi blinked and had an innocent expression. “Old Master Lu, you’re old and your memory isn’t good, but I’m still young. Of course, I remember! You can’t possibly think that everyone’s brains are useless just because you’re not smart, right?”","Old Master Lu was so angry that he almost vomited blood. His wrist trembled as he pointed at her. “Qiao Xi! Remember this, I’m Ah Zheng’s grandfather. Our Lu family will never accept you! How can an ignorant and incompetent piece of trash like you be worthy of Ah Zheng’s noble identity? If you’re sensible, divorce him as soon as possible so that you won’t be abandoned in the future!”","Old Master Lu’s eyes darkened. Qiao Xi was Old Madam Yin’s granddaughter and the eldest daughter of the Yin family. If the Yin family’s power was used by Gu Zheng, it would be even harder for them to defeat Gu Zheng in the future.","It would be good if Qiao Xi could marry Ah Yan, but if she was unwilling, the Lu family would absolutely not allow her to live in harmony with Gu Zheng!","Qiao Xi’s expression remained indifferent when she heard the old master’s words. “I’m not worthy of Gu Zheng?”","Old Master Lu snorted. “It’s good that you know. Divorce Gu Zheng immediately!”","“How am I not worthy of him? I’m the internationally renowned designer Gu Shan and also the famous oil painter Han Yin. Now that Qiao Corporation is also my business, my net worth is about to surpass the Lu family’s. If I’m an ignorant and incompetent piece of trash, then what’s Lu Yan?","“Someone who’s a famous designer and oil painter is an ignorant and incompetent piece of trash in your eyes, huh? Even if I have a company with good prospects, it’s still not worth mentioning in your eyes. What kind of person is qualified in the eyes of the Lu family, then? Is it only someone like Lu Yan who relies on his family to support him and always loses money when doing business? Someone like him who hasn’t improved after so many years and is on the verge of bankruptcy? Is that sort of person deserving of praise by you?”","Qiao Xi smiled as she looked at him. “Actually, Lu Yan isn’t completely useless. At the very least, he could coax the Lu and Gu families to help him. It’s also a skill to rely on your elders! It seems that I can’t call him trash in the future!”","“Qiao... Xi!” Old Master Lu gritted his teeth and shouted. He was so angry that he was panting. He had lived for most of his life, but he was actually angered to the point of speechlessness by a 20-year-old girl!","“Hey! Old Master, you have to take care of your health! Also, let me remind you that I have medical skills. It’s not that easy to extort me. If this is discovered by others, your Lu family will be the one losing face!”","......","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and said arrogantly, “Don’t even think about finding someone to deal with me. Although I look weak, those who go against me all end up in a miserable state. If you have the time, why don’t you help Lu Yan manage the company? Otherwise, you won’t even know how you went bankrupt!”","“Qiao Xi!” Old Master Lu’s angry roar echoed in the corridor. His eyes almost popped out. “Listen carefully. No matter what, Gu Zheng is my grandson. If you anger me, I can make him bear the reputation of being unfilial with just one sentence!","“Apologize immediately, or I’ll make you two pay the price!”","Qiao Xi was silent. She knew that Gu Zheng did not care about his reputation, but she could not ignore this problem. After all, rumors were scary. She could not let the Lu family seize the bad reputation of being unfilial to threaten Gu Zheng.","After thinking for a moment, Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly lit up. She had almost forgotten that she knew hypnosis!","Old Master Lu looked at her sinister smile and felt his entire body go cold. He retreated in horror. “Qiao Xi, you... What are you doing?”","“Old Master Lu.” Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes.","The moment he met her eyes, Old Master Lu’s body suddenly stiffened. His eyes were empty and bloodshot. He lowered his head like a puppet.","Qiao Xi leaned closer and ordered in a low voice by his ear, then took a few steps back.","Not long after, she heard Old Master Lu roar angrily, “Qiao Xi! I’m warning you to withdraw from this competition immediately. I won’t allow anyone to stand in Ah Yan’s way! I’m Gu Zheng’s grandfather. He has to listen to everything I say. Otherwise, he’s unfilial! If he goes against the Lu family, I’ll absolutely not let him off!”"]},{"number":809,"title":"Chapter 809 - He’s Trash","paragraphs":["At this moment, passersby happened to hear the old master’s roar and immediately gasped. However, they did not notice the stiffness in the old master’s tone.","Before everyone could react, they saw Qiao Xi’s eyes turn red. She was as weak as a little white flower. “Old Master Lu, Gu Zheng has been bearing the reputation of being an illegitimate child for so many years. He even had to endure the Lu family’s revenge. Now that he has recovered his identity, the Lu family hasn’t even apologized. Now, you’re even forcing Ah Zheng to give up his resources to Lu Yan! They’re both your grandsons, so why are you biased toward Lu Yan? Moreover, Lu Yan isn’t good at doing business and has already caused the Lu family to lose billions. Aren’t you being too arbitrary by insisting on doing this?!”","Lu Yan clenched his fists angrily.","Unexpectedly, in the next second, Old Master Lu seemed to be possessed as he roared, “Even if Lu Yan isn’t good at business, he’s still the grandson of our Lu family. I want to give all my resources to him!”","Qiao Xi covered her face and cried. “I finally know why you don’t like Ah Zheng. It must be because Ah Zheng is too outstanding and makes you feel pressured. The reason you like Lu Yan is because he’s stupid and useless, but what’s the point of telling me all this? Go look for Ah Zheng and tell him! I can’t make the decision regarding the company’s matters!”","Everyone revealed looks of disdain. Mrs. Gu was already crying, yet Old Master Lu was still unwilling to let her off! He did not dare to look for trouble with Gu Zheng but was making things difficult for a weak woman here. He was simply going too far!","Old Master Lu stood in front of Qiao Xi and was unwilling to let her leave.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and said weakly, “Old Master, don’t be angry anymore. Take care of your body! Otherwise, what will Lu Yan do if you’re not around? He’s not good at business and is useless. Sooner or later, he’ll destroy the Lu family!”","Old Master Lu was instantly angry. “Shut up! It’s all because of you, you b*tch! You angered me! Why are you here for the exchange?! Get lost immediately!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes changed. In the next second, Old Master Lu raised the walking cane in his hand and smashed it fiercely at Qiao Xi.","Everyone was shocked and hurriedly rushed over to stop Old Master Lu. “Old Master, what are you doing?”","“Mrs. Gu only told the truth. You can’t hit her!”","“He actually wanted to hit Mrs. Gu in public. How does he bully her behind our backs, then?! If he’s really upset about this, he can look for President Gu! The Lu family clearly doesn’t dare to face President Gu head-on, so they’re making things difficult for Mrs. Gu behind his back.”","......","“Could it be Lu Yan’s idea?! Now that Lu Yan has officially taken over Lu Corporation, he definitely has to make a name for himself. However, President Gu is also releasing a new perfume, so perhaps Lu Yan got Old Master Lu to look for trouble with Mrs. Gu.”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, Lu Yan’s gentle face instantly darkened.","Qiao Xi was still crying. “No wonder the old master stopped me from scolding Lu Yan and wanted to hit me. It turns out that he’s afraid that Gu Zheng and I will threaten Lu Yan’s interests. But they’re both your grandsons, so how could he...”","As she spoke, Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Lu Yan, only to see the corners of Lu Yan’s mouth twitch slightly.","At this moment, everyone was indignant. Was there something wrong with the Lu family’s heads? Why did they have to go against the powerful Gu Zheng? Meanwhile, they treated the useless Lu Yan as their treasure and doted on him!","Although everyone did not say anything, their eyes were filled with disdain. Their impression of the Lu family was greatly reduced. If the Lu family was really handed to Lu Yan, who would dare to work with them in the future?","Old Master Lu had been in the business world for decades and had never been looked down on like this. His chest instantly hurt as he gritted his teeth. “Qiao Xi!”","Lu Yan hurriedly went forward to support the old master. When the old master felt someone else’s touch, his eyes instantly returned to normal. He hesitated for a few seconds and really did not understand why he suddenly wanted to hit Qiao Xi.","He did indeed hate Qiao Xi, but he would not beat her up in public.","Lu Yan walked forward and looked at Qiao Xi with a smile. “Xi Xi, I’m really sorry. Grandpa is old and rash. He didn’t deliberately target you. Let’s forget about this matter.”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Young Master Lu, how can you say those words so easily? After all, you’re not the one who almost got beaten up. Are you just going to let this go?”","The smile on Lu Yan’s face froze as he clenched his fists.","“I naturally don’t want to bicker with all of you, so I’ll have to trouble the Lu family to stay away from me in the future and not disturb my life anymore.” Qiao Xi left angrily after she finished speaking."]},{"number":810,"title":"Chapter 810 - Setting Up A Trap","paragraphs":["Lu Yan was about to chase after her when he was stopped by someone. That person frowned. “Young Master Lu, Mrs. Gu entered a private lounge. It’s not convenient for you to enter. Moreover, Mrs. Gu won’t bicker with the Lu family. Don’t make things difficult for her anymore.”","He stopped in his tracks and looked at Qiao Xi’s back view with narrowed eyes. He never expected that Qiao Xi was the famous designer, Gu Shan. She would probably use her trump card this time.","Now that Gu Corporation no longer had an ace perfumer, the perfumes they produced would definitely not be as good as Sally’s. They could only work on the packaging. However, no matter how beautiful the packaging was, it was useless if the smell was bad. The customers would not pay for it.","On the other hand, Xia Mengyan was hiding in a corner with vicious eyes. Qiao Xi had Gu Zheng as her backer and was really not easy to deal with. If she returned to the Xia family one day, she would be even more unable to deal with.","Xia Mengyan rolled her eyes, picked up a pen and paper, wrote a note, and placed it on the coffee table in the lounge.","Not long after, the person in charge of Lu Corporation’s perfume department staggered to the lounge area. He reeked of alcohol. As soon as he sat down, he realized that there was a note on the coffee table. He was dumbfounded when he saw the signature.","Qiao Xi? Wasn’t she Gu Zheng’s weak wife?","The person in charge looked at the note and revealed a wretched smile. He did not expect Mrs. Gu to be so bold as to leave a note for him in the resting area. Was she not afraid of being discovered?","On the other hand, Xia Mengyan was chatting with a few young ladies when she bumped into Tang Lingyun from the Tang family. Everyone gathered together to talk bad about Qiao Xi.","Xia Mengyan said calmly, “Mrs. Gu is a little willful, but it’s just a misunderstanding between her and Tang Ruge. Lingyun, you have to know that if President Gu refuses to forgive the Tang family, the consequences will be very serious.”","Tang Lingyun was exasperated. “It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault! My sister wanted to help her out of goodwill, but she was played back by her. Now that she’s being mocked by the entire high society, she hasn’t dared to go out for many days!”","Xia Mengyan’s voice was gentle, but every word she said intensified the conflict. “Mrs. Gu doesn’t just have Gu Zheng as her backer. She’s also my cousin and has the Yin family protecting her. If you offend her, your Tang family will be in trouble. Your marriage might even be affected.”","Tang Lingyun was even angrier when she heard this. She wished for nothing more than to tear Qiao Xi into pieces and feed her to the dogs. Tang Lingyun was already stupid to begin with, so after being provoked by Xia Mengyan, she instantly lost her mind.","She slammed the wine glass on the table and shouted at Xia Mengyan, “You’re Qiao Xi’s cousin, so you’re not a good person either! So what if someone is protecting you? If you offend me, you won’t have a good ending!”","With that, Tang Lingyun left angrily.","Xia Mengyan was not angry. Instead, she smiled. When she looked up again, her eyes were filled with worry. “The Tang family is a scholarly family, after all. I really can’t bear to see the Tang family get implicated. Unexpectedly, Miss Tang doesn’t appreciate my goodwill. Forget it. Just pretend I never said anything!”","On the other hand, Tang Lingyun rushed to the lounge, raised the glass on the table, and smashed it at Qiao Xi. The people outside were all stunned by this sudden change.","Qiao Xi reacted quickly and dodged this attack, but the corner of her white dress was still stained with wine.","Tang Lingyun roared angrily. “Qiao Xi! Don’t even think about threatening me. I’m not afraid of you!”","Qiao Xi was speechless: “...” Was this person crazy?","Ever since the art exhibition, Qiao Xi thought that the Tang family would definitely calm down for a period of time. She would naturally not look for trouble with the Tang family as well. Unexpectedly, Tang Lingyun suddenly barged into her lounge today and smashed a glass at her.","Qiao Xi looked at the fragments all over the floor and felt displeased. A wave of killing intent appeared in her eyes, but because there were many people present, she could only maintain a smile. “Please excuse me for a moment. I’ll go change.”","Everyone could not help but sigh at how weak Mrs. Gu was. Tang Lingyun was already bullying her so badly, but Mrs. Gu did not lose her temper.","After Qiao Xi left, she wanted to find an empty lounge to change. After walking around, only Room 109 was available.","She stood at the door and thought for a moment. She remembered that Room 108 was empty previously. Why was there suddenly someone here? No one would come at this time, right?","She had a feeling that this lounge was deliberately left for her. As for the purpose, she was not sure.","After hesitating for a moment, Qiao Xi pushed the door open and entered. She took out a dagger from her bag to protect herself, then hid behind the door and quietly waited. Not long after, the door opened again."]},{"number":811,"title":"Chapter 811 - You Want To Murder Your Husband?","paragraphs":["At this moment, Xia Mengyan was waiting quietly in Room 108. She had already clearly heard the door next door open twice. The first time, it was Qiao Xi, so it had to be Lu Kang the second time.","According to her plan, Qiao Xi would definitely go to Room 109 to change, and Lu Kang would go over after seeing the note. That man was drunk and would definitely do something to Qiao Xi in his excitement.","The two of them were both important figures in the perfume exchange. When everyone realized that they were missing, they would quickly come to look for them. No matter what the two of them did in the lounge, they would be criticized.","Who would believe that a man and a woman who were left in a room alone were innocent?","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had also expected the seriousness of the matter, so she pretended to enter the lounge to see who wanted to harm her.","At this moment, the door suddenly opened and a figure slowly walked in. Qiao Xi’s gaze was sharp. The instant that person entered, she stabbed with her dagger. When the dagger was two centimeters away from the man, she was instantly restrained by two long fingers.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and chuckled. “Mrs. Gu, you want to kill your husband?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Why was it Gu Zheng?","Gu Zheng swiftly snatched Qiao Xi’s dagger, played with it in his hand, and threw it on the table at the side. “Mrs. Gu, do you have to bring a dagger with you to attend the perfume exchange?”","Qiao Xi lowered her head and muttered, “I brought a dagger with me to protect myself. I’m such a weak girl. I must protect myself when I’m outside. Otherwise, I’ll be bullied.”","Gu Zheng frowned and seemed a little unhappy.","Qiao Xi pouted. “Gu Zheng! What are you unhappy about? Someone wanted to harm me today. I brought the dagger to protect myself. Don’t tell me you think I’m too rough?”","“Aren’t you afraid of hurting yourself by hiding the dagger in your pants?” Gu Zheng had a serious expression.","Qiao Xi’s heart instantly warmed. Sure enough, Gu Zheng was just worried about her.","Gu Zheng looked at her affectionately and pulled her into his arms. He comforted her softly, “Mrs. Gu, you don’t have to bring a dagger with you when you go out in the future. I’ll protect you. I’ll help you deal with whoever wants to harm you!”","Before Qiao Xi could speak, heavy footsteps suddenly came from outside. A greasy and wretched voice sounded. “Mrs. Gu, you look innocent on the surface, but I didn’t expect you to be a little b*tch. However, I like your enthusiasm. Let me dote on you!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold as strong killing intent burst out of his body.","Qiao Xi picked up the dagger on the table and blinked. “Ah Zheng, I can use this dagger now!”","Lu Kang kicked the door open and looked around the room with his wretched eyes. When he saw a slim figure appear behind the screen, Lu Kang impatiently rushed over. Sure enough, he saw Qiao Xi’s stunning face. “Beautiful woman, I’m here!”","There was not the slightest fear in Qiao Xi’s eyes. When she saw him appear, she even smiled indifferently. “Who told you to come?”","“Oh! Why are you still pretending at a time like this? Didn’t you leave me a note to come over? Don’t worry, I’m a very gentle person. I’ll be gentle.”","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa and raised her eyebrows. “Mr. Lu, you’re ugly, but you think too much. I’m not blind. I clearly have a handsome husband like Gu Zheng and he’s so good to me. What reason do I have to have an affair outside and look for an ugly man like you?”","The smile on Lu Kang’s face vanished instantly. He glared at her and said fiercely, “B*tch! What the hell did you say? It’s your honor that I want to sleep with you. Don’t play hard to get. Even if Gu Zheng comes today, I’ll have a taste of you!”","“Is that so?” Qiao Xi took out a dagger and casually played with it in her hand. In the blink of an eye, the dagger was pressed against Lu Kang’s neck. Her clear eyes blinked as she smiled. “Say that again.”","Lu Kang fell silent and even stopped breathing.","Qiao Xi exhaled and said in a gentle voice, “Don’t worry, I’ll be gentle.”","20 minutes later.","Hurried footsteps came from outside the door, followed by the sounds of a group of people talking. “I heard that Mrs. Gu came to Room 109 to change, and Lu Kang went in too.”","“Lu Kang is drunk. Will he do something on impulse?”","Old Master Lu’s expression darkened. Qiao Xi was really a calamity, but if such a thing really happened, he could take this opportunity to force Qiao Xi to divorce Gu Zheng."]},{"number":812,"title":"Chapter 812 - A Man And A Woman In The Same Room","paragraphs":["“But if Mrs. Gu found out that a man had entered, someone would definitely have gone in to save her as long as she shouted. However, it’s been so long and we haven’t heard her shout. Could it be...”","“A man and a woman were in the same room for so long. If Mrs. Gu was unwilling, she could’ve just pressed the button to call the police and someone would immediately come to save her. Could it be that she was willing?”","Everyone gathered at the door and knocked. No one answered.","“Could it be that Mrs. Gu and Lu Kang are... How disgusting!”","“Open the door! If you don’t open the door now, we’ll barge in! You’re actually doing such a thing at the perfume exchange. You didn’t care about the Lu family and President Gu’s reputation at all! How embarrassing!”","The voices became more and more noisy. A few women muttered softly, “Mrs. Gu is such a restless woman. I heard that she was the one who took the initiative to seduce Lu Kang!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the door suddenly opened and a handsome and cold face appeared in front of everyone. His eyes were filled with killing intent as he said in a low voice, “Song Shijing.”","Song Shijing appeared immediately and answered respectfully.","“You heard who slandered Mrs. Gu just now. From today onward, Gu Corporation will cut off all ties with these people!” Gu Zheng instructed.","No one expected that the person in the lounge would be Gu Zheng. They were instantly dumbfounded. After a long time, someone shouted unwillingly, “President Gu, we’re all just telling the truth. Isn’t it too unfair for us if you cut ties with us because of this?”","When one person complained, the others also spoke up one after another. “Yes, we all heard that Qiao Xi left a note for Lu Kang and seduced him, asking him to meet her in Room 109.”","“President Gu, we’re defending you! You’re so good to Mrs. Gu, but she got together with another man behind your back. She’s not worthy to be your wife at all.”","“You must be here to look for Mrs. Gu as well. You must’ve already discovered their adulterous relationship. Since that’s the case, why hide it for her? If you forgive her this time, she’ll go even further in the future. She won’t care about your reputation at all. In my opinion, you should just harden your heart and divorce her. At that time, you can choose any socialite in Li City.”","......","Gu Zheng glanced indifferently at the woman who spoke. The woman instantly blushed shyly. “President Gu, you... Don’t look at me like that.”","The man glanced at her coldly and retracted his gaze. “I just want to see who’s so shameless to interfere in my family matters.”","The entire corridor was instantly silent, and the atmosphere was extremely awkward. Just as everyone was silent, a man’s roar came from the lounge. “Ah... No!”","Everyone present immediately looked disdainful.","“President Gu, she’s too arrogant. She’s so shameless in front of everyone and is even having an affair with another man in the room. Are you still going to tolerate her?”","When Gu Zheng heard Lu Kang’s shout, he was not angry at all. Instead, he smiled.","These women were indignant in their hearts because Gu Zheng was the Prince Charming in the hearts of all the socialites in Li City. All the young women wanted to marry him, but he just had to marry Qiao Xi!","“Are you so curious about what my wife is doing in the room?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and smiled. “Alright, we’ll bring you there.”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","What was going on? President Gu was being cuckolded, but he was not angry at all. He even wanted to bring them in to take a look?","Seeing that Gu Zheng had agreed to let them in, a few socialites could not wait to rush in. Lu Yan also followed everyone in.","“Lu Yan.” Gu Zheng’s voice turned cold.","Lu Yan raised his head and met Gu Zheng’s eyes. His body instantly trembled as he had a bad feeling.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “No matter who schemed against Qiao Xi today, your Lu family has to pay the price.”","At this moment, everyone had already rushed into the lounge. As soon as they entered, they went straight to the bed, but there was no one there. Immediately after, they heard a man’s roar, but this sound did not sound right!","Why was he screaming so miserably?","Hearing that someone had barged in, Lu Kang’s blood-red eyes lit up with hope. He immediately moved outside and said in a hoarse voice, “Save... Save me!”","Everyone abruptly looked up and realized that Lu Kang was tied to a chair. His cheek was red and swollen, and blood was flowing down his chin. His clothes were also cut, revealing a blood-red wound.","Lu Kang could no longer care about his image. Tears and snot flowed down his face as he opened his mouth and shouted, “Save me!”"]},{"number":813,"title":"Chapter 813 - Facts Speak Louder Than Words","paragraphs":["Everyone was instantly stunned! Didn’t they say that Mrs. Gu seduced Lu Kang? Shouldn’t the two of them be on the bed? Why was it different from what they had imagined?","At this moment, Mrs. Gu was standing in front of Lu Kang. Her eyes were red, and she looked aggrieved. She wiped her tears and spoke to Lu Kang fiercely.","The corners of the mouths of those socialites who had reprimanded Qiao Xi earlier twitched slightly. Their cheeks were burning as if they had been slapped.","Qiao Xi slowly turned around and said aggrievedly, “Ah Zheng, I knew it! Why would Lu Kang suddenly barge into my lounge? Someone must be framing me. It hasn’t been long, yet people have already come to ‘catch me in the act’.","“Everyone here is a socialite from Li City. I can understand why you’re looking for trouble with me. After all, I’m married to the Prince Charming in your hearts. You’re not happy about it, so you want me to make a fool of myself in public. But Young Master Lu, what are you doing here?”","Everyone subconsciously looked at Lu Yan in confusion.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Lu Kang has only been in here for 20 minutes, yet you guys rushed over in a hurry. You were afraid that you wouldn’t be able to catch me in the same room as him, huh? What exactly do you plan on doing here?”","Lu Yan looked at Lu Kang with a gloomy expression. At this moment, the man had already been beaten till he was swollen all over. He explained loudly, “Mrs. Gu left me a note! It’s in my pocket!”","Someone went forward and took out a note from his pocket. Everyone stared at it and could not help but exclaim. It was really a note left behind by Mrs. Gu for Lu Kang. She actually dared to have an affair on such an occasion. She was really audacious!","“Are all the members of the Lu family so stupid?” Qiao Xi sneered and said with a disdainful expression, “He has triangular eyes and a big round face. He clearly looks like a wretched, greasy, and evil man. How could I like him? I have an outstanding and handsome husband like Gu Zheng. What reason do I have to take the risk and have an affair with this ugly man?”","After being mocked, Lu Kang was fuming with anger. He could not help but curse, “You b*tch! You left me a note!”","“In that case, why don’t you take this slip of paper to be appraised and see if it’s my handwriting? In case someone uses this to malign me, facts still speak louder than words.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi looked at Xia Mengyan, who walked out of Room 108. She pretended to be surprised. “What’s going on? Why is everyone gathered here? Xi Xi, what happened?”","......","Someone hurriedly explained to Xia Mengyan, and she immediately exclaimed, “Xi Xi, don’t tell me you’re suspecting me? No matter what, I’m your cousin. How could I harm you? That note—”","“Miss Xia, did I say I suspected you? Why are you in such a rush to explain yourself? Could it be that you’re guilty?” Qiao Xi interrupted casually.","“Moreover, the lady who explained the situation to you just now didn’t say that Lu Kang came to 109 to look for me after reading the note. How did you know that there was a note?”","Xia Mengyan’s expression changed.","Xia Mengyan had just come out of the lounge. Without anyone telling her, it was impossible for her to know about the note.","“I heard you talking about the note from next door, so I came out to take a look. I was afraid that you would misunderstand me, so I explained myself.”","“Is the soundproofing in the lounge so bad? Miss Xia, you even heard such a small sound. Lu Kang was screaming for so long, but you didn’t come out to take a look at the situation then,” Qiao Xi continued to question.","Xia Mengyan lowered her head nervously and explained in a trembling voice, “I didn’t know you were next door. I did hear a man scream, but I didn’t dare to go out as I’m weak.”","Qiao Xi smiled and nodded. “Miss Xia, you have a point. Then, shouldn’t Young Master Lu give me a reasonable explanation as to why someone from the Lu family suddenly barged into the lounge I was in and even tried to do something inappropriate to me?”","Lu Yan’s face darkened. He glanced at Xia Mengyan and immediately understood the matter. Xia Mengyan had deliberately left a note to lure Lu Kang over. However, even if he already knew the truth, he could not push Xia Mengyan out to take the blame. This was because she was the perfumer for his new perfume. If something happened to her, everything he had worked hard for would be for naught. Hence, he could only take the blame for Xia Mengyan.","He looked at Lu Kang, whose face was bruised and swollen. He had already been beaten up by Qiao Xi to such a state. Who exactly was the one doing bad things to whom?"]},{"number":814,"title":"Chapter 814 - Fight Against Crime","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I did slap Lu Kang twice to vent my anger, but the person who beat him up is Gu Zheng. I’m just a weak girl, so how could I be so fierce?”","“Mr. Lu Kang is also unlucky. When he entered the lounge, he happened to meet Gu Zheng and was taken down as soon as he entered! Young Master Lu, I heard that this person has evil intentions. He’s committed crimes in Lu Corporation and harmed many young ladies. We beat him up to fight against crime. What do you think?”","When Lu Kang heard this, he was so angry that he was about to vomit blood. He roared with a ferocious expression and struggled violently. Then, he lost his balance and fell to the floor. The blood on his body seeped out as he struggled, dripping onto the floor. At this moment, he was like a fat pig waiting to be slaughtered.","The socialites had never seen such a bloody scene before. They all covered their noses and took a few steps back. They did not expect Gu Zheng, who usually looked very gentlemanly, to be so vicious.","If they had not barged in to catch them in the act, Lu Kang might have been beaten to death by Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he blocked Qiao Xi behind him. His eyes were filled with icy-cold killing intent, causing everyone present to lower their heads in fear. No one dared to make a sound.","After a moment of silence, the man’s thin lips parted slightly. “This is just a warning. Whoever dares to bully Mrs. Gu again will definitely suffer a worse outcome than this man.”","With that, Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on Lu Yan and Xia Mengyan. Xia Mengyan was so scared that her entire body trembled as she hurriedly lowered her head.","At this moment, Lu Kang was extremely weak. The wounds all over his body were aching. He lay on the floor and barely managed to breathe, but no one dared to untie him.","Gu Zheng glanced at Lu Kang, whose eyes were filled with coldness. He instructed, “Clean this up. Let’s go.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he pulled Qiao Xi along and was about to leave, but Qiao Xi had an unwilling expression. “I still want the Lu family to apologize to me! They clearly know that I’m a perfume designer, so they got someone to frame me. I’m not satisfied that we only managed to deal with Lu Kang this time.”","Lu Yan looked at the man who was breathing weakly on the floor. The veins on his forehead twitched. ‘You’re still not satisfied? What else do you want?’","Lu Kang was filled with resentment. He had clearly seen the note and came to have an affair with Qiao Xi. As soon as he entered, he was inexplicably beaten up. Hence, when Gu Zheng’s subordinates entered and lifted him up, he used all his strength to break free and crawl toward Xia Mengyan. “Miss Xia, save me!”","Lu Yan’s eyes darkened as he raised his leg and kicked Lu Kang’s chest.","This kick made everyone even more puzzled. They all looked at Lu Yan and Xia Mengyan suspiciously.","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale, and her forehead was covered in sweat. Lu Kang, that piece of trash, did not sleep with Qiao Xi but dragged her down with him. He was really an idiot!","Qiao Xi sneered. “Miss Xia, can you explain why Mr. Lu Kang asked you for help? Could it be that you two are very close? Or did you give him the note?”","The corners of Xia Mengyan’s mouth twitched slightly, then her eyes turned red. She said aggrievedly, “Xi Xi, I don’t know why he asked me for help. We’re just colleagues. We’ve exchanged a few words in the company before, but we’re not even friends.”","At this moment, Lu Kang was completely sober. He shouted unwillingly, “I found the note on the coffee table as soon as you left. Who else could it be?”","Xia Mengyan gasped, and her voice trembled slightly. “Mr. Lu Kang, are you saying that I left you the note? Xi Xi is my cousin. I wouldn’t do such a thing. Moreover, how could I be sure that Xi Xi would definitely go to Room 109?”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Xia Mengyan was quite calm. It was a pity that she was not an actress.","Xia Mengyan frowned and said thoughtfully, “Xi Xi, I heard that Tang Lingyun splashed a glass of wine on you. That’s why you went to 109 to change. If you want to suspect someone, you should suspect her! She led you to the lounge and left a note for Lu Kang to frame you.","“Moreover, she even flared up at me just now. Could it be that she deliberately set up a trap to take revenge on us sisters? No matter what, this has nothing to do with me. Don’t listen to Lu Kang’s one-sided story.”","“Miss Xia, you’re right!” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “In that case, I’ll leave Lu Kang to you, Young Master Lu. If the results are unsatisfactory, then I’ll have reason to suspect the Lu family.”","“Although Tang Lingyun and I have a grudge, how could she be sure that I’d come to 109? Perhaps only the Lu family can explain this clearly.”"]},{"number":815,"title":"Chapter 815 - Choose One","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi said indifferently, “There are only two conclusions that can explain it now. Either Miss Xia deliberately occupied Room 108 and forced me to come to Room 109, then forged a note, or Lu Kang was bold enough to write a note to get himself out of trouble. Young Master Lu, how you explain it will depend on you.”","The veins on Lu Yan’s forehead twitched. Qiao Xi was forcing him to choose between Xia Mengyan and Lu Kang. No matter what he chose, he would offend one of them.","Xia Mengyan’s face was pale. She did not expect that she would not be able to escape Qiao Xi’s suspicion. Moreover, Lu Yan seemed to have already suspected her.","At this moment, a higher-up of the Lu family said unhappily, “Mrs. Gu, today is the perfume exchange. It won’t do either side any good to blow things up. Even if you didn’t write the note, it can’t prove that Lu Kang or Miss Xia wrote it. You have no right to punish them. Moreover, you’ve already beaten Lu Kang up. He’s already paid the price. What else do you want?”","“Then send the note to be appraised,” Qiao Xi said casually.","“But if we appraise the handwriting, the matter will really blow up. I’m an internationally renowned designer, Gu Shan, and I’m also Gu Zheng’s wife. At that time, no matter who set me up, the Lu family will suffer a huge loss.”","The higher-up of Lu Corporation was indignant. “Why are you so sure that you’re not the one behind this whole thing?”","Whether it was Lu Kang or Xia Mengyan, they were both the backbone of Lu Corporation. They could not abandon one just because of Qiao Xi’s words. This was a huge loss to Lu Corporation, so how could they be willing to bear it?","“Lu Yan.”","Gu Zheng, who had been silent for a long time, suddenly spoke up. His voice was filled with killing intent. “Since the Lu family is dissatisfied with Mrs. Gu’s way of dealing with things, then send the note to be appraised.","“The Lu family offended Mrs. Gu, which means they’ve offended me, Gu Zheng. I don’t mind fighting with you. I want to see who’s so bold to attack Mrs. Gu!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Lu Yan’s heart trembled. He had spent all his energy on the new perfumes. It was not easy for him to confirm that there was no problem with Han Ye. Nothing else could happen.","If he insisted on confronting Gu Zheng this time, Gu Zheng would definitely do his best to attack Lu Corporation. At that time, the new perfumes that were about to be released would definitely fail. All his previous efforts would be in vain. Moreover, the Lu family would have to bear the bad reputation of framing Gu Corporation’s designer. They would never be able to raise their heads in the industry.","......","Lu Yan clenched his fists tightly, and his face alternated between green and white. After hesitating for a long time, he slowly looked up and said gently, “I’m really sorry, Mrs. Gu. Our Lu Corporation didn’t manage our subordinates well this time. Don’t worry, our Lu Corporation will definitely give you a satisfactory answer.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth could not help but curl up when she heard this.","After the Lu family left, someone discussed softly, “Could it be that the Lu family really set up a trap to frame Mrs. Gu?”","“Mrs. Gu is already married to a handsome and rich man like President Gu. How could she like someone like Lu Kang? Moreover, she even secretly invited him to the lounge on an occasion like the perfume exchange. No one with a brain would do such a thing. Plus, look at Lu Yan’s and Xia Mengyan’s guilty expressions. They must have done something shameful.”","“Then what’s going on with Tang Lingyun?”","Everyone was guessing that Tang Lingyun was probably just cannon fodder.","On the other hand, Tang Lingyun had just returned to the lounge when she received a call from the Gu family. She was reprimanded by the elders. Then, when she left the clubhouse in a hurry, she was even pushed hard and fell.","She was only wearing a thin dress. It was so painful that she gritted her teeth. Her arms and knees were bleeding.","When everyone saw her disheveled appearance, their faces were filled with disdain. Tang Lingyun was angry and resentful, but when she looked up, she could not find the person who pushed her.","...","After dealing with the Lu family, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng returned to the private lounge. Qiao Xi was in a good mood. “Lu Yan can’t say anything now. For the sake of releasing his new perfumes, he can only sacrifice Lu Kang to protect Xia Mengyan.”","“Yes, and he’ll immediately release new perfumes. He’ll seize the market as soon as possible to avoid us taking revenge,” Gu Zheng said.","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng suddenly stood up and pulled Qiao Xi up. He pushed her to the wall and firmly subdued her. His hot breath surrounded her.","The man’s voice was hoarse and low. “Xi Xi, do you know your mistake?”"]},{"number":816,"title":"Chapter 816 - Know Yourself And Your Enemy","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi had a confused expression and did not understand what Gu Zheng meant. She looked up and met the man’s deep eyes. Then, she heard the man’s low and hoarse voice. “You knew that someone wanted to harm you, yet you still had the guts to go to 109 alone. Xi Xi, are you getting bolder?”","Qiao Xi lowered her head guiltily and muttered softly, “Can that good-for-nothing hurt me? Moreover, I’m fine!”","He bent down and moved closer. Qiao Xi leaned against the wall, her legs trembling nervously.","A trace of anger appeared in the man’s usually calm eyes. “Are you so confident that you won’t encounter any danger? You met Lu Kang this time. What if you meet someone stronger than you the next time? Can you still guarantee your safety?”","Qiao Xi did not expect Gu Zheng to be so angry because of this matter. She hurriedly lowered her head and admitted her mistake. “It won’t happen again. I’ll protect myself.”","“Xi Xi, I don’t want this to happen again.”","Gu Zheng’s breath sprayed on her face, and his sharp gaze landed on her, almost burning her to ashes.","Qiao Xi was terrified to the point her voice trembled. “Gu Zheng, Senior... I was wrong.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the man quickly grabbed her wrist and pressed her body against the wall. Their two bodies were pressed tightly together. She could even feel the shape and temperature of the man’s chest muscles.","Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle and coaxing. “Mrs. Gu, aren’t you very powerful? I want to see how you’ll break free from me.”","Qiao Xi struggled with all her might, but it didn’t shake Gu Zheng’s grip in the slightest. To Gu Zheng, Qiao Xi’s strength was like scratching an itch.","The corners of his lips were pressed against her ear, and his lips gently touched her small and round earlobe. The woman in his arms instantly trembled. He chuckled. “If I were a bad person, you’d already be a fish on the chopping board for me to slaughter.”","Qiao Xi naturally knew that she was unable to defeat Gu Zheng. It was probably impossible to find a match for him in the entire Li City. If she encountered an ordinary person, she would naturally have the ability to deal with them. However, at this moment, she did not have the courage to retort Gu Zheng.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi cried and acted cute. “Boo-hoo, Ah Zheng, don’t be fierce with me. Actually, I only found out that someone wanted to harm me after I entered the room. I was too afraid to go out, so I could only brace myself.”","Gu Zheng looked at her indifferently. After a while, he suddenly bent down and planted a deep kiss on her lips. It was crazy and urgent. The calmness he was proud of instantly vanished. The words Qiao Xi said were instantly drowned in his scorching kiss.","The man hooked her chin and forced her to raise her head slightly. At this moment, her cheeks were red and her mind was a mess.","This bastard!","After a long time, he stood up reluctantly and panted slightly. “Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were dazed. When she heard his call, she could only subconsciously nod.","He gently stroked her red and swollen lips, listening to her delicate breathing. He said slowly, “Don’t do it again, or you’ll suffer!”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled. This man was truly too terrifying. Just a small matter had caused her to almost die.","...","Half an hour later, Qiao Xi finally recovered her calm. The blush on her face gradually dissipated, and she applied lipstick again to cover her red lips.","Gu Zheng sat on the sofa and smiled roguishly. “Mrs. Gu, you don’t have to attend the event later.”","Qiao Xi immediately raised her eyes in surprise. “Why? Didn’t you ask me to take a look at the packaging of Lu Corporation’s new perfumes? We absolutely can’t lose this time!”","Gu Corporation could not lose, and Gu Zheng could not lose either.","This time, Lu Corporation was going to use Han Ye’s paintings as their packaging. What packaging would Gu Corporation use to compete with the Lu family? Even if it was not to fight with the Lu family, they had to ensure sales. After all, their main goal was to earn money.","Qiao Xi said in confusion, “Know yourself and your enemy and you’ll never be defeated. I have to understand the enemy before I can formulate a plan!”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly. “There’s no need. They’re all ugly anyway. They’re not as good-looking as your designs.”","Song Shiyu, who was waiting outside the door, thought to himself, ‘President, you’re really good at sucking up. Even if Young Madam’s design is ugly, you’ll go against your conscience and say that hers is the best!’","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “That’s true. I’m an internationally renowned designer. How could their designs be better than mine? I reckon only Lu Corporation’s packaging can compare to my work!”"]},{"number":817,"title":"Chapter 817 - You Can’t Compare To My Wife","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi sat on the sofa and said confidently, “I’m not bragging, but they won’t be able to surpass me even if they study the craft for another two to three years. After all, not everyone has talent!”","Song Shiyu: “...” ‘Yes, yes, yes, you’re the best!’","Then, Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa and blinked at Gu Zheng. “Ah Zheng, are you willing to put my designs into production?”","Gu Zheng remained calm. “Of course. It’s my honor that you’re going to design and package the company’s new perfume, Mrs. Gu. So no matter what you design, I’ll use it.”","Song Shiyu quickly handed the laptop to Qiao Xi and accidentally touched her finger. “Young Madam, my brother just sent me the other works from the exchange meet. They’re not as good as yours. Your work is the most perfect!”","Gu Zheng frowned. “Song Shiyu, do you not want your hand anymore?”","After the president’s reminder, Song Shiyu realized that he had accidentally touched Young Madam’s finger just now, but he did not do it on purpose. He had only touched her nail. Was the president going to chop off his hand because of this?","What a jealous man!","An hour later, the perfume exchange was about to end. Everyone was anxiously waiting for the results to be announced. However, everyone knew that the first two companies were definitely Gu Corporation and Lu Corporation.","Gu Corporation had taken first place for five consecutive years. Gu Zheng’s strength could be said to be unparalleled, but Lu Corporation was not to be trifled with. They came prepared this time.","“I heard that the Lu family has poached veteran perfumers from Gu Corporation. Now that the Gu family doesn’t have any good perfumers, they can only use new people for the time being.”","“Not only that, but the Lu family even invited Sally to personally make the perfumes. They’re also using Han Ye’s paintings as the packaging...” At the mention of Han Ye, the person could not help but be stunned for a moment. “Speaking of which, has the Lu family obtained Han Ye’s authorization? After all, that person...”","“Since the Lu family has already decided to enter production, they must have already solved the copyright problem. With the packaging and fragrance combined, the Lu family will definitely be the champion this time!”","......","On the other hand, Xia Mengyan happened to meet Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng when she went out. She immediately chased after them. “Xi Xi!”","Qiao Xi pretended not to hear her and continued walking forward.","Xia Mengyan quickly caught up to her and said with a smile, “Xi Xi, I really didn’t expect you to participate in Gu Corporation’s perfume design as well. However, friendship comes first and competitions come second. Don’t let this competition affect our relationship.”","Before Qiao Xi could say anything, she saw Gu Zheng’s expression turn cold. “Miss Xia, I can tell you clearly that be it in terms of design or perfumes, you can’t compare to my wife.”","The smile on Xia Mengyan’s face vanished instantly. She said aggrievedly, “Ah Zheng... President Gu, we were childhood playmates, after all. Why are you so cold to me? Although I’m not an international top perfumer, I’m still famous in the industry. I wonder if Xi Xi is also a perfumer? How can you be so sure that I’m inferior to her?”","Qiao Xi was extremely annoyed. Was there something wrong with the Xia family’s brains? Previously, there was Xia Yunlou, and now, there was Xia Mengyan. All of them annoyed her.","She thought that Gu Zheng would ignore Xia Mengyan, but Gu Zheng looked up indifferently and said slowly, “Miss Xia.”","Xia Mengyan suddenly looked up, her eyes filled with anticipation and urgency. “President Gu...”","“The Lu family poached a few experienced perfumers from Gu Corporation. They all participated in the research and development of Lu Corporation’s new perfumes. In other words, Miss Xia didn’t complete the research and development of the perfumes alone, but you’re letting everyone think that you developed the new products yourself. Isn’t that too selfish of you?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng walked to the car and opened the door. He invited Qiao Xi to get in like a gentleman. Before he got in, he even glanced meaningfully at Lu Yan, who was not far away.","Xia Mengyan watched the car slowly drive away and bit her lip. Lu Yan walked over. “What’s the use of being sad here? You need to be smart to get someone!”","Hearing Lu Yan’s words, Xia Mengyan gritted her teeth in anger. “I’ve known him since we were young, but he ended up marrying that woman, Qiao Xi. If I hadn’t signed a contract with your Lu family, he wouldn’t be so cold to me!”","“Miss Xia, do you mean to say that you blame me? Back then, you agreed to sign the contract to return to the country and develop your career. You wanted to quickly make a name for yourself. You don’t have to make yourself sound so aggrieved.” Lu Yan was unhappy."]},{"number":818,"title":"Chapter 818 - The Lu Family’s Annual Meeting","paragraphs":["Lu Yan snorted. “Miss Xia, instead of venting your anger on me, why don’t you look for your aunt, Xia Yunlou? Ask her who was originally engaged to Gu Zheng. It shouldn’t have been Qiao Xi.”","Xia Mengyan asked, “How are you so sure?”","“Because I’m the one who’s engaged to Qiao Xi!” The corners of Lu Yan’s mouth curled into a sinister smile, and his eyes were filled with viciousness.","...","After Xia Mengyan left, she immediately called her father. Her father and Aunt Yunlou were half-siblings, but they were very close.","When Xia Yunlou heard about this, she snorted angrily. “I already said that the marriage wasn’t hers! But she just had to marry Gu Zheng. Now that the Lu family knows about this, the entire Li City will soon know that our Xia family has a shameless daughter!”","Xia Mengyan continued to ask, “Then who’s the person President Gu is engaged to?”","“You have to ask your grandfather that. Back then, this marriage was arranged with Eldest Miss Lu. After Eldest Miss Lu passed away, it was never mentioned again. However, your grandfather seems to have a token. If you can find it, you can use it to fulfill the marriage contract,” Xia Yunlou said softly.","Xia Mengyan was instantly excited. She suppressed her excitement and said, “Aunt, please look for that token. If you find it, contact me as soon as possible.”","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi had just arrived home and was already preparing to pack the perfumes. After the first batch of finished products was completed, she was extremely satisfied. “Gu Zheng, I’m confident in winning!”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Congratulations in advance, Mrs. Gu.”","......","“The packaging I designed, in addition to the unique fragrance, will make it easy for us to win against them. But Lu Yan...”","Before he could finish, Song Shijing walked in. “President, the Lu family sent someone over to deliver an invitation.”","Gu Zheng reached out to take the invitation and said casually, “Chairman Lu invited us to attend the company’s annual meeting.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Why?”","The company’s annual meeting was attended by internal employees. What did this have to do with Gu Zheng? They were clearly competitors, so it should not be appropriate for Gu Zheng to appear at the annual meeting.","Thinking about it carefully, the pre-sales of the perfume would be coming to an end about the time the annual meeting was held. At that time, it would be clear who would win the championship for this quarter’s sales. Inviting Gu Zheng to the annual meeting was to tell everyone that the arrogant Gu Zheng had lost. He had lost completely and could not fight back at all.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Lu Yan is too confident. Is he sure that he’ll succeed?”","Gu Zheng’s lips curled into a faint smile. “Then let’s go take a look.”","...","A month later, at Lu Corporation’s annual meeting.","Every year, Lu Corporation’s annual meeting was luxurious and grand. This time, they even booked a luxury hotel in Li City. The first and second floors were for the employees on the lower floors, while the upper floors were for the middle-level leaders. The top floor was for the higher-ups of Lu Corporation, shareholders, and so on.","With Gu Zheng’s identity, he naturally went straight to the top floor. However, before he could enter the banquet hall, he heard an unhappy voice from inside. “Why would our Lu family invite an outsider to our annual meeting? Don’t tell me he really thinks he’s from the Lu family?!”","“No matter what, he’s Eldest Miss Lu’s son. It’s understandable for him to come to the Lu family’s annual meeting, but the heir of the Lu family is already Young Master Lu Yan. Even if he comes, he’ll only be attending as an outsider.”","“Maybe he still wants the Lu family as his backer. After all, no one from the Gu family supports him!”","Qiao Xi stood outside the door and looked at Gu Zheng with a smile. “Could it be that the person they’re talking about is you?”","Gu Zheng said casually, “It sounds like it.”","The people in the banquet hall were still discussing. “Although Young Master Lu Yan doesn’t have his mother’s love, he has been living in luxury since he was young and has the support of two families. Meanwhile, Young Master Gu has been despised since he was young. Even his father hates him. Even if he recovers his identity now, he won’t be able to obtain the support of the Lu family.”","“I heard that his wife is not easy to deal with either. She even embarrassed Chairman Lu in public!”","“Why is he here for our Lu family’s annual meeting? How shameless!”","“Miss Lu Xiang, what do you think?”","Lu Xiang, who was in the crowd, had a look of disdain. “Everyone, you’re right. He’s not welcome at our Lu family’s annual meeting!”","Lu Qingyun’s son was not worthy of returning to the Lu family. It was already kind of them to let Gu Zheng live until now, but he just had to be enemies with the Lu family. Hence, she could not be blamed for being vicious!"]},{"number":819,"title":"Chapter 819 - Second Miss Lu Is Furious","paragraphs":["Lu Xiang was jealous, and her eyes were filled with resentment.","Coincidentally, at this moment, Qiao Xi pushed the door open and entered. Lu Xiang frowned and was about to flare up when she turned around and realized that it was Qiao Xi. Her heart could not help but tremble.","Qiao Xi blinked and said gently, “Say it! Why aren’t you saying anything, Miss Lu?”","Everyone’s gaze landed on Qiao Xi. Her beautiful eyes moved to look at Old Master Lu, then she sneered. “Ah Zheng, since the Lu family doesn’t welcome us so much, let’s leave!”","Gu Zheng curled his lips into a smile and threw the exquisite invitation on the waiter’s tray. “Alright.”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I’m really sorry, Old Master Lu. You invited Ah Zheng and we arrived on time. But since everyone doesn’t want us to be here, then there’s no need for us to stay. But why didn’t you tell everyone that you invited us?","“Why did Miss Lu make it sound like you didn’t invite us and we shamelessly came to attend?”","Old Master Lu glared at Lu Xiang. No matter how dissatisfied he was, he could not say it in front of outsiders. If Gu Zheng left just like that, how would their plan today continue?","Old Master Lu’s face darkened. “Lu Xiang, quickly apologize to Ah Zheng. You’re Ah Zheng’s aunt. How could you say that about him? Even if he really did something wrong, as an elder, you have to be tolerant. Don’t say such things again!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Old Master Lu had specially emphasized the word ‘elder’ to tell Gu Zheng that Lu Xiang was his elder. If an elder said something wrong, what could a junior do?","Old Master Lu had already said so and given Gu Zheng a way out. Now, as long as Gu Zheng said that there was no need, this matter would be over.","But...","“Second Miss Lu, quickly apologize!” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","The banquet hall instantly fell into silence. No one dared to say anything. Lu Xiang’s face was livid, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly. “You...”","Everyone’s gaze landed on Lu Xiang. She trembled, and her breathing became hurried. She wished she could rush over and slap Gu Zheng hard.","How dare a junior like him embarrass her in front of outsiders?","Old Master Lu’s face darkened. “Ah Zheng, you’re a junior, after all. How can you be so rude to your elders? Previously, it was our Lu family who didn’t educate you, causing you to become so naughty and arrogant. Now that you’ve already returned to the Lu family, you should follow the Lu family’s rules.”","The atmosphere became even more awkward. The air seemed to have frozen. Everyone lowered their heads and did not dare to make a sound.","Gu Zheng was not in a rush to speak. It seemed that neither party had any intention of giving in. If both parties were unwilling to lower their heads, how would this annual meeting continue?","Old Master Lu thought that as a junior, Gu Zheng could not get his elders to apologize to him in front of everyone. Moreover, it was not a big deal. If he insisted on acting like this, it would not be good for his reputation.","The entire venue was silent for two minutes. Qiao Xi, who was at the side, spoke first, “You clearly know that your Lu family hasn’t done your part to educate him, so what right do you have to use the Lu family’s rules to restrain him?”","Qiao Xi held Gu Zheng’s hand and glanced coldly at the members of the Lu family. “Speaking of which, your Lu family’s rules aren’t much either! Do elders not have to apologize for their mistakes? Do juniors deserve to be scolded? Who taught you such crooked logic?”","Her reprimand instantly caused a commotion. Lu Xiang could not help but roar angrily, “Qiao Xi!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes unhurriedly and raised her eyebrows. “Oh! Second Miss Lu, are you angry from embarrassment?”","These words angered Lu Xiang so much that she was fuming. She no longer cared about her image as a socialite and cursed, “Who are you to teach me a lesson? Moreover, we only invited Ah Zheng to today’s annual meeting. He’s considered half a member of the Lu family and has the right to attend the annual meeting. Who do you think you are? Hurry up and get lost!”","After a furious roar, the entire venue fell silent.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were sharp, and he exuded a chill.","Lu Xiang did not know that she had angered Gu Zheng, so she still shouted, “Not just anyone can attend our Lu family’s annual meeting! You’re just a toy Ah Zheng married. After he gets over the feeling of novelty, he’ll abandon you. What right does such a woman have to attend the Lu family’s annual meeting? Unless you can prove that you’re qualified to attend.”"]},{"number":820,"title":"Chapter 820 - Terminate The Cooperation?","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with rage. He was just about to pull Qiao Xi away, but she unexpectedly wasn’t angry in the slightest. Instead, she smiled and said, “Then what do you think can be considered as proof?”","Lu Xiang raised her head high and pretended to be an elder. “It’s very simple. Lu Corporation and Gu Corporation have a collaboration, but we haven’t confirmed the sales plan. If you can come up with a complete and feasible plan within an hour, I’ll agree to let you stay.”","Everyone was dumbfounded. Song Shiyu and Song Shijing mourned in their hearts. Lu Xiang had angered Young Madam. She would definitely end up very miserable!","The employees of the two companies had not come up with a clear sales plan for so long, which meant that this was not a simple matter. Even if Qiao Xi had the ability, it was absolutely impossible for her to complete a feasible sales plan in such a short period of time. Lu Xiang was clearly making things difficult for Qiao Xi.","Just when everyone thought that Qiao Xi would back down, she nodded confidently. “Alright.”","Lu Xiang snorted. “You agreed readily, but let me tell you, if you lose, the leader of the collaboration will automatically become Lu Corporation. At that time, we’ll come up with a plan. No matter what plan we come up with, Gu Corporation has to accept it!”","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s expression was already extremely cold. He seemed to have already thought of a hundred ways for Lu Xiang to die.","Old Master Lu, who was at the side, smiled proudly. This was an excellent opportunity. Although he could not seriously injure Gu Zheng, it was good to disgust him. Moreover, if the Lu family were the ones who came up with the plan, the Lu family would be able to obtain many benefits from this collaboration.","Qiao Xi smiled. “If I lose, the leader will be Lu Corporation. What if I win?”","Lu Xiang had a look of disdain. Qiao Xi still had the hope of winning? Impossible!","Before she could speak, Qiao Xi said casually, “If I win, the collaboration this time will be led by Gu Corporation. Moreover, the Lu family will have to give up 10% of the profits. In other words, Gu Corporation will take 70% of the profits in the end, while the Lu family can only take 30%.","The entire venue was silent. After everyone was stunned for a few seconds, one of the higher-ups of Lu Corporation roared, “Mrs. Gu! You’re bullying us! Originally, Gu Corporation would get 60% of the profits from this collaboration. Now, you want to take another 10%. What do you want our Lu family to earn?”","“This bet was proposed by Miss Lu Xiang first. Isn’t her request a means of bullying? If I lose, you can get benefits from Gu Corporation. If I win, you don’t have to pay any price. How can there be such a good deal in the world? Your Lu family wants to bet, but you’re unwilling to pay the price? Is this fair?” Qiao Xi’s ridicule caused everyone’s expressions to turn ugly.","When Lu Xiang heard Qiao Xi’s words, she could not help but roar, “Gu Zheng, look at the good wife you’ve married. She’s bullying her elders! I’m your elder and the person in charge of this collaboration. What right does she have to speak to me like this?! If she doesn’t apologize to me, this collaboration will be terminated!”","Qiao Xi, this little b*tch, was lawless just because she relied on Gu Zheng’s love. She actually embarrassed her in public. If the collaboration between the two families ended, how could Gu Zheng still let her fool around?","Hearing Lu Xiang’s roar, Qiao Xi only raised her eyebrows. Who gave Lu Xiang the confidence that she would apologize?","Why did the Lu family have an inexplicable sense of confidence? They always felt that they were high and mighty. If they were so powerful, why was Lu Corporation getting worse by the year?","Just as she was about to speak, a cold male voice came from beside her. “The breach of contract will be sent to the Lu family later.”","Everyone was stunned.","Lu Xiang had just finished speaking. She said that if Qiao Xi did not apologize, then the collaboration would be terminated. President Gu did not hesitate at all and directly said he would give the Lu family a sum of compensation. This meant that he would rather the collaboration be terminated than have Mrs. Gu lower her head and apologize.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were calm and emotionless, but he was tall and exuded a kingly aura that made everyone extremely nervous.","His voice was clearly very calm without the slightest anger, but it was still awe-inspiring. No one dared to offend him at all.","At this moment, the entire banquet hall was in an uproar. It was not easy for them to collaborate with Gu Corporation, yet it ended so easily?","Gu Zheng said slowly, “I’ve always been clear about public and private matters, so I didn’t refuse when Miss Lu asked to collaborate with me. As long as both parties work hard together, we’ll definitely reap in a lot of benefits. It’s just that you might have misunderstood something...”"]},{"number":821,"title":"Chapter 821 - It’s Better To Make Friends","paragraphs":["“Other than the Lu family, we have many other companies we can work with. The others won’t even hesitate to give us more benefits to get the opportunity to work with us. We can work with anyone, but I’m the only one who can work with the Lu family. You have to know that it was your Lu family who begged me to work with you!”","Gu Zheng’s words caused the expressions of everyone in Lu Corporation to change. It was not easy for them to get this chance with Gu Corporation. This collaboration could bring huge benefits to Lu Corporation. If the collaboration was terminated because of a few words from Lu Xiang, then...","Everyone’s unhappy gazes landed on Lu Xiang. She lowered her head with a livid expression, but she was unwilling to apologize. She did not want to apologize to Lu Qingyun’s son!","Lu Qingyun was already dead. Why should she still live under Lu Qingyun’s shadow and endure the torture of that b*tch’s son?","Lu Xiang roared indignantly, “I’m your biological aunt. You’re actually threatening me for a woman who doesn’t know the rules?”","“It seems that you threatened me first.” Gu Zheng’s tone was filled with mockery. He had given Lu Xiang too much respect, which was why she had been arrogant for so many years. Now, she actually bullied Mrs. Gu!","Gu Zheng’s expression darkened. He did not care about the expressions of the people from Lu Corporation at all. He directly held Qiao Xi’s hand and said softly, “Let’s go.”","Qiao Xi nodded. The two of them were just about to turn around and leave when Lu Xiang finally couldn’t help but roar, “Gu Zheng! The penalty for breach of contract isn’t a small sum. If news of you breaking the contract for Qiao Xi gets out, what will others think of Qiao Xi? They’ll say she’s a femme fatale. At that time, the entire Gu Corporation will blame her!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Second Miss Lu, you think too much.”","The sum Gu Corporation had to pay for this breach of contract was just a drop in the ocean for Gu Zheng. He would not take it from the company’s accounts. Since it was his private matter, he would settle it in private. It would not affect others much. Who would stand up and criticize Mrs. Gu?","Seeing that Gu Zheng had made up his mind, the higher-ups of Lu Corporation finally let go of their dignity. They hurriedly ran in front of Gu Zheng and advised, “President Gu! Please think about it again. Even if you have money, you can’t fool around like this!”","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks and slowly turned around. His eyes were filled with coldness as he said in a sharp voice, “I can spend my own money however I want. You don’t have to worry.”","Everyone’s expressions were extremely ugly. Before they could say anything, Gu Zheng sneered. “Everyone should know very well that after Lu Corporation and Gu Corporation cut off all ties, no one in Li City will work with Lu Corporation anymore.”","“Is Lu Corporation worthy of fighting me?”","Everyone from the Lu family was livid. Lu Xiang bit her lip so hard that it almost tore.","“As for whether the higher-ups of Gu Corporation will criticize Mrs. Gu or not, you’re thinking too much. Without Lu Corporation, there are still other companies. With Mrs. Gu’s reputation, it’s not difficult for us to find a company to collaborate with. What do you think?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Old Master Lu widened his eyes. Previously, he was still calm because he thought that Gu Zheng would not easily terminate the collaboration. After all, Gu Corporation was not as experienced as Lu Corporation in terms of fashion design.","However, Qiao Xi was Gu Shan. With her in Gu Corporation, it was equivalent to accumulating huge connections for Gu Corporation. Many companies would swarm over to collaborate with Gu Corporation.","Lu Xiang forced herself to remain calm and gritted her teeth. “Gu Zheng, stop talking big. Can Qiao Xi alone pull in a collaboration? Get Qiao Xi to apologize to me immediately and I won’t bicker with you. Let’s forget about this matter!”","She thought that she had already made a concession and Gu Zheng was done causing trouble. He could not have too stiff a relationship with the Lu family. After all, they were all his elders.","Before Gu Zheng could say anything, Song Shijing snorted. “Impossible.”","“What else do you want?” Lu Xiang was furious.","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation also came forward to persuade Gu Zheng. “President Gu, Mrs. Gu, this is just a small matter. Why implicate the collaboration? It’s better to make friends than enemies. This will be beneficial to both of us.”","“Isn’t it too late to persuade us to reconcile?” Song Shiyu stood in front of everyone and sneered.","Gu Zheng did not like to bring bodyguards with him when he went out, so there were only four of them. At this moment, there were more than 50 people from the Lu family in the banquet hall. Even with such a huge difference in numbers, everyone was suppressed by Gu Zheng’s aura and could not say anything."]},{"number":822,"title":"Chapter 822 - Mrs. Gu’s Mouth Is Really Vicious","paragraphs":["At this moment, the anger in Lu Xiang’s heart had already reached its peak. She suddenly raised her hand and smashed the wine glass. The dark red wine liquid poured all over the ground and was mixed with glass fragments, scaring everyone.","“Are you done?! Don’t go too far!”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Second Miss Lu, aren’t you a socialite from Li City? Why aren’t you paying attention to your image and getting angry so easily?”","Song Shiyu quickly echoed, “Second Miss Lu, you were the one who looked for trouble first. Now, you’re saying that others have gone too far. Your Lu family is really good at distorting the truth!","“Don’t use your status as an elder to threaten our president. In the past 20 years, have you ever cared about the president? Even though it’s been confirmed that the president is Miss Lu Qingyun’s child, you still insulted him. Since you’re unwilling to be the president’s elder, what right do you have to make him respect you?”","Song Shiyu’s words angered Lu Xiang so much that her eyes rolled back. Her body swayed as she shouted unwillingly, “Gu Zheng, we tried our best to facilitate this collaboration to get closer to you. No matter what, we’re family. Why do you have to make things so awkward?”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. Lu Xiang was too shameless!","Family? Were they worthy? They kept saying that they were family, but had they ever done anything that a family member should do? Back then, when Gu Zheng was abused by Huang Lilan, where was his so-called family? Now, they wanted to use Gu Zheng’s power to gain benefits. Well, they could forget about it!","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Gu Zheng suddenly chuckled. “Young Master Lu, could it be that you didn’t tell Second Miss Lu about my relationship with Liuli Corporation?”","Lu Xiang and Old Master Lu subconsciously looked at Lu Yan. Everyone present knew that Liuli Corporation was the top fashion brand in the world. Rumor had it that the founder was a reclusive family in C Nation. That person’s surname was also Lu.","In order to increase Lu Corporation’s reputation in the fashion industry, the Lu family had contacted Liuli Corporation no less than five times. They wanted to collaborate with them. Even if this collaboration did not earn them money, they were willing to do it. However, they were rejected each time.","Could it be that Liuli Corporation was related to Gu Zheng?","Lu Yan’s expression darkened. The silence seemed to have explained everything.","At this moment, Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Ah Zheng, how could you ask Young Master Lu that? He definitely wouldn’t have told the Lu family. If everyone knows that you’re more outstanding than him in every aspect, how will he have the face to take over the company?","“I forgot to tell everyone that I’m a designer from Liuli Corporation. Even if Young Master Lu is unwilling to have this information revealed, it’s the truth. No one can hide it!","“Ah Zheng, you’d better not make things difficult for Young Master Lu. As a good-for-nothing, it’s already embarrassing enough for him. If you say it in public, it’ll be so embarrassing for him!”","Song Shiyu: “...” What a vicious mouth! Young Madam still had the cheek to say that she was weak?","Gu Zheng could not help but smile. His Mrs. Gu was so cute when she mocked others.","Lu Xiang’s face was filled with disbelief. “Qiao Xi! How could you be a designer of Liuli Corporation? Do you think I’m a three-year-old child?”","“Aunt!” Lu Yan immediately stopped her, then said helplessly, “Miss Qiao is indeed the chief designer of Liuli Corporation and has a lot of influence internationally.”","The moment that was said, Lu Xiang’s face instantly turned pale.","Lu Yan hurriedly reminded her in a low voice, “Aunt, calm down. Don’t forget why we invited them here today. Don’t ruin this plan on an impulse.”","Of course, Lu Xiang knew what to do, but she could not take this lying down. Qiao Xi was actually the chief designer of Liuli Corporation? The Lu family had kept begging for a collaboration with Liuli Corporation!","“Ah Zheng, let’s go. The moment we entered, Second Miss Lu took us down a notch. She even asked me to write a sales plan and asked me to apologize to her. If we continue to stay here, I don’t know what will happen. We might as well leave as soon as possible to avoid unnecessary trouble.”","Qiao Xi’s casual words angered Lu Xiang so much that her nails dug into her palms. Lu Yan hurriedly said, “Miss Qiao, wait.”","Lu Xiang was extremely unwilling, but she still gritted her teeth and lowered her head. She said kindly, “Ah Zheng, I don’t want to make things difficult for you. It was my fault just now. Please take a seat.”","Her lowered eyes were filled with viciousness. She would definitely take revenge for the humiliation she was suffering at this moment. She wanted Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng to have a taste of humiliation in public!","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng did not respond at all when he heard her words. He seemed to be dissatisfied with her ‘apology’."]},{"number":823,"title":"Chapter 823 - Learned Something","paragraphs":["The corners of Lu Xiang’s mouth twitched slightly as her anger burned. She shouted, “Gu Zheng!”","“Second Miss Lu, you haven’t apologized to Mrs. Gu yet.”","Lu Xiang widened her eyes. “What do you mean?”","She had already lowered her head to express her goodwill to Gu Zheng, so what else did he want? Could it be that she really had to apologize to Qiao Xi in front of everyone? That would be too embarrassing!","“If you’re unwilling, we won’t force you. Xi Xi, let’s go.” As soon as Gu Zheng finished speaking, he was about to hold Qiao Xi’s hand and leave.","When Old Master Lu heard this, he glared fiercely at Lu Xiang. Her entire body trembled. She could only grit her teeth and say unwillingly, “Qiao Xi, I’m really sorry. I said something wrong just now. Today is the Lu family’s annual meeting. Let’s quickly take a seat and not delay the rest of the process.”","She suppressed her anger and felt depressed. Her eyes were filled with unwillingness.","At the side, Lu Yan looked at his assistant and asked in a low voice, “How is it?”","The assistant said, “Young Master, everything is ready. The presales of the new perfumes this time will definitely surpass Gu Corporation’s.”","Lu Yan took a deep breath, and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. “Gu Corporation, which has won for five consecutive years, is finally going to lose!”","The farce ended with Lu Xiang apologizing. Qiao Xi did not say anything else and sat down with Gu Zheng. She leaned into Gu Zheng’s ear and said softly, “There’s still 20 minutes.”","20 minutes later, the presales channels for Gu Corporation and Lu Corporation would open at the same time. At this time, the price of the perfumes would be the lowest. Hence, most of the customers would opt for the presales. The winner would be decided in about an hour.","If the difference in presales was not big, there would be some suspense as to who would win. However, if the gap was big, the final outcome could be announced immediately.","Hence, an hour later, they would know who the winner was between Lu Yan and Gu Zheng.","The Lu family specially chose this time to hold the annual meeting. It was to wait for the presales channel to open and witness the final victory.","...","Three minutes before the presales channel opened, a higher-up of Lu Corporation raised his glass. “Young Master Lu, you’ve worked hard for the release of the new perfumes this time. Since it’s the annual meeting today, I wish you victory!”","Qiao Xi muttered in a low voice, “Tsk! Why didn’t he just say that he wishes Lu Yan will surpass you? Can’t he be more direct?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly. He knew what everyone was thinking. Whether they were tactful or direct did not matter to him. He only cared about the outcome.","Lu Yan happily clinked glasses with the higher-up. Then, the two of them looked at each other. Everyone then looked at Gu Zheng. The person asked meaningfully, “Gu Corporation is also releasing a new perfume and invested a large sum of money into it. In the past, Gu Corporation was the top in presales and postsales. President Gu, are you confident in winning the championship this time?”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly.","Lu Xiang, who was at the side, mocked, “Ah Zheng, before your new perfume was developed, a few senior perfumers from Gu Corporation happened to jump ship to Lu Yan’s company. I heard that Gu Corporation had no choice but to use new perfumers. Could it be that your perfume this time...”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as if he did not hear her.","Lu Xiang pretended to be gentle. “Ah Zheng, don’t blame Lu Yan for this. After all, in the business world, strength is everything. Even if you’re brothers, you have to take it seriously. Those perfumers probably think that they have better prospects at Lu Corporation, so they jumped ship.”","Qiao Xi: “...” They would have better prospects at Lu Corporation? Lu Xiang’s ability to lie through her teeth was really unparalleled!","At this moment, the entire venue was silent. Everyone could hear the mockery in Lu Xiang’s words. If it were anyone else, they would have left in anger long ago. However, Gu Zheng was not angry at all. He leisurely held his wine glass and said with a faint smile, “Second Miss Lu.”","The man’s voice was low as he said slowly, “Does having good prospects mean that there’s more room for improvement? Of course, Gu Corporation can’t compare to the Lu family. After all, Gu Corporation is already at the peak of C Nation, while the Lu family has already lost everything this year. There’s indeed a lot of room for improvement. I’ve learned something from you, Second Miss Lu.”","Everyone clicked their tongues in their hearts. Gu Zheng’s mouth was even more vicious than Qiao Xi’s!","Everyone knew that Lu Xiang had just said it casually and wanted to mock Gu Zheng. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng mocked her instead and slapped Lu Xiang in the face. He also mocked the entire Lu family.","Lu Xiang’s eyes almost popped out. “Gu Zheng!”"]},{"number":824,"title":"Chapter 824 - The Lu Family Is Uneducated?","paragraphs":["“That’s right!” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “Second Miss Lu, you probably haven’t read much and don’t know what the future holds. Fortunately, Ah Zheng didn’t grow up in the Lu family when he was young. Otherwise, he’d definitely be laughed at for being uneducated! I advise you to read more books and newspapers when you have nothing to do. Eat less snacks and sleep more as well. Otherwise, you won’t be smart enough and will say things that don’t make sense!”","Lu Xiang was so angry that her face was ferocious. These words were not only an insult to her but also to the entire Lu family. They said that the Lu family was uneducated? Was it fortunate that Gu Zheng did not grow up in the Lu family?","Was a little bastard like him worthy of growing up in the Lu family?","“Shut up!”","Old Master Lu slammed his walking cane on the floor, and his expression was extremely ugly. He glanced at Gu Zheng unhappily. “Lu Xiang just said something wrong in the spur of the moment, but she’s right. Gu Corporation failed to keep their talents. This is also the truth. Ah Zheng, why are you so unforgiving over this small matter?”","“Old Master Lu, you’re right. I didn’t manage to retain the talents. It seems that the Lu family is confident that they’ll win this perfume competition?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at the man. The more gentle and indifferent Gu Zheng was, the more shocking it was. The Lu family would probably lose completely this time and pay a painful price for their stupidity.","Lu Xiang finally found a chance to take revenge. How could she let it go so easily? Hence, she continued to say sarcastically, “There are a total of five perfumers under Lu Yan now. They’ve also received Han Ye’s authorization to print Mr. Han Ye’s work on the packaging of the perfumes. Everyone knows that Mr. Han Ye is the top figure in the oil painting world. There are many people who admire him. Even if it’s just for Mr. Han Ye, many people will fight to buy the perfumes developed by Lu Corporation. Hence, Lu Corporation will definitely not lose this time.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Second Miss Lu, your analysis makes sense.”","Lu Xiang glanced at him in disdain. “Ah Zheng, do you know Han Ye? Have you seen his paintings? This is the first time Han Ye is using his works in the commercial market. Lu Corporation has already won half of the competition just through the packaging.”","Gu Zheng slowly looked up and said casually, “How can I not understand what you understand? You don’t have to repeat it over and over again. It’ll make you look very stupid.”","Qiao Xi: “...” How vicious was this bastard?!","Lu Xiang was so angry that her mouth was wide open. Her expression was extremely miserable.","......","Qiao Xi really did not understand. Lu Xiang clearly could not win against Gu Zheng, yet she still insisted on provoking him. Did the Lu family like the feeling of being slapped in the face?","“President Gu, you seem to be very confident!”","The higher-up of Lu Corporation from earlier snorted. “The presales are about to start. Let’s see who the winner is. You two are both young masters of the Lu family. No matter who wins, it’s a joyous occasion for the Lu family.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Just listen to what he said. How could he have the cheek to say that?","At this moment, Lu Yan was probably already prepared to do his best to make the Lu family’s presales volume higher than Gu Corporation’s. Even if it was just a little higher, he could still raise his head in front of Gu Zheng.","The presales channel was about to open. So many people were watching with excitement as they waited for the high and mighty Gu Zheng to lose. However, this would be the best blow to Lu Yan.","The Lu family wanted to prove that Lu Yan was more outstanding because Lu Yan was carefully nurtured by the elders of the Lu family. He represented the Lu family’s reputation, while Gu Zheng started from scratch. If Lu Yan could not compare to Gu Zheng even though he had so many resources, wouldn’t the Lu family lose their reputation?","Hence, the Lu family wanted to help Lu Yan and dig a hole for Gu Zheng. They wanted to let the entire Li City see who was more suitable to be the heir!","At this moment, Old Master Lu said sternly, “Then let’s see who the final winner is. You’re both my grandchildren. It’s a good thing no matter who wins. Ah Zheng, what do you think?”","Gu Zheng took a sip of red wine, making his lips slightly red. “Alright.”","Qiao Xi sat by his side and curled her lips into a sinister smile.","Next, the presales channel opened. The presales numbers of Gu Corporation and Lu Corporation appeared on the big screen of the hall at the same time. Almost instantly, the number of buyers exceeded 10,000.","There were not many people who had the ability to buy such luxurious perfumes. In just a minute, the number of people buying them exceeded 10,000. It was simply shocking.","As soon as the presales channel was opened, the number of customers would increase. However, the number of customers would decrease in half an hour. It was the same every year."]},{"number":825,"title":"Chapter 825 - Done Illegitimately","paragraphs":["As expected, half an hour later, the number of people buying from Gu Corporation gradually decreased before it stabilized. This was the same as the previous years and also conformed to the presales trend. However, the number of people buying from Lu Corporation continued to increase.","Qiao Xi could tell at a glance that there was something wrong with the data. The Lu family must have hired hackers to secretly manipulate the data, but this person made the data so fake. She felt that it was a little deliberate.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he continued to taste the red wine elegantly. “Looks like we have to thank the Dark Net siblings. Mu Ling even looked for trouble with you before. I didn’t expect her to help us.”","Only then did Qiao Xi realize that Mu Ling and Mu Ming were helping them from behind!","It seemed that Lu Yan was afraid that he would lose to Gu Zheng, so he hired a hacker to deal with the data in advance. However, in order to avoid anyone noticing, he had to fake it according to the presales trend. It was fine as long as he had more sales than Gu Zheng in the end. However, Mu Ming just had to let everyone see that something was wrong and use this method to tell everyone that Lu Corporation was faking it.","Lu Yan also sensed that something was wrong, but fortunately, the data gradually stabilized. He then heaved a sigh of relief.","Now, the screen clearly showed that Lu Corporation’s presales volume was 100,000 bottles higher than Gu Corporation’s. This was already a decisive victory.","Actually, the number of presales for Gu Corporation this year was already higher than before, but it was still 100,000 bottles less than Lu Corporation’s. After all, this was a battle of high-end perfumes. The number of people who could buy high-end perfumes was limited. Now that the difference was so great, it was absolutely impossible to surpass it in the future.","Even with Gu Shan’s reputation, Lu Corporation still won in the end.","Lu Xiang looked at the data on the big screen, and the depression in her heart instantly dissipated. She revealed a proud smile.","“Ah Yan won! Congratulations!”","An hour later, the presales channel was about to close. Lu Corporation’s perfume won the championship with a lead of 100,000 bottles from Gu Corporation. This news instantly became a trending topic.","Everyone on Weibo was discussing: [Lu Corporation’s perfumes used to be so ordinary, but they actually surpassed Gu Corporation’s perfume this time? You have to know that Gu Corporation has been in first place for five years. Now, they’re giving away the championship just like that?]","[Because Lu Corporation poached veteran perfumers from Gu Corporation and invited the perfumer, Sally, back from overseas. They also received Han Ye’s authorization. They had to win!]","[Sally is nothing. The most important thing is Han Ye. Most people are probably after Mr. Han Ye.]","[But why did I hear that when others wanted to buy Han Ye’s copyright previously, he refused them all. Why did he suddenly agree to Lu Corporation this time? Does he think Lu Corporation’s perfumes are very good?]","[Although Gu Corporation has Gu Shan, her reputation is not as resounding as Han Ye’s. Moreover, she’s a fashion designer. She’s still a little lacking in terms of packaging design. Gu Corporation did not lose in vain this time.]","Looking at the comments online, Qiao Xi only smiled. Everyone was buying Lu Corporation’s perfume for Han Ye and not for the smell of the perfume itself.","Everyone was very curious why a genius painter who treated money as dirt would suddenly give his work to the Lu family. It was because of this genius that everyone’s desire to buy Lu Corporation’s perfumes was aroused.","Actually, everyone did not like Sally’s perfume. The reason why the presales volume reached such a high figure was because of Han Ye’s reputation and Mu Ming’s tricks.","Just as the presales channel was about to close, Lu Xiang said proudly, “Ah Zheng, although you lost, you don’t have to take it to heart. Who can occupy the first place for the rest of their life? Ah Yan was lucky to win this time. It might be you next time.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and did not say anything. Lu Xiang did not expect Gu Zheng to be so calm. He was not anxious at all.","Lu Xiang was a little unconvinced and snorted. “Gu Zheng, you’re pretending not to hear your elders talking to you! It looks like the high and mighty President Gu can’t afford to lose!","“You, Gu Zheng, have never lost before because you never confronted Ah Yan before this. Now that he has already taken over Lu Corporation, the status of you two brothers will be on par in Li City in the future. If you lose, you lose. Why do you have to be so cold?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Lu Yan raised the wine glass in his hand and smiled at Gu Zheng.","He was showing off in front of Gu Zheng. He had won!","Everyone knew very well that the presales channel would close soon. It was absolutely impossible for Gu Corporation to have another 100,000 orders at this last moment. If such a thing really happened, it would definitely have been done illegitimately."]},{"number":826,"title":"Chapter 826 - The Final Victor","paragraphs":["Lu Xiang mocked, “Ah Zheng, why don’t you learn from Ah Yan? You have to be humble and careful. Look at you, you can’t take it after losing once. If news of this gets out, outsiders will look down on you.”","Hearing her words, Gu Zheng was not angry at all. Instead, he revealed a meaningful smile.","His tone was indifferent, but it was so cold that it made one’s hair stand on end. “The presales channel hasn’t closed yet. It’s still unknown who will win.”","Instantly, the entire venue was silent. Everyone present was a higher-up of Lu Corporation. They all hoped that Lu Corporation could win this competition, but after Gu Zheng said these words, they suddenly lost their confidence. It was as if the championship belonged to Gu Zheng and no one could snatch it away.","Time flew. There were only 40 seconds left.","Lu Xiang snorted. “Gu Zheng, a loss is a loss. Why is it so hard for you to admit it?!”","Old Master Lu looked up at the data and saw that there were still no problems. He finally relaxed and said earnestly, “Ah Zheng, victory and defeat are common in war. It’s not something embarrassing. You don’t have to take it to heart.","“Now that Ah Yan has won, it proves that he’s more suitable than you to be the heir of the Lu and Gu families.”","Hearing Old Master Lu’s praise, Lu Yan smiled proudly.","Then, Old Master Lu said again, “Ah Zheng, I have to admit that you’ve been managing Gu Corporation very well. It’s indeed very surprising to me, but Ah Yan is a child I raised, after all. I know very well whether he’s capable or not.","“Look at you now. You’ve only lost once, yet you’re silent and ignoring your elders. You have to learn from Ah Yan in this matter. You can’t turn against him after losing once.”","Lu Xiang finally vented her anger and smiled at Lu Yan. Gu Zheng, who had never lost before and who made the entire business world revere him, had completely lost.","Moreover, he had lost to Lu Yan. If news of this got out, where would Gu Zheng’s reputation go?","Qiao Xi looked at the countdown on the screen and smiled indifferently. “Chairman Lu, it’s not time yet. How can you be sure that Ah Zheng has lost?”","Lu Xiang was about to retort when Old Master Lu spoke first, “There are only a few seconds left. Could it be that Ah Zheng can still turn the tables?”","A few seconds passed in the blink of an eye. Everyone stared at the screen and quietly waited for the final outcome.","Everyone from the Lu family was smug. Their smiles were about to reach their ears, but at the last moment...","The smiles on everyone’s faces froze. The data of Lu Corporation disappeared from the screen as if the hundreds of thousands of orders never existed.","After Lu Corporation’s data disappeared, Gu Corporation, which was originally in second place, was pushed to first place and became the champion according to the presales figure.","But what was going on?","Lu Yan’s face was livid as he looked fiercely at his assistant. “What’s going on?”","Cold sweat broke out on Lu Xiang’s forehead as her body went limp. She almost fell. “Impossible! How could such high numbers disappear instantly? There must be something wrong behind the scenes!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the final winner appeared on the screen. It was Gu Corporation.","The entire venue was silent. After a long silence, Gu Zheng slowly said, “I won.”","Silence.","There was dead silence.","In the spacious hall, dozens of people were standing there, but it was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop. Even the sound of breathing had disappeared.","At this moment, the second and third-ranked companies appeared on the screen one after another. Lu Corporation’s name did not appear until after they showed the sixth ranking company.","Lu Corporation was clearly ranked first just now, but now, they weren’t even in the top six. How was this possible?","At this moment, the netizens also started leaving comments: [I’ve already paid the deposit. Why are you suddenly refunding me?]","[What the hell is Lu Corporation doing?! They’re not selling perfumes after causing such a commotion? Are they playing with us?]","[I’ve been waiting in front of the computer to snatch the perfumes! In the end, they suddenly refunded me. They’re really too lousy. I won’t buy Lu Corporation’s products again!]","At this moment, the smiles on the faces of the Lu family had all vanished, replaced by disbelief.","Old Master Lu subconsciously looked at Lu Yan. His face was pale as he shouted angrily, “What exactly is going on? Why did you refund the deposits?”","No one knew what was going on. The entire venue was silent. Everyone was alarmed, and their breathing almost stopped. Only Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi were sitting on the sofa, leisurely tasting red wine and eating the exquisite cakes."]},{"number":827,"title":"Chapter 827 - Perfume","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi seemed to not notice everyone’s gloomy expressions and even praised with a smile, “The desserts in this hotel are not bad. Bring me here for the cakes in the future, alright?”","Gu Zheng smiled and nodded. The couple were sweet and did not care about the Lu family’s feelings at all.","Old Master Lu’s expression was terrifyingly gloomy as he roared, “Gu Zheng!”","“Chairman Lu, why are you angry at Gu Zheng? If you have the time, why don’t you quickly investigate why the data suddenly disappeared?”","Old Master Lu’s expression was gloomy, and his voice was cold. “I’m talking to Gu Zheng. What does it have to do with you? The disappearance of the data must be because someone—”","“Chairman Lu, a loss is a loss. Why are you still such a sore loser?”","Qiao Xi blinked and sighed helplessly. “Victory and defeat are common in war. The business world is constantly changing. It’s hard to say who’ll win or lose. Although Lu Yan lost this time, it’s still possible for him to win the next time if he works harder. He can’t be angry after losing once, right?”","She imitated Old Master Lu’s tone and returned his words to the Lu family.","Old Master Lu was so angry that he felt dizzy. His face was ferocious and vicious as he panted heavily. After a long time, he roared, “Shut up! Today’s matter has nothing to do with you. Otherwise, I—”","“Chairman! We found out what happened!”","At this moment, Lu Yan’s assistant rushed in and interrupted Old Master Lu. He announced loudly, “The reason for the disappearance of the data has been found. Actually...”","Lu Yan’s heart trembled. The assistant looked at him meaningfully, then lowered his head and said word by word, “The oil painter, Mr. Han Ye, is suing us for using his paintings for the packaging of perfumes without permission. The court has already accepted this case and contacted the sales channel. After the platform confirmed the authenticity of the case, they removed the new perfumes and want us to compensate five million yuan for the breach of contract.","“Moreover, all the bottles with Mr. Han Ye’s paintings must be destroyed. Otherwise, Mr. Han Ye will continue to appeal. At that time, not only will the Lu family have to compensate with a large sum of money, but their reputation will also be damaged.”","......","As soon as the assistant finished speaking, everyone from the Lu family turned pale as cold sweat broke out on their foreheads.","Old Master Lu’s body swayed as he fell onto the chair. His old eyes were filled with despair. “Lu Yan, didn’t you say that you already obtained Han Ye’s authorization?”","Lu Corporation’s perfumes were packaged with Han Ye’s paintings. It was also because of this gimmick that Lu Corporation’s perfumes attracted so much attention. Otherwise, they would never have been able to win against Gu Zheng.","Now that Han Ye was suing Lu Corporation, it naturally spread online. Everyone also knew the reason behind this. At that time, Lu Corporation’s reputation would plummet.","Old Master Lu still had a trace of hope. “Ah Yan?”","At this moment, Lu Yan’s mind was blank. He did not know what was wrong. He had clearly gone to the art exhibition and found a hacker. All the clues could confirm that Han Ye had already passed away. Moreover, Han Ye did not have any relatives, so he could use the copyright as he pleased.","In order to ensure that nothing went wrong, he even found two top hackers from Dark Net. They also came to the conclusion that Han Ye had passed away, but why did Han Ye suddenly appear and sue Lu Corporation?","Moreover, he sued Lu Corporation on the day of the presales. He took down all the perfumes in the last few seconds and deliberately blew things up. The only person who could do all this was probably—","Lu Yan abruptly raised his eyes to look at Gu Zheng, only to see that his expression was indifferent as if this matter had nothing to do with him at all. He was still putting food into Qiao Xi’s bowl with a doting expression. The two of them were showing off their love as if no one was around.","As Lu Yan’s gaze was too sharp, everyone could not help but look at Gu Zheng.","Old Master Lu’s gaze was sharp. Lu Xiang’s face was filled with anger as she screamed, “Gu Zheng, it must be you!”","Even though Qiao Xi had lowered her eyes, she was able to notice the burning and angry gazes around her. Under the doubts of everyone, Gu Zheng still wiped her mouth intimately, then said indifferently, “Second Miss Lu, you can’t spout nonsense. What evidence do you have to prove that I did it?”","Lu Xiang was furious and shouted, “What evidence do I need? It’s clearly you. Announcement of the new perfumes was made a month ago. Why didn’t Han Ye sue us then? He just had to wait until the day the presales channel opened to do so. He even refunded the deposits in the last few seconds. Do you dare say that you didn’t do it?”"]},{"number":828,"title":"Chapter 828 - No Brothers In Business","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “Young Master Lu didn’t receive the authorization, so Han Ye can sue you at any time. You can only blame Young Master Lu for being too careless and not understanding the situation. What does it have to do with me?”","Qiao Xi: “...” This matter indeed had nothing to do with Gu Zheng, but it was related to Han Ye!","Lu Xiang was so angry that she could not say anything. She could not flare up in front of everyone and could only take deep breaths to relieve her emotions. However, her face was terrifyingly vicious.","The most important thing now was not to question Gu Zheng but to salvage the Lu family’s image. Han Ye had already successfully sued them, and the perfume bottles had to be destroyed. However, even if they destroyed the bottles and changed the packaging, everyone would know that they were the original perfumes. They would still feel conflicted about purchasing them.","However, if they really destroyed all the finished perfumes and developed new perfumes, Lu Corporation would suffer a huge loss. Hence, their only way was to immediately look for Han Ye. No matter what, they had to make Han Ye forgive them and prove that all of this was a misunderstanding.","Lu Yan gritted his teeth and said, “I only confirmed the results after asking around. How could Mr. Han Ye sue us? Someone must be deliberately harming Lu Corporation’s interests.","“Everyone, I’ll give you a satisfactory answer for today’s matter and do my best to salvage Lu Corporation’s image and losses.”","After Lu Yan finished speaking, he looked fiercely at Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng raised his glass indifferently and smiled.","Not long after, the news of Lu Corporation being sued by Han Ye was suppressed. The platform explained to the public that the packaging of Lu Corporation’s perfumes needed to be changed. They did not say that the packaging was infringing on rights.","However, this could only temporarily suppress the news. Before long, it would still be exposed.","On the other hand, Lu Yan was still anxiously investigating, but the result was that Han Ye was no longer alive. Then, he found an important piece of information. The person who was suing had the surname Gu. Even though the information was hidden very well, he still found some clues.","The person’s surname was Gu?","Lu Yan flew into a rage. The person suing was surnamed Gu? How could this have nothing to do with Gu Zheng? Even if it was not him, he must have instructed someone else to do it.","......","He glanced at the banquet hall and walked toward Gu Zheng. Everyone’s gaze followed his footsteps to Gu Zheng.","Lu Yan could not suppress the anger in his heart. His gentle mask had already cracked as he questioned, “Gu Zheng, did you sue Lu Corporation?”","Boom!!!","A thunderclap exploded in everyone’s hearts, and they were dumbfounded.","Qiao Xi sat lazily on the sofa and looked at Lu Yan with a smile.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Do you have evidence?”","Lu Yan snorted and slammed his phone on the table. “I’ve already found out that the person suing us is surnamed Gu. Moreover, Lu Corporation’s perfumes were taken off the shelves. The person who would benefit from this is you, Gu Zheng. Other than the Gu family, there are no other families in Li City with the surname Gu. Who else could it be but you?”","Old Master Lu had already thought that Gu Zheng was behind this. Now that Lu Yan had also produced strong evidence, he could determine that this grandson of his was indeed an ingrate. He actually dared to sue the Lu family.","Did he know how much impact this would have on the Lu family? The loss of perfumes was only a part of it. The most important thing was their reputation. Many people would not buy Lu Corporation’s products anymore because of this.","When Lu Xiang heard this, she instantly roared, “Gu Zheng!”","Gu Zheng slowly looked up and said casually, “Young Master Lu, is that all?”","Lu Yan gasped and gritted his teeth. “Gu Zheng, can you guarantee that this has nothing to do with you? Can you explain why the person suing us has the surname Gu?”","Everyone looked at Gu Zheng in unison. Everyone knew very well that even if Gu Zheng did not personally sue them, it would still have something to do with him.","There were no brothers in the business world. It was not strange for Gu Zheng to set up Lu Corporation for Gu Corporation, but such methods were really despicable, so everyone thought that Gu Zheng would not admit it no matter what.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng nodded and smiled indifferently. “It’s indeed not a coincidence. I didn’t expect Young Master Lu to be so smart.”","The moment that was said, the entire venue exploded. Only then did everyone realize that... Gu Zheng had admitted it?","Lu Yan’s expression instantly turned ferocious. “Gu Zheng! Didn’t you say that this has nothing to do with you? Are you lying to me?”","“Young Master Lu, you’ve misunderstood. What I meant was that you were the one who rashly sold the perfumes, causing Lu Corporation to be sued. This has nothing to do with me. I just did what I should have done.”"]},{"number":829,"title":"Chapter 829 - Far Away","paragraphs":["Old Master Lu stood up angrily and rushed in front of Gu Zheng with a gloomy expression. “Ah Zheng, although you and Ah Yan are competitors, you’re also brothers. How could you use such despicable methods behind our backs?! Do you know how much loss you’ve caused the Lu family?","“I know you hate the Lu family, but we want to make it up to you. However, look at what you’ve done!”","Old Master Lu sighed and ordered, “Immediately withdraw the lawsuit so that our new perfumes can be released on time. If you do that, I won’t pursue the matter of Lu Corporation’s losses.”","In everyone’s opinion, Old Master Lu was already showing Gu Zheng a lot of respect. As long as Gu Zheng was willing to withdraw the lawsuit, the Lu family could pretend that nothing had happened. If it were an outsider, the Lu family would not let them off so easily.","Even if the perfumes were resold, it would still cause a huge loss to Lu Corporation. Old Master Lu was already being very tolerant by doing this.","However, Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. Qiao Xi, who was at the side, said in confusion, “Why should we withdraw the lawsuit? The Lu family violated the law, so why shouldn’t we let others protect their rights? Now that the lawsuit has been successfully filed, it means that the Lu family has indeed violated the law. What reason do you have to ask us to withdraw the lawsuit?”","Old Master Lu instantly choked. Lu Xiang was so angry that her face turned livid.","Qiao Xi deliberately asked in a weak and innocent voice, making the Lu family feel even more embarrassed. Could it be that she wanted them to say it from their own mouths? Because Gu Zheng was half a member of the Lu family, this matter should be over.","“Why aren’t Chairman Lu and Second Miss Lu saying anything?","“Since you all know it in your hearts, why do you still want Ah Zheng to withdraw the lawsuit? You’re bullying our Ah Zheng for having a good temper!”","Lu Xiang was so angry that she almost vomited blood!","Who had a good temper?","They were bullying Gu Zheng? Who was bullying who?","Why was Qiao Xi lying through her teeth? Who in Li City and even the entire C Nation would dare to bully Gu Zheng?","Old Master Lu suppressed his anger and ordered unhappily, “Ah Zheng, if you’re dissatisfied, we can talk in private, but you have to withdraw the lawsuit immediately. After all, none of us has seen Han Ye before. Maybe you found someone to fool us.”","Qiao Xi sneered. Who said they had never seen Han Ye before? He was right in front of them!","Old Master Lu’s gaze was cold, and his tone was serious. “How could Lu Yan do anything illegal? He had long done a detailed investigation before putting the perfumes into production! Ah Zheng, you’re slandering us! You can’t harm your brother behind our backs for your own benefits!”","Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent. “The lawsuit was successful. Doesn’t this explain everything?”","Lu Xiang immediately retorted, “You’re rich and powerful. You must be behind this! We’ve never even seen Han Ye, so why should we believe you?”","“Why should you believe me?”","Gu Zheng chuckled. “Then I’ll prove it to you.”","...","At this moment, outside the banquet hall.","Gu Yao got out of the car with a middle-aged woman who was dressed exquisitely. “Madam Carter, we’re here.”","The people at the door looked disdainful. “Oh! So it’s Second Young Master Gu! You’ve already been chased out of the Gu family, yet you still have the cheek to attend Lu Corporation’s annual meeting? The audacity!”","Madam Carter’s face darkened.","Gu Yao was not angry. He widened his eyes and said, “Well, even you have the cheek to stand here. Why can’t I be here? It’s your Lu family’s honor that I’m here!”","The person instantly choked. Before he could retort, Gu Yao snorted. “No matter how shameless I am, I’m still better than your Lu family. Your Lu family is so shameless!”","“Gu Yao! Don’t go too far!”","Gu Yao could not be bothered with this small fry. “Madam Carter, let’s go in.”","The usher still wanted to stop them, but Gu Yao pointed at the invitation in his hand. “Open your eyes wide and see clearly. We have an invitation. What right do you have to stop us from entering? Doesn’t the Lu family care about their reputation the most? If news of this gets out, will Lu Yan let you off?”","With that said, the two people instantly lost their arrogance. When they looked up, Gu Yao had already brought Madam Carter in.","In the banquet hall, the air seemed to have frozen. The atmosphere was extremely cold.","At this moment, Lu Xiang could not care less about her image anymore. She said with bloodshot eyes, “Alright! I want to see how you’re going to prove it. Unless you invite Mr. Han Ye over, how are you going to prove that the Lu family violated the law? You, Gu Zheng, are rich and powerful. You have the ability to forge evidence. Even if the lawsuit succeeds, it doesn’t mean anything. Moreover, even if Ah Yan really violated the law, the person who wants to sue is Han Ye. What right do you have to sue on behalf of him?”"]},{"number":830,"title":"Chapter 830 - Revenge On The Lu Family","paragraphs":["In everyone’s opinion, Gu Zheng was suing Lu Corporation for copyright infringement and even removed Lu Corporation’s perfumes at the critical moment when the presales channel was opened. He was clearly provoking the Lu family.","Although this former illegitimate child had already recovered his identity, the Lu family did not acknowledge him. Hence, he had to use this method to take revenge on the Lu family.","Ignoring the fact that his behavior was shameless, what right did he have to sue the Lu family? If he wanted to sue, Han Ye should have been the one to do it! Gu Zheng had no right!","Gu Zheng swirled the wine in his glass gently, his eyes were deep. They were filled with mockery and disdain.","Lu Xiang was instantly infuriated. “Gu Zheng, did you hear me?! I told you to withdraw the lawsuit immediately! Ah Yan wouldn’t have infringed the rights. Since he could put the products into production without worry, he must be confident. Even if there’s a possibility of infringement, it should be Mr. Han Ye suing the Lu family. What right do you have?!”","“Chairman!”","At this moment, the chairman’s secretary rushed in while panting. “Gu Yao is here!”","Old Master Lu had never liked Gu Yao. He was just a stupid hedonistic son. Huang Lilan only raised him to pave the way for Lu Yan. Although they had sent Gu Yao an invitation out of respect, they could not be bothered to interact with someone like Gu Yao. They did not expect Gu Yao to come.","However... what was he doing here?","Old Master Lu’s face was gloomy. He was about to send Gu Yao away when he heard his secretary say while trembling, “Y-Young Master Gu Yao said that he brought someone with him today. He’s also here to attend Lu Corporation’s annual meeting, but that person doesn’t have an invitation. If I’m not wrong, that person is Madam Carter, a famous figure in the oil painting world.”","Everyone present had heard of the name Carter. It could be said that this name resounded throughout the entire oil painting world. Everyone knew her.","Lu Yan suddenly recalled that Carter seemed to be very familiar with Qiao Xi. Moreover, Qiao Xi had the identity of Han Yin. Perhaps Carter was here to help Gu Zheng.","At this moment, the secretary said again, “Chairman, Madam Carter said that she came here because she heard that Lu Corporation and Han Ye were working together, so she came to congratulate you.”","......","Carter was here to congratulate Lu Corporation?","Lu Corporation and Carter had nothing to do with each other. Of course, she was not here because of Lu Corporation. She probably admired Han Ye and specially came to show her face.","Lu Yan subconsciously looked at Gu Zheng. Since Carter already made her way over to congratulate him, what reason did Gu Zheng have to sue the Lu family?","He heard that Carter and Han Ye had known each other for many years. She definitely knew about Han Ye. If Han Ye really passed away and Gu Zheng still wanted to sue the Lu family, then Gu Zheng would just be looking for trouble. At that time, Madam Carter would expose Gu Zheng and he would completely lose his reputation.","Lu Yan looked up at Old Master Lu. The two of them understood each other’s thoughts.","Lu Xiang could not suppress the excitement in her heart and hurriedly said, “Hurry up and invite Madam Carter in!”","Carter quickly entered the banquet hall and saw Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi not far away. She was about to greet them when Old Master Lu warmly came to welcome them. She could not refuse and could only nod politely.","“Madam Carter, it’s an honor for you to attend Lu Corporation’s annual meeting.”","Carter smiled indifferently. “I’m really sorry to have come so suddenly. I just heard that Lu Corporation and Han Ye are collaborating to release new perfumes. I happened to meet Mr. Gu Yao, so I congratulated him as well.","“Han Ye’s oil paintings are considered treasures in the world. I admire his talent very much. To be able to use his oil paintings as packaging for perfumes, Lu Corporation’s perfumes will definitely sell well.”","Old Master Lu and Lu Yan nodded, then revealed regretful expressions.","Carter sensed that something was wrong and asked in confusion, “Is there something wrong with what I said?”","Lu Yan replied respectfully, “No, it’s just a pity that the perfumes can’t be released for the time being.”","Carter continued to ask, “Why? Are the results of the presales not good? Young Master Lu, don’t be sad. There are many people who like Han Ye. When the perfumes are officially released, there’ll definitely be many people fighting to buy them.”","With that, Carter could not help but look at Gu Zheng. In the past, Han Ye never had any business cooperation. Now that he had suddenly agreed to collaborate with Lu Corporation, it meant that he had a deep relationship with Lu Corporation.","However, when she entered the banquet hall and saw Han Ye and Han Yin, she felt that something was wrong. The couple’s eyes were filled with ridicule.","She could not help but wonder if she had come to the wrong place. Why did she feel that Han Ye’s relationship with Lu Corporation was not good? Then why did he authorize the Lu family to use his works?"]},{"number":831,"title":"Chapter 831 - No Evidence","paragraphs":["Before Carter could figure it out, Lu Yan said helplessly, “During the presales, Lu Corporation was always in first place. We even surpassed Gu Corporation by 100,000 bottles.”","Carter nodded thoughtfully. “In that case, why do you look so regretful, Young Master Lu?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Lu Yan glanced at Gu Zheng, who was not far away. He suppressed the anger in his heart and said sorrowfully, “But when the presales channel was about to close, all our sales were canceled.”","“Why?” Carter asked.","Everyone subconsciously looked at Gu Zheng. Lu Yan looked worried. “Because someone is suing Lu Corporation for copyright infringement. This is our Lu family’s own matter and we shouldn’t trouble you. However, I heard that you’re Mr. Han Ye’s friend, so you should be clearer on this matter.”","Hearing this, Carter was instantly confused, but since Lu Yan had already said so, she could not say anything else. She could only nod. “Young Master Lu, please speak.”","When Lu Xiang heard this, she could not wait to mock Gu Zheng. “Gu Zheng, Madam Carter is already here. Are you still not going to withdraw the lawsuit?”","Gu Zheng did not even raise his eyes.","At this moment, Lu Yan walked in front of Carter and said respectfully, “Madam Carter, it’s my honor that you’re here for Lu Corporation’s annual meeting. Unfortunately, there were some problems with the presales this time. At the last moment before the presales channel closed, all of Lu Corporation’s sales were canceled. The person suing Lu Corporation for copyright infringement is Gu Zheng.","“Gu Zheng is suing Lu Corporation for copyright infringement in Han Ye’s name. In order to expand the negative impact of the matter, he even chose to forcefully refund all deposits made at the last moment before the presales ended. At the same time, Gu Corporation was pushed to first place.","“For his own benefits, he used such despicable methods to frame the Lu family. It has affected the Lu family’s reputation and broken the balance of the entire business world. If this is the way to become the richest man in the world, I’d rather not be it!”","These words caused a commotion in the calm banquet hall. Everyone revealed disdainful expressions.","Old Master Lu, who was at the side, nodded in satisfaction. Then, he sighed. “Ah Zheng, it’s understandable for you brothers to compete with each other, but why did you play tricks behind our backs? You relied on suing us to win the sales championship. You’re too despicable. Your reputation will also be affected. From now on, who will be at ease doing business with you?”","......","Lu Xiang was proud of herself. “Quickly withdraw the lawsuit or bear the consequences!”","Carter listened to everyone with a subtle expression.","What was the Lu family talking about? Why did she not understand?","“Mr. Gu is suing Lu Corporation for copyright infringement?”","After a long time, Carter asked in confusion, “Is it because Lu Corporation used Mr. Han Ye’s work without permission that they’re being sued now?”","Gu Zheng’s lips curled into a cold smile. He did not expect Carter to attend the annual meeting, but things became even simpler now that she was here.","Lu Yan had a helpless expression, and his gentle voice was filled with unwillingness. “First of all, we didn’t violate the law. Secondly, Gu Zheng isn’t Han Ye. If our Lu family had really violated the law, Mr. Han Ye should be the one suing us. Mr. Gu doesn’t seem to have the right.","“Isn’t it a little too much for Mr. Gu to pretend to be Han Ye and sue us?”","At this point, Lu Yan even sighed as if he was an honest person who was forced to do this. Meanwhile, he made Gu Zheng seem like a sinister, cunning, and selfish person.","“If Mr. Han Ye sues me, I have nothing to say, but he wouldn’t do that. Madam Carter, what do you think?”","When Carter heard Lu Yan’s words, her eyes instantly widened. She looked at Lu Yan, then at Gu Zheng. She asked with a subtle expression, “Young Master Lu, did you really obtain Han Ye’s authorization?”","Lu Yan said confidently, “Of course. I’ve long received Mr. Han Ye’s authorization. I don’t know where President Gu heard the rumors that I don’t have the authorization. It’s really shameful of him to rashly sue Lu Corporation for his own benefits.","“If only Mr. Han Ye could appear and clear my name. Unfortunately, that’s impossible.”","Lu Yan looked regretful. “I’ve investigated. Mr. Han Ye has already...”","Han Ye had already passed away and there were no relatives around him. Who was qualified to sue Lu Corporation for copyright infringement?","Even if he did not have Han Ye’s written authorization, he could still say that he had previously obtained Mr. Han Ye’s verbal authorization. After all, there was no evidence, and no one could verify it. Even if Gu Zheng wanted to sue him, he did not have any evidence.","At the thought of this, Lu Yan smiled proudly. He had completely won this time."]},{"number":832,"title":"Chapter 832 - Slapping The Lu Family In The Face","paragraphs":["As soon as Lu Yan finished speaking, Carter frowned. Old Master Lu, who was at the side, sensed that something was wrong. He was about to stop Carter, but...","“Who said it’s impossible?”","Carter looked at Lu Yan as if she was looking at a fool. “Young Master Lu, how do you know that you won’t be able to see Han Ye? Actually, you’ve already seen him!”","...","The entire venue was silent, eerily so.","Lu Yan felt as if he had been struck by lightning. His heart skipped a beat as he had an ominous feeling.","When had he seen Han Ye? Hadn’t Han Ye already passed away?","The corners of Lu Yan’s mouth twitched slightly, and his gentle face gradually became ferocious. He did not even dare to carefully figure out what Carter meant.","If Han Ye was not dead, then Lu Corporation’s copyright infringement...","No! Impossible! Carter did not know before she came, which meant that Han Ye had not announced this matter to the public yet. If that was the case, they still had a chance. As long as they found Han Ye and gave him a generous compensation, there would be room for negotiation.","However, for some reason, he felt waves of panic in his heart. There was an aura of despair surrounding him.","Old Master Lu’s expression darkened. He knew that he could not let Carter speak anymore.","Carter, on the other hand, had a mocking expression. It turned out that Lu Yan did not know that Gu Zheng was Han Ye, so he used Han Ye’s painting without permission. Now that Gu Zheng was suing Lu Corporation, Lu Corporation was accusing Gu Zheng of playing tricks.","......","She had seen shameless people, but she had never seen someone so shameless!","“Young Master Lu, do you want to know who Han Ye is?”","Lu Yan’s body trembled. He subconsciously looked at Gu Zheng, only to see the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curl into a smile. It was extremely lazy but carried a trace of coldness.","When Lu Xiang saw him like this, she was instantly infuriated. “Gu Zheng! What’s with your expression? Even if Mr. Han Ye can’t testify for Ah Yan, it doesn’t mean that you can pretend to be Mr. Han Ye and sue Lu Corporation! Moreover, Ah Yan has long since received the authorization. You’re slandering him!","“Gu Zheng, if you use this method to win the championship, you’ll be despised by everyone!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng chuckled.","“Of course, he can sue Lu Corporation.”","At this moment, a cold and serious voice sounded. Carter revealed a mocking expression. “Gu Zheng is the person most qualified to sue Lu Corporation!”","He had the right? What right did he have? The person most qualified to sue Lu Corporation should be Han Ye!","Lu Xiang was about to retort loudly when her body suddenly trembled as if someone was grabbing her throat. Her face was livid, then she suddenly looked at Gu Zheng with disbelief.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was sitting leisurely on the sofa with his long legs crossed. Under everyone’s burning gazes, he was still elegant and noble.","The man’s lips curled up slightly. In the eyes of the Lu family, such a smile was a public provocation!","Before everyone could come back to their senses, Carter sneered. “Young Master Lu Yan, you keep saying that you’ve obtained Han Ye’s authorization, so why don’t you know that Mr. Gu is Han Ye?”","Boom!!!","Mr. Gu was Han Ye?","These words were like a thunderclap that struck everyone’s hearts. Everyone was dumbfounded, and the Lu family’s expressions alternated between red and white.","Carter’s words gave the Lu family a heavy slap. Old Master Lu’s face darkened as he could not help but size up Lu Yan. The grandson he had raised since he was young was actually so different from Gu Zheng?","Lu Yan clenched his fists tightly. His mind went blank. His gentle face was filled with malevolence, and the veins on his forehead were about to pop out.","Carter continued to question, “Young Master Lu, you must’ve met Han Ye when you were discussing a collaboration, right? Even if you hadn’t met him, you must’ve contacted him through the internet or phone. Since Lu Corporation has already obtained the authorization, why doesn’t anyone know that Mr. Gu is Han Ye?”","Lu Yan felt like he was sitting on pins and needles. He could not suppress the anger in his heart anymore. He glared fiercely at the calm man not far away. His face gradually darkened from pale to black. He wished he could tear Gu Zheng into pieces.","As the young master of the Lu family, Lu Yan had grown up with a silver spoon in his mouth. He was even nurtured by the Lu family with all their hearts. They had also decided to hand over the Lu family’s inheritance to him. He was supposed to be the person standing at the top of the pyramid, but ever since Gu Zheng established Gu Corporation, everyone began to disregard him.","He originally thought that he could break off Gu Zheng’s sharp edges this time and prove to everyone that he was the most suitable candidate to be the heir of the Gu and Lu families.","However, someone actually told him that Gu Zheng was Han Ye.","This was impossible! Absolutely impossible!"]},{"number":833,"title":"Chapter 833 - Send Him To Prison","paragraphs":["Looking at the Lu family’s expression, Qiao Xi, who was at the side, had already lost her patience. She snorted coldly. “Lu Yan has never seen Han Ye at all, much less obtained Han Ye’s permission. That’s why he doesn’t know Han Ye. Coincidentally, Gu Zheng realized that his work was being privately used by someone else. Shouldn’t he exercise his legal rights to protect his interests? It turns out that in the eyes of the Lu family, anyone who hurts the Lu family’s interests is selfish? How laughable!”","“Qiao Xi!” Old Master Lu was unable to restrain his anger.","His entire body trembled as fear surged in his heart. If news of this got out, the entire business world would despise the Lu family. The Lu family, which was already in a precarious situation, would definitely encounter an unprecedented crisis.","However, how did Gu Zheng become Han Ye? He was treated as an illegitimate child the moment he was born and was despised by everyone. He was left in Maple Garden to fend for himself when he was young. Even his parents hated him. Moreover, how could a person who was about to die from poison become a top figure in the oil painting world?","Back then, they firmly believed that Gu Zheng would not live past the age of six, so they agreed to swap children with Huang Lilan. They wanted to focus on nurturing Lu Yan for him to inherit the family business in the future. However, they did not expect that not only did Gu Zheng survive, but he also founded Gu Corporation from scratch.","Now that Gu Corporation had become the leading company in C Nation, Gu Zheng had also become a famous figure in the business world. Not only that, but he also had more influence in the art world. It could be said that he could command hundreds of people.","On the other hand, Lu Yan had the outstanding resources of the Gu and Lu families, but he was still stuck at the same spot. It was very difficult for him to even continue managing Lu Corporation.","Old Master Lu’s heart ached. At this moment, he was badly regretting it. If he had chosen Gu Zheng back then, would the outcome have been different? However, there was no turning back now. Gu Zheng already knew what the Lu family had done and would not favor them anymore. Now, he could only place all his hopes on Lu Yan and hope that Lu Yan could make a comeback one day.","They could not fall out with Gu Zheng now. No matter what, they had to get him to withdraw the lawsuit. Otherwise, Lu Corporation would suffer irreversible losses.","Old Master Lu was silent for a moment before squeezing out a flattering smile. “Ah Zheng—”","Gu Zheng’s long fingers stroked the wine glass as he slowly looked up. His cold voice interrupted Old Master Lu’s words. “I have two requests. First, Lu Corporation has to destroy all the perfume bottles with my work printed on it. Second, Lu Corporation has to compensate me for the infringement fees at three times the authorized price.","“Otherwise, what Lu Yan has to pay with isn’t money but his future and reputation. The Lu family has nurtured Lu Yan for more than 20 years. We can’t just watch him go to jail, right, Chairman Lu?”","Boom!!!","......","Lu Yan’s heart skipped a beat.","Gu Zheng! What right did he have?","Old Master Lu was so angry that he felt dizzy. “Gu Zheng! You... What do you mean? Are you threatening us?”","This bastard! He had the Lu family’s bloodline, yet he still wanted the Lu family to compensate him?","Gu Zheng chuckled. “Chairman Lu, you already understand, so why ask? Let me tell you again that I want the Lu family’s compensation. Otherwise, I’ll see you in court.”","“Gu Zheng! You’re fooling around!” Old Master Lu was so angry that his beard was trembling. He slammed his walking cane on the floor. “How unfilial!”","A bastard who was hated by his parents still dared to be so arrogant?","Old Master Lu’s breathing was heavy, and his face was purple. Lu Yan hurriedly went forward to support him, then turned to look at Gu Zheng. “President Gu, you’re from the Lu family, after all. Why do you have to—”","“Young Master Lu, my surname isn’t Lu. Besides, do you think I’m from the Lu family?”","At this moment, Qiao Xi walked forward, her eyes filled with coldness. “Young Master Lu, now that everyone knows that Ah Zheng is Miss Lu Qingyun’s son, what’s your identity as the child who once called himself Miss Lu Qingyun’s child? Why is Huang Lilan so good to you? Why would she rather bear everything herself than let you be tainted?","“Don’t treat everyone as a fool. Everyone knows your identity. You’re just a puppet nurtured by the Lu family. Now that you’ve damaged Gu Zheng’s rights, he has the right to sue you. What right do you have to ask him to let you off?”","Qiao Xi clicked her tongue. “We don’t need the money. In any case, we husband and wife and don’t lack money. It’s useless to ask for compensation of just a couple billions. Why don’t we just send Young Master Lu to jail? It’s such a large case. I wonder how many years Young Master Lu will be sentenced to?”"]},{"number":834,"title":"Chapter 834 - Ordinary And Confident","paragraphs":["“The evidence is conclusive, yet Young Master Lu is still unrepentant. Even if your Lu family hires the most powerful lawyer, you have no chance of winning. However, the Lu family is still a big family in Li City, after all. With your connections and Young Master Lu’s good performance, he’ll be released in a few years. Unfortunately, Young Master Lu will be someone who has been to jail then. I don’t know if he’ll still have a chance to be the heir.”","The Lu family’s faces turned livid.","“Gu Zheng!” Lu Yan gritted his teeth.","“What? Are you angry from embarrassment, Young Master Lu?” Qiao Xi’s face was filled with ridicule.","At this moment, Lu Yan wanted to cover Qiao Xi’s mouth. He even wondered why he had a good impression of this woman back then and even dealt with the Qiao family for Qiao Xi.","He originally thought that he could rely on his sincerity to move Qiao Xi and get her to leave Gu Zheng to be with him. As long as Qiao Xi was willing to divorce Gu Zheng, he could disregard the past and marry her. However, he never expected that all of this was just his wishful thinking. Qiao Xi had already been bewitched by Gu Zheng, and her mind was filled with thoughts of what was best for Gu Zheng. Why should he ask for trouble?!","Lu Yan had long known that Qiao Xi was not to be trifled with, but he did not expect her to have such a vicious tongue. Every word she said stabbed at his heart.","However, Mrs. Gu was not appeased. She continued to attack crazily. “Young Master Lu, have you looked in the mirror?! I want to vomit just looking at your hypocritical appearance!","“I really don’t understand why your Lu family is so confident when you’re so ordinary! You were the one who broke the law and even made Ah Zheng lower his head. What right do you have? Just because you’re shameless?","“Don’t you think so?”","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, Gu Yao chimed in, “Yes, yes! Since you made a mistake, you should either go to jail or pay the compensation. However, you don’t want to compensate or go to jail. You even said that my brother is unfilial. The Lu family is really good at distorting the truth!”","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation looked at Lu Yan with subtle expressions. At this moment, they began to wonder if the heir they were following really had the ability to lead them.","Previously, Lu Yan spent a lot of money to buy a plot of land to build a resort. Unexpectedly, not long after, it was discovered that there was a tomb underground, causing Lu Corporation to lose 10 billion yuan. Now, because of the packaging of the perfumes, Lu Corporation suffered a huge loss.","Could it be that Lu Yan was a spy sent by the enemy?","Ever since he took over Lu Corporation, not only had he not made any achievements, but he had also lost more than 10 billion yuan. Lu Corporation was already in a difficult situation. If this continued, how long would Lu Corporation survive?","Old Master Lu also noticed everyone’s gazes. At this moment, his face was ferocious, and his old eyes were filled with horror and anger. His body swayed as if he would faint the next second.","He suppressed the anger in his heart. He absolutely could not have a falling out with Gu Zheng in public. Although he could not let Gu Zheng be of use to him, he could not become enemies with Gu Zheng either.","Right now, he could only use his bloodline to force Gu Zheng to yield, so he had to endure it.","Old Master Lu shot a look at one of the higher-ups. The other party instantly understood and said while trembling, “President Gu, how about this? During the presales, Lu Corporation sold a total of 800,000 bottles of perfume. We promise to only sell these 800,000 bottles. The total amount is about 900 million. We’re willing to compensate you at twice the price. We just hope that you won’t pursue the matter with Lu Corporation.”","Old Master Lu lowered his eyes and clenched his fists.","Anger! Unwillingness!","Unexpectedly, after spending his entire life in the business world, he still ended up losing to his grandson.","The 900 million yuan was the total price after all the perfumes were sold. However, after deducting the publicity fees, research and development fees, and materials fees, the final net profit was only 200 million yuan.","However, they still had to compensate Gu Zheng with 1.8 billion yuan. The employees of Lu Corporation had been busy for two months. In the end, not only did they not earn a single cent, but they even lost 2.5 billion yuan.","Who could accept this outcome?","Old Master Lu could not just watch Lu Corporation go bankrupt. Not only did he have to pay Gu Zheng 1.8 billion, but he also had to ask him to accept the money and immediately withdraw the lawsuit so that he would not mention this matter again.","Old Master Lu had never been so embarrassed in his life. He knew that he had been schemed against by Gu Zheng, but he did not dare to go head-on with him. He could only willingly hand over 1.8 billion.","It was extremely humiliating...","Lu Yan’s expression was gloomy, and there was a strong smell of blood in his mouth. He even felt that he was about to faint. At this moment, he finally felt like he was being stepped on by Gu Zheng."]},{"number":835,"title":"Chapter 835 - Compensate 1.8 billion","paragraphs":["Lu Corporation’s annual meeting had only started for half an hour, but Lu Yan had already lowered his head and was being questioned by all the higher-ups of Lu Corporation. Meanwhile, Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa and calmly tasting red wine. His expression did not change at all.","When Lu Xiang heard that she had to compensate Gu Zheng 1.8 billion yuan, she was instantly angry.","Why? That was 1.8 billion, not 180,000! Moreover, the Lu family was already in a difficult situation. How could Gu Zheng have the cheek to take this sum of money?","This scumbag deserved to die! If she had known earlier, she would have killed him when he was young. Then, there would not be so much trouble now.","Lu Xiang could not suppress the anger in her heart and cursed, “Gu Zheng! You ingrate! Do you have the cheek to ask for this money? It’s 1.8 billion!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Old Master Lu’s blood surged. He roared, “Shut up!”","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation also looked at Lu Xiang in disdain. This woman was really too stupid!","The atmosphere in the banquet hall was extremely awkward. After a moment of silence, the man on the sofa slowly looked up and revealed a calm smile. “Compensate me with 1.8 billion?”","Everyone held their breaths as their bodies trembled.","Gu Zheng said casually, “I could have accepted this suggestion, but...”","But?","Everyone’s hearts almost stopped as they anxiously waited for Gu Zheng to speak. Only Qiao Xi was leisurely eating the cake.","“However, Second Miss Lu seems to be very unwilling. If I accept this money, won’t I be an ingrate?”","Lu Xiang gasped, and her expression changed.","Gu Zheng chuckled. “In any case, I don’t lack this 1.8 billion. There’s no need for me to ruin my reputation for such a small amount of money. Xi Xi, don’t you think so?”","Qiao Xi nodded like a chick pecking on rice. “Very right! Ah Zheng, I think we should sue Lu Corporation! It seems that Second Miss Lu doesn’t care about Young Master Lu at all! She would rather let him go to jail than give us 1.8 billion!”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Yes.”","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation had gloomy expressions and hurriedly begged, “President Gu, President Gu...”","It was not easy for them to persuade President Gu to accept the money and let the matter rest. Just because Lu Xiang’s words had angered President Gu, he became unwilling?","If Lu Corporation was sued, not only would they have to compensate, but all their perfumes would also be taken off the shelves and destroyed. They would not even be able to recover their capital. Moreover, Lu Yan would still go to jail. Most importantly, if Lu Corporation was sued, the company’s reputation would be greatly affected. From now on, there was a high chance that customers would not buy Lu Corporation’s products anymore. This would be a devastating blow.","Originally, they only needed to fork out 1.8 billion yuan to solve the problem. Although everyone was unwilling, this was the only solution. Now that Lu Xiang had caused a scene, the matter had become even more serious.","Was Lu Xiang crazy?","Old Master Lu, who usually doted on his daughter, could not help but roar, “Lu Xiang! Are you crazy?!”","Old Madam Lu said unhappily, “Why are you shouting at Xiang’er? She’s doing this for the company, but you’re actually biased toward Lu Qingyun—”","Hearing this, Old Master Lu was so angry that his beard trembled. He immediately interrupted, “Shut up!”","“Old Madam Lu, are you trying to say that he’s biased toward Lu Qingyun’s son?” Qiao Xi said with a smile, “You mean to say that you don’t like Eldest Miss Lu, right? So why are you so good to Lu Yan? When the Lu family adopted Lu Yan, they announced to the public that they had found Eldest Miss Lu’s biological son. Could it be that the Lu family already knew that Lu Yan wasn’t Eldest Miss Lu’s child?”","The entire place was silent.","Old Master Lu was almost angered to the point of vomiting blood. “Qiao Xi, you...”","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation all lowered their heads and remained silent. The atmosphere was terrifyingly oppressive.","“Everyone.”","At this moment, Gu Zheng slowly stood up. His expression was indifferent, and his voice was cold and distant.","“I’m sorry, but I’ve already lost my patience. It’s time for this farce to end. Xi Xi, let’s go.”","The moment that was said, everyone in the Lu family gasped. If Gu Zheng left just like this, it would be equivalent to giving Lu Corporation a death notice.","From the moment he stepped out of the banquet hall, the news of Han Ye’s lawsuit would spread widely. Not only would the Lu family have to compensate, but their reputation would also be ruined. Moreover, Lu Yan would go to jail.","Qiao Xi held Gu Zheng’s arm and smiled lightly. “Originally, Lu Corporation only needed to compensate 1.8 billion yuan and everything would’ve been fine. However, Second Miss Lu was unwilling to compensate, which caused the situation to worsen. Ah Zheng, who do you think Second Miss Lu got her IQ from?”","“Maybe it’s because our family has too much money and thinks that losing 1.8 billion is nothing to fret over. She’ll only be satisfied when the Lu family loses everything.”"]},{"number":836,"title":"Chapter 836 - Want An Apology","paragraphs":["The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth slowly curled up, while the Lu family’s faces were still pale. They were thinking about how to persuade Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi said casually, “Second Miss Lu, do you have a grudge against Lu Yan? He clearly didn’t have to go to jail, but you made things worse by causing a scene.”","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation looked at Lu Xiang angrily. They did not really care about Lu Yan, but Lu Yan was now the acting president of Lu Corporation. He represented Lu Corporation’s image. If he went to jail, Lu Corporation’s reputation would be completely ruined.","At this moment, a higher-up broke down and begged, “President Gu, we’re willing to destroy all the perfumes and compensate at twice the price. We’ll give you a total of 1.8 billion!”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. The Lu family had gone from asking them to withdraw the lawsuit to letting them still sell the perfumes to compensating 1.8 billion. Now, they had decided to destroy all the perfumes and would still compensate them 1.8 billion.","The Lu family’s constant concessions meant that they no longer had the confidence. Originally, they could still rely on selling the perfumes to recover a portion of their capital. Now, they had reluctantly given up.","Gu Zheng ignored the higher-up’s words and continued holding Qiao Xi’s hand as they slowly walked out of the banquet hall.","Everyone stopped breathing. The air around them seemed to have frozen. They had already given in to him to this extent, so why was President Gu still not satisfied?","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation looked terrified. “President Gu, what else do you want?”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks and turned around to glance at everyone. She chuckled. “Ah Zheng has never made demands. He doesn’t lack money and isn’t interested in that 1.8 billion. He doesn’t have time to go to court with Lu Yan either. He’s only unwilling to forgive the Lu family because of Second Miss Lu’s words.”","She said unhurriedly, then looked at Lu Xiang casually.","“Why don’t we just get Lu Xiang to apologize?! As long as Second Miss Lu is sincere, Ah Zheng might withdraw the lawsuit. Anyway, it doesn’t matter to us. Whether we sue or not depends on our mood. Whether you apologize or not depends on you.”","......","Qiao Xi’s words instantly caused a commotion. Everyone had different expressions, but most of them were angry, especially Second Miss Lu. Her expression was gloomy like ink, and her hands could not help but tremble.","Everyone knew clearly in their hearts that the couple really did not care. The more Qiao Xi did not care, the angrier Lu Xiang became.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and did not care about what she said at all. He looked at her with doting eyes. “Is the food here not to your liking? I’ll get the chef to prepare a new table of food for you when we get home.”","The two of them chatted casually as if no one was around. They did not care about the Lu family at all.","“Chairman... Chairman Lu!” The higher-up of Lu Corporation’s voice trembled as they looked at Old Master Lu in despair. They hoped that he could stand up and take charge of the situation. Otherwise, Lu Corporation would be destroyed in Lu Yan’s hands.","Old Master Lu’s expression was terrifyingly gloomy, and his old face was filled with malevolence. His gaze was filled with anger and disgust, but he still had to humble himself to please Gu Zheng.","Seeing that Old Master Lu was silent, the higher-ups of Lu Corporation looked at Lu Xiang. Lu Xiang was already in her 40s. Her relationship with her husband was not harmonious. Hence, she often stayed with the Lu family. Now that she had caused a commotion in the Lu family and angered President Gu, she wanted all of them to bear the consequences.","The banquet hall was silent for two minutes. Finally, someone could not help but say, “If Eldest Miss Lu was still alive, how could President Gu...”","Lu Qingyun was Gu Zheng’s biological mother. If she were still alive, why would President Gu target the Lu family? Even if he did not have any feelings for the Lu family, he still had to care about Lu Qingyun’s reputation.","Hearing everyone mention Lu Qingyun, Lu Xiang’s expression changed. She gritted her teeth. That familiar feeling had returned!","Back then, when Lu Qingyun was still alive, everyone said that Eldest Miss Lu was gentle and generous. They said that she was indeed the daughter of a socialite. Lu Qingyun kept overshadowing her. Now that so many years had passed, Lu Qingyun’s son was actually making things difficult for her in public and asking her to apologize?","What right did Gu Zheng have?","Old Madam Lu was so angry that she felt dizzy. Back then, after she became a mistress, she and Lu Xiang suppressed Lu Qingyun. After Lu Qingyun died, they controlled the entire Lu family. They thought that no one would threaten them anymore.","However, who knew that Lu Qingyun, this weak woman, would give birth to an outstanding son? Gu Zheng was controlling the entire Li City’s economy at such a young age.","Since they did not lower their heads to Lu Qingyun back then, they would not lower their heads to Gu Zheng now!"]},{"number":837,"title":"Chapter 837 - A Pauper Can Never Become A Princess","paragraphs":["Old Madam Lu’s eyes were filled with resentment as she roared unwillingly, “Gu Zheng! Xiang’er is your aunt, yet you...”","“If she’s Ah Zheng’s biological aunt, then he should indeed call her ‘Aunt’. But what right does the daughter of a mistress have to be Gu Zheng’s aunt?”","Qiao Xi interrupted Old Madam Lu indifferently, then snorted coldly. “It’s fine if you don’t want to apologize, but why are you trying to claim kinship? Chairman Lu, I need to remind you of something. Three months ago, Lu Yan and Yao Mengqing made a bet with me. Young Master Lu bet on two percent of Lu Corporation’s shares.","“It just so happens that I won that bet, so I’m also a shareholder of Lu Corporation now. If Lu Yan is sued, I’ll sell these shares. At that time, it’ll be very disadvantageous for Chairman Lu to gather back the shares. However, it seems that Old Madam Lu and Second Miss Lu don’t care at all.”","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation subconsciously looked at Lu Yan. He actually used the shares of the company as a bet and lost to Qiao Xi?","Old Madam Lu was not cultured to begin with, let alone know about company matters. She shouted like a shrew, “Qiao Xi! What right do you have to ask Xiang’er to apologize? No matter what, she’s an elder. You need to show some respect for our status here!”","Everyone knew very well in their hearts that although Qiao Xi only held two percent of the shares, if Lu Yan really went to jail, the shareholders would all sell their shares. It would be difficult for Old Master Lu to gather back the shares then. At that time, Gu Zheng would definitely buy the shares at a high price. Once his shares surpassed the Lu family’s, Lu Corporation would completely belong to him.","There was only one way to get Gu Zheng to withdraw the lawsuit, and that was to get Lu Xiang to apologize.","Old Master Lu suddenly looked up at Lu Xiang fiercely.","At this moment, Lu Xiang was still calm. She knew that the old master doted on her. He had never been able to say harsh words to her, not since she was young. How could he ask her to apologize to Gu Zheng?","She did not care about Qiao Xi’s words at all. Unexpectedly, when she raised her head, she suddenly met Old Master Lu’s vicious gaze. She was terrified to the point her entire body trembled. “Dad, you...”","Before she could finish, Old Master Lu slammed his walking cane on the floor. He suppressed his anger and gritted his teeth. “Lu Xiang, apologize to Ah Zheng!”","His voice was filled with anger and unwillingness, while his heart was filled with humiliation. He used this tone to tell everyone that he was unconvinced, but he had no choice but to lower his head.","......","Suddenly, the phones of everyone from Lu Corporation rang at the same time. A message appeared in front of everyone’s eyes: [The news has been confirmed. Lu Yan has been sued for copyright infringement. As he was unable to fulfill his presales promise, he’s been receiving a great number of complaints from customers. The relevant departments have already started an investigation.]","At this moment, everyone finally started to feel nervous. They knew that if they did not come up with a solution and let the matter fester, Lu Corporation would be completely destroyed.","Lu Xiang’s voice trembled with unwillingness. “Dad, why should I apologize to him? He’s just...”","She used her last bit of rationality to not say the word ‘bastard’. Then, she said indignantly, “Dad! This is Gu Zheng’s trap. He deliberately dug a hole for the Lu family. I’m unwilling to lower my head for Lu Corporation. Otherwise, how badly will the Lu family’s reputation drop?”","Bang!","A higher-up of Lu Corporation could not help but smash the wine glass and roar, “Lu Xiang! Shut up! You’re relying on the fact that you’re the only daughter of the Lu family to commit crimes! If you had a little bit of Miss Qingyun’s intelligence, you wouldn’t have caused Lu Corporation to become like this! You’re a jinx. You want to destroy the entire Lu family and make all of us go bankrupt with you!”","Old Madam Lu instantly exploded when she heard this. “Bullsh*t! What are you talking about?! Are you rebelling?! Xiang’er is the daughter of the Lu family. What does she caring about her family’s matters have to do with you?!”","The banquet hall was filled with the seniors of Lu Corporation. Many of them had dedicated their lives to Lu Corporation. Their life and death depended on the company. However, under Gu Zheng’s oppression, they gradually lost their minds.","“Do you have the right to speak? You’re just an uneducated mistress! A pauper can never become a princess. You’ve never been worthy to be the wife of the chairman. You and your daughter are both useless! Even as mistresses, you can’t keep your men! You even want to make things difficult for Eldest Miss’ biological son. Are you idiots?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes curved into crescents when she heard that person’s reprimand. She felt extremely carefree.","The people from Lu Corporation were all bad people to begin with. Now that there was an internal conflict, they revealed their true colors. They usually pretended to be harmonious, but now, for the sake of benefits, they were unwilling to give in."]},{"number":838,"title":"Chapter 838 - The Wicked Will Be Dealt With By The Wicked","paragraphs":["At this moment, Lu Xiang and Lu Yan had already become a thorn in everyone’s side. Everyone criticized them. “In the end, it’s just because Lu Yan doesn’t have the ability that he insisted on fighting with President Gu. If he wanted to release his new perfumes, he should’ve investigated Han Ye’s identity clearly. He used someone else’s paintings without investigating clearly, which resulted in such consequences. Do you know the law?! Do you know what copyright infringement is?!”","“President Gu was able to establish Gu Corporation by himself and become the international oil painter, Han Ye. You, Lu Yan, can’t do anything well. Even with the Lu family’s resources, you’re still useless!”","“Lu Yan brought this upon himself! What does it have to do with us?!”","“President Gu had already decided to let the matter rest. As long as Lu Corporation takes out 1.8 billion yuan to compensate, everything will be settled. However, Lu Xiang just had to anger President Gu. Are you stupid or do you want to drag everyone down with you?”","“If Lu Corporation goes bankrupt, what will we do? Chairman Lu, you’ve been managing Lu Corporation for your entire life. Are you going to watch as the mistress and illegitimate daughter ruin your hard work?”","Old Madam Lu and Lu Xiang’s bodies went weak. They almost fell to the floor.","It had been so many years, but Lu Xiang still could not get rid of the title of being an illegitimate daughter. These people called her ‘Second Miss Lu’ on the surface, but they still looked down on her background behind her back.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. As the saying went, the wicked would be dealt with by the wicked. Earlier, Lu Xiang mocked Gu Zheng for being an illegitimate child, but in the end, she was mocked by the higher-ups of Lu Corporation for being an illegitimate daughter.","At this moment, the higher-ups roared crazily, “Lu Xiang, apologize! Lu Yan! You have to apologize too!”","“What did you two pieces of trash bring to the company? If it weren’t for your surname being Lu, you would’ve been chased out a long time ago. Without you, the Lu family wouldn’t have encountered such a crisis!”","Cold sweat broke out on Lu Xiang’s forehead as she retreated in horror. “No, I’m not apologizing!”","Gu Zheng, who was standing at the door, smirked. He wanted to see how long Lu Xiang could last.","Soon, everyone received news that contracts were being terminated. The employees downstairs anxiously went upstairs to ask about the exact situation.","......","No! They could not watch Lu Corporation go bankrupt.","Old Master Lu indeed doted on his daughter, but at this moment, he had no choice but to seriously order, “Lu Xiang, quickly apologize to Ah Zheng and beg him to forgive you!”","The higher-ups of Lu Corporation could not suppress the anger in their hearts anymore. Seeing that Lu Xiang was unwilling to apologize, they splashed a glass of red wine on her head.","“Ah!” Lu Xiang screamed. Bright red wine liquid flowed down her head and covered her terrified face. It was a shocking sight.","When one of them made a move, the others could not help but raise the things in their hands and throw them at her.","Bang!","Someone threw a wine glass at Lu Xiang’s forehead, and a wound instantly appeared. She held her forehead and felt a splitting headache. Her vision was blurry.","The originally gorgeous banquet hall was in a mess now. Lu Xiang stood in the middle. Her white evening gown was already dyed red by the alcohol. She screamed helplessly and gradually broke down...","Seeing this, Lu Yan did not dare to delay and hurriedly apologized. “President Gu, I’m sorry.”","Gu Zheng smiled, his eyes filled with mockery.","Everyone looked at Lu Xiang. She held her forehead and wiped the red wine off her face. No one came forward to comfort her.","Lu Qingyun was clearly dead, and she was the only daughter of the Lu family now. In the past, she was the one who bullied others. Who would dare to bully her? However, everyone was forcing her to apologize to this bastard!","Lu Xiang’s heart was filled with despair. It was clearly Gu Zheng who schemed against Lu Corporation, but now, he wanted her to apologize. However, she had no choice. She knew very well that if she insisted on not apologizing today, these people would definitely not let the matter rest.","Her former relatives, friends, and colleagues all looked ferocious. Even her mother did not dare to defend her. Her father had also asked her to apologize with a gloomy expression. As for that piece of trash, Lu Yan, she could not count on him.","“Gu Zheng...”","Lu Xiang was extremely humiliated. Her face that was covered with red wine gradually became ferocious. She gritted her teeth and said word by word, “I apologize. I’m sorry.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire venue fell silent.","After a moment, Gu Zheng chuckled and said in a happy voice, “It’s really rare to hear you say words of apology. Gu Yao, did you record it?”","Gu Yao said, “Of course! It’s clearly recorded. It’ll be broadcasted in Lu Corporation tomorrow!”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘You brothers are really vicious!’","Seeing that Lu Xiang had apologized, the higher-ups of Lu Corporation asked excitedly, “President Gu, Lu Xiang has already apologized. Then...”"]},{"number":839,"title":"Chapter 839 - It’s Fortunate You’re Around","paragraphs":["Hope reignited in everyone’s eyes. Now that Lu Xiang had already apologized, Gu Zheng should let them and the Lu family off.","The banquet hall was silent. Everyone’s breathing slowed down as they quietly waited for Gu Zheng to speak. He did not speak, so no one dared to rush him, afraid that they would anger this living King of Hell.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng seemed to be tired of seeing Lu Xiang’s and Lu Yan’s humiliated expressions. He slowly opened his eyes and smiled casually. “Alright.”","Song Shijing went forward to convey the president’s message. “The president will withdraw the lawsuit immediately, but at the same time, you have to take down all the perfumes and destroy the bottles. You have to compensate the president 1.8 billion yuan.”","Everyone from Lu Corporation was livid. Old Master Lu only felt a dull pain in his heart. It was so painful that he could not say anything. However, even though they were so unwilling, they still gritted their teeth and accepted this outcome.","Old Master Lu could only clench his fists and grit his teeth. “Someone will confirm the compensation with Gu Corporation later.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and left mercilessly. This farce was finally over. The Lu family would have to pay an enormous price for this, but fortunately, the Lu family’s reputation was preserved.","As soon as Gu Zheng and Lu Xiang left, Old Master Lu’s vision darkened as he fell to the floor. His body trembled as he pointed at Lu Yan and Lu Xiang. He did not even have the strength to say anything.","He regretted it! If he had chosen Qingyun and Gu Zheng back then and if Lu Corporation had been handed to the mother and son, perhaps the Lu family would have long become the top corporation in the country. He would not have to worry about the company’s trivial matters at his age.","However, at this point, he had no way out. From the moment he decided to keep Ah Yan, everything was already destined.","Soon, Lu Corporation quickly suppressed the news and gave the customers a reasonable explanation. They also gave some coupons to the customers who paid for the presales deposit. Only then was the crisis resolved.","They had lost 1.8 billion yuan to Gu Zheng. Coupled with the manpower, resources, and publicity expenses they had invested during this period of time, they lost a total of 2.6 billion yuan.","Previously, Lu Corporation had already lost more than 10 billion yuan. In just a few months, they lost another 2.6 billion yuan. The huge company was already emptied out and could not withstand any more storms.","......","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi chuckled and praised, “Gu Yao, you’ve become smarter! You even knew how to bring Madam Carter over.”","Gu Yao looked proud. “I was smart to begin with!”","Qiao Xi smiled and nodded. The gratification she felt was similar to that of a mother watching the child she raised grow up. This kid had grown up and gotten rid of the title of a good-for-nothing. Although he liked freedom and did not want to join the company, he was doing well now.","She could not help but sigh. “Actually, Huang Lilan isn’t completely useless. She did something right by bringing you to Gu Zheng.”","It was because of Gu Yao that Gu Zheng’s gray childhood had some color.","The first time they met, Qiao Xi only thought that Gu Yao was an ignorant and incompetent hedonistic son who kept protecting Yao Mengqing. Now that she thought about it, she could not blame him. It was because he was too naive and trusted others very easily. Moreover, as long as someone was good to him, he would give up everything to repay that person. Who would not like such a loyal little puppy?","Qiao Xi smiled as she looked at him. “It’s fortunate you’re around.”","Gu Yao was so touched that tears welled up in his eyes. His sister-in-law was too good. When he was chased out of the Gu family, everyone thought that he was a stray dog. Only Qiao Xi comforted him and gradually brought him out of the shadows.","Just as he was about to pull Qiao Xi over to express his gratitude, Gu Zheng also looked at him with a doting gaze. “It’s so good to have you around.”","Gu Yao was instantly smug.","Even Gu Zheng, this bastard, said that he was fortunate to have him around. He was really outstanding. He danced with excitement. “Yes! It’s your honor to be able to meet me!”","Qiao Xi had just taken a sip of the soup when she suddenly choked.","This kid couldn’t help but boast now! Gu Zheng had only praised him a few times, yet he was already so arrogant. How dare he speak to Gu Zheng like this?","...","10 minutes later, Gu Yao stood outside in the snowstorm like an abandoned dog.","He was wrong. He would never be arrogant again.","Coincidentally, it was snowing today, so his brother heartlessly threw him out.","Gu Yao was so aggrieved that he was about to cry. Looking at the heavy snow, he could only get into the car and think about where he should go next. However, he would be alone no matter where he went. It was too boring"]},{"number":840,"title":"Chapter 840 - You’ll Always Be My Younger Brother","paragraphs":["Just as he was thinking about it, someone knocked on the car door. A man was standing outside the car in a black windbreaker. He frowned. “Gu Yao, are you stupid? It’s snowing so heavily and you want to drive somewhere? Are you tired of living? Hurry up and get out of the car. I don’t want to see the news of Second Young Master Gu getting into a car accident and dying tomorrow!”","Gu Yao was stunned for a moment. He gritted his teeth and said, “Can you not curse me? I wanna beat you up so badly!”","Qiao Xi, who was not far away, pursed her lips. Gu Zheng was clearly worried that it would not be safe for Gu Yao to drive on a snowy day and wanted him to stay in Longwan Residential, but the words he said were so infuriating.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Give it a try, then.”","Gu Yao was so scared that his entire body trembled. He suddenly noticed that Gu Zheng was only wearing a thin windbreaker. He could not help but complain, “It’s snowing so heavily and you’re only wearing a windbreaker? You’re not even wearing a down jacket. Are you showing off your good figure?”","Qiao Xi: “...” He was clearly concerned about the other party, but why was he being so annoying?","Although Gu Yao was dissatisfied, he still got out of the car obediently. As soon as he got out of the car, a black umbrella blocked the heavy snow for him. Then, Gu Zheng’s calm voice sounded. “Come celebrate the new year with us this year.”","In the past, Gu Yao would spend the new year in the Gu family’s old residence. However, he had been chased out by the Gu family and did not know who his biological parents were. He had nowhere to go except for his brother, Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Blood relations don’t matter to me. There are so many people in the Gu family who are related by blood, but their relationship is worse than that of strangers. I’ve never cared whether you’re my biological younger brother or not. I only care about you. I thought you already knew this.”","Gu Yao did not say anything and just lowered his head. He, who was usually noisy, suddenly quietened down.","“All these years, we’ve been brothers and supported each other. I thought that you would understand my intentions even if I didn’t say anything. I didn’t expect you to be even more stupid than Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi: “...” How was she stupid? Could he not implicate her?","His voice was calm and gentle. “No matter whose son you are, you’re still Gu Yao and my younger brother. This won’t change at all. Don’t you understand?”","......","Gu Yao hesitated.","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks and turned to look at him. “You were a good-for-nothing in the past. Now that you’ve left Huang Lilan, you don’t have to pretend anymore. You’ve gradually become polite and capable. I’m very pleased. After all, you’ve always been a good child.","“You’ve been doing very well in the company recently, and everyone’s impression of you has changed. However, I don’t want your relationship with me to change at all. You can always do whatever you want in front of me.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle. This was the first time he spoke so gently and calmly to Gu Yao like a big brother.","“Gu Yao, I can’t stop you from doing what you want. I’ll respect your wishes, but I don’t want you to keep a distance from me.”","Gu Zheng had always been a man of few words. This was the first time he had said so much. Every word stabbed Gu Yao’s heart.","“You don’t have to think that you’re taking advantage of me. In my gray childhood, you were the only one who brought me warmth. Just based on this alone, you’ll always be my younger brother.”","Gu Yao lowered his eyes. In the past, he was the second young master of the Gu family. He thought that it was reasonable for Gu Zheng to be good to him and indulge him because they were biological brothers. However, ever since he found out about his identity, he did not dare to fool around like before. He kept a distance from many people, including Gu Zheng.","In the past, even if he had committed a crime, he would very arrogantly say that his brother was Gu Zheng. However, now, he did not dare to use Gu Zheng’s name to commit crimes. After all, Gu Zheng was no longer his brother.","Moreover, Gu Zheng had been taking care of him all these years. He already owed Gu Zheng a lot, so what right did he have to continue enjoying Gu Zheng’s care?","However, Gu Zheng’s words today hit him hard.","‘I’ll respect your wishes, but I don’t want you to keep a distance from me.’","‘Brother! My dear brother!’","Gu Yao burst into tears. “Brother, do you really not mind us not being biological brothers? Will you still treat me as well as you did before?”","Gu Zheng frowned. “What do you think?”","“Even if I call you a bastard, you won’t hate me?” Gu Yao wiped his tears and asked seriously.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and frowned slightly. After a moment of silence, he glanced at Gu Yao and said, “Kid, do you want to be beaten up?”","Gu Yao looked terrified, then he smiled foolishly. He was sure that Gu Zheng would not change. Gu Zheng would still be good to him and dote on him."]},{"number":841,"title":"Chapter 841 - The Tang Family’s Secret","paragraphs":["The next morning.","Lu Corporation announced to the public that they would close the presales channel because there were some problems with the perfumes. They did not meet the standards, so they decided to destroy all the perfumes.","Hence, many people felt that Lu Corporation was a conscientious company. They would rather destroy all the perfumes than let the consumers take any risks. However, there were still some people who understood the situation. Previously, there was news that Lu Corporation was sued, and no clear explanation was given. The removal of the perfumes this time must be related to the lawsuit.","Today happened to be New Year’s Eve. Lu Corporation was in a panic and only hoped that Gu Zheng would not go back on his word. Otherwise, how could they be in the mood to celebrate the new year?","On this day, Old Master Tang came to Li City from the capital to visit his relatives who were living in Li City. He had already heard about the Lu family in the capital. Old Master Tang said thoughtfully, “President Gu is brave and resourceful. He’s an outstanding figure among the younger generation. If you have time, invite him to our house as a guest.”","Madam Tang lowered her head, not knowing how to tell the old master about the grudge between Qiao Xi and Tang Ruge.","Old Master Tang’s son, Tang Dawei, had already told him about the oil painting, but he only smiled indifferently. “Ruge is young, and she happened to offend Mrs. Gu. She just needs to apologize. I want to look for President Gu to discuss business. He won’t reject me because of a personal grudge.”","He glanced meaningfully at Tang Dawei. “All these years, I had to help you arrange many things before you could sit in the position of heir. Don’t disappoint me.”","The moment that was said, Tang Dawei’s family’s expressions changed as they lowered their heads.","Madam Tang replied in a low voice, “Dad, I heard that Eldest Brother and Sister-in-law’s children seem to have made a name for themselves outside. They’re targeting the Tang family now! I’m not afraid of them taking revenge on me, but I’m afraid it’ll be detrimental to the Tang family. If they...”","Old Master Tang’s expression darkened. “I understand. Don’t worry, I’ll handle this matter. They won’t affect the Tang family’s interests.”","Madam Tang and Tang Dawei heaved a sigh of relief.","...","......","The next morning, Gu Zheng hurriedly entered the study to handle urgent documents. Qiao Xi was woken up, so she turned on her computer and logged into Black Tide’s account. Then, she sent Mu Ming a message.","Mu Ming replied: [You’re welcome.]","If it were not for Mu Ming, Lu Yan would not have confirmed the news of Han Ye’s death. This time, Mu Ming and his sister had done her a great favor. In return, Qiao Xi would also help them.","[Did Tang Ruge ask you to tamper with the information of the account named ‘Fu Sheng’? You should know that the original owner of this account is me, right?]","Mu Ming did not hide anything. [Yes.]","Qiao Xi: [Do you have a grudge against Tang Ruge?]","Although it was a question, Qiao Xi was already very sure that Mu Ming and Mu Ling knew that she was Fu Sheng. They could have rejected the job. However, not only did they accept Tang Ruge’s money, but they also gave her some leeway. When the matter was exposed, Tang Ruge would definitely lose all her dignity.","Mu Ming did not reply immediately. Qiao Xi continued: [Actually, I’ve already investigated your relationship with the Tang family. You helped me, so I should tell you a secret. 16 years ago, someone hired Ling Pavilion to kill your parents. I found out that the employer was a man, but I can’t find any other information. After all, Ling Pavilion has always been paid to do things. They don’t ask about the employer’s identity.]","16 years ago?","His parents died in a car accident nine years ago. After that, he and his sister were chased out by the Tang family. They started Dark Net Organization and got to know Mo Yuan and Black Tide.","Now, Black Tide actually told him that someone had hired assassins to kill his parents 16 years ago.","Hence, the murder was planned for seven years. In the end, that person got the outcome they wanted.","After Qiao Xi told Mu Ming the details, she lay on the sofa and looked at the snow outside the window.","The heating system in Longwan Residential was good, so she did not feel cold even when wearing a thin dress. It was like a different world from the snow outside.","Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes comfortably like an elegant cat. Just as she was about to fall asleep, the sudden ringing of her phone woke her up.","She looked in the direction of the voice. It was not her phone but Gu Zheng’s. But who would call Gu Zheng at this time?","Usually, Song Shijing and Song Shiyu would pick up business calls. After confirming that there were no problems, they would report it to Gu Zheng. Moreover, Gu Zheng had very few relatives and friends, so very few people called his private number.","Qiao Xi had a feeling that the caller was extraordinary."]},{"number":842,"title":"Chapter 842 - Get President Gu To Answer The Phone","paragraphs":["After a long time, the phone was still ringing. She picked up the phone and walked out of the bedroom. When she reached the door of the study, the door was ajar. She gently pushed the door open. Gu Zheng was not in the room. Immediately after, the sound of water came from the bathroom.","“Gu Zheng, your phone is ringing,” Qiao Xi said.","The man’s deep voice came from the bathroom. “Answer it.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “This person has been calling you for a long time. Perhaps they have something urgent to tell you. It’s not good for me to answer it, right?”","The sound of water stopped. The man said without hesitation, “It’s okay.”","Qiao Xi held the phone and hesitated for a few seconds before answering the call. She then pressed the speaker button.","The person on the phone did not expect Gu Zheng to pick up her call and exclaimed. Then, a pretentious female voice came from the other end of the phone.","“President Gu, I’m really sorry to disturb you so early.”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment before recognizing this woman. It was Tang Ruge!","Tang Ruge’s breathing was a little heavy as she asked nervously, “President Gu, did I disturb your sleep? I’m really sorry. I thought that you would have woken up by now, so I decided to call you. I hope you don’t mind.”","The other end of the phone was silent for a few seconds. Qiao Xi sat on the sofa unhurriedly and chuckled. “Miss Tang, you clearly knew that you’d disturb him, so why did you still call?”","The corners of Tang Ruge’s mouth twitched slightly. Under the gaze of Madam Tang and Old Master Tang, she could only suppress her anger and pretend to be puzzled. “Ah... Did I call the wrong number? Who are you?”","Qiao Xi lay on the sofa and asked casually, “Miss Tang, do you know what time it is now?”","......","“Six o’clock.”","“You called at six in the morning, yet you’re asking who I am? Why are you pretending to be stupid?!” Qiao Xi did not show her any mercy.","Tang Ruge was so angry that her face darkened. Her nails almost dug into her palms.","Qiao Xi! This b*tch!","“So, it’s you, Xi Xi! I just couldn’t react in time. Don’t take it to heart! Is President Gu there? Why did you answer his phone? I remember that President Gu doesn’t like others touching his things. It’s not good for you to casually answer his call, right?”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Miss Tang, I hope you can understand something. I’m Ah Zheng’s wife, so I naturally have the right to answer his calls. Miss Tang, you call yourself a socialite from the capital, but you’re calling Ah Zheng at this time. Isn’t that too rude?”","Tang Ruge’s eyes were filled with resentment. She suppressed the anger in her heart and said with a trembling voice, “Xi Xi, you’ve misunderstood. I didn’t mean that. I just want to remind you to avoid any conflicts between you two. Don’t always think that I’ll harm you. I’m doing this for your own good!”","“There’s no need.”","Qiao Xi questioned coldly, “Miss Tang, you don’t have to worry about me. Please explain why you called my husband so early in the morning.”","Tang Ruge clenched her fists tightly, and her gentle voice gradually changed. “I have something to tell President Gu. Can you get President Gu to answer the phone?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Tell me what it is. He’s taking a shower.”","The word ‘shower’ instantly caused Tang Ruge’s face to turn livid. Qiao Xi, this little b*tch who seduced men, was actually showing off such a thing to her. Didn’t she feel ashamed?","Tang Ruge’s fingers that were holding the phone turned pale, and her body was trembling slightly. “You don’t understand business matters. Give the phone to President Gu.”","“Miss Tang, are your ears not good? I already said that he’s in the shower and can’t answer the phone. Moreover, the Tang family and Gu Corporation have never done business with each other, yet you called so early in the morning to say that you want to discuss business. Don’t you think this reason is very far-fetched?”","Tang Ruge knew that Qiao Xi was mocking her sarcastically, and she was so angry that her breathing quickened. “Xi Xi, don’t misunderstand me. I wouldn’t have called President Gu if I didn’t have serious matters to attend to. As President Gu’s wife, you should be tolerant. You can’t be unreasonable just because of a phone call, right?”","“I’m being unreasonable? Miss Tang, don’t you have any self-awareness?!”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly and casually curled her lips into a smile. “It’s very easy to wake others up when you call so early in the morning. You’d better call when I’m not around next time.”","“Qiao Xi!” Tang Ruge could not help but roar. Sensing that she was agitated, she immediately took a deep breath and said gently, “You’ve really misunderstood. I really didn’t mean anything else. I’m indeed looking for President Gu for business matters.”"]},{"number":843,"title":"Chapter 843 - A Generous Person","paragraphs":["Old Master Tang, who was sitting at the side, could not help but frown when he heard his granddaughter’s words. “Ruge, is it because Mrs. Gu doesn’t want you to talk to President Gu?”","Tang Ruge was so anxious that her eyes turned red. She nodded stubbornly. “Grandpa, Xi Xi seems to have misunderstood me. It’s all my fault...”","Old Master Tang said unhappily, “If a man has other thoughts, they can’t be stopped. The more she shields him, the more useless she seems. Ruge, tell her directly that I want to discuss business with President Gu.”","Tang Ruge nodded, then said gently, “Xi Xi, it’s not that I want to look for President Gu. It’s my grandfather who wants to talk to President Gu about business. You don’t know anything about business, so it’s better to let President Gu answer the phone.”","At this moment, the sound of water in the bathroom stopped. The man pushed open the bathroom door, and steam spread out. He was wearing a bathrobe, and the straps were not tied tightly, which revealed his fair and strong chest. “Who is it?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at him and could not help but gulp. She said unhappily, “Tang Ruge wants to discuss business with you.”","“She’s looking for me to discuss business?” Gu Zheng repeated, seemingly in disbelief. Then, he sneered.","Tang Ruge could not see Gu Zheng’s expression on the other end of the phone, but when she heard his magnetic voice, her cheeks could not help but turn red. She hurriedly said shyly, “President Gu, my grandfather is here in Li City. He wants to talk to you about business, but he didn’t expect Xi Xi to pick up the call and misunderstand me.","“Xi Xi, can you give the phone to President Gu?”","Qiao Xi blinked and looked at Gu Zheng aggrievedly. She said loudly into the phone, “Alright! Then have a good business discussion!”","Tang Ruge heard the man’s breathing, followed by a cold and magnetic voice. “What’s the matter?”","When the Tang family heard Gu Zheng’s voice, they instantly smiled. The anger in Tang Ruge’s heart vanished as she said gently, “President Gu, Tang Corporation is going to open an entertainment company in Li City. Previously, when Xi Xi picked up the call, she asked me to tell her about the matter. I was afraid that she wouldn’t know anything about business, so I insisted on talking to you. Next, Gu Corporation is prepared to—”","“Isn’t Tang Corporation on holiday for the new year?” Gu Zheng asked coldly.","Gu Zheng leaned against the chair in the study with a lazy expression as if he was impatient just talking to Tang Ruge.","Tang Ruge was stunned for two seconds and subconsciously said, “We’re on holiday! It’s the new year, so, of course, we’re on holiday.”","“I’m on holiday too, so I won’t talk about work today,” Gu Zheng said casually.","Tang Ruge’s expression changed. Coincidentally, Qiao Xi’s voice came from the other end of the phone. “I told Miss Tang that you wouldn’t talk about work during the holidays, but she still insisted that you answer the phone. As the president of Gu Corporation, you only have a few days of free time in a year, yet she still came to disturb you!”","Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent. “Miss Tang, if Tang Corporation wants to collaborate with Gu Corporation, you should contact my secretary first and let him screen the documents before handing them to Song Shiyu. Song Shiyu will only hand them to me after he’s confirmed that the plan is feasible. Only then will I discuss business with the Tang family.”","“President Gu...” The smile on Tang Ruge’s face froze. How could she not hear the alienation and mockery in Gu Zheng’s tone?","Looking at his granddaughter’s red eyes that were about to cry, Old Master Tang took the phone. “President Gu, I want to discuss business with you.”","Gu Zheng was stunned when he heard the unfamiliar voice of the old man, but he quickly reacted. This was the old master from the Tang family. He said casually, “So?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Gu Zheng’s tone was really asking for a beating.","Old Master Tang instantly choked. After a long silence, he cleared his throat and said, “It’s my first time in Li City. I’d like to ask for your guidance, Old Master Gu. I remember that you and Ruge were childhood playmates. It can be said that we’re fated.","“I heard that there was a misunderstanding between Ruge and Mrs. Gu. I apologize on behalf of this child. I hope Mrs. Gu can be magnanimous and not take issue with her.”","Be magnanimous? Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. If she did not forgive Tang Ruge, then she would be a vile person? Would she be accused of disrespecting her elders as well?","The next second, Gu Zheng said casually, “Mrs. Gu is kind-hearted, but I’m petty. I can’t tolerate people who bully her.”","Old Master Tang probably did not expect Gu Zheng to not show him any respect. His breathing became hurried as he suppressed the anger in his heart. After a long time, he said, “Tang Corporation has always been investing in antiques. We’ve established an entertainment company now, and it’s a field that Gu Corporation has always been outstanding in. President Gu, I hope you can...”"]},{"number":844,"title":"Chapter 844 - Heavenly Voice Entertainment","paragraphs":["“I’ve already told Miss Tang that I won’t be discussing work today,” Gu Zheng said impatiently. “Moreover, a newly established entertainment company isn’t a big enough matter to be discussing a collaboration with me.”","These words instantly made Old Master Tang swallow his words. Gu Zheng was right. The entertainment company established by the Tang family could not be considered a big company at all. It was just a small studio with pitifully few artists. Meanwhile, Gu Corporation was famous in the entertainment industry. It could be said to be one of the largest entertainment companies in the country. They had a powerful say in the entertainment industry.","Gu Zheng did not care about how many people were fighting to collaborate with Gu Corporation, let alone a newly established studio.","There were many artists under Gu Corporation. There were A-list singers, popular actors, as well as singing and dancing groups. Their artists were featured in every popular drama.","Qiao Xi really did not understand. Where did Old Master Tang get the cheek to discuss a collaboration with Gu Zheng?","Old Master Tang was not angry. Instead, he smiled meaningfully. “President Gu, I have very outstanding composers under me.”","Qiao Xi’s expression changed. Could it be...","Gu Zheng had already lost his patience. Just as he was about to hang up, Old Master Tang hurriedly said, “Do you know the composer who won the award for Planet Music Festival? I can have her join Heavenly Voice Entertainment. Am I qualified to discuss a collaboration with President Gu now?”","Old Master Tang’s lips curled into a confident smile. He was sure that Gu Zheng would not refuse his suggestion this time, so he was not anxious. He just quietly waited for Gu Zheng’s answer. Unexpectedly, the phone was hung up.","His heart was instantly splashed with a bucket of cold water, and his face was as gloomy as ink. This was the first time the high and mighty Old Master Tang was looked down on like this. At this moment, he no longer had a kind appearance. He gritted his teeth and said, “You’re already so arrogant at such a young age. I want to see how long you can be arrogant!”","Tang Dawei and Madam Tang hurriedly went forward to comfort him. Old Master Tang’s expression softened a little, and he gradually calmed down. Then, he looked at Tang Ruge.","“Ruge, when will the Planet Music Festival give out the awards?”","Tang Ruge said with a smile, “Someone pretended to be me before, so the award ceremony was canceled. However, they’ve already sent the trophy over. I don’t care about these empty titles anyway.”","“How can you not care? You’re the composer who won the championship for Planet Music Festival!”","Planet Music Festival was the benchmark for international popular music. The person who could win this award could be said to be a genius in the music industry. Their future would definitely be limitless. Moreover, this was the first time such a genius had appeared in the Tang family. She was even the granddaughter he had nurtured since she was young. Of course, the old master would be proud!","“As long as you enter Heavenly Voice Entertainment, you’ll be affiliated with Gu Corporation. With such a backer, who’ll have doubts about your status as the heir?”","Old Master Tang said earnestly, “Dawei, I’ve already handed the Tang family to you and Ruge. Don’t let me down.”","“Fortunately, Ruge is more outstanding than the two children in your eldest brother’s family. Back then, you couldn’t bear to chase them away and said that you were afraid that they would take revenge on the Tang family after accumulating power outside. After so many years, do the siblings have the ability to go against the Tang family? They don’t even have proper jobs. What do they have to compare themselves to Ruge?”","Tang Dawei and Madam Tang nodded with smiles, their eyes filled with pride.","Tang Ruge, who was at the side, did not have the slightest trace of a smile on her face. She was feeling uneasy. Only the leader of Dark Net knew that she was pretending to be Fu Sheng. That person had already accepted her money, so there was no reason for them to expose this matter.","At the thought of this, Tang Ruge heaved a sigh of relief.","“Ruge, Li City is going to hold a large-scale charity banquet in two days. Everyone with a high status in Li City will be attending. You have to go with me. Now that you’re a grown woman, you should show your face in high society more often.” Old Master Tang looked at his granddaughter affectionately. As expected of the child he had raised. She did not disappoint him.","Tang Ruge smiled and nodded.","Would Gu Zheng attend Li City’s charity banquet? She could not help but look forward to it.","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa with narrowed eyes. Her long eyelashes were lowered as if she had fallen asleep.","She held her phone and quietly listened to the person on the other end of the phone. She could not help but chuckle. “It’s not convenient for the people from Ling Pavilion to attend the charity banquet, so you need my help?”"]},{"number":845,"title":"Chapter 845 - Secret Mission","paragraphs":["“Yes,” Luo Qing said. “It’s not convenient for the people from Ling Pavilion. It’s better for you to go. I’ll send someone to help you.”","“Get close to that rich businessman, Yang Lin?” Qiao Xi said casually, “This isn’t difficult. There’s no need to send anyone. I’ll contact you after I complete the mission.”","Luo Qing instructed, “Alright, be careful.”","Qiao Xi smiled sweetly. “Don’t worry, Second Brother!”","Ling Pavilion did not accept orders easily. This time, Second Brother specially asked her to do this and approach the rich businessman, Yang Lin. There must be a special reason.","Qiao Xi turned on her computer and logged into Black Tide’s account. She investigated Yang Lin’s information within Stars’ system, but there was very little information. However, someone who could make Second Brother personally instruct her to take the mission was definitely not ordinary.","Her slender fingers quickly typed on the keyboard, and information slowly appeared. The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a cold smile.","This man was really not simple!","...","Two days later.","At seven in the evening, the charity banquet was officially held. Qiao Xi had already approached Yang Lin two days ago under the alias ‘Bai Lu’. At this moment, she was preparing the materials to disguise herself in the bedroom before meeting up with Yang Lin.","Suddenly, Song Shiyu’s voice came from outside the door. “Young Madam, what gown will you be wearing today?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. “???”","......","“Originally, the president said that he wouldn’t be attending this banquet. I didn’t expect him to suddenly say that he was going to attend this morning. I guessed that you’d definitely be attending as well, so I came to ask which gown you want to wear. I’ll get someone to send it over to you.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. Was Gu Zheng going too? Gu Zheng did not like such occasions. He had always donated money, but he never attended. Why was he suddenly attending this time?","She was sure that Gu Zheng would not go, so she agreed to take on this mission. But now...","Qiao Xi’s expression changed as her body abruptly froze.","She was attending the banquet as Yang Lin’s female companion. If Gu Zheng found out, she would be in trouble.","Perhaps it was because he saw her gradually terrified expression, the corners of Gu Zheng’s lips curled up slightly. He quietly entered and walked to her side. He said in a low voice, “Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled, and her heart skipped a beat.","The man leaned behind her, his hot breath spraying behind her ears. His magnetic voice slowly sounded. “Have you thought of which gown to wear?”","Qiao Xi looked at the dress album Song Shiyu handed her and felt troubled.","“Pick one you like. The makeup team will come to our house to help you dress up later. We’ll set off together after you’re done getting ready,” Gu Zheng said softly.","Qiao Xi was even more perturbed now. What should she do?!","“There’s a sapphire necklace being bid at the charity banquet this time. I remember that you designed a blue gown previously. It’s a perfect match. I’ll bid for it and give it to you, okay?”","His voice was gentle, and his gaze was doting. It was like spring, making one unable to help but indulge in it.","Qiao Xi was extremely regretful now. She should not have agreed to Second Brother’s request to take on this mission. The most infuriating thing was that Yang Lin had done too many bad things and even wanted to cause trouble at the charity banquet.","She hesitated for a moment and said tentatively, “Ah Zheng... I... I won’t go today.”","The more she spoke, the softer her voice became. She gradually lost her confidence and could only lower her head.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes to look at her, his eyes filled with affection. His voice was also filled with smiles. “Why?”","Qiao Xi’s body trembled slightly. She kept having the feeling that this question was meaningful. If she did not give a reasonable excuse, she would not be able to walk out of this door today.","If Gu Zheng knew that she was getting close to Yang Lin, he would definitely help her complete the mission. However, there were so many eyes on Gu Zheng now. If he got close to Yang Lin at this time, he would be suspected of having ulterior motives.","Qiao Xi thought hard. What reason could make Gu Zheng believe her?","After a long silence, Qiao Xi’s eyes shifted, then she cried out in surprise. Her eyes were slightly red as she revealed a pitiful expression. “My stomach hurts, and I’m not feeling well. I can’t go.”","Gu Zheng’s gentle gaze slowly moved from her face to her stomach, then he smiled meaningfully. “I see. Then the gown at your door...”","“Actually, I wanted to go with you, so I prepared the gown. Who knew that my body would fail me?! I’m still too weak.”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “Yes, that’s right.”","Gu Zheng did not continue asking and nodded. “Alright, you don’t have to go if you’re not feeling well. I’ll go myself.”"]},{"number":846,"title":"Chapter 846 - Childhood Sweethearts","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment, and her voice trembled slightly. “I’m not going, so why are you going? Haven’t you always disliked such occasions?”","The air was silent for a few seconds. Gu Zheng chuckled. “How can I buy you the necklace if I don’t go? Don’t worry, I’ll be back soon.”","She did not want the necklace. She was afraid that Gu Zheng would recognize her. However, if she changed her appearance, Gu Zheng would not be able to tell, right? She just had to try her best to avoid him.","When she thought about this, Qiao Xi finally felt relieved.","Gu Zheng looked down at his watch. It was almost time. He left and instructed, “Song Shiyu, buy some medicine for Young Madam and take good care of her at home.”","Take care of her? Why did Qiao Xi think that Gu Zheng wanted Song Shiyu to monitor her? However, it did not matter. With Song Shiyu’s IQ, he could not keep an eye on her at all. She just had to lock the door and pretend to rest in the bedroom.","After Gu Zheng left, Song Shiyu hurriedly bought the medicine and sent it to the bedroom.","Qiao Xi looked at the large pile of medicine on the table and decided that after the mission ended, she would definitely beat Yang Lin up!","...","At 6:40 pm, Gu Zheng appeared at the entrance of the banquet hall. There were elites, rich businessmen, and reporters from various TV stations here.","At this moment, Tang Ruge had already entered the banquet hall in a high-end gown. She smiled at the camera. Tang Dawei and Madam Tang stood at the side for an interview. They announced that they were opening a branch company in Li City.","After the reporters asked about the development of Tang Corporation, they all went up to Tang Ruge. “Miss Tang, you were managing the company in the capital previously. Are you suddenly coming to Li City to take over Tang Corporation’s branch company?”","Tang Ruge smiled and said, “I came to Li City to improve my ability. I’m still young and have many things to learn. As for whether I’ll take over the company or not, it’s still uncertain.”","......","“May I ask which big shot you consulted?”","Tang Ruge smiled shyly. “While that’s true, I can’t reveal that gentleman’s name.”","Everyone looked at Tang Ruge’s shy expression. Recently, there were rumors in Li City that Tang Corporation would collaborate with Gu Corporation. Everyone understood who the gentleman she was talking about was.","At this moment, someone suddenly shouted, “President Gu!”","Everyone’s hearts trembled. They thought that this person was too impudent. Even if they knew who it was, they could not say it out loud!","Unexpectedly, when she turned around, she realized that Gu Zheng was really here.","The man was wearing an expensive suit. His eyes were deep, and his expression was indifferent. Even when facing the camera, he did not change at all. The moment he appeared, he became the focus of everyone’s attention.","Tang Ruge’s heart was pounding, then she frowned. “Didn’t President Gu say he wasn’t coming? Why is he suddenly here?”","The moment that was said, the reporters instantly caught on to the main point. They rushed over and asked anxiously, “Miss Tang, you know President Gu? Could it be that the gentleman you’re talking about is President Gu?”","“Why isn’t Mrs. Gu attending with President Gu? President Gu should bring a female companion to such an occasion.”","“Speaking of which, Miss Tang doesn’t have a male partner either. Actually, the two of them are very compatible!”","Hearing everyone’s words, Tang Ruge blushed slightly and explained shyly, “Our family admires President Gu very much. President Gu and I were childhood playmates, but we don’t contact each other often anymore, so...”","“So Miss Tang and President Gu are childhood sweethearts!” a reporter exaggerated.","Tang Ruge had a gentle smile on her face. Her cheeks were red as she said softly, “Actually, we’re not childhood sweethearts. We just knew each other. I came to Li City this time to celebrate Old Madam Gu’s birthday, but I decided to stay for other reasons.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the reporters’ eyes lit up as if they had caught wind of something big.","Miss Tang had been to the Gu family to celebrate Old Madam Gu’s birthday, so she must have interacted with President Gu. The two of them were about the same age and were a match made in heaven. Perhaps there would be sparks.","“In that case, Miss Tang and President Gu are friends. Do you know why President Gu is attending the charity banquet? President Gu has never been interested in such events. He usually sends people to attend and donate money on his behalf. There’s no need for him to appear personally!”","“Could it be that President Gu wants to bid for something?”","Question after question came. Tang Ruge did not panic at all. She still had a generous smile on her face. “It might be—”","“Everyone, why don’t you ask me directly?” A cold voice came from behind everyone. It was cold and distant, making everyone’s hair stand on end."]},{"number":847,"title":"Chapter 847 - Who’s Miss Tang?","paragraphs":["Everyone’s bodies suddenly stiffened as horror gradually appeared in their eyes. They slowly turned around and saw Gu Zheng strolling over. His deep eyes were mysterious and emotionless. He swept his indifferent gaze across the crowd without stopping on Tang Ruge at all.","Song Shijing walked up to them. “Do you have any other questions?”","The reporters felt their hearts tremble as if someone was grabbing their throats. They could not say anything.","“Friends, since our president is already here, it means that he’s willing to accept your interviews. If you have any questions, you can ask him in person or ask me. Why ask an outsider?”","Song Shijing gave a mocking smile and looked at Tang Ruge. Her expression froze instantly as she lowered her head awkwardly.","At this moment, no one was in the mood to see if she was embarrassed. When they heard that President Gu could be interviewed, the reporters who were still trembling in fear instantly went crazy. “President Gu, what do you think of this charity banquet?”","“What attracted you to this charity banquet? Why did you choose to attend?”","“Why didn’t you bring Mrs. Gu to the banquet today? You didn’t bring any female companions either?”","“Do you have anything to say about Gu Corporation’s future?”","Song Shijing answered some of the questions for Gu Zheng and left the rest to him.","...","Everyone’s gazes landed on Gu Zheng as they quietly waited for his answers. After a moment of silence, the man slowly looked up and said slowly, “I’m here for someone.”","The entire venue was in an uproar. He was here for someone?","The cameras were all aimed at his handsome face. Everyone’s breathing became gentle as they were afraid of disturbing him.","President Gu did not bring Mrs. Gu to the banquet with him. He even said that he was here for someone. Who exactly was worthy of President Gu’s concern?","Some people subconsciously looked at Tang Ruge, only to see her cheeks gradually turn red as she lowered her head shyly.","“Who’s the person President Gu is talking about? Could it be... Miss Tang?”","When Madam Tang and Tang Dawei saw that Qiao Xi did not come with Gu Zheng and they saw their daughter’s shy appearance, they could not help but be dumbfounded.","Could it be that... President Gu was really here for Ruge?","Tang Ruge walked forward shyly and thought to herself, ‘Even if Gu Zheng isn’t here for me, he won’t embarrass a woman in public. He can only tacitly agree that it’s her he’s here for.’","Moreover, she had never said that Gu Zheng was attending the banquet for her. She was just blushing. The reporters were the ones who said that.","She approached Gu Zheng shyly. Just as she was about to approach him, the man’s cold voice entered her ears. “Who’s Miss Tang?”","The entire venue was silent. At this moment, everyone’s quiet breathing could be heard clearly.","Even though the reporters were experienced, they could not help but feel embarrassed for Tang Ruge.","President Gu was too rude. He actually asked Tang Ruge who Miss Tang was in front of her. Wasn’t this clearly a slap to her face?","There were only two possibilities for him to say that. Firstly, he really did not know Tang Ruge. Secondly, he did, but he did not like Tang Ruge, so he deliberately pretended not to know her. However, either way, it made Tang Ruge lose her dignity.","The corners of Tang Ruge’s mouth twitched slightly, and the veins on her forehead popped out. After a while, she calmed down and said with a trembling voice, “President Gu...”","Gu Zheng glanced at her indifferently without a trace of emotion.","Tang Ruge bit her lip tightly as her body trembled. She took a deep breath. “President Gu, I’m Tang Ruge. We met at Old Madam Gu’s birthday banquet. How long has it been? You don’t remember me anymore?”","She pretended to be relaxed and deliberately said it to the reporters. As long as Gu Zheng remembered her name, the reporters would not say anything. After all, she was the eldest daughter of the Tang family. Who would deliberately make things difficult for her?","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent. “I’ve never cared about unimportant people. What makes you think I’ll remember you, Miss Tang?”","Everyone: “???”","Tang Ruge felt a lump in her throat. Her face was purple as if she had been slapped hard. It was so painful that she could not say anything.","At this moment, the reporters could no longer care about Tang Ruge. They asked curiously, “President Gu, can you reveal who the person you’re talking about is? Who is she to you? Does she have any important influence on Gu Corporation?”"]},{"number":848,"title":"Chapter 848 - President Yang’s Female Companion Is Beautiful","paragraphs":["Outside the banquet hall, a Maybach stopped. A couple dressed in luxurious clothes got out of the car.","Qiao Xi had an earpiece on to ensure that she could communicate with Luo Qing at any time. The necklace on her neck was also installed with a pinhole camera that could transmit images to him.","She had used the name Bai Lu to get close to Yang Lin. She even deliberately went elsewhere to wait and asked Yang Lin to personally pick her up to attend the banquet. Hence, no one would suspect that the woman beside Yang Lin was Mrs. Gu.","Gu Zheng looked at the woman who got out of the car not far away and narrowed his eyes.","Yang Lin brought Qiao Xi into the banquet hall. Qiao Xi did not know what had just happened and only urgently wanted to avoid that man in case he noticed something.","The reporters continued to ask, “President Gu, can you reveal the other party’s identity?”","Gu Zheng smiled and looked past the crowd to the woman at the entrance of the banquet hall.","Qiao Xi: “???” What the hell?","She subconsciously touched her face. She had disguised herself! Moreover, Second Brother’s disguise skills were top-notch. Even she could not see any flaws with it. Could it be that Gu Zheng had realized it?","Fortunately, his gaze only lingered for a moment before he looked away indifferently. His cold voice sounded. “No.”","...","The reporters all looked disappointed, but they were already very satisfied. It was the first time President Gu was willing to accept getting interviewed. They did not dare to ask for more.","Just as they were searching for their next target, Gu Zheng suddenly came in front of Yang Lin. His eyes were deep, and his voice was filled with a trace of coldness. “Are you President Yang of Huai Bi Jewelry?”","Everyone’s gazes immediately shot over. Qiao Xi’s heart skipped a beat as she hurriedly lowered her head in fear.","Yang Lin really did not expect the famous President Gu to take the initiative to talk to him. He was instantly overjoyed. “It’s me! President Gu, you’ve actually heard of me? What can I do for you?”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully, then his gaze drifted to Qiao Xi who was beside him. “It’s nothing much. I just think that President Yang’s female companion... is very beautiful.”","Yang Lin: “??”","Everyone: “???”","No one present expected President Gu to praise Yang Lin’s female companion in public. Wasn’t he already married? They heard that Mrs. Gu was also very beautiful. Why was he praising another woman on such an occasion?","Yang Lin widened his eyes and was stunned for a long time. Then, he tactfully pushed Qiao Xi in front of Gu Zheng. He said with a smile, “It’s her honor that you like her. Bai Lu, quickly thank President Gu.”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Thank your *ss!’","She slowly looked up and saw Gu Zheng’s faint smile. She felt a chill run down her spine and could only pretend to be calm as she squeezed out an awkward smile.","Gu Zheng sized her up openly, his voice low and magnetic. “Bai Lu is a nice name.”","Qiao Xi felt the burning gazes of everyone and gritted her teeth. If she ignored Gu Zheng at this moment, she would definitely be suspected. After thinking about it, she could only deliberately change her tone. “Hello, President Gu.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and stared at the woman in front of him. No one could tell his emotions. They only heard his gentle voice. “Miss Bai, you have a nice voice as well.”","Yang Lin’s gaze shifted between Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng. He knew that Gu Zheng did not bring Mrs. Gu with him today. He was even publicly praising Bai Lu. He had probably taken a liking to this woman.","Yang Lin asked tentatively, “President Gu, should we let Bai Lu—”","Before he could finish, Gu Zheng smirked in satisfaction.","Qiao Xi revealed a terrified expression. What was Gu Zheng trying to do? Stop fooling around!","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng shook his head and left.","Qiao Xi hurriedly heaved a sigh of relief and obediently walked by Yang Lin’s side to avoid being noticed.","At this moment, the people from Ling Pavilion had already arranged everything. As long as Qiao Xi completed the mission and reported it to Luo Qing, this mission would be completed.","On the other hand, the sapphire necklace was already being presented on stage. However, this charity banquet was different from usual. Instead of bidding for the items one by one, all the items were gathered in the exhibition hall. Everyone could look at it at close range and bid when they saw something they liked.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was hiding in a corner. She was just about to take out the earpiece and leave when suddenly...","“Miss Bai, why are you hiding here?”","A gentle and smiling voice sounded behind her. There was a hint of mockery in that person’s tone."]},{"number":849,"title":"Chapter 849 - Mrs. Gu Is Very Narcissistic","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi turned around. The man seemed to be subduing her with every step he took, and she was unable to dodge in time. She was instantly pushed to a narrow corner. She slowly raised her eyes and looked at the man’s deep light brown eyes.","The corners of his mouth curled up into a meaningful smile. He lowered his head and looked at her affectionately.","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as a familiar feeling surged into her heart. She lowered her head in a panic, but the scorching aura reached her body and caused her to be unable to ignore it.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and pressed his arm against the wall beside her, closing in the distance between them. His voice was hoarse and gentle. “Miss Bai?”","Qiao Xi’s breathing almost stopped, and her mind went blank. “Gu... Gu Zheng?”","She reached out to separate their bodies and refused to let him approach her. The man lowered his eyes and snorted. His tone was filled with ridicule. “Not many people dare to call me by my name. It’s really strange that you’re so bold the first time we meet. Do we know each other?”","Qiao Xi pressed her hands against his chest, and they were burning hot. She hurriedly withdrew them, and her breathing became hurried. Could it be that Gu Zheng had seen through her identity?","At this moment, a photo appeared on the big screen of the banquet hall. It was the precious sapphire necklace.","Gu Zheng asked slowly, “Miss Bai, do you like that necklace?”","Qiao Xi knew about that necklace. Gu Zheng was here for that necklace.","She kept feeling that Gu Zheng’s gaze was too scorching as he kept staring at her face. She could not help but suspect that Gu Zheng had already seen through her identity. She pretended to be calm and said, “It’s alright. President Gu, do you like it?”","“I like it very much. I want to buy it for someone,” Gu Zheng said without hesitation.","Qiao Xi subconsciously asked, “Who are you giving it to?”","......","With that, she wished she could slap herself. However, since she had already asked, she could not take back her words. She could only quietly wait for Gu Zheng’s answer.","The man chuckled with a trace of roguishness. “For my wife.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shijing had already placed a bid for it and handed it to Gu Zheng as instructed. He opened the luxurious velvet box and weighed it carefully. He asked softly, “Miss Bai, do you know my wife?”","Qiao Xi looked at him with a puzzled expression. She gulped and said with a smile, “I don’t know her, but I’ve heard that Mrs. Gu is a gentle and elegant talented woman!”","Perhaps Gu Zheng did not expect Qiao Xi to praise herself like this, because he was stunned for a few seconds and did not say anything. Then, he said with a subtle expression, “Miss Bai, where did you hear the rumors?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Am I not a gentle and elegant talented woman?’","“Then Mrs. Gu must be a kind-hearted and successful woman!”","Gu Zheng shook his head and smiled.","Qiao Xi was slightly angry and frowned. “Then what kind of a woman is she?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng’s low and hoarse voice sounded. “Mrs. Gu is a delicate little kitten. She always does bad things behind my back. Even when she’s angry from embarrassment, she’ll still be angry at me.”","When he spoke up to this point, he glanced meaningfully at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi: “...” This bastard had indeed recognized her a long time ago and was even deliberately pretending not to know how to tease her!","Since he was pretending, she would continue acting with him. She gritted her teeth. “In that case, Mrs. Gu is a lively and cute girl!”","Gu Zheng nodded, his eyes filled with ridicule. “Yes, and she’s very narcissistic.”","Qiao Xi forcefully endured her anger and said fiercely, “This necklace is quite nice, but it’s just too cheap. How is it worthy of that lively, loving, kind, elegant, and gentle woman, Mrs. Gu? If President Gu wants to give her a gift, he should give her a more expensive one!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Miss Bai, why don’t you give me an idea?”","Coincidentally, a Chinese zither appeared on the big screen at this moment. She pointed at the screen. “President Gu, what do you think of this Nine Heavens Chinese Zither?”","Gu Zheng looked up. He knew that Mrs. Gu knew how to play the violin, but he did not know that she knew how to play the Chinese zither. Did she really want this violin, or did she say so because it was expensive?","However, Gu Zheng had never cared about money. As long as Mrs. Gu liked it, so what if it was 50 times more expensive?","“Okay.”","Song Shijing quickly went to bid for the Nine Heavens Chinese Zither. Gu Zheng asked softly, “Miss Bai, what do you think?”","Qiao Xi was silent. She knew that Gu Zheng did not care about the price of that necklace, but this ancient zither was truly too expensive. Even so, Gu Zheng bought it without saying anything. He was truly too prodigal."]},{"number":850,"title":"Chapter 850 - Nine Heavens Chinese Zither","paragraphs":["Perhaps seeing through her thoughts, Gu Zheng said slowly, “As long as you like it, so what if I spend money? What I don’t lack the least is money, so it’s worth it to spend money to buy you happiness.”","Just as Qiao Xi was about to speak, Luo Qing’s voice sounded in her earpiece, and her expression changed.","Gu Zheng seemed to have sensed something and slowly turned around. “I’ll take my leave first. Miss Bai, if you need help, you can go to the third floor to seek help. They’re all my people there. Don’t put yourself in danger.”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled. Gu Zheng really knew everything. Nothing could be hidden from him.","...","After Qiao Xi finished dealing with Yang Lin, the people from Ling Pavilion appeared and took Yang Lin away. The rest of the matter was left to Luo Qing to handle. She would not continue to participate.","The banquet had already been going on for more than an hour. Qiao Xi felt that the layer of skin on her face was not breathable and very uncomfortable, so she entered the lounge and prepared to remove it before secretly leaving when no one was around.","However, not long after she walked out of the lounge, she bumped into a familiar figure.","Gu Zheng’s footsteps were steady. Song Shijing and the others followed behind him and walked over majestically. They happened to meet Qiao Xi, who was still wearing Bai Lu’s gown.","Song Shijing looked surprised. “Young Madam, aren’t you feeling unwell? Why are you here? This gown...”","...","“Yes, before I went out, you said that your stomach hurt. Are you feeling better now?” Gu Zheng looked meaningfully at the flustered little woman in front of him.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. She was truly too unlucky. She had just left the lounge when she encountered the person she least wanted to see.","Seeing her awkward expression, Gu Zheng waved his hand to signal Song Shijing and the others to leave. He asked them to put the exquisite mahogany box on the sofa. The man waved at her. “Come and see the gift you chose.”","Qiao Xi could not help but look at the mahogany box on the sofa. She recalled that when she was fighting with Gu Zheng earlier, she had instigated him to bid for the expensive Nine Heavens Chinese Zither.","Gu Zheng said casually, “That necklace is indeed beautiful, but a kind, lively, cute, gentle, and elegant woman like Mrs. Gu should have a more expensive gift.”","His tone was calm, but it carried a trace of ridicule. Not only did he repeat Qiao Xi’s words, but he even grunted lightly. “Why didn’t I realize before that you were so narcissistic?”","Qiao Xi’s face flushed red as she flew into a rage out of humiliation and questioned, “Are you saying that she’s not such a person?”","Gu Zheng smiled and did not say anything. He looked at the mahogany box on the sofa and slowly opened it, revealing the colorful zither.","Before Qiao Xi could speak, a male voice sounded from afar. “Isn’t this the Nine Heavens Chinese Zither from the auction?”","Qiao Xi turned around and saw a few people walking toward them. The middle-aged man standing at the front was dressed in bright clothes, and behind him was a man who looked like an assistant. He looked cunning and wretched. As soon as he walked over, he started sowing discord. “You said you wanted to bid for this ancient zither a long time ago, yet someone actually snatched it from you!”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. It turned out that this ancient zither was something that someone else wanted. She had just casually pointed at something expensive for the sake of teasing Gu Zheng, but if this ancient zither was really taken, Gu Zheng would not have blindly snatched it.","At this moment, the middle-aged man spoke with a calm tone, “The two of you aren’t from the music industry, right? Can you sell this zither to me? I can raise the price.”","These words sounded quite polite, but the disdain in his eyes could not be concealed.","Gu Zheng’s voice was cold. “This is a gift for my wife. I don’t intend to give it up. Moreover, when I bought this ancient Chinese zither, it was made known to me that it wasn’t reserved.”","The moment that was said, the man’s expression darkened. The assistant behind him was immediately indignant. “Do you know who the person in front of you is? Do you know why we’re here in Li City?”","Qiao Xi: “???” ‘Who do you think you are?!’","Gu Zheng was naturally unwilling to pay attention to these two people. He did not even bother to look at them and directly pulled Qiao Xi out of the door.","The middle-aged man’s expression changed as he questioned coldly, “What kind of attitude is this? This belongs to me, so you have to give it to me!”","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks and said calmly, “If the two of you have any objections, you can look for the person in charge of the charity banquet. There’s no need to pester us here.”","Unexpectedly, that person was unconvinced and shamelessly sent someone to stop Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi knew that these two people must have just arrived in Li City, so they did not know the famous Gu Zheng."]},{"number":851,"title":"Chapter 851 - Emotional Blackmail","paragraphs":["The middle-aged man in the lead said arrogantly, “The two of you aren’t from the music industry, so perhaps you don’t know me. Let me introduce myself. I’m a guest of honor for Planet Music Festival, Xu Da.”","After Xu Da finished speaking, he looked proud and raised his head arrogantly. Planet Music Festival was the top music competition in the country and was very famous overseas. His identity as a guest of honor for Planet Music Festival was enough to make the two people in front of him admire him.","He had his hands behind his back and a proud expression as he quietly waited for Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng to come forward to greet him. However, after waiting for a long time, the two of them did not move in the slightest.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi cleared her throat and slowly said, “Mr. Xu, you came to Li City to give out an award. Who are you giving it to?”","Seeing this, Xu Da said arrogantly, “A composer named Fu Sheng won a gold award at Planet Music Festival. I came to Li City to give her an award.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly. So it was for Fu Sheng!","Xu Da said arrogantly, “Let me remind you that Miss Fu Sheng has taken a liking to this ancient Chinese zither. I wanted to bid for this zither as a gift to Miss Fu Sheng. As the top composer of Planet Music Festival, she’s the most suitable candidate for this zither. Since some people don’t know music, why did they bid for this zither?”","He glanced coldly at Qiao Xi, and his eyes were filled with ridicule. “If this Nine Heavens Chinese Zither falls into the hands of an outsider, it’ll only be left in the storeroom to rot. This is equivalent to ruining it. Why don’t you just give it up?!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng’s expression turned cold.","Qiao Xi continued to smile as she casually said, “So, Mr. Xu, you mean that if I don’t give up this zither, I’ll be considered unreasonable?”","When Xu Da saw that Qiao Xi was very sensible, his expression softened. “Only Fu Sheng is worthy of this ancient zither. Even if you obtain it, it’s worthless to you. Why don’t you give it to someone more suitable for it?”","Qiao Xi smiled. “I can give it to you, but Mr. Xu, you have to show your identification and prove that it was Planet Music Festival who asked you to buy this zither for Fu Sheng. If it’s the person in charge’s request, my husband and I naturally have no reason to refuse.","“When my husband bought this zither, the auctioneer didn’t say that anyone had reserved it. However, if the person in charge of Planet Music Festival wants this zither, I can give it up.”","......","Xu Da’s face was livid.","“If it’s just because Miss Fu Sheng has taken a liking to this zither and you want to give it to her in your own name, why should I give it to you? Moreover, if you really wanted to give someone a gift, why didn’t you come earlier? You just had to wait for the zither to be auctioned off before coming over to make things difficult for us. Doesn’t that make you a robber?”","Qiao Xi’s words were reasonable, and every word heavily smashed into Xu Da’s heart. His expression became uglier and uglier. The muscles on his face were even trembling slightly.","Finally, he flew into a rage out of humiliation and shouted, “What nonsense are you talking about?! It doesn’t matter if it’s Planet Music Festival’s idea or mine. Only Fu Sheng is worthy of this violin. You’re just an amateur who doesn’t know music. What right do you have to occupy this violin? Do you have any shame?”","“Everything is first come, first serve. Why should I give in just because she likes it?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows.","“She has obtained such a great honor. She’s the pride of the entire Li City and the country. What right do you have to stop her?” Xu Da shouted.","“If she wants it so badly, then let her look for me herself!” Qiao Xi’s face was filled with ridicule. “Oh! Mr. Xu, are you trying to use emotional blackmail against me? How dare you ask me for something? Just because you’re old? If Miss Fu Sheng really likes this zither, she can look for me. I want to see if she’s as shameless as you!”","Xu Da did not expect to be rendered speechless by a 20-year-old woman. His expression gradually turned ferocious.","Qiao Xi said meaningfully, “Mr. Xu, perhaps you don’t know the rules of the auction. Once the mallet is hit thrice, it means that the deal is done. This zither belongs to me. As for the others, they won’t have the chance even if they want it. Why should I have to give in to just anyone who takes a liking to it?”","Moreover, what right did ‘Fu Sheng’ have to ask for this Nine Heavens Chinese Zither?","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and left. Gu Zheng carried the ancient zither and followed her. Xu Da was still standing on the same spot while gnashing his teeth in hatred. He was unable to calm down for a long time."]},{"number":852,"title":"Chapter 852 - Gold Award Winner","paragraphs":["On the way, Gu Zheng asked, “Previously when you went to look for Song Shijing, was it about this?”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Song Shijing majored in law. I asked him to do me a small favor and give me a copyright certificate.”","Gu Zheng revealed a doting smile. “Looks like I’ve underestimated you, Mrs. Gu. You’ve already laid out your plans. Who in the world is more suitable for this zither than you, Mrs. Gu?”","He walked steadily and looked ahead. His tone was gentle. “Don’t worry, I’ll get Song Shijing to pay more attention to Xu Da. I won’t let him look for trouble with you.”","Qiao Xi’s face turned red as she revealed a shy expression. It turned out that in Gu Zheng’s eyes, she was such a weak and helpless little girl!","The couple got into the car. Qiao Xi had just taken out her phone when she realized that the screen had turned black. A white code appeared on the screen. It turned out that Mu Ming and Mu Ling were looking for her. Actually, she did not have a good relationship with this pair of siblings. Previously, Mu Ling always quarreled with her and even became enemies with her because of Mo Yuan. However, when Xu Mei wanted to help Qiao Rou get rid of the dirt on her, the siblings refused without hesitation. They even ordered the entire Dark Net not to let anyone take on Xu Mei’s job.","Hence, on the account of their past relationship, she had to help. Moreover, this matter was very simple for her. She just had to expose Tang Ruge for pretending to be Fu Sheng. It was something that she should do.","Gu Zheng slowly looked up. “You want to help?”","“It’s not exactly helping. I don’t care about other people’s family matters, but Tang Ruge has been looking for trouble with me time and again. This time, she’s even pretending to be Fu Sheng. It’s time for me to retaliate.”","Qiao Xi replied to Mu Ming’s message and said calmly: [The copyright certificate has been completed, but I still need someone to help me. She’ll arrive in Li City a few days later.]","Gu Zheng smiled. It seemed that Mrs. Gu had long set up a trap. Whether Mu Ming asked her for help or not, she had already decided to make Tang Ruge pay the price. Tang Ruge could provoke anyone but not Mrs. Gu.","...","“I’m such a weak and obedient girl, yet Tang Ruge insists on bullying me. Since that’s the case, then I don’t have to show any mercy. I hope she won’t cry too miserably!” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully.","At the entrance of the charity banquet.","Xu Da was still immersed in his anger. He was so angry that his face was livid. “Miss Fu Sheng has long taken a liking to that zither, but that woman refused to give in. What right does she have to refuse? Who does she think she is?! She’s inferior to even a strand of Miss Fu Sheng’s hair!”","The assistant also chimed in, “Which family is that wild girl from? She’s rude and has such a bad temper. She actually doesn’t take the winner of Planet Music Festival seriously!”","“We’ve already agreed to Miss Fu Sheng’s request, but now that the zither has been snatched away, how are we going to explain this to her?!”","“Mr. Xu, what’s wrong?” At this moment, a gentle female voice came from afar. Tang Ruge walked over elegantly in a gown and smiled at the two of them. “Mr. Xu, who made you angry?”","Xu Da was already filled with anger. When he saw the so-called ‘Fu Sheng’, he exaggerated what had happened just now. He wanted Tang Ruge to deal with that arrogant woman.","When Tang Ruge heard this, she asked indifferently, “Was there a handsome and tall man standing beside the woman you’re talking about?”","Xu Da hurriedly nodded. He was curious about how Tang Ruge knew that. He heard her say with a smile, “It’s a misunderstanding. Xi Xi and President Gu are both my friends. If they like that ancient zither, just give it to them. I won’t mind.”","Xu Da looked shocked. “What? They’re your friends? Since they’re friends, why did they snatch your things?”","Tang Ruge looked miserable but pretended to be calm. “It’s okay. If Xi Xi likes it, just give it to her. Anyway, I’m not lacking in zithers. After all, she’s my friend. There’s no need to make both parties unhappy because of a zither.”","Xu Da was indignant. “Miss Fu Sheng, you’re too kind. She clearly knew that you liked that zither, yet she still snatched it away. She did it on purpose. She doesn’t know how to play the zither at all, yet she insists on having it. You’re the top composer of Planet Music Festival, yet she still looks down on you. She’s simply too much!”","Tang Ruge said helplessly, “Xi Xi is a little willful. She definitely has to get whatever she likes. I don’t have to compete with her. If this matter blows up, it won’t be good for anyone. Mr. Xu, you don’t have to take it to heart. I’ll apologize on her behalf.”"]},{"number":853,"title":"Chapter 853 - A Noblewoman","paragraphs":["Xu Da was already angry because of Qiao Xi’s attitude. Now when he saw Tang Ruge compromising, he stomped his feet in hatred.","“You’re the winner of Planet Music Festival, yet you still have to give in to her. There aren’t many young people as humble and polite as you are now.”","Tang Ruge smiled and said, “I grew up in the capital. My parents are very strict with my education. They tell me to be humble and kind no matter what. It’s just a zither, so I’ll just give it to her.”","Their conversation was secretly recorded by the reporters who came to interview them. That night, a piece of news spread online. The composer who won the gold award for Planet Music Festival had appeared in Li City in preparation to attend the award ceremony.","Before the award ceremony, the organizers of Planet Music Festival had to keep the winner of the gold award a secret. This had always been the rule. The final outcome would not be revealed until the last moment. However, the big shots in the industry had long received the news and knew that the winner of the gold award this time was a woman called Fu Sheng.","The more mysterious it was, the more attention it attracted. Hence, the entire internet was discussing who the winner of the gold award was.","Not long after, netizens found the account Fu Sheng had registered on a small website. She gained millions of fans overnight. Those with sharp eyes realized that one of the songs was very similar to a song released by the big celebrity, Xu Anran. Coupled with the fact that Xu Anran was suddenly banned, everyone could not help but suspect that Xu Anran had plagiarized Fu Sheng’s work.","Fu Sheng was just a stage name. As for this woman’s true identity, no one knew. Hence, everyone started an intense discussion online.","[Previously, I didn’t understand how Xu Anran suddenly disappeared, so I went to investigate. It turns out that Xu Anran plagiarized and framed the real daughter of the Xu family with her mother. In the end, the mother and daughter were chased out of the house.]","[Xu Anran’s adoptive father, Mr. Xu, has already cut off all ties with Xu Anran and Madam Xu. It seems that the mother and daughter had done many shameful things behind his back!]","[Previously, Xu Anran’s brainless fans were still clamoring over how their idol had released a new song. In the end, they were slapped in the face. Plagiarists should get out of the entertainment industry!]","...","While the netizens were discussing fervently, a reporter suddenly released a photo of Tang Ruge and Xu Da with the caption—","[I took a photo of Miss Tang and Mr. Xu at the charity banquet yesterday. Everyone might not know who Mr. Xu is. Let me explain to everyone. This is the guest of honor who’ll be giving out awards for Planet Music Festival. He came to Li City this time for the award ceremony that’s taking place two days later.","[I heard that this gentleman came to attend the charity banquet just to bid for a zither. Unfortunately, someone beat him to it. Mr. Xu was unwilling, so Miss Tang came to comfort him. I’ll post the video for everyone later.]","A moment later, the reporter released a video. However, because the video was taken from a distance, no one could hear the conversation between the two clearly. However, everyone could hear the words ‘Gold Award’ and ‘Planet Music Festival’.","[Let me make a bold guess. Miss Tang is probably the winner of the gold award for Planet Music Festival. She’s Fu Sheng!]","Once Fu Sheng’s identity was exposed, the internet instantly exploded. Everyone hurriedly checked Tang Ruge’s information. This lady’s identity was not ordinary. She grew up in the capital, and not only was she the eldest daughter of the Tang family, but she was also a top socialite and talented woman. She had won many awards in piano, chess, calligraphy, and painting competitions. Coupled with the gentle and kind image she had carefully built over the years, she instantly attracted a large number of fans.","Coincidentally, Tang Ruge was participating in a live broadcast at this moment. She was wearing a silk dress, and her dark hair fell over her shoulders. She looked like the humble but pretty daughter of a small family. One seemed to be able to feel the air of an intellectual on her, and she made others feel like there was a breeze caressing them just by looking at her.","The host had a good impression of this noble young lady and guided her into the topic. “Miss Tang, do you know Xu Anran?”","At this moment, the matter of Xu Anran plagiarizing Fu Sheng’s work had already been exposed. In just 10 minutes, it was trending. Everyone was also very concerned about Tang Ruge’s attitude toward this matter.","Tang Ruge looked confused. “Xu Anran... I know her. I’ve seen her on TV.”","“Miss Tang and Xu Anran are both socialites of high society. Have you never met in private?” the host continued to ask.","Tang Ruge smiled. “We’ve met a few times at banquets, but I’m not familiar with her. Moreover, I don’t think we’re the same kind of people.”"]},{"number":854,"title":"Chapter 854 - Plagiarism","paragraphs":["In everyone’s eyes, Tang Ruge had always been gentle and kind. This was the first time she had publicly expressed that she didn’t like someone. That person was Xu Anran, who had gotten into the plagiarism scandal.","Just as everyone was still guessing, Tang Ruge smiled bitterly. “I don’t like to talk about others behind their backs, but since the host asked today, I’ll be honest. I don’t like her, but it’s not because of her plagiarism. It’s because of what she did to my friend.”","When Qiao Xi heard these words, an inexplicable feeling instantly appeared in her heart. The next second, Tang Ruge said with a sad expression, “Everyone should have heard about the real and fake daughters of the Xu family. Xu Anran is only the adopted daughter of the Xu family, but she deliberately hid the news of the real daughter. When the real daughter returned to the Xu family, she even targeted her in every way. The real daughter of the Xu family is an important friend of mine.”","Tang Ruge’s eyes were filled with schemes. The corners of her mouth curled up slightly, revealing a confident and gentle smile. In front of the camera, she maintained a good image and defended her friend. Even if she publicly said bad things about Xu Anran, no one would think that she was in the wrong.","“My friend is called Qiao Xi.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi, who was sitting in front of the computer, was speechless. How shameless!","Tang Ruge continued to put on an act. “Xi Xi is the famous fashion designer, Gu Shan. We’ve known each other for many years. When we first met, she was still an unknown designer. I watched her grow step by step until now. It wasn’t easy for her to find her biological parents, but Xu Anran wanted to interfere and ruin her hard-earned happiness. How can I like Xu Anran?","“Xu Anran might know about my relationship with Xi Xi, so she played some tricks behind my back. I believe everyone has already guessed it. I can’t say much about the exact situation.”","Qiao Xi took a sip of water and stared at the woman on the screen thoughtfully.","Song Shiyu, who was at the side, quickly shouted, “Young Madam, she’s using you! She even said that she knew you when you weren’t famous. What does this mean?! It means that she’s better than you. It’s all thanks to her that you’re so famous now. Not only is she your friend, but she’s also your benefactor. What good methods she’s using this time!","“She even said that Xu Anran knows about your relationship, which is why she’s targeting her. She means to say that you’ve implicated her. As for what Xu Anran did, everyone knows even if she doesn’t say it. She plagiarized! Xu Anran plagiarized Fu Sheng’s song. She’s telling everyone that she’s Fu Sheng!","...","“I’ve never seen such a shameless person!”","Qiao Xi nodded while feeling touched. “Song Shiyu, you’ve become smarter. You’ve analyzed her thoughts thoroughly.”","Song Shiyu was right. That was what Tang Ruge meant. Moreover, her methods were very brilliant. No one would be able to tell that she was wrong. Instead, everyone would think that she was kind-hearted and valued friendships.","Immediately after, a group of people stood up for Tang Ruge. [Gu Shan appeared in the International Fashion Week seven years ago. Coincidentally, Tang Ruge and Gu Shan met seven years ago. The two of them became friends when they were in their teens. No wonder they’re so close!]","[Could it be that Tang Ruge is the winner of Planet Music Festival?]","[Although Planet Music Festival hasn’t announced the news, I think it’s Ruge. We’ll wait and see!]","[Shocking! The Tang family has already sued Xu Anran’s studio and asked her to compensate for the copyright infringement. Xu Anran has to personally apologize!]","[Xu Anran is in trouble this time. She was banned online after committing the crime previously. Now that the plagiarism incident has been exposed, it’s absolutely impossible for her to make a comeback. She probably thought that Fu Sheng was just a small composer back then since her songs were usually posted on small websites. That’s why she dared to plagiarize. Who knew that she would meet Tang Ruge this time?]","At this moment, the host also received a message from his assistant. He hurriedly asked, “Ruge, do you know that your parents are suing Xu Anran?”","Tang Ruge smiled. “Of course, I know. I’m very grateful to my parents and grandfather. They love me very much.”","These words were equivalent to admitting that she was Fu Sheng. Everything was already developing in her favor.","Qiao Xi sneered and turned off the live broadcast in disgust. Her gaze landed on the ancient zither Gu Zheng had given her. She casually fiddled with it a few times, and a pleasant melody slowly sounded."]},{"number":855,"title":"Chapter 855 - She’s Fu Sheng","paragraphs":["Suddenly, a black shadow flashed past the window. Not long after, that person jumped in from the window. After that person entered, he said respectfully, “Eldest Miss, Yang Lin’s matter is very complicated. Young Master said that it’s not convenient for you to interfere anymore and asked you to protect yourself. This is a weapon Young Master gave you to protect yourself.”","With that, the person took out a dagger embedded with gems.","Qiao Xi took it and pulled the dagger out of the sheath, which revealed a faint cold light. She asked thoughtfully, “What’s the relationship between the Tang family and Yang Lin?”","The person was stunned for a moment. “How did you know, Eldest Miss?”","“I’ve investigated Yang Lin. He’s just a businessman. Why does Second Brother care so much about him? All these years, Second Brother has been most concerned about the dirty dealings the Tang family has been doing behind his back. So, Yang Lin must be the person who conspired with the Tang family to commit human trafficking and fraud?”","The man in black gulped and said nervously, “Young Master originally told me not to tell you, but since you’ve already found out, I’ll tell you the truth. Yang Lin has captured someone. Young Master was entrusted by another party to save the person captured by Yang Lin, so he wanted to attack Yang Lin. However, to capture him in one go, he can’t make too big of a move. He can only do it in secret.”","Qiao Xi nodded. No wonder Second Brother took this matter so seriously. Ling Pavilion, which had always been tasked with killing people, had now taken up the job of saving someone.","“After spending a few days on it, Young Master found their nest. As long as we find out where that person is, we can successfully save him. Someone will naturally handle the rest. It won’t have anything to do with us anymore.”","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa and closed her eyes slightly. “I really didn’t expect that the scholarly Tang family would actually collude with Yang Lin to do illegal business behind the scenes. No wonder Gu Zheng is in no rush to deal with Tang Ruge. It turns out that someone is already targeting this family!”","Second Brother was already investigating the Tang family’s dirty business, so Gu Zheng must also know that the Tang family was colluding with Yang Lin. Coupled with the fact that he recognized her as ‘Bai Lu’ at the charity banquet, he should have already guessed what Ling Pavilion was going to do.","The Tang family and Yang Lin had been in cahoots for a long time. The crimes they had committed were countless. The reason why the Tang family and Yang Lin could be left to do as they wished for so long was not that Gu Zheng or Second Brother were afraid of them, but because if they wanted to eliminate these people, they had to wait for a good opportunity.","...","“Eldest Miss.” The man in black suddenly spoke and reminded her softly, “Ever since you married President Gu, you haven’t cared about anything else. You can choose not to participate in Ling Pavilion’s matters, but you don’t care about your family business either?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly: “...”","“Back then, you said that you wanted to open an entertainment company. Now, your Qingfeng Entertainment is already ranked second in the industry and is gradually getting closer to Heavenly Voice Entertainment. During this period of time, we’ve been helping you manage the company, but we’re just employees, after all. How can we make decisions for you? You should come back and manage it yourself!”","Qiao Xi thought about it. She founded Qingfeng Entertainment on a whim, and she signed a few small celebrities in the beginning. After that, she never participated in the management and planning of the company. She originally thought that the company was about to go bankrupt, but she did not expect it to be second in the industry!","At this moment, the news of Tang Ruge being Fu Sheng was everywhere on the internet. The award presenters of Planet Music Festival also came to Li City one after another.","For some reason, Xu Da’s words at the charity banquet had reached the ears of Madam Wen Lai, the founder of Planet Music Festival. She also knew that Tang Ruge wanted that ancient zither.","The rule of the Planet Music Festival was that not only could the winner of the gold award win the championship, but they could also choose a gift that they liked and have Planet Music buy it for them.","When Madam Wen Lai heard the news, she insisted on coming to Li City. “I’ve met this young lady once before. She doesn’t really like music, but she’s very talented. I’m really surprised that she was able to attend the music festival this time. Since she wants this gift, I have to get it for her.","“It just so happens that I also wish to see the beautiful girl from back then again. Has she gotten even more beautiful than before? I saw her once many years ago, but I still can’t forget her face.”","At this moment, the person standing beside Wen Lai lowered his head. Miss Fu Sheng was indeed very talented, but her face...","Tang Ruge’s face could not help but appear in his mind. Her beauty was completely supported by expensive clothes and makeup. Moreover, her appearance was not something that Madam Wen Lai would find memorable."]},{"number":856,"title":"Chapter 856 - Award Gift","paragraphs":["On the other hand, the award presenters had already arrived in Li City one after another. They had long contacted the largest concert hall in the area to present the award to Miss Fu Sheng and have it broadcasted worldwide.","Perhaps some people did not pay attention to this award ceremony before, but now that the plagiarism incident had spread online and it was revealed that Tang Ruge was the daughter of the Tang family, everyone could not help but pay attention to this grand occasion.","However, other than the trophy, the person in charge also had to give Tang Ruge the ancient zither. Hence, he looked for Xu Da. “Mr. Xu, did you contact the organizers of the charity banquet in advance and have them reserve the zither for Miss Fu Sheng?”","Xu Da’s heart trembled as he lowered his head guiltily. As the award presenter for Planet Music Festival, did he need to reserve anything? As long as he wanted it, the other party should obediently deliver it to his door. He had indeed not reserved that zither. Who knew that someone would bid for it so quickly? Moreover, that woman was unwilling to give it up.","The more he thought about it, the angrier he became. Xu Da cleared his throat and said without blushing, “That’s right!”","“The person in charge of the charity banquet said that someone has already bid for that zither. Now that we can’t get the gift Miss Fu Sheng likes, what should we do?”","Xu Da looked flustered, but he quickly recovered. “It’s okay. I told Miss Fu Sheng about this a long time ago. She said that the person who got the zither is her friend, so she doesn’t care.”","The person in charge’s expression darkened. “Since she’s Miss Fu Sheng’s friend, why did she snatch the zither that Miss Fu Sheng likes?”","At this moment, the netizens also found out about the zither. This was because Wen Lai had already arrived in Li City. In the interview, she even made it clear that she would give Fu Sheng a zither. Fu Sheng had liked that zither for a long time. Planet Music had already contacted the person in charge of the banquet and would definitely send the zither to Fu Sheng as soon as possible.","This was a normal routine for the award ceremony. In the past, the award ceremonies for Planet Music Festival would always go very smoothly. However, this time, a plagiarism scandal arose. Now, even the zither was snatched away.","The person in charge of the award ceremony looked worried. They had already promised Miss Fu Sheng that they would get the ancient zither for her, but they had gone back on their word. Not only would Madam Wen Lai be angry, but the people of Li City would also not let the matter rest. They would think that this was a show of disrespect to Li City. If this matter blew up, it would not be good for anyone.","...","He thought for a long time and helplessly posted an apology statement on Planet Music’s official website. He sincerely admitted his mistake, which caused the zither to be bought by someone else. He didn’t even know the whereabouts of the zither now.","Everyone was very curious about who bought this ancient zither that originally belonged to Miss Fu Sheng. At the same time, they were angry on behalf of Tang Ruge. [What a pity. Planet Music Festival is only held once a year. Every year, the winner of the gold award would get what they want. However, Miss Fu Sheng has to change her request. Planet Music is too irresponsible!]","[So who exactly stole that zither?! Why didn’t you investigate?! If you can find the buyer and explain the situation to them, they’ll definitely give it up if they know that it’s a gift for Miss Fu Sheng!]","Instantly, the account of the person in charge of Planet Music exploded. Netizens stood up to scold the organizers.","Continue_reading on","Tang Ruge looked at the comments online and smiled sinisterly. The identity of Fu Sheng had brought her too many benefits. As long as she remained to be Fu Sheng, countless people would stand up for her. She did not have to do it herself.","After a moment of silence, she made a call. “We can start now. Follow the original plan.”","The night before the award ceremony, a mysterious account suddenly posted a video on Weibo. In the video, a woman in a high-end dress was seen carrying the ancient zither. The timestamp in the video was exactly half an hour before Xu Da arrived at the charity banquet. Hence, when Xu Da arrived at the charity banquet, the ancient zither had already been bought.","The video was very clear, and it was just enough to see the woman’s face clearly. That person was... Qiao Xi!","[In that case, Mr. Xu Da went to the charity banquet for the zither. Before he went, he would definitely have informed the person in charge of the banquet. The person in charge would immediately take the zither off the display case and not sell it to outsiders.]","[Who knew that before the zither could be taken down, Qiao Xi would bid for it? Others might not know the origin of this zither, but as Miss Fu Sheng’s friend, doesn’t she know that this is the gift Miss Fu Sheng wants most?]"]},{"number":857,"title":"Chapter 857 - Kidnapping","paragraphs":["At this moment, Madam Tang and a group of noblewomen were in the mall when they bumped into a bunch of reporters. Faced with the reporters’ questions, Madam Tang only smiled politely and pretended to be gentle. She said, “Ruge is a gentle and kind child. She doesn’t want to make everyone unhappy over a small matter. I hope you won’t have any ill intentions to ruin the relationship between her and her friend.","“Actually... Sigh! Forget it.”","The noblewomen beside Madam Tang said helplessly, “It’s only because Ruge isn’t willing to bicker that we—”","“Don’t say anymore. It’s all in the past now. Our Ruge doesn’t care about the zither either. She’ll come across other musical instruments that she likes.” Madam Tang smiled gently and continued speaking to the reporters, “This isn’t the first time something like this has happened. Ruge doesn’t even care, so don’t make a fuss.”","However, the more Madam Tang spoke like this, the more people thought that Qiao Xi had deliberately snatched Tang Ruge’s things. Meanwhile, the eldest daughter of the Tang family had a good temper and was unwilling to make things too ugly with her friend. Hence, she could only swallow her anger.","After this interview, the news that Qiao Xi had bought the Guqin immediately broke out on the internet. Then, someone revealed that Qiao Xi had rushed to the charity banquet early to snatch the award gift that should have belonged to Tang Ruge because she was jealous of Tang Ruge. Weibo instantly exploded.","[So that’s the truth! Qiao Xi clearly knew that the ancient zither belonged to Miss Fu Sheng, yet she still insisted on buying it. She’s too scheming!]","[Miss Fu Sheng is so pitiful! She treats Qiao Xi as a friend, but Qiao Xi doesn’t treat her as a friend! It’s fine that Qiao Xi doesn’t have the ability, but she even played these small tricks behind Miss Fu Sheng’s back. How shameless!]","[Miss Fu Sheng is loyal to her, yet she actually did such a thing?]","[Madam Wenlai said that if she can’t give the ancient zither to Miss Fu Sheng, she’ll regret it for the rest of her life. However, a certain someone who can’t stand seeing others do well just had to interfere!]","The netizens stood up to express their opinions, while the Tang family and Planet Music Festival’s officials did not retort. They just let public opinion ferment as if they had already tacitly agreed to all the allegations.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was looking at the news on the internet coldly. It was unknown if Tang Ruge was deliberately stirring up trouble or if she had hired fake commenters. These people on the internet were using the excuse of protecting Fu Sheng to scold her indiscriminately.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she dressed up and left. There were still six hours before the award ceremony began, and the sun had just risen. She had just left Longwan Residential when she heard footsteps behind her.","......","The footsteps were getting closer and closer. A few men rushed over and captured her. One of them held a handkerchief that had been soaked in chloroform and pressed it to her nose. In a few seconds, her entire body went limp. Then, the few of them quickly carried her to the truck.","“I thought I would have to wait a few days to kidnap this woman. I didn’t expect to get her so easily.”","“Ease it. This woman is very delicate. If she gets hurt, we won’t be able to get a good price for her!”","“She’s living in such a big villa. This woman is no ordinary person! If we really sell her to such a place, she’ll definitely die!”","“She’ll accept her fate after being beaten a few times. Hurry up and drive. Don’t let anyone find out. Let’s quickly deal with this woman to avoid any trouble.”","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes in the truck. Her gaze was cold, and she did not seem to have fainted in the slightest. She quickly untied the rope around her wrists, then indifferently sized up the truck.","The truck was not big, and there was a faint smell of blood. It seemed that this was not the first time they had done such a thing. Previously, the Tang family had also used this truck to commit human trafficking.","The truck door was tightly shut, and it was dark before her eyes. Qiao Xi could only grope around as she moved forward. Suddenly, a strange movement came from behind her. Qiao Xi turned around vigilantly and raised her hand to slap the man. Unexpectedly, her wrist was grabbed by someone, and her body swayed before she fell into a warm and familiar embrace","The man’s voice was low and magnetic. There was a refreshing fragrance of tea in his breath as he whispered in her ear, “Xi Xi, it’s me.”","Hot air sprayed onto Qiao Xi’s neck, causing her entire body to tremble. It was clearly dark before her eyes, yet she seemed to be able to see the other party’s face clearly.","“Ah Zheng, why are you here?” Qiao Xi was surprised.","She had long guessed that Tang Ruge would attack her. Coincidentally, Second Brother was investigating the Tang family’s human trafficking activity, so she suggested being the bait to help Second Brother destroy the Tang family."]},{"number":858,"title":"Chapter 858 - The Tang Family’s ‘Business’","paragraphs":["Originally, Qiao Xi felt that this was not a dangerous mission. After all, these people wanted to sell her to the brothel and would not hurt her at all. Even if they attacked, those good-for-nothings were not her match. Moreover, the assassins of Ling Pavilion would follow her all the way and protect her safety.","“Don’t say anything.” Gu Zheng hugged her tightly and took a shallow breath. “Mrs. Gu, you got involved in something big. As your husband, how can I bear to let you take the risk alone?”","In the darkness, Gu Zheng held her hand tightly as if he was worried that she would be afraid, so he gave her a sense of security.","It was unknown how long he had been waiting in the truck. His body was slightly cold, but his lips were warm. He kissed the woman in his arms as if she was a treasure in this world.","“No... Gu Zheng, you can’t...”","Gu Zheng did not seem to hear her and was still focused on kissing her. His hands held her tightly in his arms, not giving her a chance to resist.","Qiao Xi: “...”","Was this man crazy? There were others in the truck!","When those men threw her in, the people from Ling Pavilion took the opportunity to hide inside as well. At this moment, these people were hiding in the dark and listening to the couple making out!","The few subordinates of Ling Pavilion who were ordered to protect Qiao Xi heard the sound of Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi kissing and blushed. They did not expect that the cold and heartless Gu Zheng would actually be so unrestrained behind their backs.","...","On the other hand, Tang Ruge received a call and knew that Qiao Xi had already been captured and was currently unconscious. Tang Ruge could not control her excitement.","Qiao Xi! She was Gu Zheng’s wife and the eldest daughter of the Yin family. Unfortunately, she could only rely on selling her body for the rest of her life. As long as she was sold to that kind of place, she would never be able to come out. Even if she was lucky enough to come out, she would be hated by others.","......","How could a genius like Gu Zheng want a woman who had probably ridden 10,000 men?","Tang Dawei felt uneasy and asked in a low voice, “Dad, didn’t we agree that our Tang family wouldn’t do such things anymore? If we send Qiao Xi to such a place...”","When Old Master Tang, who was leisurely drinking tea, heard this, his expression instantly darkened. He slammed the teacup on the table and roared angrily. “What are you afraid of?! If we don’t say anything, who will know that we kidnapped Qiao Xi? Moreover, now that the matter has been settled, isn’t it too late for you to regret it?!”","Tang Dawei was so scared that his face turned pale. He lowered his head and did not say anything.","“You’re the head of the Tang family. You can’t be as soft-hearted as your elder brother. Our Tang family relied on that kind of business to have our current status and wealth. Now that we’ve already captured her, if we let her go and someone finds any clues, our Tang family will be doomed!”","Old Master Tang had a serious expression as he shouted at the top of his voice, “Who do you think I’m doing this for? It’s all for you and Ruge! Qiao Xi has already become an enemy of my Tang family. If you don’t get rid of her soon, you and Ruge will be the ones suffering in the future. If you can’t harden your heart now, you’ll definitely regret it in the future!”","Tang Dawei could not help but look at his daughter. How would he feel if Ruge was sold to that kind of place?","Back then, when his family wanted to do such a business, he did not agree. However, the old master insisted on it. After that, he also had a taste of the benefits and turned a blind eye to it. However, now that the Tang family had already obtained what they wanted, why would they do such a heartless and evil thing?","“Dad, but...”","Seeing Old Master Tang’s gloomy expression, Madam Tang hurriedly interrupted Tang Dawei. “Dawei, why can’t you bear to do it?! Qiao Xi is vicious and has repeatedly framed Ruge. She deserves what’s happening to her now. We sold her to that kind of place to atone for her sins. Don’t feel guilty.","“Moreover, if we don’t deal with her now, she’ll definitely go against the Tang family in the future. For the sake of the Tang family, we have to get rid of her. Moreover, she’s just a vulgar wild girl. She even shamelessly occupied the position of Mrs. Gu. Now that she’s gone, Ruge will have a chance to marry President Gu. At that time, our Tang family will be a first-class family.”","Hearing Madam Tang’s words, the old master’s expression softened a little. He had decided to pass the position of head of the family to Tang Dawei because he married a wife who was sensible. She was much better than that old-fashioned and stupid eldest daughter-in-law."]},{"number":859,"title":"Chapter 859 - Are You Looking For Me?","paragraphs":["Tang Ruge was overjoyed and almost laughed out loud.","After selling Qiao Xi to such a dirty place, she would absolutely have no chance of escaping and would no longer have the qualifications to be Mrs. Gu. A large family like the Situ family would not care about a daughter they had never met. Moreover, they were not even sure that Qiao Xi was from the Situ family. There was no need to waste manpower and resources to look for her.","From now on, no one would block her path anymore.","A trace of viciousness flashed past Tang Ruge’s eyes as she advised, “Dad, I know you’re kind-hearted, but you should look at who you’re facing. How can a sinister and vicious woman like Qiao Xi be worthy of your kindness? I know you’ve always been filial, so you won’t go against Grandpa’s wishes, right?”","Under everyone’s persuasion, Tang Dawei took a deep breath and nodded.","...","The truck drove for a long time before finally stopping at eight in the morning. The people from Ling Pavilion had already opened a hole in the top of the truck and got out with Gu Zheng. Everyone found a hidden place to hide.","Boom—","The door of the truck slammed open, and the dark vehicle instantly lit up.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was lying on the floor with her hands bound. She pretended to be slowly waking up and struggled weakly.","The two men pulled her into a warehouse. As soon as they entered, Qiao Xi could clearly hear cries coming from the surroundings. They were all women who had been kidnapped.","Her expression turned cold, but she still pretended to be weak and was pushed in by everyone.","This warehouse must have been abandoned for a long time. It was located in a remote area. No one would come to this uninhabited place. No wonder Second Brother had not been able to find their nest for a long time.","......","“Send this woman to the room upstairs. She’s not an ordinary person. Take good care of her. She’ll definitely fetch a good price!”","A man’s voice sounded in her ears, then Qiao Xi was locked in a room upstairs. The room was filled with the faint smell of blood. It could be imagined how many women they had abused before and how much blood their hands were stained with.","Qiao Xi remained indifferently in the room. After a while, Luo Qing’s voice sounded from the invisible earpiece. “Gu Zheng is here too?”","“Yeah.”","Luo Qing could not help but smile. “In his eyes, you’re really a weak Mrs. Gu. He’s afraid that you’ll be hurt, but now that he’s here, things will be easier.”","“What do you mean?” Qiao Xi asked.","“President Gu’s assistant has already called the police. He said that you and Gu Zheng have gone missing. The GPS on you shows that you were brought to an abandoned warehouse. He thinks that the two of you were kidnapped. At this moment, the police have already sent people over.”","Qiao Xi blinked. She had originally planned to use her kidnapping to lure the police over and take the opportunity to destroy the Tang family’s nest. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng had also thought of this method. Now, the police were making their way here faster than she had expected.","As soon as Luo Qing finished speaking, a few men’s voices came from outside the door. “I heard that this woman offended the boss, so she was captured and brought here. She said that we can enjoy her first before selling her. Since she’s already married, we can do whatever we want to her. Why don’t I have a taste of this rich woman first?”","“I saw that woman the moment she entered. She has delicate skin, a slender waist, and a beautiful face. I’ve never seen someone so beautiful. It’s worth it to sleep with her once!”","The few of them pushed the door open excitedly and barged in. However, they did not see anyone.","“Where is she?”","“That’s not right. I saw her enter with my own eyes. Why is she gone?”","“She couldn’t have run away, right? I’ll send someone to look for her!”","As soon as that person finished speaking, the door behind them slammed shut. The already narrow and humid room suddenly became dark, scaring the three of them.","“Haha...” At this moment, the woman’s silvery laughter came from above everyone’s heads. Her laughter carried a trace of coldness, making everyone shudder.","“Are you looking for me?”","The three men abruptly raised their eyes and saw Qiao Xi sitting on the beam on the roof, looking at them with a smile. Her eyes were filled with disdain and coldness as if she would kill them in the next second.","For some reason, they suddenly broke out in a cold sweat. However, when they thought about it carefully, she was just a young lady. How could she defeat the three of them?","The sharp-mouthed man stared wretchedly at Qiao Xi’s long legs and fair ankles as he slowly approached."]},{"number":860,"title":"Chapter 860 - Mrs. Gu Cried Again","paragraphs":["“Young lady, you’re so beautiful. It’s a pity that you’re going to be sold to a brothel to serve those old men. Why don’t you accompany us? If you’re obedient and serve us well, we might keep you by our side so that you don’t have to suffer there.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she lightly jumped down from the beam and said with a smile, “Alright!”","When the three men heard her words, their eyes instantly turned red as they looked at the woman in front of them in infatuation. They had never seen such a beautiful woman in their lives, let alone have the honor of spending a night with her. They would have no regrets in their lives if they could have a taste of this woman.","They instantly went mad and rushed anxiously toward Qiao Xi.","...","When Ye Qingyuan and the police arrived, they heard shrill screams from the room upstairs.","Everyone’s expressions darkened. Mrs. Gu was upstairs. If she was injured, they would not be able to explain it to Gu Zheng!","Song Shiyu, who was at the side, was speechless. It was over. Had Young Madam lost her life?","Everyone did not dare to delay and hurriedly went upstairs. The police held guns in their hands, afraid that someone would hurt Mrs. Gu. However, after pushing the door open, the scene in front of them stunned them.","The three men’s faces were bruised and swollen as they fought fiercely. They stared fiercely at each other and did not care about the leisurely Qiao Xi at the side. They did not notice the people who had barged in.","Even though there were many police officers with guns standing at the door, the three of them continued to beat each other up crazily. No one was willing to give in.","Mrs. Gu, whom everyone was most worried about, was sitting in a corner at this moment. She watched the three men fight with interest as if she was watching a show.","Song Shiyu: “...” ‘Young Madam, there are so many people here. You have to restrain yourself!’","The captain was named Yuan Shan, and with his order, the officers all rushed forward to capture the three of them. Only then did Qiao Xi withdraw her gaze and slowly stand up.","Yuan Shan sized up Mrs. Gu. He had worked on so many kidnapping cases, but he had never seen the victim not afraid at all. Instead, she watched the criminals fight with interest. He cleared his throat and was about to ask about the details of the case when Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned red as she sniffled.","Please reading -on","Song Shiyu: “...” ‘Was it still going to happen anyway?’","Qiao Xi choked, then pounced toward the man behind everyone. She buried her head in the man’s broad chest and sobbed in horror and grievance.","Gu Zheng hugged the little woman in his arms and shook his head helplessly. He knew very well that Qiao Xi had used a hypnosis technique to make the three of them fight, but he absolutely could not let outsiders know about this ability of hers.","He stretched out his hand and gently stroked Qiao Xi’s back, his eyes filled with gentleness.","Yuan Shan was silent for a moment. Could it be that Mrs. Gu’s calm appearance just now was all an act? Actually, she was very afraid in her heart. Now that she had seen President Gu, she could not hold it in anymore.","Suddenly, Yuan Shan’s expression changed. With his years of experience handling cases, he figured out that this warehouse was not simple. He had a bad feeling that there seemed to be other victims here.","The next second, Qiao Xi sobbed and said, “When I entered, I think I heard the cries of women downstairs. Were they also kidnapped? Quick, go take a look.”","With that said, Yuan Shan was even more sure of what he was thinking. It seemed that they had coincidentally found a criminal den this time.","Suddenly, there was a rush of footsteps outside the door. A police officer looked embarrassed and said anxiously, “Captain, we found the others in the basement...","“There are dozens of kidnapped women!”","The dozens of women detained in the underground room were enough to tell everyone that this was a criminal den that had been established for a long time. After a series of investigations, all the evidence pointed to the Tang family. These women who were detained had overheard the conversation between the criminals. They frequently mentioned the Tang family and Old Master Tang.","Yuan Shan’s expression was extremely ugly. “Mr. Gu, Mrs. Gu, this is definitely not a simple kidnapping case. With my many years of experience, I’m guessing that this is a den for human trafficking. We still need time to investigate the exact situation. The impact of this case is extremely bad. I hope you can come back to the police station with me to make a statement.","“As for Mrs. Gu...”","At this point, Yuan Shan hesitated for a moment. The victim’s emotions were unstable, and Mrs. Gu was just a weak woman. It would be too cruel to ask her to recall the details of her kidnapping. It would also easily traumatize her."]},{"number":861,"title":"Chapter 861 - Saved","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Qiao Xi sobbed and said sweetly, “I’m fine. For the sake of those women who were kidnapped, no matter how afraid I am, I’ll cooperate with your investigation. Moreover, when those kidnappers called, I secretly recorded their voices. Perhaps I can help you solve the case!","“It’s just that I was too afraid at that time. I don’t know if I recorded it clearly.” As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi took out a recording pen from her pocket. Yuan Shan took the recording pen, and his expression instantly changed.","The recording was of the Tang family’s conversation. They had already admitted to the fact that they were trafficking people. Even after they had already earned a lot, they were still unwilling to stop.","Yuan Shan’s lips trembled slightly, and his expression was terrifyingly gloomy. “Mrs. Gu, you took the risk to record this and provided important evidence for our investigation. I thank you on behalf of all the victims.”","It turned out that it was not that Mrs. Gu was not afraid but she was just pretending to be calm to collect evidence. Although she was just a weak woman who did not have the strength to truss a chicken, she was smart enough to make a recording when she was kidnapped. Mrs. Gu was not only beautiful but also intelligent. No wonder President Gu cared about her so much.","...","Soon, several police cars and ambulances arrived. When Qiao Xi saw dozens of disheveled women being carried out, her eyes could not help but turn red.","No one would have thought that the Tang family, who had always been thought of as a scholarly family, would do such a dirty and heartless thing behind everyone’s backs in order to earn money.","The cries of the women filled the entire warehouse. Perhaps they thought that they would never be able to escape in their lives and their hearts were already dead. They did not expect to be able to escape in their lifetime. They hugged each other and cried about their tragic fate.","Qiao Xi did not know how long these women had been trapped here. The Tang family imprisoned them here. Other than beating and scolding them, they were also humiliated. It was impossible to know if they were even fed and clothed sufficiently. They lived a life worse than death.","If Second Brother had not found out about such a dark matter, with the Tang family’s current power and methods, when would these women be saved?","They were sobbing uncontrollably as if they were about to cry a river. It caused Qiao Xi to be unable to help herself from crying too.","“Miss Qiao?” Ye Qingyuan brought a group of doctors over and gestured for the others to treat the women first. He walked in front of Qiao Xi and spoke gently.","Qiao Xi sniffed. “Doctor Ye, do you know that the original heir of the Tang family was Old Master Tang’s eldest son, Tang Yan? He knew that Old Master Tang was secretly trafficking people and had always been fighting against Old Master Tang. He wanted to uphold justice even if it meant his family would suffer. In the end, he was killed by the Tang family. They’re all clearly surnamed Tang, so why are they so different?”","Ye Qingyuan hesitated for a moment. “This is the first time I’ve seen you so sad. Are you blaming yourself?”","Please reading- on MYB0 X N O VEL. COM","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise.","“At this moment, your eyes are filled with self-reproach. Are you thinking that if you had found this place earlier, perhaps many women wouldn’t have been killed? I’m really curious why the usually weak Mrs. Gu would risk her life this time?","“In the past, I’ve heard people talk about you, Miss Qiao. According to most of them, you don’t have a good reputation. They say that you only have good looks but your character is extremely bad. Now that I’ve seen you, I realize that the rumors outside can’t be trusted.”","Ye Qingyuan had always thought that Qiao Xi was an extremely weak woman, so when he found out that Gu Zheng had bullied her until she fainted, he even blamed Gu Zheng. Now, it seemed that Mrs. Gu was not as weak as he had imagined.","He raised his eyes to glance at Qiao Xi and said meaningfully, “Actually, I came here to remind you that the next time you do such a dangerous thing, you must tell Ah Zheng first so that he won’t worry.”","Qiao Xi was instantly stunned.","“Don’t think Gu Zheng is always calm like how he looks now. Actually, when he found out that you were going to risk your life last night, he seemed to have changed into a different person. He has always been calm. Even when his life was threatened, I’ve never seen him blink. However, when he heard that you were going to walk into a lion’s den last night, his eyes were filled with fear. You might not have thought that this mission was a big deal, but he couldn’t allow you to be in danger at all.","“You must have completed many missions before this. With the experts of Ling Pavilion protecting you as well, you definitely wouldn’t be afraid. But Gu Zheng simply can’t let you be in danger.”","Although Ye Qingyuan was Gu Zheng’s good friend, Qiao Xi had only spoken a few words to him. Now that she heard him say such heartfelt words, she was slightly surprised."]},{"number":862,"title":"Chapter 862 - You’re Everything To Him","paragraphs":["“Miss Qiao, in Ah Zheng’s heart, you’re everything to him. If he loses you one day, I can’t imagine what will happen.”","Qiao Xi slowly turned around and looked at the man not far behind her who had been following her. He was standing in a corner with deep eyes that had a trace of redness in them. This trace of panic was unusual on the normally indifferent and cold Gu Zheng.","“Don’t be sad. These women have all been saved. The kidnappers have also confessed who the mastermind is. This time, the Tang family is completely ruined. Moreover, this matter involves a lot. The Tang family isn’t the only one who’ll be unlucky,” Ye Qingyuan said softly.","...","At this moment, those women were all sent to the hospital. After a deeper investigation, the police found out that the Tang family had done more than just human trafficking in the abandoned warehouse. They had also done many other illegal things. There were also other reputable businessmen in high society involved in this matter.","The Tang family was finally in big trouble this time. Not only had they hurt many innocent women, but they had also kidnapped Mrs. Gu. Hence, Gu Zheng said that the police had to find out the truth no matter what. The police immediately gathered evidence and soon produced an arrest warrant.","Qiao Xi returned to the police station to make a statement. When she left the police station, it was already the afternoon.","Everyone in the police station was so busy that they did not even have time to eat lunch. The policewoman who was taking Qiao Xi’s statement said helplessly, “It just so happens that Tang Ruge is attending an award ceremony today. That kind of person is actually the winner of Planet Music Festival. How ridiculous!”","A colleague at the side snorted. “The Tang family has earned so much money through illegal channels. Having their daughter become a musician isn’t something difficult for them. However, everything they have now was obtained by hurting others. They definitely won’t have a good outcome.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was filled with coldness. Now that things had come to this, it was time for her to end things with Tang Ruge. It was not only for herself but also for those women who had been harmed by the Tang family.","In the afternoon, the award ceremony began. Reporters rushed in one after another. The award ceremony was broadcasted live. At this moment, many people were tuning in to the live broadcast. The netizens also wanted to see what the gold award winner, Miss Fu Sheng, looked like.","Tang Ruge was wearing an ink-colored muslin dress. Her long hair was tied up with a hairpin, and she exuded a scholarly aura. She walked over elegantly and smiled at the camera.","Madam Tang stood in the middle of the group of noblewomen and said proudly, “I’m not bragging, but our Ruge has been especially obedient since she was young. When she grew up, she became even more diligent and studious. I just didn’t expect her to be so talented in music. She won a gold medal in her first music competition. She must have gotten lucky!”","Many noblewomen hurriedly echoed, “Madam Tang, you’re really too humble. Ruge won the award with her own ability. Your daughter is really too outstanding. I’m so envious. If my brat was even half as good as Ruge, I wouldn’t have to worry all day.”","Madam Tang looked proud and trembled with excitement. She turned around and said in a low voice, “Ruge, you have to perform well later. You have to let everyone see how outstanding our Tang family is.”",".....","Not only was her daughter the top socialite in the capital, but she was also the winner of Planet Music Festival. She was also the pride of the Tang family.","After Madam Tang married into the Tang family, she had been living in the shadow of Tang Yan and his wife. Tang Yan was the head of the family, and he had the final say in the Tang family. After Tang Yan died, she could gradually raise her head.","Seeing the people around her praising her, Madam Tang raised her head proudly. “Ruge, after the award ceremony ends, I’ll hold a celebration banquet for you at home. We’ll invite our relatives and friends to gather.”","Tang Ruge smiled and nodded. “Mom, there’s no need. It’s just an award. There’s no need to be so ostentatious.”","“How is this considered ostentatious? This is the gold award for Planet Music Festival we’re talking about! It’s an achievement that many people dream of!” Madam Tang deliberately raised her voice.","“You’re just too humble. If someone else had won the award, they would’ve spread the news to the entire Li City. But you, on the other hand, refused to even tell your parents! You’ve been outstanding since you were young, so you don’t think much of winning the award.”","Hearing Madam Tang’s words, the people in the live-stream also praised Tang Ruge. Who did not like humble and talented people? Moreover, Tang Ruge came from a good family and had an outstanding temperament. She was simply too perfect.","Suddenly, Madam Tang’s gaze landed on the crowd. She said unhappily, “Who invited them?!”"]},{"number":863,"title":"Chapter 863 - The Higher You Climb, The Worse You Fall","paragraphs":["At this moment, a young man and woman were standing in the corner of a banquet hall. The others did not know who these two people were, but the Tang family knew them very well. The smile on Tang Ruge’s face gradually disappeared, but she quickly recovered her gentle smile when facing the camera.","“Back then, my two cousins left home willfully and refused to return to the Tang family for so many years. Now, they’ve probably realized how good the Tang family is and want to come back. Mom, I still have to go on stage later. Go tell Grandpa not to be angry. No matter what, my cousins are still descendants of the Tang family.”","Hearing Tang Ruge’s words, everyone seemed to understand something. It turned out that these two were the children of the deceased Tang Yan and his wife.","Back then, after Tang Yan and his wife died, the siblings were not sad at all. They even had a falling out with the Tang family over the inheritance. In the end, the two of them ran away from home. Old Master Tang said that he would cut ties with the siblings completely.","Rumor had it that Old Master Tang had always doted on his two grandchildren and looked forward to their return. Unfortunately, the siblings were really heartless. Even when Old Master Tang was seriously ill, they never went home to visit him.","Now that they heard that Tang Ruge had won the gold award for Planet Music Festival, they rushed over. It seemed that they wanted to compete with Tang Ruge for the position of heir.","How shameless!","Tang Ruge looked at everyone’s disdainful expressions with a proud expression. After so many years, the siblings were still so stupid. They still dared to come to the Tang family’s territory? Weren’t they afraid of drowning in gossip?","Tang Ruge shook her head helplessly and said gently, “Please don’t blame my cousins. They’re of the Tang family’s bloodline. Back then, they did something wrong when they were young, but as long as they’re willing to come back, we’ll welcome them.”","Everyone could not help but sigh. “They’re all descendants of the Tang family, but why are the children of the Tang family’s eldest son so different from Tang Ruge?!”","“These siblings are really heartless! They didn’t even care about the death of their parents. I heard that Tang Yan and his wife’s funeral was handled by Tang Dawei and Tang Ruge.”","“Unfilial children! How can they still have the cheek to come back?!”","Tang Ruge wanted to stop everyone from reprimanding the two, but the more she explained, the angrier everyone became.","Madam Tang tapped Tang Ruge’s forehead affectionately. “You’re too kind. You always think of others. You don’t have to worry about the siblings. Just prepare for the award ceremony!”","With that, Madam Tang looked at the siblings. A trace of viciousness flashed past her eyes as she said in a low voice, “You heartless things! You still want to compete with Ruge for the position of heir? You overestimate yourselves!”","Everyone looked at the siblings with disdain. Mu Ling was so angry that she was fuming. She was about to go forward and demand an explanation when she was stopped by Mu Ming.","“Mu Ling, don’t be rash. The higher you climb, the worse you’ll fall. Tang Ruge may be glorious now, but Black Tide will arrive soon.”","Mu Ling suppressed the anger in her heart and found a seat with Mu Ling in a remote corner. They already had evidence of the Tang family’s crime. Mu Ling could not control her emotions. “They’re the ones who did something wrong. What right do they have to criticize us?”","Mu Ming’s gaze was cold as he clenched his fists.","What right did they have? Their parents just did not want to be associated with the Tang family. They just did not want to be in the human trafficking business but were killed by the Tang family.","After their parents died, they were chased out of the house and had to live on the streets. They even had to endure the infamy of being unfilial. Now that their parents were mentioned again, everyone in the Tang family did not feel guilty at all.","It had been seven years. The Tang family had already gotten everything they wanted, but they were still doing such heartless deals behind everyone’s backs. Were they really not afraid that the Tang family would be destroyed the day the truth was revealed?","Mu Ming took a deep breath and gradually calmed down. He held his sister’s hand tightly and comforted her softly, saying, “Don’t worry, they’ll definitely pay the price for what they’ve done.”","Mu Ling gritted her teeth and looked at Tang Ruge and the others. Anger burned in her heart.","Suddenly, her phone rang. She looked down and saw that it was a message from Black Tide. She immediately beamed as if she had never been so eager to wait for someone’s news.","[I’ll be right there, but there’s something else I need your help with.]","Mu Ling looked up at Mu Ming. “Brother, Black Tide said that some of the kidnapped women were already sold. She wants Dark Net and Stars to work together and try to find them.”"]},{"number":864,"title":"Chapter 864 - She’s Good-looking But Has A Bad Character","paragraphs":["With the two top hacker organizations working together, as long as they had an internet connection, they would definitely be able to find clues. There was hope of finding the women and children who had already been sold.","Before Mu Ming could answer, Mu Ling took out her laptop and posted an announcement on Dark Net, asking everyone to cooperate with Stars to investigate the missing people. The top hackers in the country made their moves together, and like a large network that spread throughout the country, they quickly found some clues.","“Brother, if Dad and Mom know that we’re saving those who were trafficked, they’ll be very happy, right? After all, they previously fought with these evil forces and even sacrificed their lives for this.”","“They’ll be happy,” Mu Ming said softly.","A moment later, the award ceremony officially began. The host went on stage to give a speech, then began the award ceremony. The reporters all aimed their cameras at the stage, but they still did not see the legendary ancient zither.","The reporters hurriedly asked, “Miss Fu Sheng, there are rumors online that the zither you like was snatched away by your friend, so you won’t be able to get the gift you want at the award ceremony. Is that right?”","Tang Ruge hesitated for a moment, and there was a trace of sorrow in her eyes. Then, she bit her lip, and her eyes turned red. She looked aggrieved but remained firm. “No, everyone has misunderstood. Xi Xi and I are good friends. She knows that the zither is my award gift. How could she snatch it away? Moreover...”","Her eyes were red, and her voice became choked. “Moreover, the person in charge of the charity banquet knows the meaning of that zither. They wouldn’t have casually sold it. These are all rumors. Don’t believe them.”","The reporter continued to ask, “But I don’t think that ancient zither was at the scene. Miss Fu Sheng, can you explain why?”","Tang Ruge lowered her eyes as tears welled up in her eyes. She explained nervously, “Actually... I accidentally damaged the ancient zither when I was practicing yesterday, so I couldn’t show it at the scene. All of this has nothing to do with Xi Xi. Don’t misunderstand.”","The reporter who asked this question was arranged by the Tang family. The Tang family had given him a sum of money to cooperate with Tang Ruge’s acting. At this point in the interview, he asked meaningfully, “Miss Fu Sheng, is that really the case?”","Tang Ruge did not dare to look up, afraid that others would notice the panic in her eyes. “Y-Yes.”","“That’s not it!” At this moment, an angry roar came from not far away. Xu Da held the trophy in his hand and walked over angrily. He explained to the reporters, “Miss Tang is kind-hearted. She only said that because she doesn’t want to embarrass her friend. That zither is clearly...”","“Mr. Xu!” Tang Ruge hurriedly stopped him, then pulled Xu Da back. Her eyes were red as she said awkwardly, “Mr. Xu, that zither really doesn’t matter to me. Moreover, it has nothing to do with Xi Xi. You’ve really misunderstood. Let’s quickly give out the award and not waste everyone’s time.”","Xu Da frowned and suddenly raised his voice. “Miss Fu Sheng, you’re still protecting that woman at a time like this! Since you don’t want to say it, I’ll tell everyone the truth! Actually, that zither was snatched away by Qiao Xi and hasn’t been returned to Miss Fu Sheng until now!”","Everyone knew that Xu Da was a guest presenter for Planet Music Festival, so there was no need for him to lie. Now, it seemed that what the internet said was true. Qiao Xi was jealous of Fu Sheng, so she secretly rushed to the charity banquet before Xu Da and stole the ancient zither that should have belonged to Tang Ruge.","“That young lady is quite good-looking, but her character isn’t good!”","“What’s the use of being good-looking? She has a vicious heart. She even dares to snatch the award gift from the winner of Planet Music Festival so brazenly. She must have done countless other bad things behind the scenes!”","“But Miss Fu Sheng just said that she damaged the zither. What exactly is going on?!”","Hearing the discussion of the crowd, Xu Da took a step forward and said indignantly, “That’s because Miss Fu Sheng is kind-hearted and can’t bear to see her friend get scolded. That’s why she said that. Actually, she never got her hands on that zither. Moreover, no one probably knows how Qiao Xi stole that zither, right?!”","Tang Ruge lowered her head with a sinister smile. Mu Ling, who was below the stage, was fuming. How could there be such a shameless person?","Xu Da straightened his back and said indignantly, “The person in charge of the charity banquet knew that the zither was supposed to be given to Miss Fu Sheng. It wasn’t supposed to be sold to anyone else. For the sake of achieving her goal, Qiao Xi actually pretended to be Miss Fu Sheng, so the person in charge gave the zither to her!”"]},{"number":865,"title":"Chapter 865 - The Legendary Qiao Xi Is Here","paragraphs":["“However, Miss Tang has a good temper and isn’t willing to bicker with Qiao Xi because she doesn’t want to ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation. If it were anyone else, who would be able to take this lying down? Miss Tang is already so tolerant, yet Qiao Xi doesn’t know how to repent and hasn’t apologized to Miss Tang until now!","“Miss Tang treats her as a friend, but because of jealousy, she stole Miss Tang’s ancient zither. When everyone is scolding her online, she’s hiding at home like a coward. Moreover, I’m guessing that her original intention isn’t to snatch the ancient zither but to stand on stage to receive the award in Miss Tang’s place!”","Boom—","The entire venue was in an uproar. No one expected the truth to be like this. As Miss Tang’s friend, it was fine that Qiao Xi played tricks behind her back, but she actually wanted to stand on the podium in her place?","As soon as she finished speaking, Tang Ruge covered her face and cried. Her faint sobs made one’s heart ache. The netizens in the live-stream also posted comforting comments.","[Fu Sheng is crying so pitifully! She’s crying over her lost friendship. After all, she finally found out that her good friend of so many years is such a scheming woman. No one can accept this!]","[She clearly knows that Qiao Xi has done so many bad things, yet she still wants to save Qiao Xi’s reputation. Qiao Xi is the famous designer, Gu Shan. If such a scandal were to spread, who would still wear the clothes she designs in the future?]","Xu Da’s face was filled with disdain. “Even at a time like this, she’s still unwilling to return the ancient zither to Miss Tang. A person like her isn’t worthy to be a designer at all!”","Tang Ruge slowly looked up. Her eyes were swollen, making everyone present sigh.","She tried her best to calm herself down. She wiped her tears and smiled gently. “It doesn’t matter if she comes or not. I don’t want to bicker with her either. I hope everyone won’t make things difficult for her. No matter what, she’s my friend. We’ve known each other for so many years. I don’t want her reputation to be ruined in the end.”","Then, Tang Ruge waved her hand. “Mr. Xu, let’s start the award ceremony.”","Xu Da was still indignant. “This kind of woman is actually a chief designer. She’s wild just because she’s a little smart. She’ll pay the price sooner or later!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the door of the banquet hall slowly opened. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a slim figure standing at the door. The woman had a curvaceous figure and was wearing a suit that made her look capable. Her dark hair fell to her shoulders, making her look very imposing.","She just stood there and did not say a word, but everyone felt an invisible pressure.","“I heard that all of you really wanted me to come?” Qiao Xi’s cold voice carried a trace of ridicule as it slowly entered everyone’s ears.","Tang Ruge shuddered, and her heart skipped a beat.","Qiao Xi? How was this possible?! Hadn’t she already been captured? How could she appear here? Could it be that she had escaped? However, there were so many burly men guarding her, and she was drugged. How could she escape from that uninhabited place unless she had wings?","Before Tang Ruge could figure it out, Qiao Xi said casually, “Unfortunately, I’ve disappointed everyone. I didn’t come here to apologize.”","Everyone looked at that stunning face and was stunned for a long time. This was the legendary Qiao Xi? They had only heard of Qiao Xi’s name on the internet before and had never seen her face. This woman was not just beautiful but was as gorgeous as a fairy!","The entire venue was silent. Everyone seemed to be stunned. They could not believe that this beautiful woman in front of them would do so many disgusting things.","As soon as Xu Da saw Qiao Xi, he roared angrily, “If you’re not willing to apologize, why are you here?!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she unhurriedly found a chair to sit down on. Her indifferent eyes glanced at Xu Da as she let out a cold snort as if she couldn’t be bothered to talk to him at all.","Xu Da was completely infuriated by her appearance. “You pretended to be Fu Sheng to snatch the ancient zither from the charity banquet. Now, you’re unwilling to apologize and are still so arrogant. Do you really think we’re easy to bully?”","Only then did everyone come back to their senses. No matter how good-looking and capable Qiao Xi was, it was a fact that she had pretended to be Fu Sheng. If Mr. Xu Da had not discovered her scheme, the person standing on the podium today might have been her.","If she successfully stole both the ancient zither and Fu Sheng’s identity, how sad would Miss Tang be?!","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the chair and slowly raised her cold eyes. “Miss Tang, do you want me to apologize?”"]},{"number":866,"title":"Chapter 866 - Every Year","paragraphs":["Everyone could not help but look at Tang Ruge. She was frowning and biting her lip aggrievedly. Tears trickled down her face. “Xi Xi, we’re friends. I didn’t want to bicker with you about this, but now that everyone knows about this, your reputation will be completely ruined if you still don’t apologize.","“I’ve never thought of asking you to apologize, but everyone is scolding you online now. If you still don’t repent, then I can’t help you. As long as you apologize obediently, I’ll help you explain and try my best to save your dignity.”","In the eyes of everyone, not only had Qiao Xi snatched away the ancient zither that should have belonged to Fu Sheng, but she also wanted to stand on the podium in Fu Sheng’s place. If she was still unwilling to apologize, then everyone would absolutely not let the matter go.","As soon as Tang Ruge finished speaking, everyone looked at Qiao Xi with disdain and disgust.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she said casually, “There are records for the charity banquet’s auction. If you want to know, you can investigate and see if I used Fu Sheng’s identity. If I really caused trouble for Fu Sheng, then I should indeed apologize.”","Hearing these words, Tang Ruge instantly beamed with joy. She originally thought that Qiao Xi would spout nonsense in front of everyone, but she did not expect her to back down so quickly. It seemed that she was afraid. If she really apologized, it meant that she had indeed deliberately snatched the ancient zither away.","Tang Ruge was thinking about how to scheme against Qiao Xi when the next second—","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and glanced coldly at Tang Ruge. Her icy-cold eyes seemed to want to see through Tang Ruge as she sneered. “Unfortunately... you’re not Fu Sheng.”","She paused and deliberately dragged out her words with a teasing expression.","Everyone was stunned. Qiao Xi was implying that Tang Ruge was not Fu Sheng? How was that possible?! Planet Music Festival had already verified Tang Ruge’s identity and was holding an award ceremony to give out the award to her today!","[What nonsense is she spouting? She’s saying that Tang Ruge isn’t Fu Sheng when her scandal was exposed. She’s too shameless!]","Everyone below the stage could not help but look at Madam Tang with some doubt. “Madam Tang, could it be...”","Madam Tang’s heart burned with anger. Because everyone was present, she could only pretend to be calm. “Don’t listen to her nonsense. She just doesn’t want to apologize, so she’s slandering our Ruge. I’m Ruge’s mother. This child has been outstanding since she was young, so she won’t pretend to be someone else. Moreover, Planet Music Festival has already confirmed Ruge’s identity. How could they be wrong?”","......","Hearing Madam Tang’s words, the doubts in everyone’s hearts gradually dispersed. Qiao Xi probably did not want to apologize, so she casually made it up. There was no evidence at all.","Tang Ruge’s eyes were red as she choked. “Xi Xi, how can you slander me like this? I’m Fu Sheng. What should I do to make you believe me?”","“There’s no need,” Qiao Xi replied coldly.","Tang Ruge heaved a sigh of relief in her heart. She had just calmed down when Qiao Xi raised her eyes again and chuckled. “I won’t believe you no matter what you do because I have evidence.”","These words scared Tang Ruge so much that her body trembled. The live-stream exploded.","[Qiao Xi has evidence? She has evidence that Tang Ruge isn’t Fu Sheng?]","[Is there something wrong with this woman?! Planet Music Festival has already confirmed that Tang Ruge is Fu Sheng. How can it be fake? Moreover, Tang Ruge is the top socialite in the capital. How could she pretend to be Fu Sheng? If she really is Fu Sheng, the real Fu Sheng would have rushed to the scene when she heard the news. Since no one appeared, it means that Tang Ruge is Fu Sheng!]","[There are strange people every year, but there are especially many this year. She has good looks but isn’t smart.]","Xu Da stood up and roared, “This is Planet Music Festival’s award ceremony, not a place for you to fool around. I advise you to leave quickly, or I’ll get the security guards to throw you out.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Mr. Xu, your temper is too explosive. Could it be that you’re feeling guilty and that’s why you’re chasing me away in such a hurry?”","Xu Da looked at Tang Ruge’s aggrieved appearance, then at Qiao Xi’s arrogant appearance. He was instantly infuriated. “Why should I feel guilty? You clearly did something wrong. It’s fine if you’re unwilling to apologize, but you actually dare to ruin Ruge’s award ceremony. I think you’re crazy!”","Qiao Xi paid no attention to his anger. Instead, she took out her phone from her bag and casually fiddled with it a few times. Instantly, the big screen flashed, and two music scores that had been scribbled on appeared. The signature below was Fu Sheng’s."]},{"number":867,"title":"Chapter 867 - Does Tang Ruge Really Know Music?","paragraphs":["Then, Qiao Xi released another music score. It was Tang Ruge’s. The handwriting on the two documents was completely different. Everyone knew that Tang Ruge was Fu Sheng, but why was the handwriting on the two scores different?","Tang Ruge originally wanted to comfort the angry Xu Da, but when she saw the enlarged photos on the screen, her expression instantly stiffened. Her eyes then became filled with viciousness.","Her mind was blank, and time seemed to have stopped. She could only clearly hear the sound of her own heartbeat. It was intense and chaotic.","The entire venue was silent, but comments popped up crazily: [Wow! It’s really different!]","[Could it be","Everyone was stunned, their eyes filled with confusion.","Tang Ruge’s heart instantly trembled when she saw everyone’s stunned expressions. She was just about to open her mouth to change the answer when Qiao Xi spoke first, “Miss Tang, did you say there are two?”","“Uhh...”","The musicians who came to attend the award ceremony discussed in low voices. “Two? Anyone who knows music would know that this song has many notes. It’s absolutely impossible for there to only be two!”","Tang Ruge heard the low discussions of the musicians around her and hurriedly said, “It’s not two, it’s five. I was nervous and said the wrong thing just now. It’s five!”","The moment that was said, everyone was stunned. They were all music lovers. Although they had not calculated how many notes there were in this song, they knew very well that there were definitely more than five.","[Does Tang Ruge really know music?]","Qiao Xi chuckled. “Miss Tang, unfortunately, you gave the wrong answer!”","Sweat trickled down Tang Ruge’s forehead, and her expression gradually became ferocious. This b*tch! What right did she have to ruin her award ceremony?","“Miss Tang, this song was composed four years ago by Fu Sheng. Although it was a long time ago, how could a composer not remember their own song? The chorus of this song has eight notes, so your answer is wrong.","“Did you really compose this song? Why do I feel that you’re not familiar with the song you composed? Anyone who knows a little music knows that this song has a lot of notes, but you don’t! I’m really curious if it’s because you have a bad memory or if you’re not Fu Sheng at all.”"]},{"number":868,"title":"Chapter 868 - No Fear","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at Tang Ruge provocatively. She saw that Tang Ruge’s face was filled with horror as she shouted in exasperation, “What nonsense are you talking about?! This song was composed four years ago. Moreover, I was sick at that time. What’s so strange about me not remembering how many notes it has? You...”","Qiao Xi held her chin and said with an innocent expression, “Miss Tang, don’t be nervous. If you have a clear conscience, you don’t have to be afraid of anything. If you’re really Fu Sheng, you don’t have to be nervous.”","These words were like heavy rocks that smashed into Tang Ruge’s heart. She was so scared that her face turned pale. Everyone also sensed that something was wrong.","“I... I’m not nervous.”","Why was this b*tch still alive? Shouldn’t she have been sold to a remote mountain? Why did she escape? Those pieces of trash couldn’t even keep an eye on a woman. They were really useless.","“Qiao Xi, are you done?!” Madam Tang, who had always been calm, was filled with anger at this moment. She cursed, “Ruge has always treated you as a good friend, but what have you done? You’re still not satisfied after snatching her belongings and you actually came to the award ceremony to make things difficult for her. Don’t you have any shame? How can you be so shameless?!”","The entire venue was silent. Some thought that Madam Tang was right, while others thought that Tang Ruge was guilty. However, no one said anything. The netizens in the live broadcast also stopped discussing as if they were waiting for the outcome.","A moment later, the indifferent Qiao Xi suddenly chuckled. “Miss Tang, I’ve already given you a chance to admit your mistake, but you didn’t cherish it. Since that’s the case, don’t blame me for not showing you any respect.”","Tang Ruge had a bad feeling in her heart. Her eyes were filled with horror and uneasiness. She wished for nothing more than to rush over and cover Qiao Xi’s mouth.","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at Tang Ruge, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. “The evidence I talked about earlier isn’t just these pictures. There’s even stronger evidence.”","The moment that was said, the expressions of everyone in the Tang family changed. Tang Ruge’s body softened, and she almost fell to the floor. Madam Tang glared at her and shouted, “No!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the bank’s records and their conversation appeared on the big screen. The person who transferred the money was Tang Ruge, and the person who received the money was the leader of Dark Net, Mu Ming. Tang Ruge’s request was clearly displayed in the photo. She wanted Dark Net to change the ownership of Fu Sheng’s account to Tang Ruge.","Dark Net always left evidence behind when they did things. This could not be faked at all, so this photo was enough to prove that Tang Ruge was not Fu Sheng at all. She pulled a trick and pretended to be Fu Sheng, but she still wanted to slander Qiao Xi.","The surrounding discussion was about to drown Tang Ruge. She found it difficult to breathe. Her face was pale, and her body was trembling violently.","Impossible! How could Qiao Xi know about Dark Net? Didn’t they say that Dark Net would keep their clients’ confidentiality? She paid them so much money, yet those people actually revealed the news to Qiao Xi?","Qiao Xi glanced at Tang Ruge mockingly, then looked at Xu Da and said with a smile, “Mr. Xu, I don’t know why you were so sure that Tang Ruge was Fu Sheng. Are you still going to give Tang Ruge the award?”","Xu Da stood rooted to the ground. At this moment, he wished for nothing more than to find a hole to hide in. The netizens in the live-stream also went crazy. They were as angry as they were just now.","[Tang Ruge is not Fu Sheng! She’s a complete liar!]","[I knew it. How could someone who won the gold award for Planet Music Festival not know music?! It turns out that Tang Ruge bribed a hacker to change the account information. She’s too scheming!]","[Xu Da is really funny. He treated Tang Ruge as a treasure, but now, he’s utterly humiliated by her.]","Everyone in the banquet hall was filled with anger. They pointed at Tang Ruge and shouted, “You’re not Fu Sheng! You liar! Where’s the real Fu Sheng? Is someone like you worthy of pretending to be Fu Sheng?”","Everyone’s curses entered Tang Ruge’s ears. She retreated in fear and tripped over something, causing her to fall to the floor in a sorry state.","Embarrassment and fear engulfed her heart, almost making her faint. She struggled to get up from the floor as her body trembled. “Shut up! I’m not lying! I’m Fu Sheng!”","Everyone was stunned for a few seconds, then they were even angrier. “You still dare to lie to us at a time like this? What kind of top socialite are you? You’re a scheming woman!”","“Qiao Xi had long known that she was pretending to be Fu Sheng. On the account of their past relationship, she gave Tang Ruge a chance to admit her mistake. However, she refused to admit it and even shamelessly attended this award ceremony. Tang Ruge only has herself to blame for this!”"]},{"number":869,"title":"Chapter 869 - She Has Her Own Considerations","paragraphs":["Tang Ruge shook her head crazily, and her exquisite hair got all messy. She choked and could not retort.","How could Qiao Xi be so kind? She did not expose her in the beginning not because she wanted to save her some dignity but because she wanted to see her struggle in despair with her own eyes. In the end, she wanted her to be hated by everyone.","Today was supposed to be the most important moment in her life. She was going to be the most talented socialite in high society and become a goddess in everyone’s hearts. However, everything was ruined by Qiao Xi.","Many of the people attending the award ceremony were noblewomen and young ladies from high society. Madam Tang invited them because she wanted to show off how outstanding her daughter was in front of them and make those who once loo ge asked a hacker to change Fu Sheng’s account information. She did this to fulfill Fu Sheng’s last wish. What’s wrong with that?”","Everyone stopped cursing. If that was the case, Tang Ruge did have her reasons, but they felt that something was wrong.","Tang Ruge, who was slumped on the chair, heard these words. Her eyes suddenly lit up with hope again. She hurriedly stood up and wiped her tears. She pretended to be indifferent and explained, “That’s right. Fu Sheng was indeed my friend. Unfortunately, she died a few years ago due to an illness. Her only wish was for me to pass down all her songs in her place so that everyone could hear her voice.”","Everyone looked at each other, their eyes filled with doubt. They remained silent.","“Haha.” Qiao Xi chuckled and broke the deathly silence."]},{"number":870,"title":"Chapter 870 - Fu Sheng Is More Beautiful Than You","paragraphs":["“Miss Tang, even if you wanted to make her songs known, you didn’t have to participate in the competition. If you’re really Fu Sheng’s friend, you should tell everyone the true creator of these songs and not flatter yourself,” Qiao Xi said casually.","Tang Ruge had already lost her mind. She shouted in exasperation, “I did this to fulfill Fu Sheng’s last wish. She’s already dead. If it weren’t for me, so many people wouldn’t have heard her songs. She wouldn’t have won the gold award for Planet Music Festival either.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the originally calm live-stream was instantly filled with curses. [Has this person’s brain been kicked by a donkey? Even if Fu Sheng gave her songs to Tang Ruge before she died, it doesn’t mean that she can occupy Fu Sheng’s identity! She did such a shameful thing, yet she still thinks she’s in the right?]","[At first, when she was exposed for pretending to be Fu Sheng, she refused to admit it. Now that the matter was exposed, she’s saying that it’s to fulfill Fu Sheng’s last wish. I don’t think Tang Ruge is telling the truth! How could Fu Sheng be friends with someone like her?!]","Tang Ruge looked at the curses in the live broadcast, and her body swayed violently as if she would fall if the wind blew. She clenched her fists tightly, and her sharp nails dug into her palms, drawing blood. She abruptly raised her eyes and glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. She gritted her teeth and said, “This was Fu Sheng’s last wish. I was her only friend, so I have the responsibility to help her fulfill her last wish. What right do you people, who don’t know Fu Sheng, have to point fingers here?!”","Everyone lowered their heads and did not retort. They had indeed never seen Fu Sheng before. If this was indeed Fu Sheng’s last wish, Tang Ruge did not seem to have done anything wrong.","“Miss Tang, you’re really brilliant.” Qiao Xi smiled and clapped.","“What a pity...”","Everyone’s gazes landed on Qiao Xi, only to see her crescent-shaped eyes narrow as she said meaningfully, “Unfortunately, Fu Sheng isn’t dead!”","It was silent, deathly silent. Everyone’s breathing stopped, and their eyes widened. Their shocked gazes shifted between Qiao Xi and Tang Ruge.","Tang Ruge abruptly raised her eyes and was unable to control the anger in her heart anymore. She roared with all her might. “Qiao Xi! What nonsense are you talking about?! Fu Sheng is clearly dead!”","Fu Sheng had stopped logging into her account a few years ago. Moreover, Tang Ruge had been participating in the competition as Fu Sheng for so long. If Fu Sheng was still alive, how could she be indifferent about it? Moreover, she had already gotten Dark Net to investigate Fu Sheng’s identity. The other party said that they had already investigated and found no such person.","“Who said Fu Sheng is dead?”","......","Suddenly, the door of the banquet hall slowly opened, and a woman in her 60s walked in. She was elegant and dressed exquisitely. She walked in front of everyone steadily.","The moment this woman appeared, all the musicians present erupted. They stood up and bowed. “It’s Madam Wen Lai!”","Xu Da and the other guests came forward to welcome her. Only then did the reporters know that the elegant woman in front of them was the legendary founder of Planet Music Festival, Madam Wen Lai.","The reporters rushed forward. “Madam Wen Lai, are you saying that Miss Fu Sheng is still alive?”","Wen Lai scanned the crowd coldly. His cold gaze finally landed on Tang Ruge, scaring her so much that her body trembled. Her eyes were filled with panic.","“You’re the one who pretended to be Fu Sheng to participate in the competition?” Wen Lai questioned mercilessly. There was undisguised disgust in her eyes. To her, Tang Ruge was just a clown.","Tang Ruge stood there uneasily. Her throat seemed to be stuffed, and she could not say a word.","Wen Lai’s face darkened as she gradually raised her voice. “You thought that Fu Sheng was dead, so you could pretend to be her without being exposed? Unfortunately, your wishful thinking is wrong. Fu Sheng is still alive and well in this world. She’s younger and more beautiful than you!”","Tang Ruge’s face was livid. She never expected Wen Lai to be here. Moreover, from the sound of it, she seemed to be very familiar with Fu Sheng.","“I’m not pretending to be Fu Sheng. I just want to fulfill her last wish—”","“Shut up!” Wen Lai berated, her gaze cold and sharp. “Do you think you can deceive me with your thoughts? Miss Tang, your tricks are really laughable to me.”","Tang Ruge swallowed her words when she was interrupted. She could not say anything else because she realized that she could not retort. She was afraid that if Fu Sheng was really still alive and Wen Lai and Fu Sheng were very familiar with each other, her lies would all be exposed."]},{"number":871,"title":"Chapter 871 - You’re Fired","paragraphs":["“Actually, you don’t know anything about music at all. You just want to use Fu Sheng’s identity to pursue fame and fortune. You even claim to be the top socialite in the capital. If socialites have no bottom line like you, that’s really too sad!”","Wen Lai reprimanded mercilessly. Tang Ruge’s face alternated between red and white. She wished she could faint immediately to avoid losing her reputation in front of everyone.","“Madam Wen Lai! How can you say that?!” Madam Tang said unhappily, “Although my daughter isn’t the real Fu Sheng, she has good intentions. She did all this for Fu Sheng’s sake!”","“Heh! For Fu Sheng’s own good? She occupied Fu Sheng’s identity and spread rumors to frame her so that she’d be cursed by everyone, but you’re saying your daughter did all that for Fu Sheng’s own good?”","Wen Lai’s gaze suddenly turned sharp. “Xu Da, as a guest presenter of Planet Music Festival, you were actually bewitched by an impostor and even publicized the matter of the zither. Is this what you should do as a senior in the industry?”","Xu Da was embarrassed. How could he have thought that the eldest daughter of the Tang family was an impostor?","When Tang Ruge heard Madam Wen Lai’s words, she had a bad feeling. Zither? Rumor? Every word seemed to explain one thing.","“I’m afraid everyone here still doesn’t know who the real Fu Sheng is,” Wen Lai suddenly said, her eyes filled with a mocking smile. “It’s only right for Fu Sheng to bid for the ancient zither. The impostor, Tang Ruge, pretended to be aggrieved and shed a few tears in public, yet countless people stood up for her. Did you accept the Tang family’s money or were you bewitched by Tang Ruge? How could you let the real winner of the gold award suffer such grievances?”","Xu Da’s legs went weak as they trembled. “I... I didn’t.”","“Even if you didn’t accept the Tang family’s money, you’re so stupid and can’t read people. You’re not worthy to be a guest presenter for Planet Music Festival. You’re fired!”","Xu Da’s face was pale. He never expected to be fired just because he spoke up for Tang Ruge. The consequences of being fired by Madam Wen Lai were very serious. From now on, he would not be able to step into the music industry again.","Tang Ruge lowered her head and pondered over Wen Lai’s words. She could not help but tremble as fear surged in her heart.","“Miss Tang, do you know who the real Fu Sheng is now?” Wen Lai looked at Tang Ruge with eyes full of ridicule. After a moment, she chuckled and turned to look at Qiao Xi. “You’re already standing in front of her, yet you can still casually spout nonsense about Fu Sheng being dead. I’ve learned something today. This capital’s top socialite is an utter disgrace!”","Boom!!!","These words were like a thunderclap that exploded in the surroundings. The gazes of everyone descended onto Qiao Xi, yet Qiao Xi didn’t feel uncomfortable in the slightest. Instead, she raised her eyes indifferently and confidently while releasing her aura.","The entire venue was in an uproar.","“Qiao Xi is actually Fu Sheng? Tang Ruge was so arrogant in front of the main character just now!”","“Tang Ruge pretended to know Fu Sheng and took over her identity. Who knew that the real Fu Sheng was standing in front of her? How laughable!”","Everyone’s mocking words entered Tang Ruge’s ears. Her mind buzzed, and the blood in her body seemed to have frozen. In the end, she collapsed onto the chair.","Qiao Xi was Fu Sheng? Impossible!","The netizens in the live-stream gradually went crazy: [I feel embarrassed for Tang Ruge. She pretended to be Fu Sheng and even pretended in front of the real Fu Sheng.]","[No wonder Qiao Xi could confirm that Tang Ruge was an impostor. Qiao Xi was giving Tang Ruge a chance, but she just refused to admit her mistake and kept lying.]","[Wow! Fu Sheng is too awesome! She’s talented and so beautiful. She’s a thousand times more outstanding than Tang Ruge. How does that woman have the cheek to slander Fu Sheng?!]","The live-stream was filled with curses. Everyone present could not suppress the anger in their hearts and clamored to chase the Tang family out.","Ever since Tang Dawei became the head of the family, Madam Tang could straighten her back no matter where she went. This was the first time she was so embarrassed after so many years. She wished she could find a hole to hide in.","Wen Lai looked at Tang Ruge in disgust. “Miss Tang, you’re really shameless. Are you still unwilling to leave at a time like this?”","“I... I...” Tang Ruge’s body trembled violently as tears trickled down her face. She stammered, “I always thought that Fu Sheng had already passed away. I just couldn’t bear to see her songs be buried like that, so... I pretended to be her to participate in the competition. I didn’t know that Qiao Xi was Fu Sheng at all."]},{"number":872,"title":"Chapter 872 - Scandal Exposed","paragraphs":["“You don’t know?” Qiao Xi grunted coldly. Her crescent-shaped eyes were curved as she was smiling, yet they were filled with disdain.","Tang Ruge shouted in a panic, “I really didn’t know!”","Qiao Xi could not help but sneer when she saw Tang Ruge’s disheveled appearance. Tang Ruge indeed did not know that she was Fu Sheng, but it was a fact that Tang Ruge had sent people to kidnap her.","Wen Lai snorted. “Everyone should be very curious as to why Fu Sheng didn’t appear despite knowing that someone was pretending to be her.”","Everyone was indeed very curious. Why didn’t Qiao Xi testify against Tang Ruge before this but chose to appear on the day of the award ceremony? Could it be that she wanted to embarrass Tang Ruge in public?","“Because Fu Sheng was kidnapped. She was just rescued by the police and immediately rushed over. Of course, she didn’t have time to stand up and retort Tang Ruge before this. If the Tang family really didn’t know who Fu Sheng was, why did they kidnap Qiao Xi?”","...","Kidnapped? Everyone gasped!","It was already crossing the line for Tang Ruge to pretend to be Fu Sheng and use Xu Da to slander Qiao Xi, yet she actually kidnapped Fu Sheng?","Everyone’s gaze landed on Tang Ruge. She lowered her head guiltily and bit her lip. She was about to lose her mind and could only shout in panic and helplessness, “It wasn’t me! I didn’t kidnap her!”","Madam Tang stood up abruptly. “Madam Wen Lai! You need evidence to back up your claims. Yes, Ruge was careless and took over Fu Sheng’s identity. But you can’t say that our Ruge kidnapped her.”","At this moment, the corners of Mu Ming’s mouth curled up slightly. The next second, a piece of shocking news broke on the internet.","[Major human trafficking case has been solved. A total of 60 victims were rescued and more than 20 people were arrested. The rest of the people involved are still being pursued.]","Dark Net and Stars had worked together on this case. The top hackers in the country helped the police with the investigation. In a few hours, they found clues about the other missing people and had already gone to save the victims.","At the same time, the police also found out that some noble families were involved in the case. They learned that these noble families were closely related to the Tang family. In just a few hours, the Tang family’s mansion was brought under police control. At this moment, the banquet hall for the award ceremony was also surrounded by police.","The reporters’ phones rang one after another. After seeing this news, everyone’s expressions changed. They looked at the Tang family with hatred in their eyes. The noblewomen and daughters who were close to Madam Tang hurriedly took a few steps back, afraid that they would be implicated by the Tang family.","This news caused the atmosphere to turn cold. After a long time, a female reporter took a deep breath and muttered, “The reason Miss Fu Sheng didn’t stop the award ceremony earlier was that she was kidnapped by the Tang family!”","“Tang Ruge knew long ago that Qiao Xi was Fu Sheng. She was afraid that Qiao Xi would expose her, so she sent someone to kidnap Qiao Xi in an attempt to ruin Qiao Xi’s life. This way, no one would know the truth. That way, Tang Ruge, the imposter, could rightfully replace Fu Sheng!”","“Qiao Xi is the chief designer, Gu Shan, but the Tang family still dared to send people to kidnap her. What if she were just an ordinary girl? Would she never have had the chance to make a comeback? Would she only have been at the mercy of the Tang family? I really can’t imagine how many bad things the Tang family has done!”","Everyone’s eyes burned with anger. They could no longer care about their rationality. They casually picked up the things beside them and threw them at the Tang family.","Rather than calling it a kidnapping, it would be more accurate to say that it was a long-term planned human trafficking business. In order to earn money, the Tang family gave up their humanity. They even thought that their actions were right.","Tang Ruge’s face was pale. She broke her nails from clenching her fists too hard, and her mind was heavy. A cup was smashed onto her head, making her look ferocious. “Ah!!! Who hit me? Who dares to hit me? Security! Quickly arrest these lunatics! Turn off the live broadcast!”","She could not ruin her image as a gentle and kind person for so many years. As long as the live broadcast stopped, she would still have a chance. Grandpa would spend a large sum of money to settle this matter. Soon, everyone would forget about this scandal.","“Stop filming! Get lost!” She covered her face in horror, her eyes filled with panic. Her hair was messy, and she looked like a lunatic.","Tang Ruge abruptly raised her eyes and looked fiercely at Qiao Xi. It was all because of this b*tch. If it were not for her, she would not have fallen into this state. As long as Qiao Xi died, everything would be the same as before."]},{"number":873,"title":"Chapter 873 - Collapse","paragraphs":["At this moment, Tang Ruge had already gone mad. She suddenly ran over and pounced on Qiao Xi. The security guards were shocked and hurriedly went forward to stop her.","The originally gorgeous and solemn banquet hall was in chaos at this moment. Tang Ruge removed her mask as a noble daughter and hit the security guards in front of her. She cursed, “You bastards, let go of me!”","“Miss Tang, let me remind you that this is being broadcasted live!” Qiao Xi looked at her with a smile, then waved her hand to signal the security guards to let go of her.","Without the obstruction of the security guards, Tang Ruge rushed over without hesitation. Just as she was about to approach Qiao Xi, Qiao Xi suddenly grabbed her wrist. That strength was simply not something a woman should have.","“Miss Tang, do you still think that the Tang family can protect you? The Tang family can only protect you if the Tang family is still around. However, the Tang family is completely doomed now.”","Qiao Xi exerted a little force with her hand, and Tang Ruge cried out in pain as she struggled weakly.","Madam Tang hurriedly rushed over and shouted, “Qiao Xi, let go of her! Didn’t you hear that she’s in pain?”","“Heh, can’t you even endure this little bit of pain?” Qiao Xi held Tang Ruge’s hand even tighter. Madam Tang could even hear the sound of bones grinding against each other.","Looking at Tang Ruge’s painful and ferocious face, Qiao Xi slowly said in an extremely cold voice, “Madam Tang, your heart aches for your own daughter, but have you ever considered that those women who were trafficked and abused by the Tang family are also the daughters of other people?! Do you know how much they dote on them?!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with rage. The sound of bones breaking was transmitted through the microphone on the stage, then Tang Ruge’s wrist twisted in a strange posture.","Tang Ruge was stunned on the spot as she stared fixedly at her wrist. A sharp pain assaulted her, and her face was pale as paper. Then, she said, “Ah! Ah! My hand! Qiao Xi!”","Hearing Tang Ruge’s roar, Madam Tang disregarded her image as a noblewoman and rushed in front of Qiao Xi like a madwoman. “Qiao Xi! Are you crazy? Why are you doing this to Ruge?! Let go of her!”","Even though Tang Ruge’s wrist was already broken, Qiao Xi still did not let go. Her gaze was sharp as she quietly looked at the crazy mother and daughter. Her thin lips parted slightly. “Your heart aches for Tang Ruge, but the parents of those kidnapped women and children also feel sorry for them. You’re all parents. Have you never thought about the feelings of others?”","Madam Tang looked at the tearful Tang Ruge and lost her mind. She roared angrily, “What do their lives have to do with me?! Let go of my daughter! You b*tch!”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes, and a trace of coldness burst out of her eyes. “Even at this time, you still don’t have the slightest intention of repenting?”","Madam Tang met Qiao Xi’s eyes, and her eyes gradually turned red. Her body seemed to be out of control as the words in her heart were instantly blurted out, “Don’t make it sound so nasty. We’re not selling people. This is just to satisfy the needs of some parties. If some people can’t conceive, we’ll sell them a child. If some people need a woman, we’ll sell them a woman. This is the best of both worlds! I’m doing this to let those women realize their value. In any case, they’ll have to get married and have children in the future. Isn’t this a good arrangement for all?","“And you, Qiao Xi. You’re so good-looking, and you only know how to seduce men. If it weren’t for you, Ruge would have married Gu Zheng a long time ago. She would have long become the top socialite in high society. What right do you have to block Ruge’s way? You should just die!”","Everyone did not expect Madam Tang to not have any regrets at all. Instead, she thought that it was reasonable for her to kidnap women and children. It was simply shocking.","[What kind of bullsh*t scholarly family is this?! Previously, I thought that Tang Ruge was gentle, polite, and knowledgeable. Now, it seems that the Tang family has just been disguising themselves too well. They’ve deceived all of us!]","[Tang Ruge isn’t good-looking, so all women who are better-looking than her should die? Is everyone who blocks Tang Ruge’s way going to be kidnapped, then?]","Qiao Xi was expressionless, but her eyes were filled with anger. She let go of Tang Ruge’s wrist and strangled her throat instead. “Madam Tang, if you like to do good deeds so much, why don’t you sell Tang Ruge? Let her realize her value!”","Madam Tang retorted without hesitation, “My daughter is the most outstanding woman in the world. She’s the top socialite in the capital. She’ll marry the most powerful and rich man. She’s also the future head of the Tang family. How can she be like you b*tches?!”"]},{"number":874,"title":"Chapter 874 - Even A Ferocious Tiger Doesn’t Eat Its Children","paragraphs":["Tang Ruge’s lips trembled. She wanted to say something but could not. How could her mother be so rash as to say what was on her mind?!","Everyone below the stage was furious. “You keep saying that human trafficking is a good thing, but you’re unwilling to let Tang Ruge go. A scourge like her should be sent as far away as possible, lest she harms Li City!”","These angry roars scared Madam Tang so much that her legs went weak. She broke down and shouted, “No! I can’t send my daughter away! She doesn’t belong in that dirty place. I sent other women there to train! It’s for their own good!”","Qiao Xi’s entire body emitted killing intent. This was the first time she revealed her killing intent in front of everyone.","For the sake of reaping benefits, the Tang family kidnapped women and children, bringing them to a desolate place. They abused, beat, and insulted the victims. That abandoned warehouse had destroyed many women in their prime and taken away many lives. Even now, the Tang family did not feel guilty at all. They even thought that they were doing good deeds.","[The Tang family is simply crazy. The internet says that Tang Dawei’s brother and sister-in-law who died in a car accident seven years ago were killed by the Tang family because they were unwilling to cooperate with Old Master Tang in the human trafficking business.]","[That’s Old Master Tang’s biological son! He actually steeled his heart to kill his own son? Are the Tang family members even worthy of being humans at this point? They’re simply demons! Even a vicious tiger won’t eat its cubs. In order to earn money, the old master actually killed his own son. Such a person is actually still alive?]","[14 years ago, Tang Yan realized that Old Master Tang was doing illegal business. However, at that time, he did not know what Old Master Tang was doing. Later on, he accidentally heard Old Master Tang on a call and found out what they were doing behind the scenes. From then on, Tang Yan began to stop Old Master Tang from taking action. In the end, Old Master Tang killed his biological son.","[After Tang Yan and his wife died, Old Master Tang even chased away their children and made Tang Da the heir of the Tang family. The couple listened to Old Master Tang very well and continued the human trafficking business with him. They also gave birth to a daughter like Tang Ruge who’s as vicious as a snake!]","Someone posted the details of the matter online. At this moment, everyone looked at the Tang family as if they were looking at a pile of smelly trash. Everyone understood why Qiao Xi was so triggered.","[Miss Fu Sheng was also kidnapped by the Tang family. She must have seen the women and children who were kidnapped. That’s why she got so angry and strangled Tang Ruge.]","Someone in the banquet hall suddenly shouted in horror, “Miss Fu Sheng, Tang Ruge is about to die! Let go!”","Qiao Xi came back to her senses. Tang Ruge’s face was already purple, and she could not help but stick out her tongue. Qiao Xi loosened her grip a little, and Tang Ruge immediately gasped crazily.","However, the moment Qiao Xi closed her eyes, her mind was filled with the helpless cries of those women and children who were covered in injuries. Their clothes were tattered and covered in blood. Their wounds were already slightly festering. They were all hiding in the dark, their eyes filled with horror.","She did not know that there was such a dark place in this world, but it did exist and she could not get it out of her mind.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi’s wrist tightened. Tang Ruge suddenly stopped breathing and struggled with both hands.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were bloodshot as hatred filled her mind, causing her to gradually lose her mind. There was only one thought in her mind, and that was to kill Tang Ruge.","“Xi Xi, calm down.”","Suddenly, a cold male voice came from behind her. Then, a pair of warm hands covered her eyes and stroked her gently. The other hand went past her waist and pulled her into his embrace.","Gu Zheng’s gentle voice caused Qiao Xi to gradually recover her rationality. He gently pulled away Qiao Xi’s hand that was grabbing Tang Ruge’s throat and whispered in her ear, “Xi Xi, the Tang family will receive the punishment they deserve. You don’t have to dirty your hands.”","Qiao Xi’s blood-red eyes gradually recovered their clarity. She blinked and slowly turned around after a moment. She looked at the handsome man in front of her and nodded.","At this moment, Tang Ruge was holding her neck and panting heavily. Her body could not help but tremble. For a moment, she almost thought that she was about to die.","The Tang family was destroyed, and no one could protect her anymore. She fell to the floor, her body limp. She had no strength at all as if she had already become a corpse."]},{"number":875,"title":"Chapter 875 - Getting Rid Of Evil For The People","paragraphs":["Tang Ruge closed her eyes and found it hard to believe. What was wrong? Why was the abandoned warehouse discovered as soon as she sent those people to kidnap Qiao Xi?","She had known since she was young that the Tang family was in the business of human trafficking. She also knew that this was a heartless business, but so what? The world was a cruel place. If they did not do this, the Tang family would eventually be replaced by other families.","After calming down for a moment, Tang Ruge abruptly opened her eyes and struggled to get up from the floor. She pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted, “It’s you! You harmed our Tang family!”","No wonder she was able to escape. No wonder the Tang family’s secret base was suddenly found. This was all Qiao Xi’s plan. She deliberately got herself kidnapped with the goal of finding the abandoned warehouse where the women and children were kept.","At this moment, the microphone on the stage had already been cut off. In the noisy environment, Tang Ruge’s voice was like a mosquito. No one could hear her at all.","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at her, and the corners of her mouth curled into a mocking smile.","Tang Ruge gradually went crazy, and her voice trembled. “You demon! You did it on purpose! You knew everything! You lured me to kidnap you!”","Qiao Xi took a few steps toward her and said casually, “So what if I did?”","She admitted it!","Tang Ruge stood up excitedly and shouted, “You weren’t kidnapped! You just put on an act! You harmed our Tang family! I’m going to expose you!”","“So?” Qiao Xi’s voice was cold. “I did it on purpose. I got Song Shiyu to call the police and brought them to your Tang family’s nest. Then, I came to the award ceremony to expose your lies. But all of this... is the truth!","“Your Tang family committed a crime. So what if I did it on purpose? Everything I did was to help the police solve the case. I helped get rid of evil for the people! You’ll be an ugly criminal for the rest of your life. You’ll never be able to make a comeback!”","Qiao Xi’s voice was very soft, and only the two of them could hear her. “Tang Ruge, if your grandfather and parents take all the blame, you can avoid going to jail. But with the Tang family gone, your life from now on won’t be any better. Isn’t it quite boring to live alone like that?”","Tang Ruge widened her eyes and looked at the woman in front of her in disbelief. Tears of horror fell from the corners of her eyes.","How scary! This woman was too scary!","...","Not long after, the Tang family was arrested for investigation. The award ceremony was held as scheduled, but the winner of the gold award went from Tang Ruge to Qiao Xi. Madam Wen Lai personally gave her the award that represented Planet Music Festival’s highest honor.","The Tang family’s mansion was in a mess now. When the police came in to arrest him, Old Master Tang still had fantasies. He resisted arrest in public and even cursed at the police, “You bastards! Do you know who I am? How dare you arrest me?”","“Of course, we know who you are. We’re the ones arresting you!” With that, Yuan Shan took out the arrest warrant. “Old Master, we’ve already obtained the relevant evidence and issued an arrest warrant. I hope you can cooperate with our investigation. Otherwise, we’ll take special measures.”","The news of the Tang family’s arrest quickly spread. This case was very influential, and the mastermind might be executed.","The Tang family’s shareholders immediately sold their shares, afraid that they would be implicated by the Tang family.","“Grandpa! Quickly think of a way!” Tang Ruge was uneasy. She grabbed Old Master Tang’s sleeve and shouted anxiously.","Old Master Tang’s expression darkened. He looked like he had aged a little overnight. “Looks like... I can’t avoid it this time. I... can’t keep my old life.”","If he died, what would happen to the Tang family? What would happen to Ruge?","Old Master Tang held Tang Ruge’s hand tightly and reminded her, “Ruge, remember that no matter what happens, you have to insist that you didn’t know about this. We’ll do our best to protect you. I’ll find the best lawyer. I believe you’ll be released soon.”","Tang Ruge’s face was covered in tears. “If the Tang family is gone, what does it matter even if I manage to go out? I’m no longer a socialite in the capital. I’ll be looked down on wherever I go. If that’s the case, I might as well die!”","“Tang Ruge!” Tang Dawei roared. They were thinking about how to protect Ruge, but she actually gave up first.","Tang Ruge was shocked by her father’s roar and sobbed helplessly. “I... What should I do?!”"]},{"number":876,"title":"Chapter 876 - Acquiring Tang Corporation","paragraphs":["At this moment, the Tang family was detained in the interrogation room. A pair of siblings came in from outside. The police knew that these two were the children of Tang Yan and his wife. They were chased out of the house by Old Master Tang a few years ago and no one had heard from them again.","The police brought the siblings into the interrogation room. When Madam Tang saw the ferocious look in their eyes, she felt angry and humiliated. At the beginning of the award ceremony, she looked down on the siblings. They were inferior to even a strand of Ruge’s hair. Now, the siblings were standing at the door while her family had become prisoners.","Mu Ming looked down at the Tang family with a mocking smile.","“Who do you think you are? Are you worthy of watching us make a fool of ourselves? Get lost! Even if I die, the Tang family won’t fall into your hands!” Old Master Tang roared angrily.","Looking at the exasperated old master, the smile on Mu Ming’s face grew wider. He was silent for a few seconds before saying coldly, “Then I’m really sorry. You’re not dead yet, but the Tang family has already fallen into our hands.”","“You bastard! What nonsense are you talking about?!”","Mu Ming raised an eyebrow, then took out a few contracts from his bag and threw them in front of Old Master Tang. “You’ll know whether I’m spouting nonsense or not after you take a look.”","Old Master Tang’s heart skipped a beat. His hands trembled as he picked up the contract on the floor. He instantly glared at Tang Muming. The Tang family’s shares had been bought over by Tang Muming!","“Old Master, after your family’s incident, the shareholders sold all their shares at a low price. The shares in your hands have also been converted into cash to compensate the victims, so I took all the shares back. I’ve taken back what originally belonged to us siblings.”","Old Master Tang looked at the man in front of him in a daze. In his memory, his eldest son’s family was old-fashioned and boring. They were inflexible. They were not as likable as his second son’s family. His eldest son’s children were also like their parents, always pulling long faces. However, Mu Ming was smiling now.","“I know you plan to take all the blame and do your best to protect Tang Ruge. As long as she’s safe and sound, the Tang family will still have a chance to make a comeback.”","Old Master Tang had a bad feeling.","“But do you think Tang Ruge has the ability?” Mu Ming sneered. He was playing with a piece of porcelain in his hand. It was the token that represented his identity as the head of the Tang family.","The Tang family became rich through the porcelain business and later became one of the four major families. Hence, they used porcelain to make the token. Now, the token that symbolized the status of the head of the family was in Mu Ming’s hands.","Old Master Tang widened his eyes. He never expected that the two little bastards who were chased out of the house seven years ago would actually come back. They even stole the company and token that he treated as his life. However, they were clearly living on the streets and did not even have enough to eat. It was impossible for them to have this ability!","Reading on Mybo xn o v el. com ,Please!","“Old Master, you should be very curious about where we got the money to acquire the Tang family’s shares and how we obtained the token. You must think it should be impossible, but we did it easily.”","Tang Ruge, who was at the side, was crying. “Cousin, we’re related by blood. Can you bear to see us suffer here? Even if you don’t care about us, you have to care about our family relations!”","“Shut up!” Mu Ming berated coldly, then his gaze landed on Old Master Tang. “Just as you thought, when we were chased away seven years ago, Mu Ling and I were wandering the streets. We didn’t have enough to eat, we had no clothes, and we couldn’t even keep warm. We didn’t have the money to go to university at all.","“You thought that if we were chased out of the Tang family, even if we were lucky enough to survive, we’d just fight to fill our stomachs and get warm. We definitely wouldn’t be successful. However, Mu Ling and I are not as useless as Tang Ruge. The more difficult the environment is, the more it can arouse our fighting spirit. Since we wanted to escape the predicament, we knew we had to work hard.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Tang Ruge’s face turned livid. She had suffered a great insult.","Mu Ming smiled. “Mu Ling and I have always liked computers since we were young. Our parents also nurtured our ability in this aspect. After we left the Tang family, not only did we not starve to death, but we even earned a huge amount of wealth that allowed us to acquire the Tang family! I forgot to tell you that you even helped take care of our business and gave us a large sum of money!”","At this moment, Mu Ling could not help but laugh out loud. “Yes! You were really willing to spend money for Tang Ruge. You gave her tens of millions just like that!”","Hearing the siblings’ words, Tang Ruge suddenly realized something. The blood in her body froze as she widened her eyes in disbelief."]},{"number":877,"title":"Chapter 877 - Karma","paragraphs":["“Miss Tang, you probably haven’t been able to figure it out. You found a top hacker to change Fu Sheng’s account information, but you didn’t even tell your parents about it. How did Qiao Xi know about it, then?”","After Mu Ming finished speaking, he looked at Old Master Tang. “It’s not just Tang Ruge. The entire Tang family relies on a hacker organization. In the past, the hacker organization helped the Tang family cover up many scandals, so Tang Ruge got the same hacker organization to modify Fu Sheng’s account information. After the human trafficking business was exposed and Stars cooperated with the police to investigate the clues, your Tang family reached out to the hacker organization again and hoped that they could help. They accepted the money and agreed to your request, but why were the Tang family still arrested?”","Everyone in the Tang family instantly felt as if they had fallen into an ice cellar. A terrifying thought appeared in their minds. Old Master Tang’s beard trembled violently, his old and turbid eyes becoming bloodshot. His fingers trembled as he pointed at Mu Ming.","“Dark Net... You...”","“That’s right,” Mu Ming admitted generously. “Every time you encountered trouble, you’d look for Dark Net for help, but you didn’t know that I’m the leader of the Dark Net.”","The moment that was said, the interrogation room fell silent. Old Master Tang’s teeth creaked. The powerful blow almost made him break down.","The leader of the top hacker organization, Dark Net, was actually Mu Ming. This organization was established seven years ago. In other words, this organization was established when they were chased out of the Tang family. How could they have this ability?","Old Master Tang felt dizzy and fell to the floor weakly.","Mu Ming smiled meaningfully. “Thank you for your contributions to Dark Net all these years. If it weren’t for you, Mu Ling and I wouldn’t have been able to acquire Tang Corporation so quickly. From today onward, Tang Corporation will officially be renamed to Ming Ling Corporation. When your granddaughter, Tang Ruge, is released, she can personally see how we manage the company!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Mu Ming pulled Mu Ling away. Old Master Tang clenched his fists tightly. Fear and anger intertwined within him. Tang Corporation was his life’s work. How could it fall into the hands of this pair of siblings?!","In the past seven years, Old Master Tang had even forgotten about the existence of the siblings. He never expected them to have their current achievements. They even endured for seven years before completely overturning the Tang family.","Old Master Tang suddenly got up and grabbed Tang Ruge’s sleeve tightly. His voice trembled. “Ruge! When you get out, you must beg your cousins for forgiveness! Don’t go against them!”","Tang Ruge sat at the side in a daze. Her mind was filled with chaotic thoughts. She was supposed to beg Mu Ming and Mu Ling? She was the eldest daughter of the Tang family and the top socialite in the capital. Why did she have to beg the siblings who were chased out of the house? She would never beg anyone!","Seeing that Tang Ruge was silent, Old Master Tang cursed. Tang Ruge, who was already unwilling, completely broke down. She had nothing left. Now, she could not even protect her last dignity.","The blood in her body surged as she shouted crazily, “I won’t do it! You were the one who chased them out of the house back then. You were also the one who killed their parents. It’s all your fault that the Tang family is in this state now. Why should I ask for anything from them?”","Reading on Mybo xn o v el. com ,Please!","Old Master Tang looked at Tang Ruge with his mouth agape. It was hard to imagine that the granddaughter he had doted on for more than 20 years would speak to him like this. The anger in his heart burned fiercely. Suddenly, his body stiffened and he fainted.","...","Three days later, Tang Corporation completely disappeared. Mu Ming and Mu Ling were in charge of the company, and the employees were changed.","When Qiao Xi found out about this, Old Master Tang had already been sent to the hospital for emergency treatment. In the end, he managed to survive but fell into a vegetative state.","“He was angered to a vegetative state by his granddaughter whom he doted on for many years. It’s a bargain for him. He’s done so many bad things that he deserves to be shot to death!” Qiao Xi grunted coldly.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Old Master Tang is as good as dead, and Tang Ruge won’t have a chance to make a comeback. This is retribution!”","Without Old Master Tang’s protection, even if Tang Ruge came out, she would not be Mu Ming’s match at all. In the end, she could only be chased out of the Tang family and fend for herself.","Now that the Tang family’s actions were already made known to the public and Tang Ruge had become the target of everyone’s hatred, her outcome would definitely be very tragic.","Qiao Xi paid no further attention to the news online. She turned around and took out the Nine Heavens Chinese Zither. Suddenly, she received a notification on her phone: [Major human trafficking case has been solved. The people involved have been trafficking humans for more than 10 years. There are thousands of victims. The police have already rescued 930 people. The other victims are still being tracked.]"]},{"number":878,"title":"Chapter 878 - Never Again","paragraphs":["[The mastermind, Tang Juncai, fell seriously ill and was hospitalized. He’s now in a vegetative state. The other people involved in the case have been detained. The Tang family might face the death penalty.]","For more than 10 years, the Tang family was involved in a human trafficking business and established a human trafficking den in Li City. Their victims came from all over the country. Such news made one’s heart ache.","Qiao Xi’s tightly furrowed brows eased up. “It’s finally over.”","“Yes, everything is over.”","In the evening, it was snowing outside. The snow seemed to be washing away the sins of this world. Gu Zheng’s voice was cold. “Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and smiled sweetly. The next second, she heard him say with a serious expression, “The Tang family has been arrested, and the victims have been found. It’s time for me to talk to you.”","Qiao Xi: “?” What was there to talk about?","The man’s eyes were deep like a bottomless spring. He bent down and firmly locked Qiao Xi in front of his chest. His voice was low and tempting. “Mrs. Gu, don’t you have anything to say to me?”","“Huh? Say... what?” Qiao Xi was uneasy.","Gu Zheng sneered. “Mrs. Gu, why are you pretending to be muddle-headed? You took such a big risk and didn’t tell your husband. If I hadn’t realized, would you have gone to that lion’s den yourself?”","His voice was very soft and slow, but every word was asked in an interrogating tone. If one listened carefully, one would be able to hear the slight fluctuation in his voice.","Qiao Xi hurriedly said, “I had people from Ling Pavilion protecting me, so it was absolutely impossible for anything to happen. Moreover, even without them, I would have the ability to protect myself. I know hypnosis!”","“I can’t allow you to put yourself even in the slightest bit of danger!” Gu Zheng suddenly hugged her waist and pulled her into his embrace. The world spun as the two of them turned around. Qiao Xi’s body was completely pressed against Gu Zheng’s, and she could clearly hear his violent heartbeat.","The man lowered his eyes and looked into her eyes calmly. “Xi Xi, don’t do it again!”","“But Ling Pavilion has many missions for me to complete. If I dodge danger, who’ll do the missions?” Qiao Xi asked. She had benefited from Ling Pavilion, so she naturally had to repay the organization.","Visit (Myb o xn ov e l. com) to read, pls!","Gu Zheng gently stroked Qiao Xi’s beautiful hair, and his voice was hoarse and low. “If you have to go, I’ll accompany you. I’ll protect you by your side. No matter what happens, I won’t let you be in danger. I’ll allow you to participate in the missions, but the prerequisite is that you can’t hide it from me.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and stared blankly at the man in front of her. Her cheeks were slightly red, and her heart was pounding. Why was this man so charming?!","Dense kisses landed on her lips, urgent and hot. He hugged the woman in his arms tightly like she was the most precious treasure in the world.","Qiao Xi was intoxicated by his kiss and was in a daze. She hurriedly said, “Alright, I won’t hide it from you anymore!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and gently kissed her eyes, cheeks, and the corners of her lips. Then, he kissed her exquisite collarbone, leaving a faint red mark.","Their bodies were tightly pressed together. Gu Zheng’s hand moved around Qiao Xi’s waist, causing her to tremble. Suddenly, the phone rang, and Qiao Xi came back to her senses. “Don’t...”","Gu Zheng turned a deaf ear to her and patted her soft and delicate buttocks as if he was punishing her. His voice was hoarse. “Pay attention.”","Qiao Xi lay on his body. After the scorching kiss, she felt the air around her thin out. She struggled to get up, but the man pulled her back. She should have been in control, but in Gu Zheng’s arms, she could not exert any strength at all. She was like a lamb waiting to be slaughtered.","Qiao Xi was just about to speak when the man’s finger landed on her lips and stroked them gently. His eyes were filled with burning love and affection, and his voice was low with a trace of a smile. “Mrs. Gu, why are you so enthusiastic today?! It’s not even night yet. Are you already impatient?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Damn! This bastard was really shameless!","“Let go of me. I want to get up!” Qiao Xi struggled to get up when someone suddenly pushed open the bedroom door. Generally speaking, only Song Shijing and Song Shiyu could come up to the bedroom on the second floor. If the two of them wanted to enter, they would definitely knock first and only come in after getting permission. Who was so bold as to come in without knocking?","Qiao Xi had already lost all her strength from Gu Zheng’s torture and was shocked by the sound of the door opening. She instantly lost her balance and fell into Gu Zheng’s embrace. Then, the two of them raised their eyes at the same time to look at the man at the door."]},{"number":879,"title":"Chapter 879 - Women Have To Be Reserved","paragraphs":["“Wow!” A surprised voice sounded from the door. Gu Yao stood at the door with his eyes wide open. He was a single man who had never been in a relationship before. When had he ever seen such a shocking scene? He stood at the door for a few seconds, his cheeks slightly red.","A moment later, he said in surprise, “Qiao Xi, I really didn’t expect you to be such a proactive woman. You’re actually suppressing Gu Zheng?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘When did he see me taking the initiative?’","Hearing Gu Yao’s words, her face turned as red as a tomato. She hurriedly pushed Gu Zheng away and got up from his body. She shouted in exasperation, “Gu Yao! Do you want to die?!”","Gu Zheng stood up casually and straightened his messy shirt. He slowly looked up. “What are you doing here?”","Gu Yao met Gu Zheng’s cold eyes and trembled in fear. “I-It’s nothing. I didn’t know the two of you were...”","Gu Zheng’s lips were slightly red, and his eyes were a little dazed. His indifferent gaze landed on Gu Yao. When he smiled, he made Gu Yao shudder.","Gu Yao defended himself while trembling. “It’s clearly your fault for getting intimate without locking the door. You can’t blame me! Moreover, Qiao Xi, you’re a woman. You have to be more reserved. How can you suppress Gu Zheng?!”","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth in anger. “Gu Yao, should I gouge your eyes out?”","Gu Yao shook his head crazily, his cheeks red as he looked at Qiao Xi in embarrassment. “I didn’t see anything. I just want to remind you that it’s not good for women to be too proactive—”","Before Gu Yao could finish, Qiao Xi interrupted him helplessly. “What should we do if the child refuses to listen? He’s probably asking for a beating. We have to beat him up.”","Gu Yao gasped, and his hair stood on end. He had just accidentally pushed open the bedroom door. How could they blame him? Moreover, he had called before he came. Why didn’t they pick up?","Qiao Xi picked up Gu Zheng’s phone, which showed Gu Yao’s missed call. Actually, Gu Yao was in such a rush to see Nine Heavens Chinese Zither. After all, this zither was very famous in the music industry, and Gu Yao liked music very much, so he could not help but run over.","A moment later, Qiao Xi set up the ancient zither and lowered her eyes to think for a moment. Her fingers then moved smoothly on the zither.","Gu Yao listened in fascination. “Is this ‘Everything’? Qiao Xi, you actually know how to play this song? You’re too awesome!”","Visit (Myb o xn ov e l. com) to read, pls!","Everything was extremely difficult to play. Ordinary people were unable to play it. Only skilled musicians could perfectly play it. Gu Yao had only heard this song by chance at a concert. He did not expect Qiao Xi to know how to play it.","In his excitement, Gu Yao forgot that Gu Zheng was standing beside him. He went up to Qiao Xi, his eyes sparkling like the stars in the sky. He said in a childish voice, “Qiao Xi, can you teach me how to play ‘Everything’?”","For the next hour, Qiao Xi patiently taught Gu Yao how to play. The time when Gu Zheng was supposed to be a loving couple with Qiao Xi was all taken up by Gu Yao. Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent on the surface, but he felt like beating someone up.","When was this kid leaving?","Gu Zheng was really bored. When he was listening to Qiao Xi’s lecture, he was also learning from the side. He quickly grasped the basics of playing the zither. After Gu Yao left, Gu Zheng walked to Qiao Xi’s side and said bitterly, “It’s just the zither. Who doesn’t know how to play it?”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with surprise. “You know how to play the zither too?”","The man sat down with a straight posture, exuding an elegant and noble aura. His posture was very standard, and his fingers gently landed on the strings. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly. “Yes, I’ll play it for you.”","Qiao Xi was surprised and delighted. She had never heard that Gu Zheng knew how to play the zither, but someone as outstanding as him would definitely stun the entire venue with his skills. Hence, she sat on the sofa with her chin in her hand and looked at the man with anticipation.","In the next second...","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face suddenly vanished, and a trace of embarrassment gradually appeared. “Ah Zheng...”","It was hard to imagine that this elegant and handsome man in front of her could play such an ugly tune. He was clearly very engrossed in playing, but the melody sounded half-dead.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and his eyes narrowed slightly. His movements were comparable to that of a professional, and even the rhythm of his fingers was so professional. However, the sound he produced was truly not pleasant. For a moment, Qiao Xi even suspected that there was something wrong with her ears."]},{"number":880,"title":"Chapter 880 - True Lovers Wouldn’t Miss Out On Each Other","paragraphs":["After playing a song, Gu Zheng slowly opened his deep eyes and looked at the woman he loved with extreme gentleness. His thin lips parted slightly. “Did you like it?”","Qiao Xi: “...” She dug her ears. If it was not because there was something wrong with her ears, then it was because Gu Zheng was too narcissistic. He played so terribly yet still had the cheek to ask her if she liked it?","After a while, the door was pushed open again. Gu Yao rushed in in a panic, his eyes still a little dazed. He looked like he had just woken up. “What happened? I heard a scary sound just now. It sounded like the soundtrack from a horror movie!”","Qiao Xi’s eyelids twitched. It was not that there was something wrong with her ears but that there was something wrong with Gu Zheng’s performance. Gu Zheng himself was not embarrassed in the slightest and said indifferently, “You must have had a nightmare.”","Gu Yao looked confused. “That’s impossible! I heard it very clearly!”","Gu Zheng did not even raise his head and snorted. “Why not? You’ve had nightmares since you were young. It’s not strange for you to hear terrifying sounds. Moreover, we didn’t hear any sounds. Xi Xi, am I right?”","Qiao Xi: “?” What could she say?","Unexpectedly, Gu Yao was silly enough. After being fooled by Gu Zheng, he said seriously, “You’re right. I must have had a nightmare. I haven’t been sleeping well recently.”","Gu Zheng nodded, and his voice softened a little. “Don’t be afraid. If you have time, go see a doctor. Hurry up and go back to your room to rest.”","With that, Gu Yao obediently returned to his room. Qiao Xi shook her head helplessly. Gu Yao was just too naive. He believed everything others said.","Gu Zheng slowly stood up and muttered, “This zither is indeed difficult to control.”","Qiao Xi smiled slyly. It turned out that there was something that Gu Zheng could not do. It was probably because Gu Zheng was too outstanding. As long as it was something he wanted to do, there was nothing he could not do. In her heart, Gu Zheng was an omnipotent existence. He founded Gu Corporation from scratch and was all-powerful in the business world at a young age. It seemed that nothing could stump him. Now, he said that the zither was difficult.","“I thought that you knew everything, but it turns out you don’t,” Qiao Xi said with a smile.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he carefully put away the ancient zither. “Of course, I have things I don’t know, but Xi Xi, you know everything. You know how to paint, compose, design, and play the zither. You’re the most special person in this world.","“Do you still remember the day we met at the Civil Affairs Bureau?”","Visit (Myb o xn ov e l. com) to read, pls!","Qiao Xi’s thoughts drifted. That day, she was supposed to register her marriage with Gu Moling. After Qiao Rou ruined it, she looked for Gu Zheng in a fit of anger and married him on impulse.","After getting married, she found out that Gu Zheng appeared at the Civil Affairs Bureau to get married to the daughter of the Meng family. Later on, he said that he did not go to the Civil Affairs Bureau for Meng Wan.","“Actually, I have a secret that I’ve been hiding from you. I went to the Civil Affairs Bureau for you.” Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle, but the words he said were like a rock that smashed into Qiao Xi’s heart, causing ripples.","After a long time, Qiao Xi said in surprise, “You knew that I was Black Tide?”","Although she and her senior had known each other for a long time, they did not know each other’s true identities. Moreover, how did her senior know that she would go to the Civil Affairs Bureau?","Gu Zheng’s lips curled into a smile, and his deep eyes were filled with deep love. “I don’t know why, but I had a feeling that someone very important was waiting for me there. If I didn’t go, I’d definitely regret it for the rest of my life.”","It was just a feeling. Gu Zheng, who had always been cold, wilfully went to the Civil Affairs Bureau because of a gut feeling. Even he did not know the reason for his behavior. At that time, he did not know that Qiao Xi was his junior at all. There was only a voice in the depths of his heart that told him that he had to go no matter what. He did not go there for Meng Wan but for someone important.","Qiao Xi was abruptly stunned, and her face was filled with disbelief. “If you hadn’t believed your gut feeling that day and refused to go to the Civil Affairs Bureau, we would’ve probably missed out on each other.”","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng shook his head. “No, even if we didn’t meet that day, we would’ve met in the future. As long as I met you, I’d fall in love with you, so I won’t miss out on you no matter what.”","True fate was not a coincidence. No matter when you met them, you would think that they were the person who would accompany you for the rest of your life.","Qiao Xi rarely heard Gu Zheng say sweet words. She curled up in Gu Zheng’s embrace with a sweet smile on the corners of her mouth. Marrying Gu Zheng might have been an impulsive move, but it was the best decision in her life."]},{"number":881,"title":"Chapter 881 - The Heir Of The Yin Family","paragraphs":["The next day, a guest came to Longwan Residential. Yin Jinglin rushed over from Shengdu and specially brought over an imperial green jade bracelet. He brought it to Qiao Xi and explained, “This is a jade bracelet worn by the direct descendants of the Yin family. My father and your mother both have it. My father’s jade bracelet was passed down to my third brother. Of course, Aunt’s jade bracelet is for you.”","Yin Jinglin’s third brother was Yin Jingting, Yin Yunyi’s son. He was also the third young master of the Yin family. The aunt he was talking about was Xia Yunqiu.","If this had belonged to her mother, Qiao Xi naturally had no reason to refuse. She carefully sized up the jade bracelet. There was a special pattern engraved on it.","Among the three Yin siblings, only her uncle, Yin Yunyi, and her mother had bracelets. It seemed that Xia Yunlou did not. The other bracelet was in Yin Jingting’s hands, which meant that the Yin family had chosen her and Yin Jingting as candidates to be the heir.","Then, Yin Jinglin handed her a transfer of assets. It was already stamped with Yin Yunyi’s seal. “Cousin, the Yin family has been developing in Shengdu since ancient times and is deeply rooted there. Grandma hopes that you can return to Shengdu to manage things, but she won’t force you. Since you’ve already settled down in Li City, the Yin family’s branch in Li City will be handed to you to manage. Third Brother is in charge of Shengdu. You and Third Brother are both the heirs of the Yin family. You’ll naturally be able to have whatever he has.","“These things were originally supposed to be handed to Aunt. Unfortunately, she’s no longer alive. You should inherit them. Also, if the Xia family comes looking for you, ignore them. They definitely won’t have good intentions.”","Yin Jinglin thought of the Xia family and could not suppress the anger in his heart. “Old Master Xia is heartless. Back then, he abandoned Grandma and got married to a mistress. Now, he still has the cheek to ask us to call him ‘Grandpa’ and even goes around saying that my father is unfilial. He has never done his duty as a father. Why should my father be filial to him?","“Ever since Grandma brought my father back to the Yin family and my father changed his surname to Yin, we have already cut off all contact with the Xia family. We look down on scum like Old Master Xia who goes back on his word. He even has the cheek to interfere in Third Brother’s marriage, saying that he’s our grandfather. He says that Third Brother is his grandson, so he should be the one deciding on his marriage! Pfft! How shameless!”","Hearing Yin Jinglin’s complaints, she knew how much the Yin family hated the Xia family. Qiao Xi could not help but nod. She had seen the Xia family before. Xia Mengyan was an example. To be able to raise a daughter like her, the Xia family was probably not a good family.","The old master of the Xia family, Xia Cheng, had cut off all ties with his first wife for so many years. Now, he was interfering in Yin Jingting’s marriage. He had probably taken a liking to Yin Jingting’s position as the Yin family’s heir and wanted to get closer to this grandson of his.","At this point, Yin Jinglin was even angrier. He took a few deep breaths before calming down. “But my third brother isn’t someone who can be manipulated by the Xia family!”","The Yin family was a century-old family with many connections. They naturally had their reasons for choosing Yin Jingting as the next head of the family. This cousin of theirs was definitely not a pushover.","“Xi Xi, when can you come back to Shengdu with me? I really want to bring you to meet my friends and tell them that I have a younger sister! Otherwise, they’ll always mock our Yin family for not having girls!”","......","After Yin Jinglin left, Qiao Xi received a call. The president of Liuli, Lu Zhi, was looking for her to discuss the fashion design plan. Qiao Xi brought the design drafts and asked him to meet her at a Western restaurant.","Lu Zhi and Qiao Xi had known each other for seven years. Lu Zhi was the mysterious president of Liuli. He had always been the chief designer of Liuli Corporation, so Qiao Xi did not understand why Lu Zhi suddenly returned to the country.","Qiao Xi had just arrived at the Western restaurant and sat down when Lu Zhi teased, “It’s rare to get you to treat me to a meal, yet you’re treating me to a meal in a restaurant under Gu Corporation. You’re really making full use of your family’s benefits.”","“When I meet a man, I have to do it where my husband can see us. Otherwise, he’ll be jealous,” Qiao Xi replied with a smile. She quickly signed the contract. Lu Zhi suddenly saw the jade bracelet on her wrist, and his eyes flashed.","Qiao Xi pointed at the jade bracelet. “You know about this bracelet?”","“Back then, the Yin family made a total of three imperial jade bracelets with the family’s emblem. Moreover, only the direct descendants of the Yin family are qualified to wear these bracelets. Almost all noble families know about this. So, what’s your relationship with the Yin family?” Lu Zhi raised his eyebrows and asked.","Qiao Xi and Lu Zhi had known each other for seven years. The two of them were considered good friends, so there was no need to hide it from him. Hence, she said frankly, “My mother is from the Yin family.”"]},{"number":882,"title":"Chapter 882 - Meeting An Idiot","paragraphs":["Lu Zhi’s eyebrows relaxed. “I see. I thought that it was a gift from the future head of the Yin family. I misunderstood.”","Initially, he thought that since Gu Shan was already married to President Gu, how could she accept a bracelet from another man? Moreover, this was not an ordinary bracelet but a family heirloom that represented the Yin family’s identity.","“The future head you’re talking about is Yin Jingting?”","“Yes, he looks gentle on the surface, but he’s decisive. If the Yin family is handed to him, he’ll definitely lead the family to greater heights! No wonder so many noble families want their daughters to marry him. I heard that Old Master Xia has accepted many generous gifts from noble families just relying on the fact that he’s Yin Jingting’s grandfather.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “With my cousin’s temper, he definitely won’t just allow it.”","“Of course, so the Xia family is being blamed and ostracized by all parties now.” Suddenly, Lu Zhi paused and smiled. “By the way, guess why I came to Li City this time.”","Qiao Xi had a confused expression. She was also curious about what Lu Zhi was doing in Li City. Liuli’s headquarters was overseas, and he did not have any business in Li City. Could it be that he came all the way to Li City to travel?","Lu Zhi smiled and said, “I’m here in Li City for your husband. I have a potential collaboration to talk to him about. I don’t think he’ll refuse.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at him and asked casually, “What collaboration?”","Lu Zhi looked mysterious. “It has nothing to do with you. You don’t need to know.”","Qiao Xi supported her chin and blinked. “What big matter are you hiding from me?”","Lu Zhi looked at her sparkling eyes and shook his head helplessly. “Madam, although I’m working for you, I’m still the president of Liuli Corporation. Do you have to interfere in my private matters?”","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “You don’t have to tell me about your private matters. I don’t want to know either, but...”","When Lu Zhi heard the word ‘but’, he knew that things were not that simple. The next second, Qiao Xi said with a serious expression, “But since it concerns Gu Zheng, I have to know!”","She had to know everything about Gu Zheng. Even though he had an unbearable childhood and a dark past, she had never despised him. She just thought it was a pity she didn’t meet Gu Zheng earlier.","Lu Zhi was in a difficult position. After a moment, he said in a low and hoarse voice, “This matter is a little complicated. Miss Lu Qingyun died from poison, and someone in our family was also poisoned. It’s difficult for me to find any useful clues alone, so I want to work with President Gu to see if we can make any progress.”","Qiao Xi had long guessed that Lu Zhi was related to the Lu family, but she did not expect that he was actually here to look for clues about the poison.","“I’ll talk to President Gu about this. I’ll get going first.” Lu Zhi stood up and put away the contract. He pursed his lips and said, “Your husband is probably already on his way here. He was so nervous to know you were having a meal with me. He’s rushing over as if he’s afraid I’ll kidnap you.”","With that, Lu Zhi left. Qiao Xi’s phone flashed. It was a message from Gu Zheng asking her to wait for him at the Western restaurant.","Qiao Xi sat in the private room and looked at the people coming and going outside through the wide and bright French windows. She savored the coffee and leaned comfortably on the soft and comfortable sofa. Her mind was a little chaotic. The faces of the Lu family members flashed past her eyes one after another when the door of the private room was suddenly pushed open.","Qiao Xi thought that Gu Zheng was here and hurriedly looked up. Unexpectedly, it was a few women dressed exquisitely and luxuriously. The woman in the lead was wearing gold and silver as she walked in arrogantly. She was wearing luxury brands from head to toe. Her outfit was worth at least a few hundred thousand yuan. Coupled with the jewelry on her body that definitely exceeded a million yuan, she exuded a strong aura of a nouveau riche.","Everyone was stunned for a few seconds when they saw Qiao Xi. The woman standing at the back said awkwardly, “Ting Ting, there’s someone in the private room. Let’s change rooms.”","Unexpectedly, the woman called ‘Ting Ting’ frowned and shouted rudely, “Why should I leave? I’ve always sat in this private room. If you want to leave, leave. I’m not leaving!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the woman aggressively walked over to Qiao Xi and said coldly, “You! Get out!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at the woman in front of her as if she was looking at an idiot. ‘Where did this idiot come from? Can an idiot leave the house as they please now?’","She ignored her and leisurely picked up the coffee. Coincidentally, she shook the jade bracelet on her wrist. Yu Manting’s expression instantly darkened, and her eyes were bloodshot. She grabbed Qiao Xi’s hand as if she had gone mad and cursed, “Vixen! Why are you wearing the Yin family’s bracelet?! Take it off!”"]},{"number":883,"title":"Chapter 883 - The Well-Chosen Fiancee","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s eyes turned cold as she forcefully broke free from Yu Manting’s hand. Then she pushed her hard. Yu Manting screamed and almost fell. She roared crazily, “B*tch! What method did you use to make him give you the bracelet? No wonder you’re occupying this private room. You’re here to show off! Quickly take it off. This bracelet is mine!”","Yu Manting’s face was pale as she panted heavily. She had followed Yin Jingting to Shengdu from Luo City, and now, she was in Li City. However, Yin Jingting did not even bother to look at her, much less give her the jade bracelet that represented the Yin family’s direct descendants. She did not expect this bracelet to appear in the hands of another woman.","This woman was so seductive. She must have seduced Brother Jingting!","Anger burned in Yu Manting’s heart. She was the future young madam of the Yin family whom Brother Jingting’s grandfather had decided on. Who was this woman? What right did she have to wear the jade bracelet?!","At this moment, her eyes were filled with anger. She snorted in disdain. “I admit that you’re quite good-looking, but I’m warning you now. Brother Jingting is my fiance. If you dare to seduce him, I’ll definitely not let you off!”","With that, she waved at the other women. “All of you, attack and snatch my bracelet back!”","Qiao Xi had a confused expression. Who was ‘Brother Jingting’? Did she know him?","Yu Manting’s friends walked toward Qiao Xi with unfriendly gazes and mocked, “Where did this little vixen come from?! How dare you take our Ting Ting’s things?! I advise you to quickly hand over the bracelet so that you don’t suffer later. Don’t think that just because Young Master Yin dotes on you now, you can fool around in front of him. The future young madam of the Yin family can only be Ting Ting!”","“You’re overestimating yourself! You want to be a princess? Why don’t you look in the mirror and see if you’re worthy?! Hurry up and give the bracelet to Tingting. Don’t force us to attack!”","When she heard a few of them say ‘Young Master Yin’, Qiao Xi finally realized that it was her cousin, Yin Jingting! After all, he also had an identical bracelet. So, this woman in front of her was one of the blind dates Old Master Xia had arranged for her cousin?","Qiao Xi looked at everyone with disdain and sneered. “Miss Yu, don’t you have any manners?”","Yu Manting was furious. She shouted with widened eyes, “Who are you calling rude?! You b*tch, how dare you speak to me like this?!”","Qiao Xi replied casually, “Miss Yu, you forcefully barged into my private room, and you even intend to snatch my bracelet. How should I speak to you? I think I’ve already shown you enough respect.”","......","Was this the fiancee the Xia family had carefully selected? The Xia family was really harming many people!","“You sharp-tongued b*tch! You’re just relying on your good looks! How can you compare to me? Brother Jingting is just temporarily bewitched by you. He’ll realize my true value sooner or later!”","She was the fiancee recognized by Yin Jingting’s grandfather. When she became the young madam of the Yin family, everyone would look up to her with envy. However, this woman had seduced Brother Ting. No wonder Brother Jingting did not return to Shengdu. It turned out that he was tied down by this b*tch.","Yu Manting’s face was filled with resentment. She picked up the coffee on the coffee table and was about to splash it at Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi had already predicted her movements and quickly reversed the situation. The cup of rich coffee spilled all over Yu Manting’s body, and her white clothes were covered in brown coffee stains.","Everyone exclaimed and hurriedly wiped the coffee off Yu Manting’s body with a tissue. “Ting Ting, did you get scalded?!”","“B*tch! You dare to splash coffee on Ting Ting? Do you know how much Ting Ting’s clothes are worth? Even if you sell yourself, it won’t be enough for you to compensate!”","The makeup on Yu Manting’s face was already ruined as she glared at Qiao Xi with a ferocious expression. “Ah!!! B*tch! Kneel down and apologize immediately! Otherwise, I’ll absolutely not let you off!”","Qiao Xi was unwilling to pay attention to this group of women and still sat on the chair as if this group of people did not exist. Her indifferent appearance angered Yu Manting even more. She gnashed her teeth in anger. “If you’re not going to apologize, then give me the bracelet! Take it off immediately!”","From the moment Yu Manting saw the bracelet on Qiao Xi’s wrist, she was unable to control the anger in her heart. She wished for nothing more than to rush over and scratch Qiao Xi’s perfect face. She rushed over and tightly grabbed Qiao Xi’s wrist, causing Qiao Xi’s delicate skin to turn red.","“Tell me! What method did you use to get Brother Jingting to give you the bracelet?! You mistress! Do you know that I’m Brother Jingting’s fiancee?!”"]},{"number":884,"title":"Chapter 884 - Let’s See Who Dares To Touch Her","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold. “Let go! Don’t make me repeat myself.”","Yu Manting did not notice Qiao Xi’s gaze that was gradually turning cold at all. “You b*tch! How dare you seduce my man?! Did you sleep with him? B*tch! I’ll kill you!”","Qiao Xi felt a dull pain in her wrist. It turned out that Yu Manting wanted to forcefully snatch the jade bracelet from her wrist. This kind of bracelet was tight to the wrist, and forcefully taking it off would hurt the skin.","“You’re courting death!” Qiao Xi’s gaze sank, and her entire body emitted a chill as she abruptly grabbed Yu Manting’s hands.","Yu Manting’s eyes almost popped out as she muttered, “Take it off! You’re not worthy of wearing this bracelet. It’s mine!”","Soon, the commotion in the private room attracted the attention of the people outside. The manager rushed over and exclaimed when he saw Yu Manting, “So it’s Miss Yu!”","Yu Manting’s hair was stuck to her face, and her clothes were dirty. She looked disheveled as she pointed at Qiao Xi and roared, “This woman stole my bracelet and even splashed coffee on me! Get her to apologize to me immediately and give me the bracelet!”","The manager looked at Qiao Xi, who was sitting on the sofa. He only felt that she looked a little familiar. He did not know her identity, but Yu Manting was a socialite from Luo City. Although she had just arrived in Li City, she was not someone he could offend. Hence, he immediately walked in front of Qiao Xi and said unhappily, “Miss, please return the bracelet to her immediately.”","Qiao Xi glanced indifferently at the manager and grunted coldly. “Let’s check the surveillance footage and see who snatched whose bracelet.”","There were indeed surveillance cameras in the private room. The manager looked at Yu Manting’s expression and knew that this eldest miss was definitely not in the right. No matter who stole whose things, the bracelet could only belong to Miss Yu. Otherwise, she would not let the matter go.","The manager immediately put on a serious expression. “Why go through so much trouble? Before the matter blows up, return the bracelet to Miss Yu immediately. Otherwise, you’ll be the one losing face in the end.”","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes. She did not expect the manager of a Western restaurant under Gu Corporation to actually be such a petty person who did not know right from wrong and bullied the weak.","She glanced coldly at Yu Manting. She had never seen someone so self-righteous when snatching someone else’s things. The Xia family was really good at choosing people. They chose the most unbearable person from so many daughters.","Seeing that the manager was speaking up for her, Yu Manting became even more arrogant. She said in a commanding tone, “Little b*tch! Return the bracelet to me!”","Seeing that Qiao Xi was not moving, the manager was about to snatch it from her in order to please Yu Manting. However, before he could approach Qiao Xi, the door was suddenly pushed open.","Visit /Myb o x nove l. com/ to read, pls!","“Let’s see who dares to touch her.” A cold male voice sounded in everyone’s ears, causing them to tremble. The manager was about to turn around and scold, ‘Who’s so blind?’ When he turned around, he met those deep and cold eyes. He instantly broke out in a cold sweat. “M-Mr. Yin.”","Yin Jingting’s face darkened as his cold gaze landed on the manager. “What are you doing?”","The manager was so scared that his entire body trembled. The person in front of him was the next head of the Yin family. Now that this man was in charge of the Yin family’s company in Shengdu, offending Yin Jingting was equivalent to going against the entire Yin family.","During this period of time, Yu Manting had been so arrogant because she was the granddaughter-in-law recognized by Yin Jingting’s grandfather. Although Yin Jingting had not been in contact with the Xia family all these years, he was Old Master Xia’s biological grandson, after all. He could not disobey his elders, so he continued to endorse Yu Manting as his future granddaughter-in-law.","Seeing Yin Jingting’s dark face, the manager explained while trembling, “Mr. Yin, this woman stole Miss Yu’s belongings. I’m just getting the item back for her.”","Yin Jingting looked at Qiao Xi, who was sitting on the sofa. His expression gradually softened. However, when he looked at the manager again, his expression returned to being cold. “What did she snatch?”","The manager pointed at the bracelet on Qiao Xi’s wrist. “This bracelet. Miss Yu said it’s hers.”","Qiao Xi looked at Yin Jingting. He exuded the aura of a king. After not seeing him for a while, this cousin of hers seemed to have become more mature. His tone was indifferent. “What evidence do you have to prove that she stole it?”","The manager’s forehead was covered in sweat as he trembled in fear. “Miss Yu is a rich young miss. How could she malign this young lady? Moreover, this bracelet looks expensive. Only someone of her status is qualified to wear it.”","“You’re saying that Miss Qiao isn’t qualified to wear it?” Before Yin Jingting could finish, another male voice came from the door. Only then did Qiao Xi notice that there was a young man behind Yin Jingting."]},{"number":885,"title":"Chapter 885 - So, She’s Gu Zheng’s Woman","paragraphs":["The man’s eyes were long and narrow, making him look like a good-for-nothing. He glanced at Yu Manting in disdain. “Does Gu Zheng’s wife need to snatch Miss Yu’s bracelet? Are you looking down on President Gu or Gu Corporation?! I remember that this Western restaurant is under Gu Corporation, right?!","“Are you an employee of the Gu family or a dog by Miss Yu’s side? How much did Yu Manting give you to make you have the guts to go against Mrs. Gu?”","These words scared the manager so much that he almost fainted. Cold sweat trickled down his forehead. “No... I didn’t accept any money. I just...”","When Yu Manting saw Yin Jingting, she instantly looked shy. She immediately leaned forward and said weakly, “Brother Jingting, I knew you wouldn’t ignore me...”","Before she could finish, Yin Jingting distanced himself from her. The hedonistic son at the side smiled evilly and asked in a tone as if he was watching a joke, “Miss Yu, you said that Miss Qiao stole your bracelet?”","Yu Manting’s body suddenly stiffened. She was only focused on Yin Jingting and didn’t pay attention to what this man had said at all. She did not know Qiao Xi’s identity either. She immediately put on a weak appearance. “Brother Qin Chen, you also know that this bracelet represents the Yin family’s identity. I’m going to marry Brother Jingting in the future. This belongs to me. What right does this woman have to wear it? What’s wrong with me asking her to return it to me?”","Hearing Yu Manting’s words, Qin Chen’s lips curled into a mocking smile. “Miss Yu, you’re too naive. Jingting’s marriage isn’t something that Old Master Xia can decide.”","Yin Jingting frowned and glanced at Yu Manting in disgust. “Apologize to her!”","Yu Manting was shocked. “What? Brother Jinting, you want me to apologize to this woman? This bracelet belongs to me. So what if I want it back? She’s a b*tch! She’s a mistress! You can’t embarrass me in public for such a vixen!”","“You’re always talking about b*tches and mistresses. Is this how the Yu family educates their daughter?”","Yin Jingting’s calm tone was filled with disdain, making Yu Manting extremely embarrassed. “You... How could you do this to me? I went from Luo City to Shengdu for you, and now, I’m in Li City. However, you’re actually reprimanding me for this b*tch! I don’t want to live anymore! Boo-hoo...”","As she spoke, Yu Manting reached out and pounced on him. Yin Jingting grabbed her hands and threw her to the side mercilessly. “I’ll give you another chance. Apologize!”","Qin Chen’s expression was strange. The future head of the Yin family had always been expressionless. When had he ever gotten so angry? Now, he was actually angry in public with this woman. Could it be that Yin Jingting liked her? But she was already married, and she was Gu Zheng’s wife!","......","Yu Manting was not a noble daughter to begin with. After being treated like this by Yin Jingting, she cried without caring about her image. “I’m not apologizing! I’m your fiancee and the future young madam of the Yin family. Why should I apologize to a mistress who stole my husband?!”","Seeing that Yu Manting was so stubborn, Yin Jingting gestured to the man beside him. Qin Chen immediately understood and took out his phone to make a call. Soon, the Yu family fell into chaos.","Yu Manting’s face was pale as she said sorrowfully, “Brother Jingting, what’s so good about this woman? She can’t enter the Yin family at all. Only I have the right to be the young madam of the Yin family! No one can snatch my position!”","Crazy roars echoed in everyone’s ears. Qiao Xi could not help but sigh in her heart. This cousin of hers was really a calamity! It seemed that it was not a good thing for a man to be too good-looking.","The air was silent for a few seconds before Yin Jingting suddenly sneered. “Yu Manting, you’ve angered her, yet you still have hopes of entering the Yin family?”","The private room was silent as Yu Manting had stopped crying. Her face was as pale as paper. After a long time, she choked and said, “What do you mean?”","Yin Jingting did not respond. He turned to look at Qiao Xi. “Do you want her to apologize?”","Qiao Xi slowly stood up and waved her hand lazily. “Forget it. Even if she apologizes, she won’t mean it. Why force her?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng walked in with a gloomy expression. His entire body carried a murderous aura as he walked straight toward Qiao Xi and pulled her into his embrace. That intimate scene was enough to explain everything.","Yu Manting stared blankly at Gu Zheng’s handsome and cold face, then at their intimate posture. She instantly reacted and her breathing stopped. So, she was Gu Zheng’s woman!"]},{"number":886,"title":"Chapter 886 - Break One Of His Legs","paragraphs":["Qin Chen smiled. “Miss Yu, do you know who you’ve provoked?”","Yu Manting was furious. She pointed at Yin Jingting and shouted, “I love you so much! You’re not even willing to give me the bracelet, but you gave it to a married woman. She’s President Gu’s woman! Are you crazy?”","Yin Jingting really did not want to talk to Yu Manting. Qin Chen, who was at the side, went forward to stop this crazy woman. “Miss Yu, do you think others have to like you just because you like them? Besides, you should know that Jingting has already cut off all contact with the Xia family. It’s impossible for him to accept the woman Old Master Xia chose.”","If this woman really liked Yin Jingting, she should know about the grudge between the Xia and Yin families. However, Yu Manting actually naively thought that Yin Jingting would listen to that old man from the Xia family and Yin Jingting would marry her as long as Xia Cheng pressured him.","After Gu Zheng confirmed that Qiao Xi was safe and sound, he raised his eyes to look coldly at the manager. His voice was extremely cold. “Repeat what you just said. I want to see how you’ll malign Mrs. Gu.”","“President...” The manager broke out in a cold sweat. He knew that Yu Manting was being unreasonable, but she was the future young madam of the Yin family. He could not offend her, so he could only cooperate with Yu Manting to distort the truth. However, he did not expect this woman to be Mrs. Gu!","A trace of viciousness flashed past Gu Zheng’s deep eyes. “Take him away!”","Song Shijing instructed the bodyguards to grab the manager. He struggled weakly, his eyes filled with horror. “President, I was wrong. I shouldn’t have wronged Mrs. Gu. Please give me a chance. Please...”","Gu Zheng turned to look at Qiao Xi with eyes that were filled with affection. “Xi Xi, what do you think we should do with him?”","The manager’s heart instantly sank. He offended Mrs. Gu just now. If he let Mrs. Gu deal with him now, his outcome would only be worse. He was just about to beg for mercy when he heard Qiao Xi fall weakly into Gu Zheng’s embrace. She said delicately, “Ah Zheng, why would I deal with someone? I’m just a weak little woman! He didn’t mean to offend me. He just didn’t know my identity. It’s just that...”","Qin Chen blinked and looked at Yin Jingting meaningfully. It turned out that he liked such weak women!","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, the manager raised his eyes with hope. He had long known that Mrs. Gu’s character was gentle and weak, so she would definitely not be harsh with him.","Just as the manager thought that he had escaped a calamity, he heard Qiao Xi choke up. “But I feel really aggrieved! Why don’t we break his leg to punish him?! Don’t kill him, or I’ll be in big trouble.”","......","Gu Zheng said, “Mrs. Gu, you’re really beautiful and kind-hearted.”","The manager’s face twitched before he fainted in horror.","Qin Chen: “?” Was Gu Zheng’s brain working normally? Was this called beauty and kindness?","Yin Jingting smiled, then he thought of something and could not help but look at the trembling Yu Manting. Her face was pale, but she was still pretending to be calm. “That bracelet is mine. If you don’t give it to me, I’ll look for Grandpa Xia. He’ll definitely help me snatch it back!”","After saying those harsh words, Yu Manting was probably afraid as well. She ran out in a hurry. Everyone looked at each other and ignored her. Sooner or later, she would pay the price for today’s nonsense.","Yin Jingting slowly walked toward Qiao Xi and asked softly, “Are you injured?”","Qin Chen stood behind him, his gaze wandering between the three of them. Could one be so blatant when one was a mistress now? Moreover, Gu Zheng was calmly watching another man care about his wife?","Qiao Xi smiled and said, “I’m fine.”","Yin Jingting nodded, but a trace of ruthlessness flashed past his gentle eyes. “Don’t worry, I’ll take revenge for you.”","Yin Jingting must have had something to attend to as he turned around and left after saying that.","Qin Chen raised an eyebrow and said with a smile, “Miss Qiao, look at Jingting leaving in such a hurry. Actually, he was very worried about you. When he heard that Yu Manting was here to look for trouble with you, he abandoned the higher-ups in the meeting room and rushed over. He’s in a rush to leave now because he wants to go back and continue the meeting.”","With that, Qin Chen took out a business card and handed it to Qiao Xi. “Take it. My number is on it. You can look for me if you need anything. I’ll be there to assist you at any time.”","Gu Zheng frowned and looked unhappy. “There’s no need. I’ll protect Mrs. Gu.”","Qin Chen looked at Gu Zheng meaningfully. He could also understand Gu Zheng. No man would be happy if their wife was being coveted by others."]},{"number":887,"title":"Chapter 887 - He Likes Married Women","paragraphs":["Qin Chen placed the business card on the table and fled the private room without looking back. He caught up to Yin Jingting. “Jingting, aren’t you going too far by caring about Mrs. Gu in front of Gu Zheng?”","Yin Jingting glanced at him as if he was looking at a fool and got into the elevator.","Qin Chen had a serious expression. “Although we’re good friends, I have to remind you that Miss Qiao is already married. It’s not good for you to continue pestering her, right?! I admit that she’s indeed very beautiful. She’s the most beautiful woman I’ve ever seen, but...”","The two of them got off the elevator. Qin Chen was still nagging behind him, “You haven’t had a woman by your side all these years. I thought you had some hidden illness. It wasn’t easy for you to fall for someone, but you actually fell for Gu Zheng’s wife. You’re really good at choosing. You chose the most difficult woman in one go. Think about it carefully. Can you win against Gu Zheng?”","Yin Jingting looked up. “Qin Chen.”","Qin Chen met his deep eyes, and his heart trembled. “I’m saying all this for your own good. Don’t be angry!”","“I’m not angry. I just think that there’s something wrong with your brain. Find some time to get yourself checked.” With that, Yin Jingting got into the car and quickly drove away, leaving Qin Chen alone.","Who was the one who was crazy? Did it make sense for him to like a married woman, then? He even gave the Yin family’s heirloom bracelet to that woman. Speaking of which, was Yin Jingting the only one who had that bracelet?","He vaguely remembered that the Yin family had another jade bracelet that was in Old Madam Yin’s hands. He heard that it was for Xia Yunqiu. Unfortunately, Miss Xia died at a young age. Later on, Old Madam Yin said that she would leave it to Xia Yunqiu’s daughter, who was also Old Madam Yin’s granddaughter. He heard that the Yin family had already found this granddaughter who had been missing for many years.","If Qiao Xi’s bracelet was not given to her by Yin Jingting, then there was only one possibility. It was given to her by Old Madam Yin. Did that mean Qiao Xi was his younger sister?","The corners of Qin Chen’s mouth twitched slightly. No wonder Jingting said that Yu Manting could not enter the Yin family after offending Qiao Xi!","...","At the Xia family’s old residence.","......","Yu Manting was sobbing uncontrollably. Madam Yu said unhappily, “Old Master, it’s not that our Yu family is being unreasonable, but Jingting is too much of a bully. Our two families have already set the marriage contract. Manting will marry him sooner or later. How could he give the family bracelet to another woman?”","Xia Cheng frowned when he heard about the family bracelet.","Madam Yu was indignant. “Manting said that Jingting is especially good to that woman. He suspended an important meeting in the company for that woman and went all the way over there as he was afraid that she would suffer! Our Manting just wanted to defend her marriage, so she criticized that woman. Unexpectedly, Jingting actually spoke up for that woman and even asked Manting to apologize to her. Didn’t he embarrass Manting in public?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Mengyan helped Old Madam Xia over. When she heard their conversation, she was surprised. “Manting, you said that Brother Jingting has a woman outside?”","“Yes! I saw it with my own eyes. That woman’s surname is Qiao, and she’s involved with President Gu. Just because she has a good-looking face, she’s seducing men everywhere. She’s a vixen!” Yu Manting said through gritted teeth.","Surnamed Qiao?","A person could not help but appear in Xia Mengyan’s mind. Xia Cheng, who was at the side, seemed to have reacted as well. He was about to explain when he heard Xia Mengyan lean forward to comfort her. “Manting, Brother Jingting isn’t that kind of person. He might have gone there to look for you. How do you know that he went over for Miss Qiao?”","Yu Manting instantly beamed. “You’re right. Maybe Brother Jingting knows that I often go there, so he went to look for me. It’s just that he saw me arguing with that woman, so he reprimanded me.”","Xia Mengyan smiled gently. “Yes! That sounds more like Brother Jingting. He must know that Miss Qiao has President Gu backing her, so he couldn’t be biased toward you. He could only pretend to scold you in front of everyone. If he didn’t do that, Miss Qiao would’ve gotten President Gu to deal with you. You’d be the one suffering then.","“Brother Jingting reprimanded you, so even if Miss Qiao and President Gu wanted to punish you, they had no reason to! So I think you must have misunderstood him. He still has feelings for you.”","After Xia Mengyan finished speaking, she heard Yu Manting’s excited voice. “That’s right. Brother Jingting reprimanded me and even asked me to apologize, so President Gu couldn’t say anything after that. Meanwhile, the manager’s leg was broken. It seems that Brother Jingting really did it to protect me!”"]},{"number":888,"title":"Chapter 888 - Ignorance","paragraphs":["Hearing Xia Mengyan’s explanation, Madam Yu smiled. “Jingting is so meticulous! He thought up of such a way to protect Manting.”","Xia Cheng understood what Xia Mengyan meant and said, “In-law, you know that although Jingting didn’t grow up in the Xia family, we know him. He would never have an affair. Moreover, he’s even stricter with those close to him. This means that he already treats Manting as his wife.","“He rushed over from the company because he was afraid that Manting would be bullied. When he saw that Manting was at a disadvantage, he reprimanded her. He didn’t want President Gu to make a move.”","Yu Manting’s face turned red as she said delicately, “In that case, Brother Jingting likes me. He’ll definitely be willing to marry me. He’s just not saying it now.”","“That’s right.” Xia Cheng chuckled.","Then, Madam Yu and Yu Manting left in satisfaction. The two of them had just left when Xia Cheng’s expression suddenly darkened. He slammed the table. “Bastard!”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly comforted him. “Grandpa, don’t be so angry. Aunt Yunqiu passed away when she was young. Without anyone to discipline Xi Xi, she’s developed a stubborn and mischievous character. However, you’re Xi Xi’s grandfather. You can’t just watch her do whatever she wants.”","“Don’t think I don’t know what she’s up to! If she wants to ruin the marriage between the Yu family and us, she has to ask for my permission first! Yin Jingting is my grandson. I have to decide who he will marry!” Xia Cheng said fiercely.","“When I divorced that woman, I wanted to take Yunyi away, but she insisted on going against me. As Yunyi’s father, how could I harm him? Jingting is the future head of the Yin family and has a lot of wealth. He needs to marry a stupid woman to prevent people from coveting the Yin family’s assets. Why doesn’t Jingting understand my painstaking efforts?!”","Xia Mengyan shook her head helplessly. “It’s been so many years, but Brother Jingting still blames us. He thinks that Grandma ruined your marriage with Grandma Yin, so...”","At the mention of this matter, Old Madam Xia’s eyes turned cold. It had been decades, but she still could not get rid of her identity as a mistress. As long as the Yin family was still around, no one would dare to acknowledge her identity as the mistress of the Xia family.","“Mengyan, why did you hide it from Yu Manting?” Xia Cheng asked.","Xia Mengyan explained with a faint smile, “As the saying goes, the ignorant are not guilty. Manting doesn’t know Xi Xi’s identity, so the Yin family can’t blame her. If she finds out Xi Xi’s identity, she’ll anger the Yin family. At that time, how will she marry into the family?”","......","Xia Cheng nodded thoughtfully, thinking that Xia Mengyan’s words made sense.","“Mengyan, you have a lot of influence overseas. Now that you’re back in the country, you have to perform well and strive to make a name for yourself in the country. You’ll bring glory to the Xia family.”","Xia Mengyan revealed a confident smile. “I’m prepared to collaborate with Gu Corporation. President Gu is able to separate personal and work matters. He won’t delay the company’s development because of my misunderstanding with Xi Xi.”","...","In the private room of a Western restaurant.","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa with a cup of hot milk in her hand as she muttered, “The Xia family is really shameless. Xia Cheng clearly cheated on his first wife and abandoned his children. Now, he actually has the cheek to interfere in his grandson’s marriage? Where does he get his dignity from?!”","“Yin Jingting won’t marry Yu Manting. Xia Cheng’s plan will fail sooner or later. Yu Manting keeps saying that she’s the future young madam of the Yin family, but she has only met Yin Jingting a few times. If she hadn’t done many disgusting things, Yin Jingting would’ve forgotten who this woman is.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was indifferent, but he could not help but chuckle.","Yu Manting was really naive. How could the future head of the Yin family be controlled by others? He would not listen to Xia Cheng’s instructions to get married and have children. All of this was just her imagination.","Qiao Xi nodded. There was no love in Yin Jingting’s eyes when he looked at Yu Manting. They were clearly filled with disgust. Not to mention marrying her, he would even feel annoyed if he spoke to her.","“The Yu family is average in high society. Yu Manting has a bad temper and is stupid and irritable, but Old Master Xia likes this granddaughter-in-law a lot. Do you know why?” Gu Zheng asked casually.","“Because she’s stupid?” Qiao Xi asked.","Gu Zheng smiled. “That’s right. The future mistress of the Yin family he chose is a stupid woman who has close ties with the Xia family. This is a good thing for the Xia family. Xia Cheng is upset that he had to give up on the Yin family’s assets after the divorce, so he now wants to take advantage of this marriage to gain benefits from the Yin family.”"]},{"number":889,"title":"Chapter 889 - Gu Zheng Personally Cooks","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was stunned by Xia Cheng’s shamelessness. He originally relied on the Yin family’s wealth to make a name for himself. After he became established, he abandoned his first wife and children. Now, he still had the cheek to covet the Yin family’s assets? If it were not for her grandmother’s prompt decision to cut off all contact with the Xia family, the Xia family might have long trampled over the Yin family.","Just as Qiao Xi was feeling extremely angry in her heart, a pair of scorching palms suddenly grabbed her waist and pulled her into his embrace. His hot breath sprayed on her neck as his low voice sounded from behind her ear. “I won’t abandon you.”","The afternoon sun shone on the two of them through the window. Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes. Suddenly, the man approached and blocked the dazzling sunlight. His deep eyes were filled with affection, and his slightly cold lips moved slightly. “Not all men are like Xia Cheng. At the very least, I won’t like other women, nor will I let you suffer.”","Qiao Xi’s entire body stiffened while her heart thumped violently. She looked at the man in front of her and felt her eyes sting.","Gu Zheng said extremely seriously, “Xi Xi, I love you, so I won’t give myself any chance to get close to other women. I swear that I’ll only love you in this life. I’ll only have you.”","With that, he slowly lowered his head and pecked her lips.","“Gu Zheng!”","His slightly cold fingers pressed against Qiao Xi’s lips and gently rubbed them. After a long time, he slowly stood up. Qiao Xi fell weakly onto the sofa as if she had lost all her strength.","Gu Zheng smiled helplessly. “I only kissed you once, yet you already lost your strength. You’re too weak. You should train your body more. Otherwise, how can you withstand me?”","Qiao Xi’s face flushed red as she glared at Gu Zheng angrily. Her voice was filled with grievance. “What are you talking about?! It’s all because you bully me that I...”","Gu Zheng bent down and picked her up. “It’s my fault, Mrs. Gu. Don’t be angry anymore. Do you still have the strength? Do you want me to carry you away?”","Qiao Xi: “...” This was a Western restaurant. Gu Zheng wanted to carry her downstairs to the parking lot? They would meet many people along the way. If they saw her like this, how could she face others in the future?!","Qiao Xi jumped out of his arms angrily and held onto the table to steady herself. She walked unsteadily to the mirror. The woman in the mirror had limpid eyes and slightly red lips. It was obvious at a glance that the two of them had done something unspeakable in the room. What was even more infuriating was that Gu Zheng had unknowingly left a hickey on her neck. It was especially obvious on her fair skin.","......","Gu Zheng also noticed the mark on her neck. After a moment of silence, he said softly, “Wear a scarf. It’s a little cold outside.”","Qiao Xi glared angrily at the man in front of her, but Gu Zheng ignored her fierce gaze. He picked up the scarf on the table and put it on for her. “Are you hungry? Do you want to eat at home?”","Qiao Xi turned around with her cheeks puffed up and refused to talk to Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng’s face was still gentle. “I’ll cook. What do you want to eat?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise. Did she hear wrongly? Gu Zheng wanted to cook? She still vaguely remembered the dishes on Gu Zheng’s table.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Mrs. Gu, do you despise my cooking so much? In that case, let’s go home and do something meaningful.”","Qiao Xi’s face instantly flushed red. She knew what Gu Zheng meant. Ever since the two of them slept together, this bastard had always used such things to threaten her. Who would have thought that the cold and abstinent Gu Zheng would be so crazy in bed?","She suddenly remembered that the butler had said before that Gu Zheng had been studying recipes recently and even went to the kitchen often. The butler was still puzzled. Was the company doing too well recently? Was the president so bored that he wanted to learn how to cook?","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng with slight doubt. Could it be that she despised Gu Zheng’s cooking earlier and he kept it to heart, so he wanted to make up for his previous humiliation?","With an uneasy heart, Qiao Xi obediently followed Gu Zheng to the supermarket. Today, he specially gave the servants at home a break. He wanted to take advantage of the fact that everyone was not around to personally cook for Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi said in horror, “You don’t have to personally cook, right? We can eat in a restaurant.”","“Mrs. Gu, I’ve been studying recipes. I promise that the food this time will be delicious. Believe me, okay?”","Looking at Gu Zheng’s handsome face, Qiao Xi really could not bear to refuse. She could only follow him into the supermarket. The moment the two of them appeared, they immediately attracted many gazes."]},{"number":890,"title":"Chapter 890 - That Woman Must Be A Mistress","paragraphs":["At this time, there were many people in the supermarket. Gu Zheng was dressed in noble clothes and had a handsome face. He held Qiao Xi’s hand as they walked around the fruits and vegetable section. Everyone cast envious and probing gazes at him.","Not far away, a woman was on the phone. “What? He wants to work with Qingfeng Entertainment? Heavenly Voice Entertainment is already the top company in the industry. Why does President Gu still want to work with Qingfeng Entertainment? If he wants to work with Qingfeng Entertainment, won’t I have to give up half of my power?","“It’s okay. I want to see who’s in charge of Qingfeng. If it’s an obedient person, I can agree, but if it’s... Wait...”","The woman gasped and widened her eyes as she looked not far away. She said in disbelief, “I actually spotted President Gu in the supermarket!”","This woman was the director of Heavenly Voice Entertainment, Jiang Qin. All these years, Gu Zheng had always let Heavenly Voice Entertainment develop by itself and rarely interfered in the company’s matters. This time, however, he suddenly said that he wanted to collaborate with Qingfeng Entertainment. She felt that her status was being threatened, but who knew that she would meet Gu Zheng at the supermarket?","Qiao Xi was focused on buying groceries and was utterly unaware that someone was staring at them from behind. However, Gu Zheng was abnormally vigilant. He turned around but did not say anything.","Half an hour later, the two of them paid and were about to leave. Gu Zheng easily picked up two large bags. Qiao Xi hurriedly reached out to take them. “I’ll help you carry one. It’s too heavy.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was gentle. “Do you think I need your help? You’re looking down on your husband too much.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and smiled. Coincidentally, she passed by a couple. The woman had an envious expression. “Her boyfriend is handsome and considerate, but what about you? I bought so many things, but you’re not even helping me carry them.”","The guy snorted. “What’s there to be envious of? It’s easiest for a handsome and rich man to have an affair. He can’t be as devoted to you as I am. The woman beside him must be a mistress!”","The woman frowned. “How do you know that she’s a mistress? That woman is very beautiful! Her figure is also very good. Why can’t they be a couple?”","The guy retorted, “Look at that man’s clothes. He’s a big shot. Someone like him has servants in his house. How could he personally come to the supermarket to buy groceries? He must have come with this woman! That woman is secretly covering her face with a scarf. She must not be in a legitimate relationship!","“The watch on that man’s wrist is a limited edition ZR. It’s worth more than three million yuan. The clothes he’s wearing are probably not cheap either. Looking at this woman’s ordinary clothes, she’s definitely not a daughter of a noble family, so the two must be having an affair! Such a man will have an affair. You don’t have to be envious of others. If you’re with me, I’ll treat you well.”","......","With that, the guy even took a photo and posted it on Weibo with the caption: [So what if he’s rich and handsome? He still cheats.]","The woman looked at her boyfriend in shock. She suddenly felt that their values were not compatible. Why did she get together with him back then? He kept saying that he was good to her, but he refused to even help her carry a bag. As long as another guy was better than him, he would use all kinds of reasons to retort.","On the other hand, Jiang Qin, the director of Heavenly Voice Entertainment, watched Gu Zheng leave in a daze. That man was indeed President Gu, but who was the woman beside him? If she was Mrs. Gu, why would she cover half of her face with a scarf and wear sunglasses? She looked very mysterious. Could she be a mistress?","Jiang Qin seemed to have thought of something and took out her phone to take a photo of the two of them. If President Gu really had an affair, it meant that his feelings for Mrs. Gu were not sincere. If that was the case, Miss Xia would have a chance to rise up.","Miss Xia had given her a sum of money to help facilitate the collaboration. If she could help Miss Xia marry President Gu, Miss Xia would definitely remember her kindness. At that time, wouldn’t it be a small matter for her to completely control Heavenly Voice Entertainment?","Jiang Qin called the company’s technicians and asked them to find the guy’s Weibo account. She also hired fake commenters to make this Weibo post a trending topic.","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi did not know about this. After returning to Longwan Residential, they started preparing to cook. Gu Zheng took off his jacket, put on an apron, and rolled up his sleeves. He turned his head to look at the woman beside him. “Mrs. Gu, are you going to keep staring at me like this?”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with worry. She decided to stay in the kitchen and personally supervise Gu Zheng’s cooking for the sake of their health. It did not matter even if the food tasted bad. As long as she did not kiss Gu Zheng, her taste buds would not work."]},{"number":891,"title":"Chapter 891 - Husband And Wife Cooperation","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng looked at her meaningfully as if he had seen through her thoughts. He smiled sinisterly. “Mrs. Gu, it’s time to eat. Do you want me to give you a kiss?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Help!’","“Mrs. Gu, you used to like kissing me before dinner. Even when you were at work, you’d still go to Gu Corporation to ask for a kiss. Why don’t you want it today?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly as she complained in her heart. ‘Bastard! Don’t you know why I don’t want a kiss before dinner? You’re asking the obvious!’","However, she could not scold Gu Zheng, so she tried to persuade him. “Gu Zheng, you’re usually so busy with work. How can I trouble you to cook dinner? Why don’t I cook?”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Since cooking is so difficult, how can I let you cook?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with tears. “Ah Zheng, you’re a president who can earn hundreds of millions in minutes. How can I let you cook? You don’t have to cook in the future, alright?”","Gu Zheng paused and nodded. “Alright.”","Not long after, Gu Zheng prepared a table full of dishes. Qiao Xi had stared at Gu Zheng from the beginning until the end. From the moment he washed the dishes until now, she had watched every step carefully. There seemed to be no problem. Moreover, every dish looked very tempting.","At this moment, the dining room of Longwan Residential was very quiet. The sky was gradually turning dark. Gu Zheng set the cutlery and looked at his wife opposite him with gentle eyes. “Mrs. Gu, do you still need a kiss before dinner?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes stared fixedly at the dishes on the table. No matter if it was the color or the fragrance, they were all very tempting. The dishes from last time were the same, but they were extremely difficult to swallow.","For the sake of preventing her from losing her composure in front of Gu Zheng, Qiao Xi said without the slightest hesitation, “No need.”","Gu Zheng snorted, picked up a bite of food, and put it in his mouth. He chewed carefully. “Mrs. Gu, you’ll regret it.”","......","Qiao Xi observed his expression, but he was still expressionless as usual, making it impossible to determine if this dish was delicious or not.","As she had not eaten lunch, Qiao Xi was really hungry. She picked up a piece of meat and put it in her mouth. It seemed that she had not eaten tasteless food for a long time, so she was not quite used to it. She barely filled her stomach before putting down her chopsticks.","Gu Zheng ate elegantly. Not long after, there were not many dishes left on the plate. Gu Zheng stood up and went to the kitchen to cut some fruit. He even poured a cup of tea for Qiao Xi. While he was close to her, he bent down and kissed her lips.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds before gradually tasting the remaining taste in her mouth. It was not as bad as she had expected. Instead, a delicious taste appeared.","No way? Gu Zheng’s cooking was so delicious?","Looking at Qiao Xi’s dazed appearance, Gu Zheng raised his eyebrows. “Mrs. Gu, I told you you’d regret it.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise as she looked at the empty plates on the table. Her eyes were filled with regret. Coincidentally, there was still a piece of meat on her plate. She picked it up excitedly and placed it in her mouth. “Ah Zheng, can you still cook for me in the future?”","Qiao Xi’s regretful appearance was probably too cute. Gu Zheng deliberately teased her and said arrogantly, “I’m usually very busy with work. I can earn hundreds of millions in minutes. How can I waste my time cooking? I probably won’t cook anymore.”","Qiao Xi suddenly reacted. Wasn’t this what she had just said? She leaned forward with a flattering expression. “I was joking just now. Actually, I really like your cooking.”","“Mrs. Gu, you said that you wouldn’t let me cook anymore, so I won’t cook anymore.” Gu Zheng looked calm.","Qiao Xi glared at him angrily. This bastard just had to make her angry.","After clearing up the table, Gu Zheng sat on the sofa and slowly said, “Let’s talk about serious matters. There’s an entertainment company under Gu Corporation called Heavenly Voice Entertainment. Their development direction is in film and television dramas, while Qingfeng Entertainment focuses on various programs and online dramas.”","Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes as she recalled the deliciousness of the braised pork. “I know! But what does Qingfeng Entertainment have to do with us?”","Gu Zheng glanced at her and chuckled. “Mrs. Gu, I’m not only your senior but also your husband. There are some things that you don’t have to hide from me. I know everything anyway.”","His eyes were filled with smiles, and his tone was teasing but filled with gentleness. Qiao Xi’s heart thumped. How did he know that Qingfeng Entertainment was her company?","“Qingfeng’s and Heavenly Voice’s development has already reached its peak. It’s very difficult for them to make another breakthrough. We need to change the current situation, so do you want to work together, Mrs. Gu?”"]},{"number":892,"title":"Chapter 892 - Lost Memories","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng smiled lightly. “Mrs. Gu, how about I invest in you? I definitely won’t let you suffer. As long as you’re willing to hand me a satisfactory proposal within a week, I’ll give you a satisfactory sum of assets.”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment and asked in a light voice, “Do you think I lack money?”","Although Qingfeng Entertainment was not as famous as Heavenly Voice Entertainment, it was still a top presence in the entertainment industry. It made a name for itself with all kinds of interesting variety shows and was unparalleled in the variety industry. However, the boss behind Qingfeng Entertainment was very mysterious. No one would have thought that the boss behind Qingfeng Entertainment was a 20-year-old lady.","“Mrs. Gu, I wish to work with you because of your ability. I want you to manage Heavenly Voice Entertainment. I think you’ll definitely give me a surprise.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds as she stared at Gu Zheng in surprise. The investment he was talking about earlier was not real money but shares of Heavenly Voice Entertainment. Qiao Xi was just about to refuse when Gu Zheng spoke again, “Actually, this company was yours to begin with. It’s time to hand it to you.”","“What do you mean?” Qiao Xi blinked with a puzzled expression.","“Do you still remember that many years ago, we were talking on the phone one time and you sang a song for me? It was the best song I had ever heard in my life. It was like the sound of nature and had the innocence of a young girl. Unfortunately, I hadn’t met you then. After I founded Gu Corporation and had enough assets, I founded Heavenly Voice Entertainment. At that time, I thought that if I could meet you one day, I would definitely hand Heavenly Voice Entertainment to you to manage. It’s because of you that I founded Heavenly Voice Entertainment.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled as she carefully searched for that memory in her mind. She actually had no impression of it at all. It felt as though something was missing in her heart. The more she thought about it, the more her head hurt.","“Xi Xi, there are some things I don’t know how to say. You just need to remember that I love you. No matter when or where, we would’ve ended up meeting anyway. We’re fated.”","Why was Gu Zheng so sure? She kept feeling that she had forgotten something, and Gu Zheng said that she had sung to him before. Had she forgotten, or did Gu Zheng remember wrongly?","Qiao Xi’s mind buzzed, and the discomfort in her body caused her to be unable to continue thinking. At this moment, Gu Zheng said gently, “Xi Xi, what happened in the past doesn’t matter anymore. You just have to remember that I’ll always be by your side. I’ll never leave you.”","Then, Gu Zheng stroked her head affectionately and teased, “Mrs. Gu, if you’re not full, I can make you supper tonight.”","Qiao Xi abruptly recovered from her shock and asked with a smile, “You just said that you wouldn’t enter the kitchen anymore!”","......","Gu Zheng slowly approached her and pinched her smooth and fair cheek. He smiled and said clearly, “I can toss aside all my principles as long as it’s for you, Mrs. Gu. It’s my honor that you like my cooking. I can cook for you for the rest of my life. As long as you like something, I’ll be sure to learn it and won’t fail.”","He had already learned how to cook. Now, he could start learning how to play the zither.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi felt dizzy. It was clearly only seven o’clock, but she was already so sleepy that she could not open her eyes. After Gu Zheng carried her upstairs, she fell asleep as soon as she lay down. In her confusion, something seemed to surge into her mind. Her temples were throbbing. An unfamiliar scene appeared in front of her eyes. Then, a loud bang sounded in her ears. The sky instantly darkened and was dyed red.","Ring ring ring...","Qiao Xi was awakened by the ringing of her phone. She abruptly stood up, her forehead covered in sweat. The curtains in the bedroom were dark, and Gu Zheng was quietly sitting on the chair with his eyes lowered like a statue.","She knew that his vision was definitely dark at this moment. Qiao Xi hurriedly stood up and turned on the lights. A trace of light appeared in the man’s eyes as he raised his eyes slightly to look at her.","Qiao Xi’s heart ached as she asked anxiously, “Why didn’t you turn on the lights?”","“I didn’t want to disturb your sleep. Moreover, I’ve long gotten used to the dark.” Gu Zheng’s eyes gradually recovered their clarity as he shifted his gaze to the phone.","Qiao Xi hurriedly picked up her phone to take a look. It was Qin An. Qin An must have something urgent considering how he gave her a call at this hour. She hurriedly picked up the phone and called back. “Third Brother, what’s wrong?”","“Little Six!” Qin An’s voice was filled with coldness. “Where’s Gu Zheng?”","Qiao Xi responded, “Huh?” Was there something wrong with this person? He was looking for her husband in the middle of the night?"]},{"number":893,"title":"Chapter 893 - He’s A Jerk!","paragraphs":["Qin An was furious. “Tell me where he is! I’ll poison him right now!”","Qiao Xi: “??”","Qin An gritted his teeth in anger. “Little Six, quickly take a look at the trending topics on Weibo. They suddenly trended an hour ago. I don’t know who did what behind the scenes, but no matter who did it, it’s a fact that Gu Zheng is a scumbag!”","Because Qin An’s voice was too loud, Gu Zheng, who was at the side, also heard it clearly. He could not help but look at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes in embarrassment and hurriedly jumped onto the bed. She went to the other side to pick up her earphones and plugged them in. Only then did she heave a sigh of relief. She lowered her voice and said, “I’ll take a look now. Calm down first.”","She opened Weibo and indeed saw that the trending topics were marked with Gu Zheng’s name. Qiao Xi instantly frowned when she clicked on one of the topics.","[The president of Gu Corporation, Gu Zheng, was shopping in the supermarket with a mysterious woman. The two of them were intimate. Less than a year after they got married, Mrs. Gu was abandoned!]","There was a photo of Gu Zheng holding her hand and the two of them shopping in the supermarket.","Qiao Xi: “???” ‘Isn’t this me?’","Qin An shouted anxiously, “The woman in the photo is wearing a scarf to cover her face and sunglasses even though she’s just shopping in the supermarket. She must be a small-time celebrity. She’s afraid of being caught being a mistress, so she tried to disguise herself! Little Six, don’t worry. I’ll kill that bastard right now and settle the score with him. I’ll definitely make this adulterous pair pay a painful price!","“Gu Zheng’s hand was on that woman’s waist, and he was even smiling at her. Does he still care about you, the legitimate Mrs. Gu?","“That woman must be very ugly. Otherwise, why would she cover her face with a scarf? Her fashion sense is so bad. She has no taste at all. With her figure, how does she have the cheek to be a mistress? Leave that scumbag Gu Zheng now. I’ll help you look for a better man. I’ll definitely find someone who’ll be loyal to you!”","......","Qiao Xi said, “Let me explain—”","Qin An interrupted Qiao Xi and said righteously, “Little Six, I absolutely won’t let that adulterous pair bully you! I’ll get someone to investigate who that woman is. I’ll get someone from Ling Pavilion to capture that woman and make her kneel in front of you to apologize!”","Qiao Xi said nervously, “Wait—”","“I know you like Gu Zheng, but he has already cheated on you. If he really cared about you, he wouldn’t have gone shopping with other women so brazenly!”","Qiao Xi was silent for a few seconds before she suddenly asked, “Third Brother, you said that woman’s figure isn’t good, so she must be very ugly?”","Qin An replied without hesitation, “She’s definitely very ugly. Otherwise, why would she cover her face?! She’s definitely not as good-looking as you. You have to be confident!”","Actually, to be fair, Qin An felt that this woman’s figure was not bad. Her appearance wouldn’t be too bad if Gu Zheng had taken a liking to her. However, as Qiao Xi’s brother, how could he tell the truth? He would definitely curse the mistress with his sister! Principles were not important at all!","Unexpectedly, the other end of the phone fell silent. Qin An gulped. “Little Six?”","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi asked in a strange tone, “Third Brother, don’t you think this woman looks a little familiar? Like we’ve seen her somewhere before?”","Qin An scratched his head. “She does look a little familiar. Who is she?”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “The person who used a scarf to cover her face and brazenly went to the supermarket with Gu Zheng is me!”","Qin An: “...”","His mind exploded as his ears buzzed. After a long time, he came back to his senses. His voice trembled slightly. “That woman is you?”","Qiao Xi nodded and glanced at Weibo. Her expression instantly darkened. “I saw the guy who posted it when I was in the supermarket.”","She and Gu Zheng had only gone shopping in the supermarket. Moreover, they were not celebrities. Even so, someone actually took a photo of them and posted it online. She was even mistaken for a mistress.","She and Gu Zheng did not hold a wedding after they got married. Netizens knew that Gu Zheng was married, but they had never seen who Mrs. Gu was. It was really one-sided to conclude that Gu Zheng had an affair just based on this photo.","On the other end of the phone, Qin An was still regretting it. He asked while trembling, “Are you angry with me?”","“I’m not angry with you, but some people’s methods make me unhappy. They actually used such a stupid method to deal with Gu Zheng. I really pity their IQ.”","Not long after, Gu Corporation’s official account released a clarification message."]},{"number":894,"title":"Chapter 894 - The President’s Gift","paragraphs":["Gu Corporation’s official account stated: [Hello, netizens. Let’s make it clear that the people in the photo are our president and Young Madam. Someone deliberately said that they were having an affair, so we’ve already sent a lawyer’s letter to the person who slandered the president and Young Madam. Please treat this matter rationally and not say anything baseless.]","Actually, Qiao Xi did not care about this matter. At this moment, she was more concerned about something else. She hurriedly asked, “Third Brother, did I leave you for a period of time when I was young?”","Qin An thought about it carefully. “Of course! You’ve always liked to run around since you were young. You were too young in the past, so I was worried. When you grew up, I wasn’t as strict with you anymore. You could learn whatever you liked, so you would be away from us for longer periods of time. I don’t know which time you’re talking about.”","Qiao Xi continued to ask, “Was there a time when I acted a little strangely after coming back as though I lost my memory?”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Gu Zheng, who was sitting on the chair, slowly raised his eyes and looked over.","Qin An replied without hesitation, “Lost your memory? How is that possible? If you lost your memory, we would definitely know!”","Qiao Xi only felt a dull pain in her heart. The scene that appeared in her dream just now felt terrifyingly real. Was it really just a dream or was it a trace of memory in her mind? However, Third Brother would not lie to her. If Third Brother said no, then it was either nothing had happened or he did not know the truth.","After hanging up, Qiao Xi suddenly smelled a fragrance as she lay on the bed. She raised her eyes and saw that Gu Zheng was holding a tray in his hand. There was a bowl of seafood porridge and two plates of side dishes on it. He placed the tray on the table and carried the bowl to the bed. He scooped a mouthful of porridge and blew on it before bringing it to Qiao Xi’s mouth. She habitually opened her mouth, and the warm porridge entered her mouth with the fresh smell of seafood. Her entire body instantly warmed up.","“We were photographed at the supermarket?” Gu Zheng asked softly.","Qiao Xi suddenly frowned and pouted unhappily. “If you hadn’t messed around in the private room, would I have worn a scarf and sunglasses? I wouldn’t have been mistaken for a mistress either.”","She looked aggrieved and said sweetly, “They all said that I’ve been abandoned. They said that Mrs. Gu is an abandoned wife of a rich family. They even said that we’re already divorced and anyone has a chance to be Mrs. Gu.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as the corners of his lips curled up. “Don’t care about those rumors.”","Qiao Xi frowned. “How can I not care? Actually, I don’t care what they say about me. It’s just that I can’t stand them saying that you cheated on me. You clearly love me so much and can’t bear for me to suffer at all, but you were called a scumbag. Even my third brother was so angry that he said he wanted to poison you.","......","“They’re clearly jealous that you’re handsome and rich. They’ll magnify your mistakes no matter what. However, they don’t know how much effort you’ve put in behind the scenes. They think that all your current achievements are because you’re the son of the Gu family.”","Qiao Xi was indignant on his behalf, but Gu Zheng didn’t care. He said indifferently, “They’re just some netizens who listen to rumors. You don’t have to be angry because of this. Those who hate me will hate me no matter how I explain it. Those who like me won’t slander me because of rumors, so there’s no need to explain. Don’t read this useless information either. It’ll affect your mood.”","“But—”","“Xi Xi.” Gu Zheng interrupted her with a smile. “Those are all strangers who we’ve never met. It doesn’t matter what they think of us. To them, we’re just a topic of conversation. Before long, they’ll have new topics to talk about.”","Gu Zheng glanced at his phone and said softly, “Rest after you’re done eating. I have a meeting tomorrow morning and can’t accompany you to Heavenly Voice’s headquarters, but I’ve already prepared a gift. I believe you’ll like it.”","Other men might have given her a ring and a bouquet of flowers, but Gu Zheng was simple and crude. He gave her an entire company. Indeed, even a domineering president was so generous.","When Heavenly Voice Entertainment was first established, Gu Zheng had said that this company belonged to a friend. It was just temporarily under Gu Corporation’s name and would be returned to her when that friend returned. The company had been developing very well all these years. They thought that since it was handed to Gu Zheng’s younger brother, Gu Yao, to manage, it probably would not be returned to that friend.","However, no one expected that not long after the new year, Gu Zheng would announce that Heavenly Voice Entertainment would leave Gu Corporation and merge with Qingfeng Entertainment. At that time, the new president would appear to handle all the matters of the two companies. This news shocked the entire entertainment industry. It was unprecedented for two top entertainment companies in the country to merge."]},{"number":895,"title":"Chapter 895 - She’s The President?","paragraphs":["When Qiao Xi opened her eyes, Gu Zheng had already gone to work. She stood up and went downstairs. After breakfast, she went to Qingfeng Entertainment to meet the person in charge, Li Jiang.","“Mr. Li, I’m going to Heavenly Voice first before returning to Qingfeng to handle the relevant matters.”","Li Jiang replied respectfully, “Yes! Boss, there’s something...”","He hesitated for a moment, and Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows as she asked, “What’s wrong?”","“A woman came to the company this morning and said that she’s your friend. She seems to think that she’s the president. I wanted to explain things to her, but she didn’t listen at all. She already went to Heavenly Voice Entertainment.”","Qiao Xi asked in confusion, “Xue Yi? Or Li Xing’er?”","Li Jiang thought carefully. “I’ve seen both of them before. I don’t know the lady who came today, and she didn’t reveal her identity.”","It was not Xue Yi or Li Xing’er. It was someone Li Jiang did not know. Qiao Xi could not think of anyone else for a while. “Forget it, I’ll go see what’s going on.”","After that, Qiao Xi stood up and left. She drove to Heavenly Voice Entertainment. She was very curious about what kind of surprise Gu Zheng had prepared for her and who the woman who claimed to be the president was.","An hour ago, in the Xia family’s residence.","“Mengyan, you said that when you were overseas, you were good friends with Qingfeng’s Mr. Li Jiang?” Xia Cheng rushed over and asked excitedly.","Xia Mengyan was sitting on the sofa and drinking tea. She replied hesitantly, “Actually, I’m not familiar with Mr. Li, but I’m very close to Qingfeng’s boss.”","No one knew who the boss behind Qingfeng was. No one could verify it, so they naturally would not know that she was lying. As long as she could forge connections to Qingfeng Entertainment, she would definitely receive preferential treatment in the country.","......","Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia asked in surprise, “Mengyan, then do you know Heavenly Voice Entertainment that’s under President Gu’s name?”","At the mention of Gu Zheng, Xia Cheng and Old Madam Xia’s expressions were a little strange. Such an outstanding man actually married the daughter of their rebellious daughter, Xia Yunqiu. It just so happened that Qiao Xi had nothing to do with the Xia family and would not bring benefits for the Xia family at all. However, if Mengyan married Gu Zheng, then it would be different for the Xia family.","When Xia Mengyan heard this, she replied with a faint smile, “Of course, I know! Heavenly Voice Entertainment is the most famous entertainment company in the country.”","A trace of hope appeared on Xia Cheng’s face. “Yesterday, President Gu suddenly announced that Heavenly Voice Entertainment will be separated from Gu Corporation and merged with Qingfeng Entertainment. He said that he wants to hand over both entertainment companies to one person to manage. That person is related to the president of Qingfeng Entertainment, but that person hasn’t appeared yet. I’ve been thinking for a long time. Could it be that the person he’s talking about is you?”","Xia Mengyan’s heart skipped a beat, and her expression froze. “No, that’s impossible. Xi Xi and I have a conflict, and Xi Xi is President Gu’s wife, after all. President Gu probably won’t let me be the president.”","“Mengyan, you can’t think that way.” Xia Cheng looked proud. “President Gu has always been clear about public and private matters. What he values is not interpersonal relationships but personal ability. Moreover, since he wanted the two companies to merge, he definitely would’ve discussed it with the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. That president might have recommended you. Moreover, President Gu might not even know that the person the president behind the scenes recommended is you. Perhaps he just heard that you’re a good friend of Qingfeng’s president.”","Xia Mengyan was so excited that her face turned red. Grandpa was right. Rumor had it that she was good friends with the president of Qingfeng Entertainment, but President Gu probably did not know about it. He only decided to leave this position to the president’s friend. Even if President Gu found out in the future, he could not go back on his word.","Sometimes, miracles would happen. Moreover, no one had stood up to say that they were the president, so it was very likely that the person was her.","Xia Mengyan’s breathing quickened. “But Gu Corporation didn’t call me. Maybe...”","“President Gu said that this was a surprise for that person, so he definitely wouldn’t have informed you in advance. He must have wanted to let you guess.” Xia Cheng was all smiles.","His granddaughter was smart and beautiful. He wanted to let that woman from the Yin family see that only the Xia family could nurture such outstanding talents. They should not have left the Xia family back then, and Qiao Xi had no right to be compared to Mengyan.","When Xia Mengyan heard Xia Cheng’s words, a trace of hope surged in her heart. She knew that she was not the friend of the president of Qingfeng Entertainment, but she still wanted to deceive herself. She did not want to give up this rare opportunity."]},{"number":896,"title":"Chapter 896 - Mocked","paragraphs":["A trace of greed appeared in Xia Mengyan’s eyes. If she could become the president of the two entertainment companies, not only would she quickly establish herself in Li City and be able to use her current resources to develop her studio, but she would also be able to get closer to President Gu.","She smiled and hurriedly went upstairs to change. She went to Heavenly Voice Entertainment in a glamorous manner. She was the eldest daughter of the Xia family. Not only did she know the director of Heavenly Voice Entertainment, but she was also a friend of the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. She was also an internationally renowned designer, Sally. No one was more suitable than her to be the president.","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi had already arrived at Heavenly Voice Entertainment. As soon as she entered, everyone’s gazes landed on her. “Is she a new artist signed by the company? She’s quite beautiful. Who brought her here?”","“You don’t know her?! Look at her clothes. She can’t be a small celebrity who just debuted. She’s President Gu’s wife!”","“What’s Mrs. Gu doing in the company? Today is the day of the merger between Heavenly Voice and Qingfeng. The president will be here soon. We don’t have time to serve this lady!”","A woman sneered. “What’s the use of being good-looking? I heard that President Gu went to the supermarket with another woman yesterday. Isn’t this equivalent to having an affair?”","“That night, Gu Corporation released a clarification message. They said that the woman was Mrs. Gu, but no one believes it at all. If it really was her, why did she wear a scarf and sunglasses? She was so secretive. She was clearly hiding something! I knew that President Gu was only bewitched by her for a moment. After a long time, he lost his interest in her.”","“A rich madam like her should be drinking tea and playing cards at home. Why is she here in the company? Does she know how to run an entertainment company? Could it be that she knows that President Gu has given the company to someone else, so she’s here to cause trouble?”","“Shh... Lower your voice. Don’t let her hear you. No matter what, she’s Mrs. Gu. If we anger her, we’ll suffer!”","“So what? President Gu doesn’t like her anymore. If she causes a scene in the company, the two of them might get a divorce. At that time, do we still have to be afraid of her? Moreover, do you know who the president is? I think she won’t be able to be Mrs. Gu for long.”","“Heh! That’s right! If she dares to cause trouble, we’ll get Director Jiang to chase her out!”","......","The discussion entered Qiao Xi’s ears. Her expression was indifferent, and the corners of her mouth curled into a cold smile. How was Gu Yao managing this company?! The employees had time to gossip and were not focused on work. Looking at the work IDs on their clothes, it showed that the employees were from the public relations department.","Qiao Xi sat on the sofa in the hall and quietly waited for Gu Yao. Suddenly, loud footsteps slowly sounded. Qiao Xi raised her eyes and saw a cold-looking woman in a beige suit walking toward her. Her eyes were filled with disdain and annoyance.","She had the work ID of an employee of the public relations department on her. Qiao Xi knew that this was probably the legendary Director Jiang. She kept feeling that this director looked a little familiar. When she took a closer look, it turned out that they had met at the supermarket yesterday. Moreover, this woman had been secretly following them. She did not take her words that day to heart at all. Unexpectedly, this person was actually the director of the public relations department of Heavenly Voice Entertainment.","Jiang Qin walked aggressively in front of Qiao Xi and asked impatiently, “Mrs. Gu, why are you here?”","A trace of coldness flashed past Qiao Xi’s eyes as she said casually, “I’m here to work.”","When Director Jiang heard this, she could not help but sneer. “Mrs. Gu, you’re here to work? There’s no suitable position for you here. Mrs. Gu, are you here today for Qingfeng Entertainment?”","At the mention of Qingfeng Entertainment, everyone could not help but look over. They were all filled with mockery.","Jiang Qin snorted. “Mrs. Gu, are you trying to say that you’re the president sent by Qingfeng Entertainment? Although you’re Mrs. Gu, the company has to be handed to someone capable. Do you think you have the ability to manage it? Heavenly Voice is a large entertainment company. Not just anyone can work here.”","Qiao Xi supported her chin and was not angry. Her tone was still indifferent. “The company does need to be handed to someone capable. Since you said so, Director Jiang, then immediately pack your things and go to the human resources department to get your salary for this month.”","Jiang Qin’s expression was gloomy. Qiao Xi actually mocked her for being incapable and saying that she shouldn’t be in Heavenly Voice. However, she entered the company through the formal recruitment process. It was not easy for her to become the director after so many years of hard work. Just because she was Mrs. Gu, Qiao Xi actually wanted to rise to the top and directly become the company’s president?"]},{"number":897,"title":"Chapter 897 - The Best Person","paragraphs":["Jiang Qin could not stand Qiao Xi to begin with. Yesterday’s affair and Xia Mengyan’s arrival at the company today proved that President Gu no longer liked her. He might abandon her one day.","Moreover, Jiang Qin had already latched onto Xia Mengyan. No matter how she looked at the situation, she felt that Qiao Xi was a good-for-nothing who only knew how to drink tea and admire flowers, so she became even more arrogant.","“Mrs. Gu, you should know that the position of the president was reserved for a friend of President Gu’s. That person is the friend of the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. If you snatch the position, won’t you be slapping President Gu’s face?","“After the two companies merge, the president will be in charge of all matters. This position concerns the company’s future development. Of course, we can’t casually hand it to someone. I believe that even if President Gu comes, he won’t let you do as you please. Moreover, the real president has already arrived. Do you still want to use your identity as Mrs. Gu to chase that person away?”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with disdain. Miss Xia was already here, yet Mrs. Gu still had the cheek to come and snatch the position. She was really overestimating herself. She did not even have the ability. What right did she have to fight with Miss Xia?","“If we rely on our connections to get to where we are, then there’s no need for us to open a company anymore. It’s not fair to people like us who relied on our own hard work to survive. After all, who would be willing to work hard for a company like that?”","“That’s right! We were all selected to work at Heavenly Voice, so we’re naturally more capable than Mrs. Gu. If you say you’re the president, we can say the same too!”","Looking at the agitated crowd, Jiang Qin smiled in satisfaction. “Miss Xia is the best candidate to be the president. Mrs. Gu, if you don’t want to be embarrassed, you’d better leave quickly. Don’t wait for President Gu to personally chase you away. You’ll lose all your dignity then.”","Qiao Xi heard the words ‘Miss Xia’ from her mouth and was suddenly stunned. Could it be that this Miss Xia was the person Li Jiang was talking about?","“Mrs. Gu!” Jiang Qin looked unhappy and gradually lost her patience. She shouted, “I’m addressing you as ‘Mrs. Gu’ today to save you some dignity. Now that President Gu has lost his interest in you, he might divorce you one day. I advise you to be more obedient. President Gu will give you a sum of money on account of your past relationship so that you won’t have to worry about food and clothing for the rest of your life. If you insist on making a scene here, you might not get a single cent!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched as a small flame ignited in her heart. What bullsh*t handover ceremony was this? Was this the surprise Gu Zheng was talking about?","She said coldly, “Director Jiang, even if Gu Zheng and I divorce, I’ll still get half of the assets. As the boss of half of Gu Corporation, am I still unqualified to deal with you?”","With that, she picked up her phone and sent Gu Yao a message before walking toward the elevator. Seeing that she was about to go upstairs, Jiang Qin shouted in exasperation, “You’re Mrs. Gu today, but you’ll be chased out of the house tomorrow! You’re hoping to get President Gu’s assets? Dream on!”","......","“Director Jiang.” At this moment, a gentle female voice sounded. She slowly walked in front of everyone and said softly, “It’s natural for Mrs. Gu to come to Heavenly Voice Entertainment. She’s here to inspect the work on behalf of President Gu. If Mrs. Gu has really taken a liking to Heavenly Voice, it means that Heavenly Voice is capable and can catch Mrs. Gu’s eye.”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes and met Xia Mengyan’s provocative eyes. She understood in her heart. It was her!","Xia Mengyan greeted the people around her, then walked in front of Qiao Xi and smiled lightly. “Cousin, are you going to run for the position of president? But I’ve already officially taken over. You must be doing this on a whim. After all, you don’t have the time to manage such a large company.”","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes and curled the corners of her mouth. “Miss Xia, who asked you to take over?”","Hearing this, everyone immediately gasped. Jiang Qin was even angrier. “The person who asked Miss Xia to take over the position is President Gu! It was President Gu who personally gave the order. Moreover, he said that all matters would be handed to the president. He asked us to listen to Miss Xia’s orders. Miss Xia was sent by the president of Qingfeng Entertainment and is famous overseas. Of course, she’s the most qualified person to be the president!”","Xia Mengyan could not help but blush. “Director Jiang, I’m not as outstanding as you say, but I promise everyone that I’ll do my best to manage the two companies after I take office. I’ll make Heavenly Voice and Qingfeng better.”"]},{"number":898,"title":"Chapter 898 - Young Master Gu Is Angry","paragraphs":["The current situation was that the two of them were fighting for the position of president. Jiang Qin almost did not hesitate to choose Xia Mengyan’s side. After all, Mrs. Gu was already an abandoned wife. However, Miss Xia was President Gu’s new favorite. Not only was she capable, but she was also the daughter of the Xia family and a friend of the president of Qingfeng. She might even be President Gu’s second wife in the future, so of course, she had to help Xia Mengyan.","When Qiao Xi heard the words ‘President Qingfeng’, she smiled meaningfully. “Oh! Miss Xia, so you’re a friend of the president of Qingfeng Entertainment!”","Xia Mengyan smiled and replied, “Yes, I met the president of Qingfeng Entertainment overseas. He’s a very outstanding senior and has taught me many things. He can be considered my master.”","Jiang Qin praised her proudly, “The president of Qingfeng Entertainment has always been mysterious. All these years, only Miss Xia has seen him. She’s very close to him and even learned a lot from him. But what do you know, Mrs. Gu? Do you know the president too?”","Qiao Xi said, “Yes, we’re very familiar with each other.”","“Keep bragging! Miss Xia said that she knows the president of Qingfeng Entertainment, so you’re now saying that you know him too. Looks like you’re determined to snatch this position today, huh?”","At this moment, Gu Yao was already standing at the door, looking extremely nervous. “I can’t embarrass Gu Zheng or Qiao Xi. I’m the vice president of Heavenly Voice Entertainment. I can do it! I’m the best!”","The assistant said, “Young Master, calm down. You’re not the main character today. The company’s matters will be handed to Young Madam in the future. You just have to help her, so you don’t have to be nervous.”","Gu Yao’s face was filled with admiration. “How can Qiao Xi be so outstanding? She knows how to play the piano, design jewelry, and translate. Now, the company will even be passed to her to manage. I just want to know if there’s anything she doesn’t know? Compared to her, I’m simply a pile of mud!”","Just as Gu Yao was sighing, someone suddenly pushed the door open and rushed out. The secretary rushed in front of him. “Young Master Gu, you should hurry in. Something is happening in the hall! Two people are here to snatch the position of the president!”","Gu Yao was stunned for a moment. Two people? Wasn’t Qiao Xi the president of Heavenly Voice? Moreover, Qiao Xi was the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. After the two companies merged, apart from Gu Zheng, no one was more qualified than her to sit in this position. Who would dare to snatch the position from Qiao Xi?","The secretary said while panting, “Miss Xia came to the company early in the morning. She’s the friend of Qingfeng’s president. She should be the new president, but I don’t know why Mrs. Gu is here too. She insists on snatching Miss Xia’s position. She’s too unreasonable!”","The assistant blinked crazily at the secretary. Gu Yao asked with a dark expression, “Who did you say is the president?”","......","The secretary replied in fear, “Miss... Miss Xia!”","“You don’t even know who the president is? If that’s the case, you don’t have to stay by my side anymore.” Gu Yao, who had always been good-tempered, suddenly had a cold expression. “Moreover, what right do you have to criticize Qiao Xi? Are you worthy? Get out of my sight immediately!”","The secretary’s body went soft, and her lips turned pale. “Young Master Gu, I... What did I do wrong?” She was just telling the truth. Mrs. Gu was unreasonable. She should not be snatching Miss Xia’s position!","Seeing that she was still unconvinced, the assistant said helplessly, “On the account that you’ve been by Young Master’s side for a few months, I won’t fire you for the time being. Go to the grassroots department and reflect on yourself. Moreover, who are you to gossip about Mrs. Gu’s identity? With her background and ability, does she need to snatch a position from anyone?”","At this moment, the secretary’s eyes were filled with regret. It was because she listened to those people’s words that she was momentarily muddle-headed. She thought that Mrs. Gu was not favored anymore. Now, she realized that Mrs. Gu was the real president. Miss Xia was clearly here to ruin things.","When Gu Yao entered, he happened to hear an arrogant voice. “Miss Xia is the president. Mrs. Gu, do you have any objections?”","Who was so shameless?","Gu Yao was about to speak when Qiao Xi happened to look over. The two of them looked at each other. Although they did not say a word, they had a special tacit understanding. He did not say anything and suppressed his intense anger.","However, he really wanted to curse. This was Gu Zheng’s company, yet his subordinates actually dared to bully Qiao Xi? Were they all crazy? He had to teach these ignorant people a good lesson today and teach them what respect was!"]},{"number":899,"title":"Chapter 899 - I Hope You Won’t Regret It","paragraphs":["“Young Master, calm down. You’re the vice president of Heavenly Voice Entertainment. You have to take care of your image. You can’t scold or hit anyone. You can’t embarrass Eldest Young Master!” the assistant hurriedly advised.","Gu Yao panted heavily and clenched his fists tightly. Xia Mengyan was really shameless. She was actually pretending to be the president of Heavenly Voice. Who gave her the confidence?","He wanted to get Li Jiang from Qingfeng Entertainment to bring all the higher-ups over and respectfully call Qiao Xi ‘President’ in front of everyone. That scene would definitely shock everyone, but Qiao Xi did not let him do it. Could it be that she had a plan?","Gu Yao and his assistant were standing in a corner. At this moment, everyone’s gaze was on Qiao Xi. No one noticed the two of them at all. After Jiang Qin lost her temper at Qiao Xi, Xia Mengyan pretended to be a good person and shook her head helplessly. “Xi Xi, if you really want to be the president, I can discuss it with the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. As long as he has no objections, I can give the position to you. After all, you’re my cousin. However, you using your identity as Mrs. Gu to snatch this position won’t be good for your reputation if news of this gets out.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “You really shouldn’t snatch someone else’s position. You’ll be mocked by others.”","Xia Mengyan said awkwardly, “Xi Xi, today is the day of the merger of the two companies. Everyone is very busy. We don’t have time to deal with complicated matters. Can you sit in my office first? We can have a good chat there, but the handover ceremony will be held soon. I won’t be able to accompany you then.”","“Miss Xia, you have to hold the handover ceremony later and have some documents to sign. How would you have the time to accompany her?” Jiang Qin said indignantly, “Mrs. Gu, do you know how much we have to do today? We all have to earn money to support our families, unlike you. You only eat, drink, and play all day. President Gu can support you. If you’re really bored, you can find a place to relax. Don’t come here to cause trouble. If President Gu finds out that you disturbed the handover ceremony, he’ll hate you even more!”","Hearing Jiang Qin’s words, Xia Mengyan smiled apologetically, but the corners of her mouth curled into a victorious smile. She advised gently, “Xi Xi, don’t mind her. Director Jiang is a little angry because she’s too busy. After we finish the handover ceremony and if you still want to be the president, I can give that position to you. But don’t make a scene now, okay?”","Jiang Qin snorted. “Miss Xia, you’re too kind. Even if you give the position to Mrs. Gu, she won’t care about you. Moreover, not just anyone can sit in the position of the president. What has she done for the company?”","“It’s okay, I don’t care about this. Xi Xi is my cousin, so I should give in to her.” Xia Mengyan smiled and shook her head, then turned to look at Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, go upstairs first. I’ll look for you after my meeting.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Mengyan left in a hurry. Jiang Qin glanced at Qiao Xi with a mocking gaze. “Since Miss Xia has allowed you to go upstairs, then go ahead. I just hope that you’ll watch yourself and not do anything irrational again.”","“Director Jiang.” Just as Jiang Qin was about to turn around and leave, Qiao Xi called out to her.","Jiang Qin turned around impatiently. “What?”","......","Qiao Xi’s eyes were icy-cold, but the corners of her mouth curled up slightly. Such a smile caused one to shudder. She chuckled and said, “I hope you won’t regret your decision today.”","Jiang Qin snorted. Could it be that she still planned to complain to President Gu? Everyone in the company knew that President Gu was having an affair. He had long looked down on her, Mrs. Gu. How could he stand up for her?","A few employees gathered together and discussed in low voices. “Mrs. Gu must be thinking of complaining to President Gu after being wronged. I really don’t understand how such an outstanding man like President Gu could marry such a woman.”","“A few days ago, there was news that Mrs. Gu is the composer, Fu Sheng. She’s also the chief designer of Liuli. Actually, she’s very outstanding too!”","“So what if she knows how to compose and design clothes? It doesn’t mean that she knows how to manage the company! Miss Xia is the internationally renowned perfumer, Sally. She’s also the eldest daughter of the Xia family. She has a good family background, she’s beautiful, and she’s talented too. I heard that she even took over her family’s company and has been managing it well. Most importantly, she’s a friend of the president of Qingfeng Entertainment!”"]},{"number":900,"title":"Chapter 900 - Scram With Her!","paragraphs":["“Even if she complains to President Gu, President Gu might not be on her side. After all, President Gu is able to make a clear line between personal and work matters. He’ll definitely think about the company’s interests. How can we give such an important position to a rich madam who only knows how to eat, drink, and play?”","“That’s right! Miss Xia was chosen by the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. How could that be changed so easily? No matter what, President Gu has to show the president some respect.”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, Jiang Qin cleared her throat and said seriously, “You should all know that the president of Qingfeng Entertainment is a business genius. All the programs he invests in are very popular, and his taste is very sharp! Hence, the person he has his eyes on will definitely be fine. Miss Xia, you definitely have the ability to be the president and lead everyone to glory!”","When Qiao Xi went upstairs, she happened to hear this. She agreed with this very much. She also felt that the president of Qingfeng Entertainment had sharp eyes and was a business genius.","When Gu Yao saw her going upstairs, he hurriedly followed her. His handsome face was filled with anger as he shouted hysterically, “Qiao Xi!”","“Are you trying to scare me to death by shouting so loudly?!” Qiao Xi frowned unhappily.","Gu Yao said angrily, “When did you become so weak? Those people are all pointing at your nose and mocking you, but you’re not saying anything? If you can’t win, I can help you! Why don’t you let me make a sound?”","Qiao Xi paused for a moment and rubbed his slightly bristled hair. “Don’t be angry anymore. I’m only doing this to see through some people. If I want to take over Heavenly Voice Entertainment, I have to know who’s loyal to me. Just take Director Jiang for example. Don’t you think that it’ll be a waste to keep this person in Heavenly Voice?”","Gu Yao instantly reacted and looked at her with admiration. “Qiao Xi! You’re really too smart!”","Qiao Xi smiled disdainfully. Didn’t Jiang Qin like to curry favor with Xia Mengyan? Then she should scram with her!","At this moment, everyone from Heavenly Voice Entertainment was preparing for the handover ceremony. Everyone’s positions were still the same as before, and the company’s business had not changed much. Heavenly Voice would still be focused on movies and TV shows, while Qingfeng was focused on variety shows. The two companies would not compete for benefits. At the same time, they could exchange resources and broaden their network of connections to achieve a win-win situation.","However, although Heavenly Voice Entertainment was ready, the people from Qingfeng Entertainment were still nowhere to be seen. Previously, they had agreed that the person in charge would definitely be here before 10, but it was already noon and there was still no sign of him.","Xia Mengyan suddenly had a bad feeling and wiped the sweat off her forehead. Could it be that the president of Qingfeng Entertainment knew that she was pretending, so he canceled the merger?","......","However, this was impossible! If the president really knew about it, he would definitely have sent someone to expose her instead of doing nothing.","Jiang Qin was so anxious that she stomped her feet and hurriedly called the people from Qingfeng. Unexpectedly, the other party’s response was that their people had already made their way over, but the employees of Heavenly Voice Entertainment did not welcome them, so they left.","Hearing this, Jiang Qin’s face instantly darkened. She flew into a rage at the few receptionists. “Who received the person in charge of Qingfeng? I told you long ago that today’s handover ceremony is very important and you must be 120% focused, but you actually chased the person in charge of Qingfeng away?”","The few young ladies lowered their heads with tears in their eyes. They had been waiting for the entire morning, but the person in charge of Qingfeng Entertainment did not come to visit at all. Moreover, they were not rude to anyone. Could it be that there were too many people in the company today and it was a little chaotic? Did the person in charge leave angrily when he realized that no one was around to welcome him?","At two in the afternoon in the vice president’s office, Gu Yao questioned with a gloomy expression, “Where’s the person in charge of Qingfeng Entertainment? Director Jiang, I handed the matter to you. Is this how you do things? Do you still want to work here?”","Jiang Qin’s heart trembled. She knew that President Gu valued the merger of the companies very much because President Gu had said many years ago that he founded the company for a friend. She guessed that the friend was the president of Qingfeng Entertainment, but the president had handed the company to Xia Mengyan to manage.","If something really went wrong during the handover ceremony, not only would she offend President Gu, but she would also offend the president of Qingfeng Entertainment. Her future would be completely ruined. Jiang Qin was so afraid that she broke out in a cold sweat. She went out of the door and asked Gu Yao’s assistant for information. “Assistant Gao, what exactly did Qingfeng Entertainment say? Did we not receive them well, or was it because of something else?”"]}]);
